window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4601,"title":"Chapter 4601 An Old Friend (2)","paragraphs":["4601 An Old Friend (2)","A bare-chested Elder, who was dozens of feet tall, appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. He was very familiar with this white-haired man with two lightning balls in his left hand.","It was the Elder he had seen at the God Refining Sect and the Offworld Battlefield. He was Void God’s Right Emissary, and his void power had reached its peak. He was on par with White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch.","If it was the previous Jian Wushuang, he would definitely run as far away as possible. However, now, he was not afraid at all.","Exhaling a breath of turbid air, Jian Wushuang pulled off his hood, revealing a face that even Void God’s Right Emissary was familiar with.","As expected, his eyes narrowed and he questioned, “It’s you, Jian Wushuang?! Didn’t you escape? You actually dare to come here alone?”","“I’m here to collect a debt,” Jian Wushuang said coldly. “A blood debt!”","“A blood debt?” Void God’s Right Emissary was stunned for a moment before he laughed. “You, a cowardly rat? Originally, I wanted to take your head and give it to Lord Void God as a chamber pot, but I didn’t expect you to come and die instead. This will save me the trouble of looking for you.”","Ignoring the Right Emissary’s insults, he reached out and slowly pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword.","The Emissary’s eyes lit up. “Good, very good. I’ll use your Divine Sword to cut off your head. We won’t waste any time.”","“Ten breaths,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","The Emissary’s eyes narrowed and his monstrous void power instantly blocked all possible escape routes. At the same time, he punched out his right fist. A fist aura that could destroy stars smashed toward Jian Wushuang’s face.","In the First Form of Sundering Stars, an even more powerful sword ray collided with the fist energy, easily negating his attack.","The Right Emissary’s eyes narrowed. This person, who was almost like an ant in his eyes, had actually neutralized his attack so easily?","Feeling irritated, he threw the two huge lightning balls in his left hand at Jian Wushuang.","The balls of lightning expanded in the wind, and a huge amount of lightning surrounded them. If one was hit by any one of them, even an Invincible Supreme realm warrior would die on the spot.","Jian Wushuang did not dodge. He stood on the spot and only the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand moved forward.","The two balls of lightning flew over, but in the instant they collided with the tip of the Tarot Divine Sword, they stopped.","Then, Jian Wushuang raised his arm and stabbed. The two lightning balls returned to where they came from. They even became more powerful.","The Right Emissary’s eyes narrowed and he subconsciously reached out to catch them. Immediately, a bloody mist exploded from his palm.","With a muffled groan, he opened his palm, and he could see white bones. The two lightning balls had broken the skin on his palm.","Ever since the first battle of the Great Catastrophe War, he had long forgotten what it felt like to be injured. Now, not only was his palm broken, but even the two lightning balls that he regarded as his life force were also destroyed. The humiliation and shame caused Void God’s Right Emissary to go berserk.","“Jian Wushuang! You’re going to die without a burial ground!”","“What pointless fury.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and laughed. The Tarot Divine Sword returned to its sheath and he charged at the violent void power.","The three-meter-tall Right Emissary met his punch and spat out a breath of empty flames. The destructive aura easily tore the space apart.","With his black robe billowing, Jian Wushuang stretched his palm forward without any fancy moves. It broke through the thick black flame and hit the black fist.","The water tank-sized fist smashed into the Right Emmisary’s palm without any suspense.","Jian Wushuang thought that this punch would cripple his foe, but such a scene did not appear. Instead, a proud smile was still hanging on Right Emmissary’s face.","The ghostly figure quietly appeared in front of him, and at the same time, a scarlet-gold divine pattern flashed.","Swish...","With a soft sound, a head separated from its body.","Jian Wushuang held the Right Emissary’s white hair with one hand, lifting the head.","Boom...","The headless body trembled slightly and then fell heavily to the bottom of the cabin.","“My body, where’s my body?” Void God’s Right Emissary shouted in fear. He wanted to escape but found that he only had a head left.","Putting the head in front of him, Jian Wushuang said, “Now, do you still want to use my head as a chamber pot?”","“No, I don’t want to.” The extreme fear of death pacified Void God’s Right Emissary. “Jian Wushuang, Master Wushuang, let me go. I promise I won’t pursue what happened today. I will definitely plead for you in front of Lord Void God. Then, the Divine Power Universe will leave you alone.”","With a flash of disgust in his eyes, Jian Wushuang threw the head in his hand into the Star Field.","Before he could rejoice, a beam of divine light shot over and immediately destroyed the head.","Void God’s Right Emissary had died!","Jian Wushuang strolled to the bottom of the cabin and saw an extremely familiar figure in a huge cage.","Her white clothes were extremely dirty at this moment, and her hair bun that was initially tied up in a playful manner was also scattered, covering half of her face.","Jian Wushuang endured the pain in his heart and cut off the cage with one strike.","“Little girl,” Jian Wushuang called out softly as he squatted.","After calling out a few times, the frightened and numb little figure raised her head timidly and looked at Jian Wushuang with a pair of deer-like eyes.","In an instant, tears poured out of the little Daoist girl’s eyes, and a sad cry came from her little mouth. “It’s you, Terrible Chess Player...”","The child cried in Jian Wushuang’s arms.","Sorrow welled up in Jian Wushuang’s heart. This innocent little Daoist child, who seemed to have gathered the spiritual energy of heaven and earth as one, was in a miserable state. It made him think of the Fengtian Patriarch, who had used his body to break through the natural barrier and save the Divine Power Universe.","With red eyes, Jian Wushuang muttered, “I’m sorry, I’m late.”","“Terrible Chess Player, where’s my Master? Quickly tell me where my Master is. I want Master to avenge me and beat these bad guys who bullied me...”","The child in his arms let out all the fear and pain in her heart.","She had been serving the Fengtian Patriarch since she was a child and was not tainted by anything in the world. Jian Wushuang was the only other person she had spoken to besides the Fengtian Patriarch, so she naturally regarded him as her closest person.","“Terrible Chess Player...” Chu Zhi stood up and looked at Jian Wushuang with her red eyes. She sobbed and said, “Tell me, where did Master go? I miss him so much. Does he not want me anymore?”","“If he finds me annoying, then I won’t talk back to him. I’m scared, and I don’t want to leave him again.”","Jian Wushuang’s heart was in so much pain, but he could not tell her the truth.","He could only say dejectedly, “Chu Zhi, don’t worry. With me around, no one will bully you from now on.”"]},{"number":4602,"title":"Chapter 4602 The Mysterious Ranger","paragraphs":["4602 The Mysterious Ranger","“Terrible Chess Player. I just want to hear the truth.” A big tear rolled down her young face. “Is my Master dead or alive?”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stopped looking at the child and said in a trembling voice, “He’s dead.”","The girl was stunned and her eyes quickly lost their liveliness. Her body swayed slightly and she fell into Jian Wushuang’s arms, fainting.","Looking at the once carefree little Fairy who had become like this, the sadness in his eyes faded away, and a monstrous killing intent rose into the starry sky.","Jian Wushuang picked up the child and slowly rose into the sky.","The other four Cosmic Boats surrounded him, and there were a total of 30 Void Masters there.","“Palace Master Wushuang, let’s go.” Dao Yan and Ban Shan came over and looked at the 30-odd Void Masters with serious expressions.","If they were in the Divine Power Universe, Ban Shan could easily kill these Void Masters without even suffering a scratch.","However, now that they were in the Void Universe, Daoist Ban Shan could only exert 60-70 percent of his divine power at most, while Dao Yan was already extremely weak. If he did not have time to replenish his divine power, even his Natal Green Lotus would be irreversibly damaged.","He had no chance of winning against these 30 Void Masters!","However, Jian Wushuang did not show any signs of weakness. The golden divine light in his eyes flowed along with the wind.","“I’ll pay you back with the blood of you bastards.”","The emotionless voice was like a divine punishment descending upon the world. With just one sentence, it stated their ending.","This relatively prosperous Star Field was quietly covered in a layer of misty frost, and all living beings below the One Scar level almost instantly become ice sculptures.","The 30 Void Masters were plunged into an ice age, and they all had a bad feeling at the same time.","“What’s going on? I feel like my bone marrow is freezing, and my void power is freezing!”","“I knew it. Even the Void God’s Right Emissary died at the hands of this brat. How could we kill him with just our numbers?”","“Run!”","After the noisy whispering, the 30 Void Masters scattered like birds, turning into black light ribbons and scattering in all directions.","Then, none of the Void Masters managed to escape. The moment they turned around, they were turned into ice sculptures.","The first form of the Four Seasons of the Tarot Sword Manual was no longer the same as before. It could kill anyone below the Half Invincible Supreme realm, let alone a group of Void Masters who were only at the Four Scar level.","Feeling the chill around him, Ban Shan could not help but tighten his robe. He began to realize that Jian Wushuang’s growth had surpassed his knowledge.","Supreme Dao Yan no longer looked at the frozen Void Masters. He stepped forward and looked at the thin figure in Jian Wushuang’s arms. He could not help but feel his heart ache.","“Is this the Fengtian Patrairch’s little girl?” Dao Yan asked in a trembling voice.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as deep as he nodded.","“She’s just a child, and she suffered such a great loss. Void Universe, you all deserve to die!” Dao Yan’s tears fell, and his face was flushed with anger.","“I really want to crush them one by one now!” Ban Shan’s face was livid. He smashed several frozen Void Masters with one punch.","“What the Void Universe owes us will eventually be repaid in blood!” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice. The last trace of pity in his heart quickly disappeared.","In the following period of time, everyone in the Void Universe had heard of an extremely powerful young Ranger. This Ranger wore a loose black robe, and he frightened more than half of the Star Fields in the Void Universe.","Every time this nightmarish figure appeared in a Star Field, the entire Void Country would be destroyed in less than half a day. From normal peasants to the Six Scar Void Masters, no living creature survived.","His vast power seemed to penetrate the heavens and earth. Even powerful Six Scar Patriarchs could not escape the fate of death.","None of the forces knew what the mysterious Ranger looked like, because those who had seen him had all disappeared with the stars.","There were rumors from the Void Country that the mysterious Ranger was sent by the Divine Power Universe to take revenge, but it was quickly denied. There were also rumors from the Holy Land that the mysterious Ranger was an apostle of the Void God. He failed to break through to the next cultivation realm and lost his mind, so he began to massacre people.","When the great sects of the five Star Fields had made full preparations and asked their Patriarchs to guard the area, they launched a coordinated attack. However, they failed in the end. The entire northernmost section of the Void Universe was wiped out.","A total of five Patriarchs who had reached the peak of the Six Scar level and 100 Void Masters mysteriously disappeared overnight.","It was as if the five bustling Star Fields had been forcibly wiped out from the starry sky, leaving only the dark void.","No one knew what had happened that night. They could only silently pray that the person who was like a nightmare would quickly leave.","...","In a desolate and cold Star Field, a Cosmic Boat that could only accommodate five people was traveling forward at an extremely fast speed.","Jian Wushuang sat on the railing at the bow of the ship. The wind was blowing his black robe, making it flutter. The killing intent that he inadvertently revealed made him feel as if he had walked out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","“1 month... 27 Star Feilds, 8 Void Masters in the Six Scar level, and 23 Void Masters in the Five Scar level are killed. Meanwhile, the casualties of those in other cultivation realms are uncountable.”","One by one, numbers emerged in his mind and quickly disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s destructive power alone was extremely terrifying. With a wave of his hand, he could destroy an entire Void Country in a Star Field. Even Six Scar level Void Masters could only withstand a few moves from him.","If it were not for the fact that he was about to leave the Void Universe, Jian Wushuang would have naturally massacred all the living forces in the various Star Fields.","At the same time, he also felt strange that the Void Universe seemed to be strangely quiet. Other than some of the bustling Star Fields sending their Void Masters to the Offworld Battlefield, there was no other movement.","The second-in-command of the Void Universe, Snake God, must have sensed Jian Wushuang’s aura easily. However, he was nowhere to be found.","Was it really because he was too low-key?","Chu Zhi, who had already changed into a white robe, woke up from her sleep. After a low cry, she quickly ran behind Jian Wushuang and tightly held onto the corner of his clothes.","Jian Wushuang felt more pity for the child. Looking at the child who was like a frightened bird, he seemed to be reminded of the eccentric Fengtian Patriarch. He thought about the old man who was concerned about the Divine Power Universe.","Jian Wushuang jumped down from the railing and used his divine power to comfort the child.","Like a startled bird, Chu Zhi slowly calmed down, but she refused to let go.","Those 27 Star Fields, those Void Masters, as well as the Void God’s Right Emissary... They all paid the price for doing this to Chu Zhi."]},{"number":4603,"title":"Chapter 4603 Dying Snake God","paragraphs":["4603 Dying Snake God","Ever since she found out that the Fengtian Patriarch had passed away, she had sat in a daze for seven days. It was as if her soul had been drawn away, and she had lost all faith and reliance.","Even Supreme Dao Yan could not cheer her up.","In the end, it was Jian Wushuang’s words that woke her up from her meditation.","The moment she left the Holy Land, she experienced the extreme evil of the universe. This was fatal to an extremely naive child.","The only thing Jian Wushuang could do now was to help her let go.","“We’ll reach the crack in a day at most,” Jian Wushuang said. “But I think the crack should be more tightly guarded. I’m afraid those guys are already waiting for us there.”","Even if there were 20 Void Masters who are in the Six Scar level guarding the crack, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could protect Dao Yan and Ban Shan until they reached the Divine Power Universe.","However, Shi Zhuzhi and Snake God were his biggest concerns. Without a perfect plan, Jian Wushuang would never let have free roam.","“I’ll go first. You guys wait in the nearby Star Field. If I’m free, I’ll come and pick you up. If I can’t come back in seven days, Elder Dao Yan, you guys can hide and wait until the crack weakens before you break out,” Jian Wushuang said.","Ban Shan was about to speak when Dao Yan reached out to stop him. He said, “We’ll listen to Palace Master Wushuang’s orders. Even if we go together, we’ll only cause trouble for Palace Master Wushuang.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Just as he was about to leave, Chu Zhi pulled on the corner of his clothes and said timidly, “You Terrible Chess Player. Don’t leave me behind.”","Jian Wushuang rubbed her hair and said, “Wait for me for two days. I’ll come back to pick you up in two days at most.”","Chu Zhi gritted her teeth and then released her grip. “Terrible Chess Player... Besides Master, you’re the only one I know. Don’t leave me behind.”","Jian Wushuang felt sad. After making the promise, he rushed into the crack.","A year might be long for ordinary living beings, but for cultivators, it was almost like the blink of an eye.","Jian Wushuang gambled that Snake God and the others did not strengthen their arrangements and went to the 23 cracks again.","As soon as he stepped into the enchantment around the crack, a thick aura of death hit him in the face.","He was slightly stunned. The corpses of the Void Masters he had killed were still scattered in the void, and their positions had not even changed.","Other than that, there was no other aura of a living person.","Could it be that no one had made any arrangements in the past year, and no one knew what had happened here?","Jian Wushuang could not believe that none of the Void Masters on duty had noticed the situation.","With Snake God’s suspicious and treacherous nature, it was impossible for him not to be guarding this place.","Could it be that they were not in the Void Universe? Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed and was about to test the waters.","Jian Wushuang was shocked and immediately released his divine power to create a formation.","In the next moment, the boundary of the crack suddenly burst open, and a bloody figure jumped into the Void Universe.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. “Snake God?!”","At this moment, Snake God’s black robe had been torn to shreds. His exposed skin and scales seemed to have been peeled off by a great force, revealing his dark gray skin and flesh.","Of the nine heads that represented Snake God, only two were left. It seemed that the wounds on the broken neck had just recovered.","Snake God, who seemed to be on the verge of death, could not help but tremble when he saw Jian Wushuang. His vertical pupils turned gray. “It’s you, Jian Wushuang?!”","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but he released his aura, which expressed his hostile attitude.","Sensing his gradually rising terrifying aura, Snake God suppressed the uneasiness in his heart and said in a deep voice, “Why are you here? Get lost, or I don’t mind killing you on the spot!”","“Oh? With your current strength?” The divine pattern was brilliant and appeared on Jian Wushuang’s black robe. He looked at Snake God with a cold smile and said, “Why don’t you give it a try now?”","After sensing the change in his aura, Snake God’s face turned ashen. “How could you...”","Jian Wushuang knew how to take advantage of a person’s misfortunes. He immediately pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword and immediately released the fifth move of the Tarot Sword Manual.","A giant phantom of Tarot condensed in the sky. Unlike before, a huge sun appeared above the tip of the phantom. It was divine and magnificent!","Looking at the Sword Intent coming at him, Snake God, who was almost out of energy, could no longer pretend. He roared, “Jian Wushuang, you can’t kill me. Once I die, all the secrets will disappear, including the news of your Master, Xuan Yi!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled, and the giant Tarot phantom image tilted to the side, almost brushing past Snake God as the attack fell.","Boundless Sword Intent surged and tore apart the starry sky. Snake God was a little slow, and he could not move away in time. His entire left arm was shattered by the Sword Intent.","Jian Wushuang reached out and grabbed Snake God’s blood-drenched body, pulling Snake God in front of him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as deep as water. “Tell me all the secrets you know and I’ll spare your life!”","Snake God’s ugly face was twisted due to the intense pain, making it even uglier.","With a trace of blood at the corner of his mouth, Snake God said with resentment and jealousy, “It has only been 10,000 years, but you have grown to such a terrifying level. Jian Wushuang, what kind of monster are you?”","Jian Wushuang tightened his grip on Snake God’s neck and said, “Don’t keep me in suspense. As long as I exert force, you will die!”","Hearing this, Snake God laughed strangely. “If you kill me, someone else will replace me soon. Jian Wushuang, can you kill them all? If you kill me now, I guarantee that you won’t even be able to leave the Void Universe!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled. Just as he was about to kill Snake God with a palm strike, Snake God suddenly said, “There are forces behind me that even I don’t dare offend. Even if you’re able to fight against me now, will you be able to deal with a few guys who are as strong as me?”","“You’re looking for death!” Jian Wushuang shouted and exerted force in his palm.","Snake God’s throat let out a hissing sound. “Listen to me. Do as I say and head to the Polar Sea. I guarantee you will be safe!”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to speak, a strong aura began to spread from the void crack.","“They’re already here. If you don’t do as I say, we’ll both die here!” Snake God slowly closed his eyes and no longer spoke.","Feeling the terrifying aura getting closer and closer, Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and dragged Snake God, who was like a dead dog, into the depths of the Void Universe behind him.","When the two of them completely disappeared, the 23 crack enchantments were torn apart.","Several figures with vast void energy around them appeared.","“Why is there the presence of divine power here? Could it be that Snake God is already dead?”","“If he’s alive, I want to see him. If he’s dead, I want to see his corpse. I can’t let him live.”","“Yes, Sir.”"]},{"number":4604,"title":"Chapter 4604 Polar Sea","paragraphs":["4604 Polar Sea","In a desolate, cold, and silent Star Field, there was no aura of any living being. A Cosmic Boat was jumping and shuttling back and forth.","On the deck, Snake God, who was bound tightly by divine chains as thick as his calves, was panting heavily.","Dao Yan and Ban Shan looked as if they were facing a great enemy.","“Palace Master Wushuang, why did you bring him here?” Ban Shan Daoist looked anxious. “Why don’t we kill this person right now to avoid any unexpected changes?”","“I say, little guy, as fate would have it, we’ve at least met once. Do you really want me to die so badly?” Snake God’s remaining two heads faced Ban Shan, and both had strange expressions on them.","!!","The divine power turned into a ribbon and covered Snake God’s mouth. Then, Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and roughly told them what had happened.","After listening, Dao Yan frowned and slowly walked to Snake God. He asked, “You know about Xuan Yi?”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to remove the divine power from Snake God’s mouth. Snake God laughed evilly and said, “Of course I know, but I can’t tell you now. This is my trump card. When I am out of danger, I will tell you.”","“Aren’t you afraid that I’ll kill you right now?” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Snake God’s ugly face trembled, and then he smiled sinisterly. “Of course I’m afraid, but if you kill me now, I guarantee that none of you will be able to live safely. Only if I’m alive will you be able to reach a safe place.”","“If you dare to play any tricks, I don’t mind taking you down with me before I die.”","“Don’t worry, I treasure my life very much. I won’t make things difficult for myself.”","No one spoke. A cloud of gloom hung over Jian Wushuang’s mind.","In order to prevent Chu Zhi from reacting when she saw Snake God, Jian Wushuang used his divine power to put Chu Zhi into a deep sleep.","For seven consecutive days, according to the route given by Snake God, the Cosmic Boat had long deviated from the normal Star Field. As far as the eye could see, the starry sky had turned from crystal blue to extremely dark and turbid.","At the same time, a pitch-black ocean floated in the starry sky, flowing into the depths of the universe.","Whoosh...","This was a continent that grew on a pitch-black sea. There was no sun, and the sky was always the chaotic color of dusk.","The universe boat was stranded on the gray soil, and the dying Snake God was hung on the bow of the ship.","“Hurry, throw me into the sea.” Snake God’s eyes were bloodshot as he looked at the pitch-black sea.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and continued to explore the strange land that grew on the huge sea with Dao Yan.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and took a handful of black water from the sea. The strange energy immediately boiled in his hand.","“What is this power?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened as he looked at the boiling black water in his palm. “It’s neither divine power nor void power?”","“It really isn’t divine power or void power.”","“This is strange. How can a place like this produce another kind of energy?” Ban Shan clicked his tongue in wonder.","Jian Wushuang looked at the bow of Cosmic Boat subconsciously, only to realize that Snake God had disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank and he immediately released vast divine power. Seeing this, Dao Yan and Ban Shan also released their own divine power.","“Hehehe...”","A muffled and strange laugh resounded from the deck of Cosmic Boat. Snake God, whose lower body had transformed into a snake, appeared in front of everyone with Chu Zhi in one hand.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s blood boiled and his eyes turned red. “You beast! How dare you?!”","Snake God ignored his rage and said sinisterly, “Release the shackles on my body, or I will kill her immediately and make her Dao disappear!”","Chu Zhi cried out in pain, her neck already bruised.","Jian Wushuang suppressed the urge to tear him into pieces and said very slowly, “Sure, but if you dare to hurt her again, I promise you that I will destroy your body and soul!”","Snake God’s pupils narrowed, and his gradually tightening palm slowly loosened.","At this critical moment, Chu Zhi suddenly took out a piece of copper from her arms and smashed it at Snake God’s head.","A miserable shriek rang out, and Snake God let go of Chu Zhi in pain.","Jian Wushuang saw this and threw the Tarot Divine Sword.","The divine sword expanded in the wind and cut off one of Snake God’s heads.","Like a long rainbow, Jian Wushuang swept toward the Cosmic Boat and punched Snake God’s last head heavily, causing blood to splatter.","“D-don’t kill me. If you kill me, all the secrets you want to know will disappear.” Snake God was no longer as sinister as before. The fear of death forced him to beg for mercy.","Jian Wushuang punched him again. He grabbed his neck and lifted him up. “Tell me. If you don’t tell me a secret that satisfies me, I’ll kill you immediately!”","“I’ll tell you, I’ll tell you everything!” Snake God nodded and said in a sad voice, “For example, the Polar Sea in front of us. It’s not something that is formed from two of our universes. It was formed by an accident and fell from an unknown place.”","Jian Wushuang sneered and said, “What kind of secret is this? Do you really want to die?”","Snake God shook his head and said, “Do you really think that the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe are the ultimate realms?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. “Continue.”","“I don’t know. I don’t know anything. That kind of existence is not something I can come into contact with.” Snake God regained his composure, and there were all kinds of indescribable emotions in his vertical pupils. “What I know is only my guess, but you should be able to boldly imagine the ultimate end of all these things.”","Jian Wushuang did not ask any more questions. After adding dozens of restrictions on Snake God, he casually threw him on the deck.","After that, Jian Wushuang quickly came to Chu Zhi, who was hiding at the side. “Little girl, are you okay?”","With a pair of bloodshot eyes, Chu Zhi shook her head hard and then raised the copper lump in her hand. “Terrible Chess Player, you saved me. You gave this thing to my Master in the past. Now, I’m returning it to you.”","The copper lump was none other than the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron that Jian Wushuang had exchanged for with Fengtian Patriarch in the Southern Ocean Immortal Island.","Feeling the familiar aura from the cauldron, Jian Wushuang shook his head gently and gave it back to her.","“This cauldron isn’t of much use to me, so I’ll leave it with you for self-defense.”","When Chu Zhi heard this, she shook her head stubbornly. “No, Master said that I have to hand it to you personally. This cauldron will be of great use to you in the future.”","She paused for a moment before continuing, “I don’t need the protection of this cauldron. You said that you would definitely protect me.”","Jian Wushuang did not say much. Finally, he put the cauldron in her hand and closed it."]},{"number":4605,"title":"Chapter 4605 Lost in Polar Sea","paragraphs":["4605 Lost in Polar Sea","Even if he had gathered all the five Qi essence, the Chaos Wuxu Cauldron was not of much use to Jian Wushuang.","That was because even with his current knowledge, he could not understand much of it. Rather than keeping it by his side, it was better to keep it by Chu Zhi’s side in case of danger.","Judging from the results of her strike on Snake God, it seemed that Chaos Wuxu Cauldron’s effect was not bad.","After comforting the Chu Zhi, Jian Wushuang came to Dao Yan and said in a serious voice, “Senior Brother Dao Yan, Elder Ban Shan, what do you think of what that guy said just now?”","In order to prevent Snake God from eavesdropping, Jian Wushuang wrapped the area with divine power.","!!","Dao Yan muttered to himself for a while and finally shook his head. “It’s incredible. I can’t imagine what other existences exist besides the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe.”","“In my opinion, even as two sides of the universe, the two universes are the ultimate existences of all things.”","Ban Shan nodded in agreement. His thoughts were the same as Dao Yan’s. The universe of divine power was too vast. It almost included all the realms and the realm limits of all living beings.","Even if the universe reincarnated, it was just another new cycle of the universe.","Could there be another universe besides the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe?","Dao Yan was born at the beginning of the universe and chaos, so his insight would affect Jian Wushuang’s judgment.","Jian Wushuang was naturally willing to believe that the two universes were the ultimate form of everything, but he felt that Snake God’s words just now were not plain nonsense. He should have glimpsed some ancient relic civilization or heard something that he should not have heard.","Jian Wushuang looked into the distance.","The Polar Sea was deep, and there were no waves on its endless surface. It was like a black mirror that had existed since ancient times.","How was the Polar Sea formed? It dominated the starry sky but did not merge with the Void Universe and existed independently. It was incredible.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand to disperse the divine power on Snake God’s head. Then, he carried him and swept toward the edge of the Polar Sea.","Snake God, who was on the verge of death, became agitated when it sensed that it was approaching the Polar Sea. “Put me in, put me into the sea!”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. Instead, he stopped at the shore of the Polar Sea and stretched out his hand to hold Snake God in the air.","“Let me down, let me down!” Snake God struggled uneasily.","With a wave of his hand, he scooped up a handful of pitch-black seawater, and that strange fluctuating energy aura spread out again.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang poured the black water on Snake God’s broken arm.","The black water seemed to have its own consciousness. Like a wriggling snake, it entered the wound instantly. Instantly, countless tiny black meat tendrils grew out and built up with each other. It was even faster than the reconstruction of a divine body.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were sharp and his hands were fast. He reached out and cut off the growth of meat tendrils.","Ignoring Snake God’s angry roar, Jian Wushuang threw Snake God on the shore and said calmly, “Of course, I can allow you to enter the Polar Sea. Before that, expose your life source to me and let me plant a restriction in it.”","“You’re dreaming! You’re really a vicious child!” Snake God gritted his teeth and stared at Jian Wushuang with hatred.","With a cold smile, Jian Wushuang lifted his foot and kicked Snake God far away. At the same time, dozens of brilliant divine powers turned into a divine power cage and trapped Snake God in the formation.","“Don’t try to break through. You won’t be able to survive ten breaths of divine punishment with your current strength,” Jian Wushuang reminded him and then flew straight into the endless Polar Sea.","Snake God’s eyes narrowed and his eyes were filled with hatred. “Jian Wushuang, I curse you to lose your divine soul in the Polar Sea and sink into oblivion forever!”","The moment Jian Wushuang stepped into the area of the Polar Sea, a special aura of a restriction caused discomfort to the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body.","The aura of the restriction seemed to carry the chaos and savagery of primitive times. At the same time, it was a profound suppression from the level of life, which made Jian Wushuang feel uncomfortable.","After setting up a defense to fortify his consciousness and pure heart, Jian Wushuang dispelled the strange feeling and continued to rise above the Polar Sea.","He had an inexplicable intuition that something in this Polar Sea seemed to be calling him.","The dark and boundless sea was like a deep mirror. Even Jian Wushuang would feel dizzy when he looked at the sea occasionally.","In order to prevent getting lost, Jian Wushuang set up a divine power cage around Snake God so that he could feel the distance from the shore at any time.","However, Jian Wushuang felt the divine power aura that he had left on the shore rushing towards him at an extremely fast speed.","Jian Wushuang’s heart tightened. The bad feeling finally came.","On the strangely still surface of the Polar Sea, a dark light beam sped over. Before it could be seen clearly, a strong light rose from the sky and aimed at Jian Wushuang!","Buzz...","The divine patterns emerged and the vast divine power turned into a light wall that appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The two collided. As the black light was destroyed, it also shattered the light wall.","Jian Wushuang frowned. He found that it was Snake God who had launched such a fierce attack.","He saw that Snake God’s severed arm had grown back. Initially, he only had one head left, but now, there were eight heads. Black mist gushed out of every inch of Snake God’s pores.","The nine pairs of vertical pupils glowed with an evil red light and they looked at Jian Wushuang without any emotion.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to act rashly because of the power of a peak Half Ancestor realm warrior. Although he knew that he could fight a Half Ancestor without losing, that was under the condition that he used Ancestral Skills.","To Jian Wushuang, the current situation was a great disadvantage.","He did not understand how Snake God had managed to return to his peak in such a short time and lock onto his position.","Snake God had a strange face, and he smiled sinisterly. All nine of his mouths opened at the same time as he said, “Jian Wushuang, don’t hold back the most taboo existence in the depths of your heart. Let it out. This is the world of bliss!”","“Don’t you like to kill too? There are many people you killed here.”","Jian Wushuang frowned. Just as he was about to release his divine power, he saw the mirror-like Polar Sea below him suddenly boil.","Figures covered in thick ink-like mucus slowly appeared.","“Jian Wushuang! Give me back my life!”","With a shrill voice, Supreme Bing Ye, who was emitting black mist from his body, rushed over with great power.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed, but he quickly calmed down. He snorted coldly, “You’re resorting to using illusions now? I can kill you once, so what’s the harm in killing you a second time?”","As Bing Ye took the lead in the charge, the figures that had died at Jian Wushuang’s hands emerged one by one.","“You were a piece of trash when you were alive, and you’re still trash after you’re dead, right?”"]},{"number":4606,"title":"Chapter 4606 Snake God, Void God!","paragraphs":["4606 Snake God, Void God!","A monstrous battle intent soared into the sky, and countless scarlet-golden divine patterns appeared around his body. The Sword Intent transformed from his divine power was like a raging river, crushing the illusions of Supreme Master Bing Ye and the others into pieces.","Heaven and earth were crying, and strange sounds shot up to the Nine Heavens. Everything disappeared like a demon!","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to disperse the black smoke in front of him and snorted coldly. “Petty tricks.”","Snake God, who was standing in the distance, laughed evilly. “Jian Wushuang, I will never let a monster like you live in this world. You will sink into the void.”","As soon as he finished speaking, a huge phantom appeared. It looked like a giant version of Snake God. The nine snake heads that almost tore the sky apart were like nine suns.","!!","Jian Wushuang did not want to be outdone either. He turned his palm into a fist and the brilliant divine patterns came out of his body. He formed a magnificent Heavenly Divine Gate in the dark sky.","The roar reached the heavens and the earth, and even the calm Polar Sea was shaken and rippled.","In the next moment, the nine great sun snake heads tore the sky apart easily and crashed toward Jian Wushuang with endless power!","The vast Heavenly Divine Gate opened, and a giant finger that reached the sky also fell heavily!","Different from before, another giant finger descended!","The first snake head that reached out collided with the giant finger. Following which, an immense aftershock burst out. It had so much power that it was enough to kill any Star Field.","The mirror-like Polar Sea was completely turbulent, and the huge waves as high as the sky were about to swallow even the broken sky!","Jian Wushuang retreated a thousand feet and divine blood gushed out from his ears and nose.","He crushed one of Snake God’s heads with a single finger, and the two vast powers that could not be contained were completely crushed together.","The sky was shattered instantly, and all the stars were destroyed. The space crack extended for millions of miles!","...","On the shore of the Polar Sea.","Dao Yan and Ban Shan, who were sitting in the universe boat, opened their eyes at the same time. They hurried to the bow of the boat and looked at the depths of the extreme sea.","The sky was already shattered, and the stars were destroyed. The starry sky was forcibly wiped out, and the violent squall unique to the void poured into the region of the extreme sea. It was a scene of world destruction.","“Palace Master Wushuang, I’m afraid we’re in danger.” Dao Yan frowned and looked into the distance.","“What should we do? Should we go and help Palace Master Wushuang?” Daoist Ban Shan said.","“Let’s wait a little longer. We’re under the Void Universe’s restrictions. We’ll only cause more trouble if we go.” Dao Yan shook his head.","Snake God, who was trapped in the divine power cage, was still curled up in the cage. His body was covered in blood, and there was no sign of recovery.","He also sensed the destructive aura coming from the depths of the Polar Sea, and his gloomy vertical pupils looked into the distance without moving.","“It’s really strange. Why do I hope that he can pass? Damn it, damn it!”","The Heavenly Gate above the broken sky had dimmed. After killing six snake heads in a row, Jian Wushuang was about to reach the point of exhaustion.","The black mist around Snake God had also completely dissipated.","“Jian Wushuang, you deserve to die!”","The phantom form of the giant Snake God with only three snake heads let out a deafening roar. “After I kill you, all the living creatures in the Divine Power Universe will be swallowed into my stomach, and they will be consigned to eternal damnation. Hehe...”","Jian Wushuang’s anger was instantly ignited and he felt his heart burning. The extreme darkness of Heaven Gate that had destroyed the Void God’s True Shadow had arrived again!","Countless divine rays emerged, and tens of thousands of divine weapons and precious forms crushed the phantom Snake God with divine might!","In just an instant, it was as if thousands of suns had exploded at the same time. Under the illumination of the bright light, the phantom Snake God was as small as a drop in the ocean!","Like a drop of water under the red sun, the huge phantom image was completely destroyed.","The Heavenly Gate that was hanging in the broken sky dispersed at the same time, turning into star patterns and returning to Jian Wushuang’s body","He coughed and wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth with his sleeve.","The brilliant divine power of the extreme day dissipated, leaving only a faint layer of black ash where Snake God was, which dissipated with the wind.","“So he’s finally dead...”","Snake God disappeared, but Jian Wushuang felt that something was wrong.","In the next moment, the black ash that was about to scatter suddenly condensed!","A figure that Jian Wushuang did not want to see the most and was even helpless against had descended!","“Void God!” Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and he felt bitter.","The materialized figure was the peak of the Void Universe, and his Sky-Breaking Palm Strike was enough to kill any Invincible Supreme warrior.","It was a nightmare that Jian Wushuang still did not want to face. His return would mean that the Divine Power Universe would enter the countdown of complete destruction.","“No, it can’t be him. How could he have returned from the seal of Cosmos God so quickly? This is all an illusion, an illusion!” Jian Wushuang shook his head hard as if he wanted to dispel the figure from his mind.","The terrifying figure hidden in the black fog surged with peak void power and looked at Jian Wushuang with two pairs of red eyes without any emotion.","“I said that we would meet again.”","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled. In the face of such an Ancestor realm existence, he knew that any attempt to escape would be futile.","Like a burning black flame, Void God created a scroll in the sky with a wave of his hand.","In the majestic scroll, he could see countless Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms which were destroyed by the Void Masters. Countless living beings were easily killed in this Great Catastrophe.","From mortals to Invincible Supremes, they had all died in a pool of blood.","Jian Wushuang saw his descendants being slaughtered by a Void Master in the Six Scar level, Leng Rushuang falling into a mountain stream, and Supreme Jun Fu’s head being cut off by his own axe.","The cold Ninth Kalpa King finally died on the battlefield.","Everything was covered in blood!","“No, don’t!” Jian Wushuang had completely fallen into madness. “How could you be one step ahead of me?”","The phantom-like Void God’s body flickered like mist, and a deep voice came out of his mouth. “Submit to me. I promise you that you and your loved ones will continue to live and enjoy the glory of the past.”","His long hair, which had been cut off, danced wildly in the air. The divine patterns that had already dimmed expanded once again, and a brilliant divine might rose to the sky!","Jian Wushuang had gone completely mad. His eyes were bloodshot and an invisible long sword slowly formed in his right hand.","“All of you, just wait for me!” Jian Wushuang’s last words came out of his mouth.","He raised the invisible sword formed by the divine patterns in his hand and turned his body into Dao!","Galaxy Lake Sea Sword Intent, first move, Star.","The Polar Sea was completely turbulent, and the huge waves that rose from the sky completely fused with the broken sky.","The starlight seemed to have been born in ancient times.","With the shapeless body of the sword, the divine power condensed into the hilt, the long wind condensed into the blade, and the divine patterns were injected into it, the sword path itself was formed.","The most ordinary yet most magnificent strike was completely released with his ultimate Sword Dao!","The heavens and earth were clear, and the divine might was majestic.","“You guys... Wait for me. I’ll be there to accompany you soon...”"]},{"number":4607,"title":"Chapter 4607 Old Master (1)","paragraphs":["4607 Old Master (1)","Jian Wushuang slashed forward, and a mournful aura that had never been seen before shot up into the sky. The illusionary sword transformed into a huge Sword Intent that soared into the sky. After easily breaking the restrictions of the starry sky, it descended!","With Void God as the center, the Polar Sea was split by the Sword Intent from the middle into a deep chasm, and the surging seawater covered everything.","Brilliant divine patterns shot up into the sky, forming countless pillars of light that exploded.","This Sword Intent would quickly destroy any other aura it came into contact with.","Void God was still standing there. He was like a shadow that was gradually disappearing. Only the pair of red eyes disappeared the moment his body disappeared.","At this moment, the sky, earth, stars, and Polar Sea were all in chaos.","Jian Wushuang, whose divine power had been completely drained, had the divine patterns all over his body crack and his eyes lost their light.","Then, his body fell straight into the abyss of the Polar Sea.","In the chasm that was split apart by the Sword Intent of the Galaxy Lake Sea Sword Intent, countless streams of water suddenly rose up like dragons, forming a huge black virtual image.","Jian Wushuang’s falling body finally landed in the palm of the huge black phantom.","A drop of crystal clear water fell from the eye of the phantom and landed on Jian Wushuang’s forehead.","...","On the shore of the Polar Sea, all the mountains and land shook, and the deep cracks opened up the mountains.","Dao Yan, who was standing at the head of Cosmic Boat, trembled. After exchanging a glance with Ban Shan, he was ready to rush to Jian Wushuang’s aid.","Due to the surging of the Polar Sea, violent waves poured directly on the shore, almost drowning half of the divine power cage.","Snake God, who was on the verge of death, was overjoyed when he felt the black water flowing around him. The heavens are helping me!","Pure black scales regrew, and the severed arm and the eight heads that had been cut off were also growing at an extremely fast speed.","At this moment, a sudden change occurred!","The sky that was originally broken suddenly rippled.","A total of three figures walked out.","If Jian Wushuang was there, he would definitely recognize the three figures.","The first one to walk out was Devour One, who was hidden in the black mist and only revealed a red eye.","Then, Devour Two walked out together with the God Refining Sect’s previous Sect Master, Void Master Ba Huang.","Supreme Dao Yan and Daoist Ban Shan, who had yet to move, stopped when they saw this scene, and bitterness appeared in their eyes.","Snake God, who was frantically absorbing the black water, was scared out of its wits when he saw the three figures.","Devour One, who was the leader, glanced at Dao Yan first, then glanced at Snake God, who was bound by divine power.","“He’s there. Go and absorb him. You’ll be able to stabilize your Half Ancestor realm completely,” Devour One said in an indifferent tone.","Void Master Ba Huang acknowledged respectfully and walked out slowly. He had a terrifying aura that surpassed the Six Scar level.","Void Master Ba Huang was intoxicated by the mysterious and special state.","Everything was given to me by Lord Devour, and it’s time for me to repay him...","...","“Where am I? Is this the world after death?”","In the broken sky, countless squalls raged, and the stars that had been shattered into powder spread out, which was extremely mysterious.","Just as Jian Wushuang was in a daze, a low voice resounded.","“Hey Kid, you’ve woken up. Are you still going to continue playing dead?”","Jian Wushuang jumped up with a sudden jolt.","He looked over and saw a shadow in a rippling black water robe emerging from the endless dark water surface and finally standing in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang subconsciously took a step back, but he hit a wet object.","Then, ten, a hundred, a thousand figures, which were still dripping with water, reached out their palms and pushed Jian Wushuang toward the mysterious black shadow.","Gulp...","Jian Wushuang swallowed a few times. He did not know when his meridians had been filled with divine power, but he could not use any of it.","“Don’t try to use those moves on me. Although they’re gorgeous, they’re not even comparable to the force of a sneeze from me.”","A deep voice came from the shadow of the black water-robed man, and the disdain in his words was apparent.","Jian Wushuang was stunned and immediately became indignant.","‘It’s not even as strong as a sneeze? Aren’t you bragging too much?’","However, the shadow under the black water robe slowly raised his head. With just one look, Jian Wushuang shut his mouth obediently.","That gaze contained everything, the destruction of the universe, the destruction of the primeval, and the one and only...","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang was rendered speechless.","The nothingness, which had not even appeared at the beginning of life, made him feel a sense of powerlessness.","With just a glance, negative emotions began to grow wildly.","Retracting his gaze, the black water-robed figure spoke again with a rare hint of interest in his tone, “Next, tell me the most direct thought in your heart. If your universe is about to be completely destroyed, what would you do?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold immediately, even though the existence in front of him was beyond his knowledge.","Trying hard to calm himself down, Jian Wushuang said, “As long as I’m still alive, my universe will not be destroyed!”","“Oh, hehe... What if you find that in the end, you can’t turn things around with your own strength?” The black water-robed figure’s tone carried a hint of mockery.","“Then I shall perish along with the entire universe,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","The black water-robed figure did not speak again. After what seemed like a long time, his slightly lazy voice sounded again.","“If you were given three choices, one is to die with the universe with your own strength, two is to surrender to the enemy universe to save your loved ones, and three is to get help from external forces and lead your own universe to counterattack until you kill all the enemy universes without leaving any living beings behind... Which one would you choose?”","The three options echoed in Jian Wushuang’s mind. Without any hesitation, he slowly said, “I choose the third option.”","“Interesting, interesting.” Ripples appeared on his black water robe, and he seemed to be very excited. “But do you know that once you choose this path, your loved ones and friends in the past, and even all the living beings in the universe, will not understand you and will cast you aside?”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang was extremely calm. “Even if I’m beyond redemption and spurned by the loved ones and friends of the world, I’ll die with no regrets!”","The black water robe surged and the endless water waves receded. Then, a large black robe appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","A scarred hand reached out from under the black robe and slowly pulled down the hood, revealing a face that looked both young and old at the same time.","His eyeballs, which had no white, were like the purest and deepest black. He looked at Jian Wushuang and squeezed out a smile that looked like he was crying.","“I don’t have a name, but in the past, they all called me the ‘Old Master’.”"]},{"number":4608,"title":"Chapter 4608 Old Master (2)","paragraphs":["4608 Old Master (2)","Even the most difficult past had been destroyed in those ultimate years.","His two pitch-black eyes reflected Jian Wushuang’s past life.","“Don’t look into my eyes. With your shallow experience, you’ll easily get lost in an illusion,” the black-water-robed figure who called himself Old Master warned in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up from the swamp-like memory and his temples were covered in sweat.","It was too strange and terrifying. What kind of existence was this old man?","“Kid, don’t try to figure me out. I can easily see through your thoughts.” A smile appeared on the old man’s sickly and pale face.","Jian Wushuang quickly abandoned all distracting thoughts and guarded his heart.","“You’re the only person I like other than my friends. So, I’m going to help you once,” Old Master said indifferently.","“Help me once? How can you help?” Jian Wushuang was confused and did not know what to do.","Old Master’s body suddenly turned into a handful of black water and fell into the Polar Sea. Then, he quietly condensed behind him and looked into the distance with his black eyes.","“From your consciousness, I know that the universe you exist in seems to be suffering a catastrophe. It is beyond everyone’s power, and it has completely fallen. It is only a matter of time before it is completely destroyed.”","“Now, I’ve decided to help you. I’m going to turn this hopeless situation around. Everything you’ve seen before will never happen again.”","The sudden help did not make Jian Wushuang lose his rationality. He pondered for a moment, looked up at Old Master, and asked, “What are the conditions?”","Old Master slightly raised the corner of his mouth. “There are two conditions. The first condition is very simple. Completely destroy the enemy universe, leaving no living beings behind.”","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled. The first condition was obviously the third option that he had mentioned earlier!","“What, you’re going back on your word now?” Old Master sneered.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He stared at him and made up his mind. “I promise to do it. What’s the second condition?”","Old Master smiled in satisfaction. “Once you agree, it’s a contract that can’t be changed. As for the second condition, I’ll only say it after you’ve completed the first condition.”","After saying that, he flicked his finger and a drop of black water fell into Jian Wushuang’s right arm.","Jian Wushuang pulled up his sleeve in a hurry and saw a tear-shaped divine pattern on his right wrist.","As if sensing his worry, Old Master added, “This is a part of my consciousness, used for communication between you and me. It will do you no harm.”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief, but he was still wary of this mysterious person.","Ignoring Jian Wushuang, Old Master turned around slowly and stared at the flowing pitch-black Polar Sea.","...","“Old Palace Master, let’s go!”","Amidst the boundless void energy, Ban Shan was bathed in blood. He sacrificed himself for the explosion and finally, he unleashed the most terrifying attack.","The mountains and rivers were crushed into fine powder by this attack.","However, this self-sacrificing attack was easily destroyed by Void Master Ba Huang!","The huge palm strike crushed Ban Shan.","Ba Huang, who was emitting a demonic blood light, had used some secret technique to take that step and reach the Half Ancestor realm.","“Hmph, I’ve long noticed that your motives are not pure. I originally planned to spare your life, but I didn’t expect you to chase after your own death.” As he casually dispelled the blood, Void Master Ba Huang curled his lips in disgust.","Then, he looked at Dao Yan, who was covered in blood and on the verge of death. His eyes flashed with desire.","“Ba Huang, this isn’t something you can touch.” Devour One’s cold voice came from behind.","Void Master Ba Huang hurriedly agreed and ran toward Snake God.","The black mist dissipated, and Devour One came to Dao Yan. “Give me your Comprehension, and I’ll spare your life for the time being.”","He coughed out a wisp of divine blood and looked at him calmly. “Everything I have belongs to the Divine Power Universe. Even if I die and my spirit is destroyed, you can forget about taking anything from me.”","“Why do you have to do this? Hand it over to me now, and I can still let you die with dignity. Otherwise, I can only kill you first and then extract your Comprehension inch by inch!” Devour One clenched his fist in the air, and Dao Yan’s body was immediately suspended in the air, while Chu Zhi hiding behind him fell on the deck.","Dao Yan was not afraid. He looked contemptuous.","“In that case, I’ll just take it.” Devour One did not speak anymore. He reached out to Dao Yan’s chest, and a red light flashed.","“Eh? Where is your Comprehension?” Devour One was confused.","Supreme Dao Yan laughed. “How ridiculous! I’ve said it before. The Void Universe can forget about touching any of my stuff!”","Devour One did not speak anymore. An infinite amount of red light rose and tore Supreme Dao Yan into pieces like a snake.","At this point, Dao Yan had fallen in the Void Universe.","Only a young man was left in the huge Cosmic Boat.","“I’m already like this, and you’re still so persistent. Do you really think I don’t have the power to retaliate?”","In the divine power cage, Snake God, who had recovered 70-80 percent of his power, looked coldly at the Void Master Ba Huang.","“With your current strength? You’re no match for me, even if you’re at your peak. Give me your Comprehension and I’ll let you die in a better way.” Ba Huang, who was at the peak of Half Ancestor realm, sneered.","Snake God fought like a trapped beast, and his void power rose up.","Ba Huang’s face turned cold and he raised his palm to slap Snake God.","Whoosh...","The Polar Sea trembled, and the water level suddenly rose thousands of feet. The waves surged, and two figures stepped on the tide.","J-Jian Wushuang?!","Snake God’s eyes widened and he felt as if he had just been reborn. Without thinking, he shouted, “Jian Wushuang! Elder Dao Yan and Elder Ban Shan have already died in their hands!”","“You’re too noisy!” A look of disgust flashed in Void Master Ba Huang’s eyes as he swung his palm at Snake God.","A bolt of divine power swept over and headed straight for Ba Huang!","As Ba Huang was forced to retreat, Jian Wushuang rushed forward and slashed at his right arm with the Tarot Divine Sword.","Swish...","Ba Huang’s entire right arm had been cut off!","Before he could scream, he was kicked away by Jian Wushuang again.","After putting away the Tarot Divine Sword, Jian Wushuang did not look at Snake God. He leaped onto the Cosmic Boat, having a strong premonition.","Devour One, who was hidden in the black mist, looked at Jian Wushuang calmly. “We meet again.”","“Stop bullsh*tting. Where are Elder Dao Yan and Elder Ban Shan?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his palm was already on the hilt of the sword at his waist.","“Those two guys?” Devour One shrugged slightly. “I just killed them.”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank and he roared, “You deserve to die!”","Tens of thousands of Sword Intents shot up to the sky and pointed at Devour One!"]},{"number":4609,"title":"Chapter 4609 An Ancestor Realm Existence","paragraphs":["4609 An Ancestor Realm Existence","The majestic Heavenly Divine Gate emerged, and a giant finger that reached the sky pressed down.","The 10,000 Daos returned to one, turning into the most ordinary move and slashing toward Devour One.","“Impudent!” Devour Two, who had been silent all this time, shouted and went past Devour One to meet the Sword Intent.","The red and black rays of light collided with each other.","He did not even have time to be proud as the plain Sword Intent instantly tore through Devour Two’s light and slashed straight at him!","Devour Two’s pupils shrank, and the great horror of life and death stunned him.","He had never expected that Jian Wushuang, who was only a Half-Step Unparalleled Supreme realm, would be able to break through his defense!","From the broken sky, the giant fingers of the Heavenly Divine Gate pressed down at the same time.","The Star Field of the Polar Sea was completely shattered. The stars further away exploded, and the earth finally collapsed completely.","Boom boom boom!","The Sword Intent swept across and pressed down on Devour Two together with the Heavenly Divine Gate’s giant finger.","An extreme brightness covered everything, and the hurricane swept through the remaining broken earth...","After an unknown amount of time, the explosion dissipated, and Jian Wushuang could finally see everything in front of him clearly.","In the broken void, Devour One was standing in place with Devour Two, who was almost torn in the middle, in his arms.","Divine blood gushed out of the wound uncontrollably. It was obvious that he was exhaling more than he was inhaling.","“My Lord!” Void Master Ba Huang leaped over. Although his arm had regrown, he was in an extremely sorry state.","After passing Devour Two, who was on the verge of death, to Ba Huang, Devour One walked slowly toward Jian Wushuang in the void.","With every step he took, the void cracked.","An unparalleled void power surged like a huge sea. It was the aura of a Half Ancestor.","Jian Wushuang also waited with rapt attention.","“Jian Wushuang, you shouldn’t have existed. If you weren’t his disciple, I would have reported to Devouring Emperor and asked him to recruit you. Unfortunately, you are his disciple, so I can’t let you live.”","“You’re blessed by the Heavenly Dao, and you’re like a monster. You can kill a Half-step Ancestor when you’re only in the Half-Step Unparalleled Supreme realm. But... You know, we have plenty of geniuses around here. Those who are more talented than you have already stood at the top.”","Devour One’s voice resounded throughout the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands. He had taken the last step and reached the Ancestor realm!","Advancing from Half Ancestor to Ancestor was a chasm that could never be filled with hard work.","Those were the true shackles, and only by drawing from the luck of a universe could one break through those shackles.","The fate energy of the Void Universe was almost dried up. How could another Ancestor realm expert be born?","The terrifying void power seemed to carry the entire Void Universe and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","As soon as the Ancestor realm aura appeared, everything was set in stone.","“Jian Wushuang, dying in my hands is your final destination.”","Countless red lights turned into six big hands and gradually condensed behind Devour One. Every hand was filled with the laws of heaven and earth.","Jian Wushuang remained standing at the spot. His eyes gradually turned from complicated to calm.","The eyes of Snake God, who was curled up in the cage of divine power, were about to pop out. “Let me out, let me out!”","If things were like before, Jian Wushuang could only close his eyes and wait for death.","However, now, everything had changed.","A dark red giant arm, which held the power of rules of heaven and earth, smashed down on Jian Wushuang.","After that, two arms, one bright and one dark, like the sun and moon, also suppressed one after another!","The starry sky shattered, and even the void, which represented nothingness, began to collapse on a large scale under this Ancestor realm aura!","Looking at the three arms that covered the sky, Jian Wushuang just stepped back, not worried about the danger he was in.","Snake God in the divine power cage seemed to have gone mad. He madly hit the cage, trying to escape.","Feeling the warmth from his wrist, Jian Wushuang looked back.","Old Master had his right hand behind his back, and his left hand held a water staff formed by the water of the Polar Sea.","As the tip of the staff touched the void, countless tiny and dense dark lights suddenly surged out and spread in all directions.","The Polar Sea, which spanned countless Star Fields, surged and rose. Huge waves rose to the sky, transforming into a black phantom that reached the sky.","The three arms on Devour One’s back suppressed the world with an Ancestor realm aura.","However, when the frost-like black light covered the void for hundreds of millions of miles, the laws of the three arms seemed to be cut off and they were dying rapidly.","At the same time, the black phantom formed by the Polar Sea walked out of the Polar Sea and punched one of the three arms.","Boom boom boom!","The explosion reverberated throughout the universe. The red arm was smashed by the black phantom. With another two punches, the dark and light arms that were suspended in the void were also smashed.","Ripples flowed all over the black phantom’s body, and it crashed heavily into Devour One, who was standing in the void.","Devour One snorted deeply. Instead of retreating, he attacked.","The remaining three giant arms on its back condensed into a sharp giant spear at the same time and stabbed into the black phantom’s chest.","Time seemed to have stopped, and thousands of crimson cracks appeared from the heart of the black phantom. Then, it completely collapsed and returned to the water of the Polar Sea.","Devour One reappeared, his Ancestor realm aura was still vast and long.","A single scarlet eye turned from Jian Wushuang to Old Master, revealing a rare look of fear.","At the same time, a strange card with a metallic luster appeared in his hand.","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled. The Dimension-Reduction Attack of the strange card had left a deep impression on him. If Supreme Master Gai Fu had not made his move at the end, he would not have been able to escape the strange energy in the card.","Just as he was about to remind Old Master to be careful, he realized that Old Master had disappeared.","“This strange energy fluctuation, although extremely weak, should not be a product of this universe.”","A low voice quietly rang behind Devour One’s ears. He threw the card behind him without thinking.","Like the tide, Old Master’s pale palm immediately reached out and grabbed the card.","With a cracking sound, the card that even an Invincible Supreme realm warrior was helpless against was easily crushed by Old Master. It turned into powder.","Devour One’s pupils shrank, and the arm behind him pierced toward Old Master’s heart.","The water rippled, and his figure disappeared. When he reappeared, he was in front of Devour One.","“Tell me, who gave you this thing you’re using, and who sealed the energy inside?”","Old Master’s voice was filled with undeniable authority. At the same time, he stretched out his palm, and a beam of black light burst out, immediately tearing one of Devour One’s arms.","“You’re counting death!” Devour One went crazy. He had never been humiliated like this since he started following Devouring Emperor."]},{"number":4610,"title":"Chapter 4610 Returning to the Divine Power Universe","paragraphs":["4610 Returning to the Divine Power Universe","Now, this guy who had come out of nowhere had destroyed his Arms of Laws so easily.","That was a Law he had only grasped after reaching the peak of the Ancestor realm!","When Devour One reached the Ancestor realm, he had absolute confidence that he could fight against a foe as strong as Void God with the trump card that Devouring Emperor had given him!","However, now, all of his confidence and trump cards had been ruthlessly stepped on by this sickly fellow.","“Are you going to tell me or not?” Old Master’s voice was cold. He reached out and flicked his hand, and another Arm of Laws behind Devour One was cut off like a fallen leaf in the autumn wind!","!!","Devour One went completely crazy. His last remaining Arm of Laws turned into a huge spear with an endless Ancestor realm aura, and stabbed at the old man.","Old Master’s face was full of disdain, and he only stretched out his right index and middle fingers and gently pointed.","In an instant, dense black cracks emerged from the forefront of the Arm of Laws and spread rapidly. In just a breath, the Arm of Laws was broken inch by inch.","Devour One could not believe it. Even if he could fight Void God now, he would be on par. Plus, he had countless trump cards. He could probably even defeat Void God.","However, this sickly man who had suddenly appeared before him had dispelled his Ancestor realm power with a single finger. Who exactly was he?","Coldness rose from the bottom of his heart. Devour One did not hesitate anymore and directly activated the aura in his life source.","The void completely collapsed and cracked. With Devour One as the center, an indescribable and terrifying power suddenly surged. Like a terrifying dragon, it constructed an extremely special energy field in the void. Old Master dodged the fierce surge of the special energy and stood behind Jian Wushuang again.","A special red and black light shuttled through it, quickly outlining a mysterious phantom.","Runes that were emitting a dim fluorescent light were circling around the figure, and the black-gold ten-thousand leaves armor was moving rhythmically in the wind.","However, the face of the apparition was completely hidden in the fog and could not be seen clearly. Only an imperial crown appeared through the fog.","Seeing the phantom, the extremely weak Devour One immediately knelt down. “Greetings, Lord Devouring Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled as he looked at the blurry image of the crown. He suddenly realized something.","Supreme Tarot, who had single-handedly suppressed the geniuses of ten thousand races and created the Tarot Sword Manual, had fallen at the hands of this Devouring Emperor!","However, the apparition of the crown only existed for a moment. It reached out its hand and swept up Devour One, Void Master Ba Huang, and the others, then quickly dissipated.","From its appearance to its disappearance, it only took a dozen breaths, and then everything returned to silence.","A drop of cold sweat trickled down Jian Wushuang’s temple. The aura of desolation that The phantom exuded was different from that of an Ancestor realm expert, but it was also similar.","Even old Ancestor realm experts such as Cosmos God and Void God had never made Jian Wushuang tremble.","Only two people made Jian Wushuang react this way.","The other was the illusory shadow of Devouring Emperor, which Devour One had just summoned.","The appearance of these two existences made Jian Wushuang begin to doubt whether the true peak of the universe was the Ancestor realm.","As Jian Wushuang was lost in his thoughts, Old Master beside him sighed slightly. “It seems that the rules of the universe still have a great restriction on me.”","Jian Wushuang was speechless. It was already beyond his imagination that Old Master could suppress Devour One, who had reached the Ancestor realm, with just one finger.","Jian Wushuang swallowed the words that were about to come out of his mouth. Then, he leaped toward the broken Cosmic Boat.","Its tiny body was curled up in a corner, and her eyes were filled with fear.","As soon as she saw Jian Wushuang, she immediately pounced on him and sobbed in a low voice.","“Terrible Chess Player! Elder Dao Yan and Elder Ban Shan are dead...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes dimmed. When he returned from the Polar Sea, he had already noticed that their auras had completely disappeared.","“Devour One, I’ll kill you!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes sank.","“I, I want to go home. I don’t want to stay here anymore.” Large tears fell from her young eyes. Everything she had experienced in the past few days had almost made her mind collapse. If Jian Wushuang had not been there, she would have died.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “Okay, okay. Let’s go home now.”","“It’s time to set off. Your mission should also begin.” Old Master appeared on the deck and reminded Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. Even without Old Master’s reminder, it was time to start the revenge that had been accumulating in his heart for a long time!","‘Since you all started this catastrophe, you must also be aware that you’ve reaped the consequences of your own actions!’","...","After leaving the already shattered Polar Sea Star Field, the dilapidated Cosmic Boat quickly shuttled through the major Star Fields.","He had stayed in the Void Universe for two years, but it was as if he had suddenly realized something.","The battles along the way had made Jian Wushuang grow a lot, and his Half Invincible Supreme realm had been completely stabilized.","The strong wind made Jian Wushuang’s robe flutter as he sat cross-legged on the bow of Cosmic Boat.","He took out a thumb-sized seed from his bosom and carefully used divine power to nurture it.","This was the final strand of life source essence that the Dao Yan had left behind. Perhaps after millions of chaos cycles, it would be able to regain consciousness.","What Jian Wushuang could do now was to nourish it carefully.","A jade-like tender shoot slowly emerged, and Jian Wushuang laughed.","What humans feared the most was not the unknown darkness, but when hope was lost and there was no light.","The Divine Power Universe was like this jade-like bud. How could it fall forever if the Heart Fire was still there?","Snake God, who had lost all his void power and turned back into a normal person, looked at Jian Wushuang in fear and horror.","Jian Wushuang had planted a life restriction in his life source, buried in the deepest part of his body.","From then on, his life was completely in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","Unless Jian Wushuang died, Snake God would be suppressed for hundreds of millions of chaos cycles!","Old Master, who was sitting high above on the top of the void Cosmic Boat, had become interested the moment he saw Chu Zhi. He would occasionally transform into various shapes to tease Chu Zhi.","However, Chu Zhi was only close to Jian Wushuang and treated everyone else like a scourge. Old Master had no choice but to give up.","After traveling for a month, Jian Wushuang finally arrived at the 23rd crack again.","With a wave of his hand, he killed nearly 20 ordinary Void Masters guarding the barrier. The Cosmic Boat of the Divine Power Universe finally left the Void Universe.","The barrier rippled, and Cosmic Boat stopped at the outermost layer of the Divine Power Universe.","The astral winds were raging, and even ordinary Supreme realm martial artists would find it difficult to stay in such an environment for too long.","Jian Wushuang looked back, then drove the Cosmic Boat in the direction of the Land of Sorrows."]},{"number":4611,"title":"Chapter 4611 Assemble (1)","paragraphs":["4611 Assemble (1)","The cold, dead, and silent Star Field was still there. If there was no war between the two universes, no one would come to this border area even at the end of time.","As the Cosmic Boat moved forward, the faint aura of void power flowing in the cold and withered Star Field made Jian Wushuang frown.","Could it be that people from the Void Universe had already started to enter the vicinity of the Land of Sorrows?","As Jian Wushuang thought about it, he started to feel uneasy. The disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were left in the Land of Sorrows were one of the Heart Fire of the Divine Power Universe. If an existence like Devour One came here, the consequences would be unimaginable.","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang did not dare to stay any longer. He immediately steered the Cosmic Boat and rushed towards the Land of Sorrows at full speed.","!!","After sprinting for more than a month, Jian Wushuang ran into a group of people he did not want to meet the most.","He was wearing a black shirt and a black mask, revealing only a red eye, which was the symbol of the Devourers.","At this moment, four members of Devourers were hurrying over from the direction of the Land of Sorrows.","The leader of the group froze on the spot when he saw the shabby Cosmic Boat.","Just as Jian Wushuang gathered all his divine power and was prepared to fight a fierce battle.","The four members of Devourers turned into four bolts of lightning and avoided the Cosmic Boat. Then, they headed toward the Void Universe without looking back.","Old Master, who was lying on the top of the Cosmic Boat, only opened his eyes to look at the place where the Devourers had left. Then, he closed his eyes and went back to sleep.","“That, that’s it?” Jian Wushuang was confused but he did not stay for long. He continued to fly towards the Land of Sorrows.","After another half a month, the Cosmic Boat finally arrived at the Land of Sorrows.","Looking at the familiar passage, Jian Wushuang heaved a long sigh of relief. However, when he looked at the Imperial Ancestor Ruins not far away, he began to think.","‘Those members of Devourers didn’t enter the Land of Sorrows... Did they enter the Imperial Ancestor Ruins?’","Could Devour One, who had reached the Ancestor realm, be related to the Imperial Ancestor Ruins?","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang drove the Cosmic Boat into the Land of Sorrows.","There were no longer any strange ghosts or weeping songs in the dark passage. It was just like an ordinary passage.","After passing through the final barrier, the brilliant divine might was reflected in his eyes.","The God burial ground ruins that were frozen in time contained a Godly might. Even the Old Master, who was lying on the top of the Cosmic Boat, bounced up instantly.","“Such a well-hidden blessed land, I really did not expect it,” Old Master murmured softly.","Jian Wushuang did not hear what Old Master said. He had already plunged into the depths of the burial ground when he landed the Comic Boat.","Over there, tens of thousands of training halls of various sizes were densely packed. It was a spectacular sight.","There was a disciple of the Divine Life Palace meditating in each small training hall.","At this moment, Supreme Jun Fu and Supreme Tian Yi were teaching a group of disciples who had just advanced to the Supreme realm how to skillfully regulate their meridians.","Ninth Kalpa King, who was dressed in a white robe, was lying down in his own training hall. Together with Lan Lan, they were supervising whether there were any disciples slacking off.","Supreme Xue Bo, who had been in seclusion until Jian Wushuang left, had woken up a long time ago and continued to cultivate in front of the Myriad Daoist Rite Temple.","Ninth Kalpa King had been doing this kind of supervision task for several years. When he inadvertently yawned, a young Ranger in black clothes and robes appeared in front of him.","“Jian, Jian Wushuang?!”","Ninth Kalpa King jumped up. When he saw that the guy in front of him was really Jian Wushuang, he opened his arms and hugged him heavily.","“Hey, hey, be gentle. It’s not like we haven’t seen each other for a few hundred years.” Jian Wushuang laughed and hugged him back.","No matter when or what realm he was in, Ninth Kalpa King and the Divine Life Palace had already been regarded as an indispensable part of Jian Wushuang’s life.","Letting go of Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King looked at him carefully and then smiled. “Your realm has improved a lot. If I had known earlier, I would have gone with you.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Did anything happen while I was gone?”","Ninth Kalpa King said, “Nothing much. Everything is normal. In addition, I’ll tell you some good news. In the past few years, more than 90 disciples have broken through the Ruler realm and reached the Supreme realm.","Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “It’s indeed good news. There are nearly 400 Supremes in total. It’s enough to influence the entire battle.”","As the two of them conversed, Supreme Jun Fu, Supreme Tian Yi, and the others had already found out about Jian Wushuang’s return and ran over happily.","“Palace Master Wushuang. Forgive us, we’re late.” The two of them cupped their hands, and there was a bit of excitement between their brows.","“Greetings, Palace Master Wushuang.” Lan Lan said with a smile.","Leng Rushuang also ran over. She could not hold back her desire to see the man she had been thinking about all day long. She opened her arms and hugged Jian Wushuang tightly.","“I’ve made you worry, Madam.” Jian Wushuang patted Leng Rushuang on her back.","Holding back her tears, Leng Rushuang said, “If you’re going to such a dangerous place next time, I’ll go with you.”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and said, “As you wish.”","Chu Zhi knelt on the deck and looked at the warm scene through the gap of the railings. Her eyes were red.","“What’s the matter, little girl? What’s there to be sad about?” Old Master appeared beside the Chu Zhi at some point in time, and her figure was reflected in his dark pupils.","Chu Zhi hurriedly rubbed her eyes. “No, some sand just got into my eyes.”","The elderly man shook his head helplessly. He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was not far away, and then at Chu Zhi. He said indifferently, “Let’s go, little girl. We should go down.”","...","“Has Xue Bo already broken through to reach the Invincible Supreme realm?”","Jian Wushuang nodded after hearing the confirmation from Jun Fu.","It was even more difficult for an Invincible Supreme to reach the Half Ancestor realm than for a Half Ancestor to reach the Ancestor realm.","It was never difficult to create two from one, but it was rare to create one from the origin.","To advance from the Invincible Supreme realm to the Half Ancestor realm, one had to be born from the origin.","It was a path that was completely unimaginable.","From the confusion, he saw himself. One would gain Enlightenment from the Dao, and gain Dao from Enlightenment.","Every step was a process of denial and reconstruction, like a phoenix rising from the ashes to finally prove its own Dao.","As for Supreme Xue Bo, he had successfully advanced to the Half Ancestor realm.","“It seems that our Divine Life Palace has two Half Ancestor level existences. We’ll be able to fight against the high-end combat forces of the Void Universe!”","Master Jun Fu analyzed. In his subconsciousness, he had already regarded Jian Wushuang as a Half Ancestor realm expert.","“However, what if the Void God breaks free from the seal?” Supreme Tain Yi promptly reminded him, “It seems that the time is almost up.”","Hearing Tian Yi’s words, everyone fell silent. Void God was in the Ancestor realm. Without the restraint of Cosmos God, who could contend against him?"]},{"number":4612,"title":"Chapter 4612 Assemble (2)","paragraphs":["4612 Assemble (2)","Ancestor realm beings stood at the peak, regardless of whether they were from the Divine Power Universe or the Void Universe.","That realm had long surpassed everyone’s imagination.","Void God could destroy the Divine Power Universe with a wave of his hand.","If it was the previous Jian Wushuang, he would probably still feel helpless about this problem. However, he was no longer the same as before.","One move could suppress Devour Two at Half Ancestor realm and destroy a part of Void God’s True Shadow. As long as Jian Wushuang was not surrounded by many Half Ancestors and it was the home field of the Divine Power Universe, he was confident that he could stabilize the battlefield.","!!","The only variable was that Void God and the Devourers were now corresponding opponents.","Jian Wushuang turned around.","Old Master walked over slowly in his black water robe had a childish look on his face. His special aura seemed to be carrying the entire Polar Sea behind him, full of endless power.","The old man from the Polar Sea Star Field, who had signed a contract with Jian Wushuang and whose background was unknown, was already standing with Jian Wushuang.","Although Supreme Jun Fu and the others did not show any hostility, they still became cautious when they sensed the special energy fluctuations that could not be ignored.","Supreme Xue Bo, who had been meditating, opened his eyes at the same time.","The terrifying divine power of a Half Ancestor soared into the sky. In the next moment, he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and looked at Old Master with great caution.","“He’s on our side, Supreme Xue Bo,” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and said. Then, he briefly explained how he had met Old Master.","However, Jian Wushuang did not mention that the old man had killed Devour One easily. After all, in such a situation, it would only confuse the disciples.","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Jun Fu nodded and said, “In that case, he’s not from the Void Universe. He must belong to our Divine Power Universe.”","Old Master did not speak and stood behind Jian Wushuang with Chu Zhi.","“And this is?” Supreme Jun Fu looked at Chu Zhi in confusion.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes dimmed. “It’s a child under the Sky-Sealing Ancestor. Her name is Chu Zhi.”","The atmosphere instantly turned heavy. For a moment, everyone loathed the various evil deeds of the Void Universe.","“Palace Master Wushuang, all disciples of the Divine Life Palace are at your disposal!” Supreme Xue Bo knelt down on one knee and cupped his hands.","Tens of thousands of voices rang out at the same time, shaking the clouds.","After making the plan, the disciples of the Divine Life Palace in the Land of Sorrows boarded the Cosmic Boat and prepared to leave.","Standing at the bow of the first Cosmic Boat, Jian Wushuang looked at the God Burial Ground, which was still as majestic as ever. His eyes were filled with gratitude and he bowed three times.","The familiar scene gradually faded away. The small dojo of 10,000 square meters was lifted up by an ownerless divine power and still maintained its original state. It was as if they had only left for a while and would soon return to their respective dojos.","Every disciple of the Divine Life Palace knew that most of them would die on the battlefield.","However, they still did not turn back, as if they were going to do something insignificant.","This was their duty and their mission.","After leaving the Land of Sorrows, Jian Wushuang looked at the Imperial Ancestor Ruins. After hesitating for a moment, he gave up.","The Divine Power Universe had already fallen, and he could not waste any time.","Void God had yet to return. Jian Wushuang decided to kill all the living forces in the Void Universe during this period of time.","Within three months, the three Cosmic Boats had started to approach the battlefield from the edge of the Divine Power Universe.","As they got closer and closer to the battlefield, some broken pieces of treasures and the remains of Supreme realm cultivators started to appear.","The divine blood formed a river and floated in the void. It would continue to flow for tens of thousands of chaos cycles until it was slowly turned into nutrients and absorbed by the universe.","There was no longer any fighting in the shattered starry sky on the Offworld Battlefield. Only the wreckage of the Supremes floated miserably in the void.","It was only when he arrived at the base camp that was originally guarded by Cosmos God that Jian Wushuang felt a surge of void power.","From a distance, there were no less than 15 Void Masters patrolling the periphery, not to mention the other Void Masters who had already occupied the base camp.","Suppressing his anger, Jian Wushuang signaled the Cosmic Boat to stop at a distance. He brought Old Mater and Xue Bo to the base camp quietly.","Old Master had never refuted or denied Jian Wushuang’s plans. It was as if he would do whatever he wanted.","Even Jian Wushuang, who had the lowest cultivation realm among the three of them, had the strength of a Half Ancestor. It was easy to kill a group of Void Masters who had only reached the Three Scar level.","However, it would be difficult to do it quietly. Just as Jian Wushuang was about to release the Four Season Control of the Tarot Sword Manual, a familiar aura of desolation spread from Old Master’s hand.","A dark crystal light appeared in the void and covered the periphery of the main camp like frost. The patrol team of 14 Void Masters seemed to have fallen into a swamp and stopped moving.","The aura was sealed in ice, and the surroundings were so quiet that even the astral winds could not be heard.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang shouted and rushed over. With a wave of his hand, his vast divine power crushed the 14 Void Masters into powder like thunder.","Even Supreme Xue Bo, who had already advanced to the Half Ancestor realm, could not help but gasp when he saw that Jian Wushuang had killed more than a dozen Void Masters with such a casual palm strike. His heart immediately burned with excitement.","In just one year, Jian Wushuang had been able to suppress so many Void Masters. What about a million years later? Would he be able to become the next Cosmos God and lead the Divine Power Universe out of its predicament?","A million years was just a period of time for them to enter closed-door cultivation, but it also contained endless possibilities.","If Surpeme Xue Bo had known that Jian Wushuang had killed a Half Ancestor by himself, his jaw would have been dislocated.","After eliminating the patrol team, three figures quietly entered the base camp.","In the magnificent and vast hall, nearly a hundred powerful figures gathered and chatted happily.","The giant man sitting at the head of the table had six shining Scars on his shoulders. He held two trembling maids from the Divine Power Universe in his arms and laughed.","In this hall full of Void Masters, sitting at a square table below the giant man, divine power was surging.","A handsome middle-aged man was dressed in a Confucian robe. There were two-inch-long dragon horns in his black hair, indicating his identity as someone from the Dragon clan.","Natural divine power surged around his body, and at this moment, he was drinking and chatting with the Void Masters in the hall.","If Jian Wushuang had seen this, he would definitely have realized that this handsome and elegant middle-aged man was Long Bai, the third heir of the Dragon clan, the younger brother of the evil Dragon clan leader, Long Chen, who had entered the Invincible Supreme realm!"]},{"number":4613,"title":"Chapter 4613 Humiliation","paragraphs":["4613 Humiliation","Smoke rose from the incense burner in the center of the hall. A drunk Six Scar Void Master kicked the table away and began to dance in the hall with his ugly and strange body.","Long Bai sat in his original position, a trace of disgust flashing through his eyes, which was quickly concealed by a smile. He clapped from time to time, as if he was watching a beautiful dance.","The giant man sitting at the head of the table laughed out loud again. He directly picked up the maidservant sitting on his left leg, stretched out his arms, and twisted her head off.","Blood splattered as the huge man twisted off the head of another maidservant. The two heads fell into the huge man’s hands like walnuts and were coiled up.","“Long Bai!” A low and gloomy voice came from the huge man’s mouth, “The 200 maidservants you sent are really good. I enjoyed most of them. Look.”","Upon hearing this, Long Bai smiled and cupped his hands. “Lord High Void Emissary, as you said, I will offer you another 300 Holy Maidens for you to enjoy.”","The giant man called High Void Emissary nodded in satisfaction. “That’s good. When Void God returns, I’ll speak to him and ask him to leave the Dragon clan behind while we continue to control the area.”","Long Bai’s eyes flashed with joy, and he quickly cupped his hands. “Thank you, Lord High Void Emissary. The Dragon clan is willing to do our best to help Void God expand his territory.”","High Void Emissary smiled sinisterly and said with a strange voice, “I heard that your Dragon clan is prosperous. The women in your clan are all exceptionally beautiful and have strong bodies. How about you bring ten women from your clan next time?”","A trace of fury burst out in Long Bai’s eyes. He almost wanted to kill the High Void Emissary in an instant, but he forcibly suppressed it.","“I, don’t understand what High Void Emissary means,” Long Bai said through gritted teeth.","The High Void Emissary smiled sinisterly. “As long as you bring the ten Dragon clan women to me, the Dragon clan’s original territory will remain unchanged, and you can choose any seven territories for your own use. How about it?”","The Dragon clan’s innate pride and dignity were completely humiliated. Long Bai’s palm, hidden under the sleeves of his robe, slowly loosened.","After that, he cupped his hands and said without changing his expression. “This is a serious matter. Please allow me to go back and ask for the opinions of the Patriarchs.”","After saying this, Long Bai sat back down in a daze.","The overbearing leader of the Dragon clan who had led all the major forces to besiege the Divine Life Palace of life was now begging for peace like a dog!","He could vaguely sense that the opinions of the Patriarchs were completely wrong.","However, could everything still be salvaged?","The High Void Emissary, who was sitting at the head, was extremely happy. This race that was known for their arrogance was being humiliated by him at this moment. That feeling of conquest was far more satisfying than slaughtering the entire Star Field!","The High Void Emissary leaned back in his chair in satisfaction. Perhaps it was because he had drunk too much wine or because he had gathered too much Yin, but his head began to feel a little dizzy.","Everything began to spin, and overlapping shadows appeared. The High Void Emissary tried to shake his head and glanced at the center of the giant Hall. He did not know when, but three figures were standing there.","“Who are you? Quickly report what happened,” the High Void Emissary shouted.","However, he did not get an answer.","The group of Void Masters who were still toasting each other seemed to have been frozen, and they did not move.","The High Void Emissary finally regained some of his senses. To his horror, he realized that he could no longer move his body!","A blood phantom suddenly appeared in front of him. A domineering furious roar was the last sound the High Void Emissary heard.","“Bastard!”","Supreme Xue Bo extended his palm, and the divine power of a Half Ancestor easily shattered his head.","A mist of blood spurted out, and the mountain-like figure collapsed.","Everything seemed to be playing in slow motion. Long Bai watched the entire scene, and his heart turned cold.","“You have disappointed me. Your Dragon clan has disappointed me too much.”","A pained voice rang out, and a figure appeared in front of Long Bai.","Long Bai slowly raised his head, and that face that he couldn’t be more familiar with was now imprinted in his eyes.","Jian... Jian Wushuang ...","His eyes were filled with pain as he looked at that face. For some reason, the resentment in his heart had disappeared without a trace, replaced by shame and guilt.","“An ancient race that has existed since the chaos of the world, have all your pride been eaten by dogs?!”","Jian Wushuang glared at Long Bai and directly pulled him up by the collar.","Long Bai came back to his senses and felt humiliated. The divine power that belonged to an Invincible Supreme forced Jian Wushuang to take a few steps back.","“How dare you, Jian Wushuang. Do you think you can humiliate the Dragon clan?” Long Bai said angrily.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang sneered, “It’s not an outsider who’s causing the humiliation, but you!”","The shame of being looked down upon made Long Bai lose his mind instantly. He immediately summoned his Life Origin Phantom, a golden dragon with divine power, and collided with Jian Wushuang with extreme terror.","As long as he killed Jian Wushuang, no one would ever know about the most humiliating side of the Dragon clan!","Boom!","After the golden dragon phantom hit Jian Wushuang, it could not move an inch further!","Jian Wushuang responded with his palm and then twisted it suddenly. The phantom golden dragon was crushed into powder.","Long Bai himself, on the other hand, seemed to have been hit by a giant hammer. His figure retreated and was embedded into the wall with a loud bang.","Retracting his palm, Jian Wushuang walked to Long Bai step by step, his eyes as calm as still water.","After that, he slowly stretched out his palm and faced Long Bai, slapping his mouth with both hands!","Each sound was louder than the last, as if they could crack the sky, and they echoed in the giant hall.","After taking care of all the Void Masters in the hall, Supreme Xue Bo stood side by side with Old Master and watched Jian Wushuang whip and swing at Long Bai without blinking.","“His blood!” Supreme Xue Bo smacked his lips.","Old Master nodded in agreement.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang finally stopped. He swung his palm and shook off the Dragon blood.","Long Bai, whose head was as swollen as a basket and whose face looked like he had opened a dye shop, finally knelt on the ground.","Long Bai, who had almost been pulled out of his original form, had a dazed look in his eyes. He muttered, “I was wrong, I was wrong...”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang said, “This is not your fault alone. It’s the fault of your entire Dragon clan. I’m going to demand an explanation!”","Long Bai suddenly raised his head. “Let me go. I’ll definitely persuade the Patriarchs when I get back.”","“I can’t let you live. I can’t let you live just because you’ve gathered the Holy Lands and Holy Maidens of the Divine Power Universe and offered them to the Void Universe to torture and kill,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently, as if he had set the final judgment.","When Long Bai heard this, it was as if all his strength had been sucked out of him, and he slumped to the ground.","“If that’s the case, then help me pass a message to the Dragon clan’s Patriarchs and tell them not to continue making mistakes.”","When a person was about to die, his words were also kind.","When a bird is about to die, its cry is also sorrowful."]},{"number":4614,"title":"Chapter 4614 To the Dragon Clan","paragraphs":["4614 To the Dragon Clan","Jian Wushuang nodded. Then, he used his palm as a knife and cut off Long Bai’s head.","An Invincible Supreme being of the Dragon clan had fallen just like that.","The aura of the Dragon clan’s law-enforcement officers, who would kill no matter how far away they were, did not appear again.","“Palace Master Wushuang, shall we continue to move forward or...?” Supreme Supreme Blood stepped forward and asked.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and put Long Bai’s head into his Interspatial Ring. He muttered, “Now that the Divine Power Universe has fallen, if we continue to advance rashly, I’m afraid we will run into the army of the Void Universe. We will station here and wait for reinforcements.”","“Reinforcements? We still have more?” Supreme Blood said uncertainly.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “If the reinforcements don’t come, we’ll go and invite them. For example, we’ll go and invite the Dragon clan, which has already returned to the Void Universe.”","“Well, what if they ignore us?” Supreme Xue Bo asked.","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “If they stop at the edge of the cliff, or if they are reasonable, I will not pursue their surrender. But if they openly express that they have surrendered, then I will kill them all.”","Supreme Xue Bo felt a chill run down his neck. He felt that Jian Wushuang’s words were law. If he said that he would kill the entire clan, he would definitely fulfill his promise.","Supreme Xue Bo walked out of the giant hall in the main camp and led more than 10,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace to the main camp.","Jian Wushuang injected two of his Ancestral Skills, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate and Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate, into the Nailstone that could contain everything and handed it over to the Supreme Xue Bo for safekeeping. At the same time, he also injected the first move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent into the Nailstone and handed it over to Supreme Jun Fu for safekeeping.","With these three moves, Jian Wushuang was confident that even a Half Ancestor would be killed.","With Supreme Xue Bo, Jun Fu and Tian Yi guarding the base camp, they would definitely be able to hold on until Jian Wushuang returned even if they were in danger.","After giving some instructions to the crowd, Jian Wushuang brought Old Master along and set off for the Dragon clan.","The Dragon clan’s fief was vast and almost occupied the most ancient Star Field in the entire Divine Power Universe.","They enjoyed the most perfect resources, but in the Great Catastrophe War, they were the first to surrender.","Jian Wushuang did not know how many forces in the Star Field had surrendered, but it was time to settle the score!","Wan Ye Star Field.","The most ancient Star Field was the core Star Field of the Dragon clan. Only the Dragon clan’s clansmen who had reached the Supreme realm could enter and continue cultivating. It was said that the Wan Ye Star Field contained the purest divine power core in the entire Divine Power Universe. One day of cultivation there was equivalent to a hundred years in the human world.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was heading straight for Wan Ye Star Field!","Along the way, Jian Wushuang saw that half of the Star Fields and Divine kingdoms had either been destroyed or were still resisting.","The ordinary cultivators without any strength could only wait in despair for the monster that suddenly broke into their respective Star Fields.","Looking at the evil deeds they had done, Jian Wushuang had no pity for them. With a wave of his hand, he killed them with all.","Jian Wushuang had killed countless cultivators in the Void Universe and saved countless Star Fields by the time he arrived in the Wan Ye Star Field.","At this moment, he was filled with anger.","This was the most ancient and vast star area, and there was no sign of an invasion by the Void Warriors. It was peaceful and happy.","“Who dares to trespass the Dragon clan’s forbidden area? leave quickly to avoid death!”","Waves of Dragon power emerged from the towering gate and hit Jian Wushuang’s body as if they were chasing away flies.","“Good, what a great prestige!” Jian Wushuang was so angry that he laughed. He held the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand and said, “I’ll see how long the Dragon clan can hide today!”","The vast divine power was completely concentrated on the Tarot Divine Sword, and the divine power floating in the universe was all condensed under this sword.","“Break!”","The roar was like a divine punishment. The sword that had long exceeded the limits of the rules directly cracked the sky and collapsed the starry sky.","Just one sword strike, vigorous and vast!","A sword that could support the heavens and earth slashed towards the towering main gate of the Wan Ye Star Field.","As if doomsday had arrived, the main gate collapsed instantly. Sword Intent swept across the earth, directly overturning mountains and rivers, reversing the flow of the sea, and changing the color of the sky!","A sword that stretched for a million miles turned everything into nothingness!","“Who did this?!!”","A loud roar that carried boundless dragon power resounded. A dark golden dragon rose up and looked at Jian Wushuang with his star-sized dragon eyes.","The dark golden dragon’s left arm had been cut off from the root, and dragon blood with a seven-colored divine rhythm flowed out.","He was originally stationed at the main gate of the Wan Ye Star Field and spent every day sleeping. Who would have thought that someone would call his door like this? If he had not been alert, his head would have been cut off!","However, he tried his best to restrain himself and did not release his overbearing Dragon’s might. He was not a fool. The guy who could destroy thousands of miles of the Wan Ye Star Field and cut off one of his arms with one sword strike was definitely not someone he could fight against.","Jian Wushuang put away the Tarot Divine Sword and said, “Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, I’m here to ask your Patriarchs to come out!”","“You’re impudent!” The dark golden dragon could not take it anymore. He charged at Jian Wushuang with the pride of a dragon.","With a cold snort, an invisible sword essence appeared and slashed down at the dark golden dragon!","Without any sound, a huge dragon head with angry eyes was in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","The headless dragon corpse fell into the void with its last bit of inertia.","Carrying the dragon head, Jian Wushuang brought the old man and entered the Wan Ye Star Field.","Dragon blood splattered on the ground, and dragon corpses fell into the mountain streams one by one.","Jian Wushuang had killed countless descendants of the Dragon clan and there was already a pile of dragon heads in his Interspatial Ring!","Jian Wushuang only put away the Tarot Divine Sword when the Dragon clan’s descendants stopped their pursuit.","“Bring me to your Patriarchs. If you don’t, I’ll visit them one by one!” Jian Wushuang said coldly. He shook his body and dragon blood fell from his body.","All of the Dragon clan’s descendants were terrified. No one dared to step forward to intercept him. Instead, they voluntarily opened up a path.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and just sped away.","The mountains and rivers gradually disappeared, and in their place were giant Dragon statues that stood tall.","This was the forbidden land of the Dragon clan. Since the beginning of chaos, only Jian Wushuang had set foot here!","Each of the Dragon statues had the aura of a Half Ancestor!","Among the Dragon statues, there was a stone path paved with green stones that led to the huge hall that covered the sky!","After dispersing his divine power, Jian Wushuang walked on the main road and approached the giant hall.","The Dragon statues on both sides seemed to come alive. All kinds of dragon breath formed a black and yellow Qi that swept toward the giant hall.","Jian Wushuang grinned. “The Divine Life Palace has come to visit. I hope that all of you, who are hiding in the shadows, will come and meet me!”"]},{"number":4615,"title":"Chapter 4615 Break Through the Dragon Clan’s Forbidden Land","paragraphs":["4615 Break Through the Dragon Clan’s Forbidden Land","A voice laced with divine power was like a bell that resounded through the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. His voice grew louder and louder. “The Divine Life Palace has come to visit. I hope that all of you, who are hiding in the shadows, will come and meet me!”","Nearly a hundred golden dragons tore the sky apart and surrounded Jian Wushuang. Their dragon breaths filled the sky.","With just a rough glance, he discovered that all the golden dragons were at the Supreme realm, and he immediately sneered.","Among the hundred golden dragons, a giant dragon with scales that shone with seven-colored light bowed its head from the sky. “Do you know that this is the forbidden land of the Dragon clan? If you die within three breaths, I will not pursue this matter!”","Jian Wushuang glanced at it from the corner of his eyes and clenched his fist. The seven-colored giant dragon in the air fell to the ground miserably as if it had been grabbed by the neck.","With the Tarot Divine Sword in hand, Jian Wushuang was about to behead him when the clouds suddenly collapsed and a huge amount of dragon breath fell.","Even Jian Wushuang had no choice but to avoid the dragon breath that was flowing down like a waterfall.","The dragon’s breath, which contained a holy aura, opened up the sky and protected all the descendants of the Dragon race.","At the same time, a huge red-golden eye looked at Jian Wushuang through the clouds.","“You have ten breaths of time. Leave this place quickly. You shouldn’t be here.”","An extremely ancient voice seemed to have just woken up from a deep sleep, warning him.","Jian Wushuang laughed disdainfully. “Any land that belongs to the Divine Power Universe can be accessed by the people of the Divine Power Universe. Why can’t we access this area? And who made the rule that outsiders were not allowed to enter? So What if I don’t leave?”","“Ignorant brat, since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish.”","The scarlet-golden eyes in the clouds suddenly focused, and the Dragon’s might was vast. A dark golden dragon head that seemed to carry the power of the entire Star Field appeared in the sky.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the mighty golden dragon indifferently. He knew that he was the elder brother of Long Bai from the evil Dragon clan, Long Chen, who had experienced the first Great Catastrophe War!","At the same time, the giant claw that was covered with ancient scars was like a giant pillar that held up the sky and crushed down on Jian Wushuang!","Old Master took a step forward and was about to hit the ground with the scepter condensed from black water, but he was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","“I’ll do it, I can handle it.” After Jian Wushuang finished speaking, a vast amount of divine power rose from his body and hit Long Chen’s giant claw.","Swish!","The two energies that were enough to destroy the world collided, and the resulting explosion swept away the clouds. The gathered Dragon clan descendants were also blasted far away by the explosion.","The two stopped at the same time. The stone road under Jian Wushuang’s feet had cracked into a big pit.","As for Long Chen’s giant claw, half of the scales on it had been shattered.","The silence lasted for a few seconds before the giant dragon in the sky slowly dissipated. In its place was an old man with white hair and a white beard in a black and gold robe.","Long Chen, who had been in a deep slumber for countless chaos cycles, had now awoken. The might of his Third-Generation bloodline caused all of the Dragon clan descendants to prostrate themselves before him.","Long Chen stood in front of the main gate of the giant hall, staring at Jian Wushuang with his golden eyes.","“I... have seen you before.” Long Chen’s old but dignified voice rang out.","Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “Yes, of course we’ve met. However, the few times we met were in such unpleasant situations.”","Long Chen snorted coldly and stepped forward. A towering Dragon’s might pressed down on him. “You killed my people and destroyed millions of miles of my Wan Ye Star Field. What do you think the dignity of the Dragon race is?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang laughed, “Since when did the Dragon clan have dignity? Don’t you all only know how to favor your own kind and suppress your fellow people in the same universe?”","“Boy, you’re looking for death!” Long Chen’s anger was like a punishment from the heavens. He struck Jian Wushuang with his palm.","The giant claw tore the space apart, and the powerful divine power instantly blocked all his escape routes.","Jian Wushuang remained standing in the same place. Facing the suppressing palm, he only drew out the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed gently.","Just like the melting of ice and snow, the most domineering dragon’s breath seemed to drown in the ocean and dissipated.","Jian Wushuang broke the Dragon power easily and walked toward Long Chen.","Long Chen, who had become an Invincible Supreme during the first Great Catastrophe, was now in the Ancestral Dragon Forbidden Land, and his strength was comparable to that of a Half Ancestor.","However, for some reason, when he saw this ant-like figure walking over, he suddenly felt an inexplicable sense of danger.","However, this absurd thought was quickly thrown to the back of his mind. An ant was an ant. How could it shake a dragon?","With this in mind, Long Chen took another step forward. His vast dragon breath surged and transformed into his Natal Golden Dragon, which crashed into Jian Wushuang.","He was sure that Jian Wushuang would not be able to block this attack no matter what.","The frost that came from nowhere was like vines, growing and forming a magnificent cage.","Supreme Tarot’s phantom form appeared behind Jian Wushuang. It transformed into the purest Tarot Sword Intent and slashed forward!","The road paved with bluestone shattered from the middle, and the earth caved in!","The golden dragon that was charging over was instantly cut in half from the center of its eyes when it came into contact with the Tarot Sword Intent.","The dragon breath was shattered, and the golden dragon phantom dissipated.","Long Chen took a heavy step back, the Qi and Blood in his body in turmoil. With his Natal Dragon Soul shattered, he also suffered a serious injury.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the destroyed path under him and jumped up, heading straight for Long Chen.","Ignoring his Qi and Blood, Long Chen also responded with a move.","The majestic Heavenly Gate appeared out of nowhere, and a giant finger came from behind the gate, crushing down heavily.","Long Chen, who had already raised his dragon breath to the level of a Half Ancestor, felt as if he had fallen into an ice cave when he saw the giant finger above his head.","That Ancestral Skill that could only be mastered by Cosmos God had smashed right into his head.","The defense that had just been raised was crushed immediately. Long Chen did not even have time to make a sound before he disappeared completely in the brilliant divine might.","The ground was completely shattered, and after the divine might dissipated, a huge pit was left behind.","The hundred or so Dragon clan descendants who were watching from afar immediately rushed over upon seeing this.","Old Master stood in place and silently cast the black scepter. Invisible ripples formed a barrier that blocked all the Dragon clan’s descendants.","In front of the giant pit, Jian Wushuang watched in slight amusement as he watched a figure slowly rising from the depths of the giant pit.","Crystal-clear dragon blood flowed out from the bone-deep wound. Long Chen’s body was already in pieces, and most of the dragon scales covering his body had also been shattered.","Looking at the dying figure, Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to attack. Instead, he said indifferently, “Do you want to ask why?”"]},{"number":4616,"title":"Chapter 4616 Curse Long Chen to Death","paragraphs":["4616 Curse Long Chen to Death","Long Chen did not speak, but stared at him with his dragon eyes.","However, Jian Wushuang’s next words made him tremble as if the most secretive thing had been made public.","“Why did the Dragon clan surrender to the Void Universe?”","This short sentence was like a thunderclap.","Long Chen’s lips moved. “H-how did you know?”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, “Because I met someone I shouldn’t have met in the base camp of the Offworld Battlefield and learned about these things.”","“Long Bai...” Long Chen seemed to have lost all his strength and asked in a daze, “Where is Long Bai now?”","“Because of your wrong decision, Long Bai paid the price he should have paid.” Jian Wushuang said as he touched his Interspatial Ring. Long Bai’s lifeless head appeared in Long Chen’s eyes.","“My brother!” Long Chen pounced forward, but was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","“Kid, you’re going to make the entire Dragon clan your enemy!” Long Chen stomped his feet and cried.","Jian Wushuang was silent. After a long while, he said, “I have never thought of being enemies with the Dragon clan. Whether it was in the past or now, I have never thought of it.”","“It’s you who pushed the entire Dragon clan to the brink of despair!”","“You thought that by surrendering to the Void Universe, you would be able to preserve the true strength of the Dragon clan. Little did you know that if the lips die, the teeth will grow cold. That will be the true disaster for the Dragon clan!”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, “Everything I’ve done today is to wake you up! Tell me, why did you surrender?”","Long Chen kept retreating, tears falling from his eyes. “Now that the Divine Power Universe has fallen and Cosmos God has died, tell me, if we don’t surrender, who can resist Void God and the Void Universe?”","“Foolish!” Jian Wushuang said with hatred, “Don’t you know the principle of mutual dependence?”","“You’re willing to endure such humiliation for the sake of living space. Do you think that others will want you even if you claim your land and act like dogs when the Divine Power Universe has fallen? Do you think they won’t bite you just because you cut off your own teeth?”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and conjured an image.","It was the scene in the base camp of the Offworld Battlefield. Long Bai, dressed in a long robe, sat below with an ashen face.","The High Void Emissary’s strange voice rang out. “As long as you bring the ten Dragon clan women to me, the Dragon clan’s original jurisdiction will remain unchanged, and you can choose any seven regions for your own use. How about it?”","Long Bai’s eyes flashed with humiliation and rage, but he held it in. He cupped his hands and said, “This is a serious matter. Please allow me to go back and ask the Patriarchs for their opinions.”","The pride and dignity of the Dragon race that came from the ancient times were completely destroyed and stepped on in such a short conversation.","At the end of the scene, Long Bai said his last word of advice before he died, “Tell my big brother and the others to stop making mistakes.”","“My little brother!” Long Chen cried out, and the world changed.","Holding Long Bai’s head with his divine power, Jian Wushuang gently pushed it to Long Chen.","“Even if you surrender to the Void Universe, they won’t let you off so easily. They’ll only slowly devour the entire Dragon clan.”","“Although the Divine Power Universe has fallen, there is still a chance for it to rise again. I don’t want the Dragon clan to go astray on this path.”","“So what if it lives and dies with the Divine Power Universe? This is our honor and our mission.” Jian Wushuang said calmly, “If it’s the opposite, the best situation for you is to be enslaved. Wouldn’t your enslaved descendants curse you, the Patriarchs who made the decision?”","Long Chen’s body trembled, and as if he could no longer take it, he spat out a mouthful of blood.","There was no longer any pride in his eyes, and it was replaced by old age and loneliness.","“You’re Jian Wushuang, right? You’re the little guy from the Divine Life Palace, right?” Long Chen said slowly.","Jian Wushuang replied, “Yes.”","Long Chen nodded, his cloudy eyes full of relief. “I have learned today.”","In the next moment, Long Chen suddenly struck out with his palm like a knife, aiming for his own neck.","Then, a head fell into the huge pit.","Long Chen, who had voluntarily dispersed his cultivation, transformed into his Natal Golden Dragon and slowly descended.","Everything happened so quickly that Long Chen was already dead by the time Jian Wushuang could react!","Jian Wushuang fell silent. Looking at the golden dragon’s corpse in the huge pit, which had dispersed its dragon breath, he murmured, “What a strong-willed man.”","“Patriarch!” When the hundreds of descendants of the dragon race saw this, they all shed tears.","Jian Wushuang gestured for Old Master to remove the barrier. The Dragon clan members on the outside rushed to the huge pit like crazy and knelt down heavily on the ground.","“Could it be that this trip to the Dragon clan is over just like this?” Jian Wushuang looked at the Dragon clan descendants who were kneeling on the ground and could not bear to punish them.","At this moment, there seemed to be a long bell ringing, and countless black and yellow energy surged in the hall.","The two gates opened slowly and a blurry figure waved his hand from afar, signaling Jian Wushuang to come forward.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang and Old Master looked at each other and immediately jumped into the sky-shrouding hall.","When he stopped outside the hall, Jian Wushuang could vaguely see that the blurry figure was a middle-aged woman.","The woman was dressed in plain clothes, with two wisps of Xuanhuang Qi wrapped around her left and right arms. When she saw Jian Wushuang, she lowered her head and said, “Follow me.”","With that, the woman took the lead and walked into the hall.","Jian Wushuang did not doubt her and also stepped into the hall.","As soon as he stepped in, the ripples that symbolized the enchantment spread slightly, and then returned to calmness.","The extremely dense dragon breath filled every inch of the space. Even Jian Wushuang felt the pressure.","The layout of this hall was very strange. At the center of the hall, there was a huge pillar that seemed to connect with the sky.","On top of this giant pillar, there was a red-gold divine dragon that was almost as tall as the giant pillar.","Each scale was twice the size of Jian Wushuang and was filled with pure golden essence.","Holy and majestic!","The middle-aged woman with the Qi of heaven and earth wrapped around her hand said respectfully, “Patriarch, the guest is here.”","The huge scarlet-golden scales began to move rhythmically. The golden dragon that was coiled on the giant pillar also began to move.","The Xuanhuang Qi became thicker and an unimaginably huge dragon head seemed to hang down from the Nine Heavens. Its eyes were like two Star Fields, reflecting Jian Wushuang’s figure.","And that Xuanhuang Qi spurted out from the nostrils of this unimaginably huge dragon.","“Welcome. I’m the Dragon Emperor of the ancestral bloodline of the Dragon clan. You can also call me Linhe.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly shocked. He realized that the power of the Dragon King had already exceeded the Half Ancestor level."]},{"number":4617,"title":"Chapter 4617 Ancestor-Level Fate Energy","paragraphs":["4617 Ancestor-Level Fate Energy","Recovering from his shock, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said, “I’m Jian Wushuang. Greetings to Dragon Emperor Linhe.”","The huge dragon’s head slowly nodded, and speckles of golden light began to spread from its body.","When the middle-aged woman saw this, she hurriedly said, “Patriarch, you can’t.”","The dragon’s body that was coiled on the giant pillar began to transform, and in a moment, it condensed into an old man in plain clothes.","The two huge dragon horns seemed to prove that he had an almost endless lifespan.","“Patriarch, you should continue to recuperate. How can you move again?” the middle-aged woman said worriedly.","The old man named the Dragon Emperor Linhe chuckled. “It’s fine. I’ve been sick for a long time. It’s fine to worsen it slightly.”","The middle-aged woman shook her head helplessly and did not say anything else. She followed behind the old man.","“My young friend, this is the first time I’ve seen an outsider who isn’t from the Dragon clan since that war,” Dragon Emperor Linhe said amiably. The pride that belonged to the Dragon race was nowhere to be seen on him, and he looked just like an ordinary old man. This caused the distance between the two of them to be shortened.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then said, “Are you talking about the Great Catastrophe War?”","“It’s much longer than that,” As if reminiscing, the Dragon Emperor Linhe shook his head and laughed. “That war was a war between the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans. I got my old illness from that war.”","“Little friend, do you know that before me, the universe’s fate energy could give birth to more than one Ancestor-level being?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was a little confused, “Isn’t it only possible to produce one?”","Linhe laughed and shook his head. “Back then, I was still young and my father was already at the Ancestor level. However, before the war between the three races, he suddenly fell and left me with an Ancestor-level aura.”","With that, Dragon Emperor Linhe opened his palm and a wisp of mystical aura unique to the Dragon clan appeared.","With the appearance of the mysterious aura, the divine power in their bodies, including Jian Wushuang’s, trembled and felt suppressed.","It was the fate energy of an Ancestor.","Linhe looked at the strand of Ancestor-level fate energy in his hand and said softly, “I originally wanted to comprehend the fate left behind by my father. However, the war between the three races came soon after. There were also hidden injuries in my body during that war, and I was unable to break through to the Ancestor-level.”","“Now,” Dragon Emperor Linhe looked at Jian Wushuang and waved his hand to transfer the Ancestor fate energy to him. “It should have a master.”","Jian Wushuang trembled and said almost at the same time as the middle-aged woman, “No, this can’t be.”","“Patriarch, that is the foundation of our Dragon clan!” The middle-aged woman said anxiously. “You gave it to an outsider. What should we do?!”","“Silence.” Dragon Emperor Linhe was displeased. “Don’t say anything more.”","Jian Wushuang forced a smile and said firmly, “Senior, this is too valuable. I will not accept it no matter what. If you insist on giving it to me, I will have to make you lose face.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe did not express his opinion. Instead, he said, “Little friend, can I have a word with you in private?”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement and then asked Old Master to wait there.","The middle-aged woman glared at Jian Wushuang and then flew out of the hall.","After that, Dragon Emperor Linhe carried Jian Wushuang forward slowly.","“I don’t understand,” After a while, Jian Wushuang said.","Dragon Emperor Linhe changed his answer. “My young friend, do you know why we fought the war between the three races? Do you know why the foundation of the Dragon clan was destroyed and we have not been able to recover?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Linhe explained, “That’s because our three clans found an Ancestor-level fate energy together. In order to fight for that sliver of fate energy, a war broke out.”","“As the most powerful of the three clans, the Dragon clan should have easily obtained that fate energy. However, my father suddenly disappeared, causing the Dragon clan to fall into a passive situation.”","“Even so, I, who became the temporary clan leader, commanded the entire Dragon clan and pushed the war to its climax.”","“At that time, I was already half a step into that realm. I single-handedly injured the Phoenix Patriarch of the Phoenix clan and the Qilin King of the Qilin clan. Not long after, my body started to deteriorate. It was also at that time that my serious illness took place, and the war ended in a hurry.”","“I’m still alive. It’s just that the serious illness at that time still affects me even now, and I know that I don’t have much time left.”","Linhe paused for a moment before he continued, “However, the Dragon clan has suffered severe injuries. Even to this day, we have yet to recover fully. The descendants of the clan are mediocre and none of us have managed to achieve that Enlightenment.”","“The Phoenix clan and the Qilin clan have already recovered. I can almost be sure that the Qilin clan has that small fate energy.”","“If I’m alive, they’ll still be afraid. If I die, I’m afraid the Dragon clan will be annihilated in an instant.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe revealed a bitter expression. “That’s why surrendering to the Void Universe was my order. I only wanted to give the Dragon clan a chance to survive. However, it seems like I was wrong. I was gravely wrong.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang completely understood what he meant. After pondering for a while, he firmly pushed the Dao Ancestor fate energy in his hands to Dragon Emperor Linhe.","“I can’t guarantee anything, but there’s one thing I can promise you. As long as I’m alive, the only way the Dragon clan dies is on the battlefield against the Void Universe.”","Jian Wushuang’s calm words were like an oath.","Hearing this, Dragon Emperor Linhe’s eyes turned red. He bent his knees to bow, but Jian Wushuang quickly stopped him.","“This old man is indebted to you, little friend. If you still decline the fate energy, I will no longer have any face left.” Dragon Emperor Linhe cupped his hands and gave up his Ancestor fate energy with a firm attitude.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. He really did not want to accept it. After all, he was still far from the Half Ancestor realm. If he accepted it so resolutely, not only would it be of great use to him, but he would also be owing the Dragon clan a favor.","In this way, he would have to take over the affairs of the Dragon clan and the other two clans. It was really troublesome.","However, looking at the determined look on Dragon Emperor Linhe’s face, Jian Wushuang could only accept it for the time being. He added, “This is only temporary. If the Dragon clan has an unparalleled prodigy in the future, I will definitely return it.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe understood what Jian Wushuang meant and a flash of sadness appeared in his eyes.","“I’ve said before that as long as I’m alive, the Dragon race can only die on the battlefield. Now that the two universes are completely at war, the most important thing is to resist together.” Jian Wushuang said, “This is the purpose of my visit.”","The Linhe Dragon monarch said solemnly, “From now on, all the descendants of the Dragon clan will be at your command. We’ll fight the Void Universe to the last moment!”"]},{"number":4618,"title":"Chapter 4618 Phoenix Clan","paragraphs":["4618 Phoenix Clan","Jian Wushuang replied, “You don’t have to listen to my orders. We have the same enemy. The Dragon clan and the Divine Life Palace can be allies, and we will resist the Void Universe together.”","“An army without a general is like a dragon without a head.” Dragon Emperor Linhe shook his head and handed him a crystal-clear Heart-Protecting Scale. “This is my token. Keep it well. With this token, you can command the entire Dragon clan.”","Jian Wushuang no longer declined. After putting the token into his Interspatial Ring, he said, “Now that the Dragon clan has returned, it’s time for me to go back to the Offworld Battlefield and deploy my forces.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe nodded and said, “My young friend, as far as I know, the Phoenix clan has completely surrendered to the Void Universe. You must be on your guard.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned and said, “The Phoenix clan surrendered. What about the Qilin clan?”","“The Qilin clan has been struggling ever since the Great Catastrophe War started. I’ve once sent descendants of the Dragon clan to help them, but they were all rejected,” Dragon Emperor Linhe said.","He took a deep breath and said in a deep voice, “It seems like I have to go to the Phoenix clan to meet them again.”","Linhe wanted to say something but hesitated. In the end, he spoke to Jian Wushuang with all his heart.","After walking out of the Dragon clan’s Forbidden Land, Jian Wushuang looked back from high up in the sky. In the end, he left the Wan Ye Star Field with Old Master.","Jian Wushuang heaved a long sigh of relief after learning about the ancient secret and the return of the Dragon clan.","With the Dragon clan’s full participation, the high-end battlefields could be pulled back almost instantly.","The Divine Power Universe was not the universe of the Divine Life Palace, but the universe of all the people and cultivators. Without the help of other forces, it would be difficult to support the universe alone.","After leaving Wan Ye Star Field, Jian Wushuang immediately headed to the Star Field where the Phoenix clan was.","Since the fall of the Divine Power Universe, the forces of the Void Universe had almost infiltrated more than half of it. From the Star-level to the Void Warriors, they had begun to seize it crazily. Countless Star Fields and Divine Countries had been destroyed, and at the same time, there were many Star Fields that had fought to the death or surrendered.","Two out of three ancient clans had surrendered. How could Jian Wushuang not be angry?","Crimson Sky Star Field.","It was one of the oldest super Star Fields in the Divine Power Universe. It was under the jurisdiction of the Phoenix clan. Rumors said that the Crimson Sky Star Field had tens of thousands of suns. Under the scorching sun, the Phoenix clan would undergo the Nirvana Inferno and reach the Supreme realm.","After traveling for more than half a year, Jian Wushuang finally arrived at the Crimson Sky Star Field.","Along the way, all the Star Fields were more or less occupied by the forces of the Void Universe, except for the Phoenix clan. It was similar to the Dragon clan, where not even a single Void Master was in sight.","As the main sect in the Crimson Sky Star Field, ten suns were hanging above the Star Field, emitting scorching flames.","Jian Wushuang did not feel uncomfortable at all. He pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword and destroyed the mountains and rivers within a million miles of the Crimson Sky just like he had destroyed the Dragon clan’s Wan Ye Star Field!","Several Phoenixes who had rushed over were all killed by the sword.","After taking care of the disciples of the Phoenix clan, Jian Wushuang strode into the Crimson Sky Star Field.","“Who dares to break into the Crimson Sky Forbidden Land?”","In the red sky illuminated by nearly a hundred suns, a Fire Phoenix with a wingspan of nearly a thousand feet covered the sky and the sun.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his hand on the hilt of the Tarot sword started to tighten.","However, the scene that he had imagined did not happen. The huge Fire Phoenix, carrying the power of the sun, circled above Jian Wushuang’s head for a while before transforming into a handsome young man and landing in front of him.","“Are you people from the Divine Life Palace?” the handsome young man looked at Jian Wushuang and said with uncertainty.","Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised, but he still nodded.","Hearing this, the handsome young man did not say much. He tilted his head and said, “Then come with me. Our Patriarch has been waiting for your Divine Life Palace for a long time.”","With that, the handsome young man turned back into a Fire Phoenix. The divine power of a Top Supreme expert soared into the sky and turned into a fiery red ribbon that swept into the distance.","Although the Divine Life Palace had always been a top force in the Divine Power Universe, it had not had much contact with the Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans.","The Phoenix clan, which had surrendered to the Void Universe, did not mind that Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, had destroyed the Star Field. Instead, it seemed that they had been waiting for the arrival of the Divine Life Palace, which made Jian Wushuang confused.","Without much speculation, Jian Wushuang and Old Master followed the traces left by the Fire Phoenix and plunged into the depths.","The further they went, the more suns there were in the sky. When they reached the depths, the entire sky was almost occupied by the suns. There were at least ten thousand of them.","Even with Jian Wushuang’s divine power, he felt that his throat was dry.","When they arrived at the deepest part of the Crimson Sky Star Field, a giant palace that was no smaller than the Dragon clan’s Forbidden Land appeared. At the same time, nearly 1,000 Phoenixes were standing on both sides of the palace, as if they were waiting for something.","When Jian Wushuang’s feet landed on the ground, he felt the scorching heat that could almost evaporate an ordinary Supreme. Jian Wushuang naturally looked at the figure of a Fire Phoenix, which was a thousand feet long, hovering in front of the giant hall.","Swish–","A long cry that pierced the clouds resounded, and the thousand-foot Fire Phoenix soared into the sky. A total of ten magnificent tail feathers left behind flowing lights and flames in the sky, which was extremely shocking.","With just one flap of its wings, the Phoenix was already in front of Jian Wushuang, and the flames flowing on its feathers almost sprayed on him.","However, Jian Wushuang did not panic at all. He just looked at it calmly.","Swish-","The magnificent flame feathers with flowing flames retreated, and an extremely pretty face appeared in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“I say, are you spacing out? Why didn’t you dodge? With your strength of a Half Invincible Supreme realm, aren’t you afraid that I’ll burn you to ashes?”","Although it was a gentle voice, it was full of heroic spirit.","Under that pretty face, the most fascinating thing was the extremely hot body half-covered by the flame feather coat.","“Wear your clothes properly, in case you catch a cold,” Jian Wushuang reminded her kindly.","The pretty girl was stunned, and then the divine power of fire suddenly rose. “Good, you fellow. I thought you were a fool, but I didn’t expect you to actually dare to tease me!”","Jian Wushuang did not want to waste time talking to her. He said directly, “Go find your Patriarch. I have something important to ask him.”","“What? Are you so shallow to think that I’m not the Ancestral Matriarch of the Phoenix clan?” the beautiful woman sneered and said.","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. He had never expected that the Patriarch of the Phoenix clan, one of the top ancient clans in the Divine Power Universe, would be such a young and beautiful woman.","“Another stupid guy who has been bewitched by beauty. Are all outsiders so shallow these days?” The beautiful woman sighed.","“Are you really the ancestral Matriarch of the Phoenix clan?”","“Naturally.”","Jian Wushuang sneered, “That’s good. I’ve been looking for you!”"]},{"number":4619,"title":"Chapter 4619 Bet","paragraphs":["4619 Bet","The Tarot sword, which could cut through anything in the world, was unsheathed, and its sharp tip was pointed at the neck of the Phoenix Matriarch.","In an instant, nearly a hundred descendants of the Phoenix clan transformed into a pair of huge wings and surrounded Jian Wushuang.","The Phoenix Matriarch’s eyes narrowed slightly before she calmed down and sneered, “I thought you were a fool, but it turns out that you’re a fool. With your Half Invincible Supreme stage, do you believe that I’ll burn you to a crisp?”","After that, a huge totem of a Phoenix rose from behind the Phoenix Matriarch, and the Phoenix let out a long cry.","“Go back and get the Palace Master of your Divine Life Palace here before I get angry,” she said in a deep voice, her words unquestionable.","Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “I am the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace.”","“Just you?” The Phoenix Matriarch sniggered, “And you are? If you really are the Palace Master, then with the strength of the descendants of the Phoenix clan, wouldn’t any one of them be able to become the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace?”","All the Phoenix clan members laughed.","“If you’re tactful, then quickly scram back and tell your Palace Master to come see me.” She waved her hand and started to look impatient.","At this moment, a loud voice was heard. “We can’t let him go! Matriarch, he’s the one who has just invaded and killed three of our disciples!”","All of a sudden, fiery light burst out. The great Matriarch of the Phoenix clan was furious. “I was wondering why the Crimson Sky Star Field was shaking. I thought it was those stupid b*stards. It turns out that it was you! You came with bad intentions! Do you want to die?”","After saying that, the fire Phoenix totem floating in the sky opened its mouth and spat out the world-extinguishing flame at Jian Wushuang!","Even Jian Wushuang could feel the burning sensation from the Half Ancestor level fire aura.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to be careless and directly released the fourth move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Four Seasons. As a result, the winter frost world, which had always been effective, naturally dissipated on the burning ground...","The explosive flame hit Jian Wushuang and he was sent flying.","With a wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang barely managed to extinguish the flames on his clothes. His face turned serious. If the Phoenix Matriarch had used all her strength in that attack, he would have been seriously injured.","In other words, the attack that destroyed the winter frost world was less than half of the Phoenix Matriarch’s power.","Jian Wushuang stopped underestimating his enemy and focused. A red-gold divine pattern slowly appeared and began to flow around his body.","Old Master, who had been following behind him silently, raised his eyes slightly when he saw this scene, but he soon calmed down.","The Phoenix Matriarch, who was about to criticize Jian Wushuang, turned serious. At the same time, she muttered to herself, “That can’t be. This kid is a Half Invincible Supreme. Why does he give me a sense of danger?”","“Hmph, you’re just pretending!” The Matriarch snorted coldly and turned into a huge Fire Phoenix that charged at Jian Wushuang.","He opened his golden eyes and an invisible blade formed in his right hand. Then, he swung it down at the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan.","The sword will spread for millions of miles, overturning the mountains and rivers, and dimming the sun.","The Phoenix Matriarch’s eyes were filled with fear. She suddenly realized that this kid was actually a bastard who was pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger!","The old Phoenix Matriarch came to a sudden stop in mid-air, and just as she was about to take a step back, she realized in horror that all her escape routes had been blocked by the ever-present Sword Intent!","“Damn bastard!” The Phoenix spoke in the human language. With no other choice, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan raised her head and let out a long cry. Nearly 100 suns trembled at the same time, and the scorching sunlight shone down, turning everything in sight into a sea of fire.","The giant Fire Phoenix endured the pain of being burned in the sea of fire.","Swish-","A shrill cry pierced through the sky, and the flaming feathers on its body were brilliant and magnificent. Countless streams of light and flames fell to the ground, and a giant Phoenix with wings that could cover the sky was born!","In the face of the vast Sword Intent, the giant Phoenix, with a huge sun in its mouth, collided with it.","The crimson red against the golden light only took an instant, but the newly formed fire domain cracked on a large scale. Not only was the golden Sword Intent not damaged, but it also accelerated the attack!","“Matriarch!” Nearly 100 Phoenix clan disciples rushed over. However, they were blocked by an invisible barrier the moment they raised their feet.","Old Master raised his eyes and paused for a moment with the black scepter in his hand, then fell silent again.","Feeling her domain shatter, a sense of helplessness welled up in her heart.","The Matriarch of the Phoenix clan let out a final cry before closing her eyes.","When the vast sword light shattered the last sea of fire, it stopped in front of her with endless power.","Time seemed to have stopped. A moment later, all the ice and snow melted, and the sword light disappeared.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his palm and said, “Open your eyes. You’re not dead.”","The Phoenix’s eyes opened slowly. The Matriarch of the Phoenix race, who had returned to her human form, was still hovering in the air, unable to believe that she was still alive.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and saw something he should not be looking at. He quickly looked away.","“I, I actually didn’t die,” The Matriarch of the Phoenix clan murmured softly. Then, she looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing on the ground with his hands behind his back.","With a flap of her wings, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan appeared before him.","“I said, why didn’t you kill me?” She panted slightly, her chest heaving up and down.","Jian Wushuang glanced at her and said, “I have the ability to kill you, but I can’t kill you now. I need to get an answer from you.”","“What answer?”","“Why did you surrender to the Void Universe? With your power of the Half Ancestor realm and your territory, it won’t be difficult for you to resist,” Jian Wushuang said.","The Matriarch of the Phoenix race was speechless. She pursed her lips and said after a while, “If I say that I’m only pretending to surrender and that I’m using this as an excuse to wait for an opportunity, would you believe me?”","“I would,” Jian Wushuang replied with two simple words.","The old Matriarch of the Phoenix race was stunned for a moment before her lips curled up into a beautiful smile. “To be able to take on the position of Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace at such a young age, you are indeed a meticulous person.”","Jian Wushuang ignored her and continued, “Since the Phoenix clan is pretending to surrender, let’s go to the Offworld Battlefield and fight against the enemy together with the Divine Life Palace.”","“No problem.” The Matriarch of the Phoenix clan was very straightforward. However, she changed the topic immediately and said, “However, I want to see if the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace has the ability to help the Qilin clan resist the attack of the Void Universe.”","“If you succeed, I can promise that the Phoenix clan will die for the Divine Power Universe!”","“Really?”","“Really!” the Matriarch of the Phoenix race said firmly.","“Deal, we’ll set off immediately.” Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement and turned around to leave.","Looking at the figure that was not sloppy at all, her pair of Phoenix eyes slightly narrowed, and then she shouted, “Wait for me!”"]},{"number":4620,"title":"Chapter 4620 Suppression","paragraphs":["4620 Suppression","“You’re following us too?”","In the vast Star Field, at the bow of the Cosmic Boat, Jian Wushuang turned to look at the Phoenix Matriarch.","“Of course. We’ve made a bet, so, of course, I have to follow you and supervise the completion of your side of the bargain,” she said leisurely, flames occasionally rising from her long crystal-red hair.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and did not speak anymore.","The Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans were on par with each other. Each clan occupied the most ancient and perfect Star Field, and the distance between them was also getting further. Even with the speed of the Cosmic Boat, it would take at least half a year to reach the Star Field of the Qilin clan.","On the way to the Qilin clan, the various Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms had fallen far more quickly than the previous Star Fields, with less than one in ten remaining.","A large number of Scar-level Void Masters began to set up camp here, and there were countless Star-level Void Warriors who robbed countless magical treasures and resources.","Jian Wushuang was not idle either. As long as he did not delay his journey, he started to kill the Void Warriors that occupied the various Star Fields and Divine kingdoms in large numbers.","As if the coldest divine punishment had descended, he killed countless people with a wave of his hand. Even the Three and FourScar Void Masters had no power to resist.","As for the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, she was getting more and more apprehensive the more she looked at him. Just where did this fellow come from? He was clearly a Half Invincible Supreme being, yet his attacks seemed to be at the very top of the hierarchy.","‘Could this fella have obtained the direct teachings of Cosmos God?’","That was what the Matriarch of the Phoenix race thought. Otherwise, how could he have defeated her so easily?","The Phoenix clan’s Matriarch was now at the peak of the Half Ancestor realm. Furthermore, she was in her own territory. She was confident that she could take on two Half Ancestors and retreat with ease.","However, Jian Wushuang defeated her, who was at the peak of Half Ancestor realm, with only one move. She began to look at Jian Wushuang with suspicion and confidence.","After a long time of random thoughts, the Phoenix Matriarch finally came up with a simple conclusion: No matter what, she could not afford to offend the Palace Lord of the Divine Life Palace.","Rodu Star Field.","It was one of the most vast and majestic Star Fields of the Qilin clan, and also the most unique Star Field. Outside of Rodu Star Field, there were a total of six smaller Star Field that formed a circle to protect Rodu.","It was said that there was a spring of chaos sealed under Rodu. The Qilin clan had received the order of the heavens and had been stationed here since the beginning of the chaos.","The Star Field shattered, and countless corpses of cultivators and Void Warriors floated in the broken void, filling the cracks with their blood.","In front of them, battle cries shook the heavens.","The countless Void Warriors were like a tide that reached the shore, and like a swarm of locusts, they rushed madly towards the Star Field that had not been broken through for a long time.","That was the Qilin clan’s Rodu.","Another Six Scar Void Master shook his arms and blasted a hole in the huge array in front of him. Dozens of One Scar Void Masters took advantage of the situation and swarmed forward, tearing it apart with all their might.","The army was formed by tens of thousands of descendants of the Qilin clan, and the seven-colored Halo that belonged to the Qilin clan shone on the myriad domain.","However, the pitch-black void energy was like a net that covered the entire world, trapping all the divine power within.","At the main gate of Rodu Star Field, on the sky-high city wall, an old man in a golden armor, exuding an overbearing divine power, looked at the battlefield.","Five young men in golden armor stood beside the old man.","This endless war had been going on for countless years, and nearly half of the descendants of the Qilin clan had died in this war of resistance.","On the other hand, those damn Void Warriors of the Void Universe were like locusts. They could not be killed all at once, and they had exhausted the Qilin clan’s strength.","The golden-armored old man’s originally spirited eyes had already dimmed. In this isolated and helpless situation, he did not know whether to continue resisting or to surrender.","With the announcement of the fall of the Divine Power Universe, all the top forces were either killed or destroyed.","The Qilin clan had already reached the end of their ropes.","“Stubborn members of the Qilin race, listen up. As long as you return to the Void Universe, we will stop attacking and allow you to continue governing your original Star Fields. Unnecessary resistance will only accelerate your own destruction.”","The advice to surrender that was wandering in the broken sky was repeated over and over again. For some reason, the old man was touched today.","After a long while, the golden-armored elder slowly closed his eyes. “My sons, what do you think?”","The five golden-armored young men standing behind him looked at each other and said firmly. “We fight to the last moment!”","“But I want you all to live.” The golden-armored old man’s face was filled with sorrow. “If we continue to resist like this, the Qilin clan will definitely be exterminated.”","The few of them looked at each other again, their eyes dimmed.","One of the slightly immature golden-armored youths said, “Not necessarily, Father. Perhaps we can really hold on until the day Big Brother comes out of seclusion.”","Hearing this, the golden-armored elder slowly shook his head. The hope that had risen in the depths of his eyes was quickly suppressed.","It had been too long, so long that he had almost forgotten that he had another son in seclusion.","That Heaven’s Favorite of the Qilin clan was born from the Heavens, but he never came out after entering the sealed door when he was at the peak.","No one knew if he was dead or alive.","The golden-armored elder could not, and did not dare to place his hopes on that illusory thing.","Perhaps, it was really time to end this.","Just as he was about to shout the word ‘surrender’, a clear voice suddenly rang out from the broken sky.","The flames lit up the sky as a fire huge Fire Phoenix rose into the air. Her wings spread out like clouds in the sky, and countless flames fell from her fire feathers!","It was like bathing in the flames of the nine nethers. Even a Scar-level Void Master would die instantly if they came into contact with the flames, their intestines and bones rotting!","As far as the eye could see, everything was in the middle of the explosion.","At the same time, a grand Heavenly Gate opened on the back of the huge Fire Phoenix. A golden divine light shone down and an unimaginable giant finger also descended.","Divine might shone, and the sky of the star field was completely shattered.","Both the Star-level Void Warriors and the Scar level Void Masters looked at the finger that was impossible to avoid and was like a divine punishment with their eyes wide open!","Boom, boom, boom!","The sky changed color, and the void caved in. Half of the huge army of the Void Universe was wiped out by the giant finger!","Like the dark clouds after the sun appeared, they all dispersed.","The sounds of fighting stopped. The remaining Void Warriors and Void Masters who had survived the finger were all frightened out of their wits and began to flee on a large scale.","Gulp...","All the descendants of the Qilin clan gulped in unison. They were still shocked by the grand Heavenly Gate.","After dispersing the divine power, Jian Wushuang, who was dressed in a black robe, walked in the void.","Flap, flap, flap!!!","The Fire Phoenix rose from behind Jian Wushuang and its eyes were full of fire.","“Little fellows of the Qilin clan, what are you all standing there for? Shouldn’t revenge be the most important thing right now?”"]},{"number":4621,"title":"Chapter 4621 The Cold Qilin Clan","paragraphs":["4621 The Cold Qilin Clan","With this, all the descendants of the Qilin clan on the battlefield recovered from their shock. As they looked at the Void Warriors who were on the verge of collapse, all the pent-up emotions in their hearts were completely released!","The remaining seven to eight thousand Qilin clan members instantly transformed into their Natal Qilin and launched the fiercest counterattack against the retreating army of Void Warriors.","On the walls of Rodu, the golden-armored elder’s dim eyes lit up when he saw this, but he quickly suppressed it and had a complicated expression on his face.","“Father, the Phoenix clan has come to help! We’re saved!” the young man in golden armor said excitedly.","“Sixth Brother, don’t be happy too early. The Phoenix clan isn’t any better than the bastards from the Void Universe. I’m afraid they’re up to no good!” the steadiest and strongest young man said.","“No, that black-robed guy is definitely not a member of the Phoenix clan.”","“What? He’s not from the Phoenix clan. I just saw him kill half of the army of Void Warriors with one move! Since when did such a terrifying being exist in our Divine Power Universe?”","“Enough,” the golden-armored elder said in a majestic voice. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was walking in the air. He said, “Come with me to face the enemy!”","Boom boom boom!","Several pitch-black streaks of void energy formed a huge waterfall and directly killed nearly 50 Supreme realm Qilin clan members.","At the back of the retreating army of Void Warriors, there were two figures hidden in loose black robes. Their void power and astral winds were extremely terrifying, and every time they attacked, they could instantly kill dozens of Supreme realm experts.","With just these two people, they were able to stop the revenge of tens of thousands of descendants of the Qilin clan.","Swish-","With a clear cry, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan opened her mouth and spat out a blazing flame at the two figures.","The power that was enough to destroy heaven and earth made even Jian Wushuang slightly surprised.","However, what happened in the next moment shocked him.","The blazing Fire Phoenix tore through the sky and instantly smashed into the two figures.","However, as the two of them held their hands together, the void suddenly twisted strangely, and the blazing flames gushed into the void barrier without leaving a scratch.","Jian Wushuang was sure that the two of them were Half Ancestors realm experts. He immediately pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed out a sword light that covered the sky.","However, the result was the same as before. The Sword Intent that was supposed to be unparalleled and comparable to the full power of a Half Ancestor’s attack had strangely disappeared when it slashed toward the two figures.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","In the distance, in the direction of Rodu, the precious image of a towering Qilin rose into the air, and a seven-colored light shone like the sun.","“You want to leave?” Jian Wushuang performed the Tarot sword move directly and the winter cold world instantly covered the sky and the earth.","However, it was of no use. It only caused the two of them to stop for a moment before they completely disappeared.","Before they disappeared, one of the black-robed figures looked back at Jian Wushuang and finally left.","The giant phantom image of the Qilin descended and dispelled the darkness of the entire battlefield. Its brilliance was like the warm sun, shining on the body and giving off an indescribable warmth.","The giant Qilin phantom form retreated, and an old man in golden armor appeared. Behind him, five tall and strong figures were like iron walls.","“Greetings, Patriarch.” Close to 10,000 Qilin clan descendants knelt down as their voices reverberated through the heavens.","The golden-armored old man nodded and his deep voice resounded, “Everyone, do your job.”","“Yes.” The descendants did not stop for a moment. In the blink of an eye, only Jian Wushuang and a few others were left on the broken battlefield.","“I and the entire Qilin clan thank you for what you did just now.” The Golden-armored old man cupped his hands, his voice neither humble nor overbearing, and he did not have the slightest bit of gratitude.","Jian Wushuang did not mind. It was his responsibility to help the Qilin clan repel the enemy. Just as he was about to turn around and leave, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan beside him snorted coldly.","“I say, old man, we’re here to help you repel the enemy. Is it only worth a fake smile and a thank you?”","“Impudent! How dare you speak to my father like that!” The brawny young man behind the Golden-armored old man glared with his eyes wide open as he summoned the phantom form of the Qilin.","The grumbling Matriarch of the Phoenix clan was thoroughly enraged. Right before the golden-armored old man’s eyes, she slapped the face of the burly young man from afar.","A crisp slap rang out as the burly young man was sent flying far away. The other four released their Natal forms and were about to charge at the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan.","“Enough! All of you, shut up!” the Golden-armored old man shouted as he pushed them back with his arm.","The Matriarch of the Phoenix clan replied coldly, “Not to mention speaking to you like this, even if your grandfather were here, I will still call him old man!”","“Feng Qi, you shut up as well. We should thank you for coming to our Qilin clan’s aid today, but our clan has been severely wounded. I’m afraid we can’t receive you.”","The golden-armored old man cupped his hands, the intention to leave in his eyes extremely obvious.","The Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, Feng Qi, said, “I don’t want to argue with you about that. Now that the Divine Power Universe has fallen, I hope that your Qilin clan will be like us and follow the Divine Life Palace to the Offworld Battlefield to fight the enemy together instead of staying in a corner.”","“Oh, I remember that your Phoenix clan surrendered a long time ago, right? You’re now suddenly fighting your enemies now?” The golden-armored elder’s expression was calm, but his words were filled with ridicule.","Feng Qi was immediately embarrassed and angry. “Old man Lu Shan, how dare you insult me! That was a plan I used to preserve the strength of the Phoenix clan!”","The golden-armored old man called Lu Shan said no more and prepared to send off his guest.","Feng Qi gritted her teeth, but she was helpless.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and said, “Senior, I’m Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace. If the situation outside the battlefield is dire, I hope the Qilin clan can provide some help.”","Although Lu Shan did not have a good impression of this low-key and quiet young man, he still felt very good.","After weighing the pros and cons, he cupped his hands and said, “If the situation in the Offworld Battlefield gets tense, the Qilin clan will definitely send reinforcements.”","Lu Shan waved his hand and handed a communication token the size of his palm to Jian Wushuang. “Palace Master Wushuang, you can use this to contact my clan.”","“Many thanks.” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands solemnly and left with the elderly man without any hesitation.","Feng Qi glared at Lu Shan and quickly followed Jian Wushuang.","“Father, why didn’t you let us fight that demoness just now?” the burly young man clutched his red and swollen left cheek and said hatefully.","Lu Shan looked at the back that had already disappeared into the end of the Star Field and said indifferently, “When you have that strength, I will not stop you. Even if all of you kids were to fight together, she can defeat you all with just one of her legs.”"]},{"number":4622,"title":"Chapter 4622 Another Wave (1)","paragraphs":["4622 Another Wave (1)","“I’ll make the entire Phoenix clan pay the price one day!” the burly young man said in! serious tone.","“Stupid.” Lu Shan cast a sidelong glance at him. “As long as the Dragon clan is still alive, we can’t fall out with the Phoenix clan.”","“When Big Brother comes out, it will be time to settle everything,” one of the golden-armored young men said arrogantly. “At that time, the small Dragon clan will be nothing in our eyes. The entire Divine Power Universe will be ours!”","Lu Shan’s face was expressionless. He seemed to be thinking about something. After a long time, he said, “What do you think of Jian Wushuang’s strength, who claims to be the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace?”","The few golden armored youths looked at each other, their expressions somewhat unnatural.","The move that Jian Wushuang had performed was so shocking that it had almost wiped out half of the army of Void Warriors in an instant.","It should be known that more than half of the void Warriors sent by the Void Universe were at the Scar level, but they were all easily eliminated by Jian Wushuang’s move.","Even the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, who was a Half Ancestor, was far inferior to him.","The burly young man said, “Father, I don’t believe that the power just now was performed by that guy. It must be the mark left by the Patriarchs of the Divine Life Palace. You should know that he is only at the Half Invincible Supreme realm.”","Lu Shan did not reply, but he already had an answer in his heart. How could Jian Wushuang make the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan accompany him, and cause her to be willing to lead the Phoenix clan to fight against the enemy together with the Divine Life Palace? If he was as simple as a Half Invincible Supreme realm expert, it was impossible.","Lu Shan knew Feng Qi’s sharp eyes very well. If Feng Qi did not help the Qilin clan unintentionally, the Creation of the Qilin clan would have been lost.","After weighing the pros and cons, Lu Shan said, “Lu Ting, Lu Gong, the two of you will set off immediately and follow Jian Wushuang to the Offworld Battlefield.”","The brawny young man named Lu Ting was stunned. Then, he said anxiously, “Father, danger is everywhere in the Offworld Battlefield. The Void Universe is invading. I’m scared...”","“Father, if Second Brother is scared, Lu Hong is willing to go in his place.” A thin man took a step forward, his face full of arrogance.","“Who says I’m afraid? What does my conversation with Father have to do with you?” Lu Ting’s face was filled with anger, following which he cupped his hands. “Father, I am willing to go to the Offworld Battlefield with Sixth Brother.”","Lu Shan nodded as his eyes flickered. “Go on. It’s time for our Qilin clan to go out and take a look.”","The shattered galaxy surged, and countless Star Fields had become dead zones under the invasion of the Void Universe.","It was unknown whether it was due to the turbulence of the fate energy of the two universes or other factors, but the starry sky in the Divine Power Universe was no longer beautiful and bright. Instead, it was covered by endless chaotic darkness.","The Cosmic Boat shuttled back and forth, making Jian Wushuang feel cold.","“I’m so angry. If I had known earlier, I would have watched them surrender and then knelt down to beg us!”","Inside the Cosmic Boat, the hot-tempered Feng Qi was furious. She cursed the entire Qilin clan in all sorts of ways.","When she was tired of scolding, Jian Wushuang said leisurely, “Since we have successfully repelled the enemy, it’s time to fulfill your promise.”","Feng Qi looked at Jian Wushuang with a mixture of anger and complaint, as she had no way to vent his anger.","Immediately, Feng Qi touched her long hair behind her ear, and a flaming feather with surging red flames appeared in her hand.","Jian Wushuang did not reach out to take it. Instead, he looked at her and said, “You should keep it for yourself. When the time comes, you can just bring the Supreme experts of the Phoenix clan to the Offworld Battlefield. I don’t need to interfere.”","Feng Qi looked at Jian Wushuang from head to toe. “Aren’t you afraid that I’ll go back on my word and stay in my room?”","“I am afraid...” Jian Wushuang said simply and did not continue.","Feng Qi was stunned. She stomped her foot and said through gritted teeth, “Jian Wushuang, just you wait!”","Then, Feng Qi turned into a sky-covering Fire Phoenix, flying toward the Crimson Sky Star Field.","Jian Wushuang looked at the huge pit on the deck of the Cosmic Boat that Feng Qi had made with one stomp and shook his head helplessly.","After leaving Rodu Star Field, which was under the jurisdiction of the Qilin clan, Jian Wushuang finally heaved a sigh of relief.","As the most ancient force in the Divine Power Universe, their return, together with the Divine Life Palace and some remaining sects, was enough to contend with the Void Universe.","Coupled with the continuous addition of Supreme wandering cultivators, it was only a matter of time before they could completely expel the Void Universe.","On the way, the Second Son of the Qilin clan Patriarch, Lu Ting, and the Sixth Son, Lu Gong, caught up with Jian Wushuang and followed him to the Offworld Battlefield.","After returning to the Offworld Battlefield, Jian Wushuang looked at the familiar environment and the disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were patrolling outside the base camp. He finally felt relieved.","“Haha, Xue Bo of the Divine Life Palace pays his respects to Palace Master Wushuang!”","Supreme Xue Bo, who was the first to sense Jian Wushuang’s aura, rushed over from the palace with a laugh.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly supported Xue Bo. “Elder Xue Bo, you don’t have to be so polite.”","Supreme Xue Bo nodded in agreement. The relationship between them had already exceeded the understanding of others.","Behind Jian Wushuang, Lu Ting was shocked. The vast aura of Supreme Xue Bo was a Half Ancestor realm aura!","‘It seems that the Divine Life Palace really has some background. I have to tell Father that the Divine Life Palace actually has a Half Ancestor realm expert as soon as possible,’ Qu ting thought to himself.","Soon after, Supreme Jun Fu, Supreme Tian Yi, Ninth Kalpa King, Lan Lan, and the others came to welcome him with hundreds of Supremes.","Looking at the Supreme martial artists who had appeared like dumplings, Lu Ting could not help but swallow.","The foundation of these Supremes was nothing compared to the Qilin clan, which was a top ancient clan. However, a mere Half Ancestor expert had elevated the Divine Life Palace to another level.","In Lu Ting’s mind, the Divine Life Palace had already become a super force on the same level as the Phoenix clan and the Dragon clan.","Looking at these familiar old friends, Jian Wushuang felt relaxed and happy.","“Did anything happen in the Offworld Battlefield while I was gone?”","Supreme Xue Bo replied, “There are no more major invasions, and some Scar level Void Masters have begun to return to the Void Universe. Ninth Kalpa, Jun Fu, Tian Yi, and I have been guarding the places we have passed, and we have killed more than 100 Void Masters.”","“There is one more thing. About a month before you returned, an army of 50,000 Void Warriors fled from the Divine Power Universe in a panic. I wanted to kill them, but I found that the two leaders had unfathomable cultivation realms, so I let them go to the crack.”"]},{"number":4623,"title":"Chapter 4623 Another Wave (2)","paragraphs":["4623 Another Wave (2)","After listening to Supreme Xue Bo’s description, Jian Wushuang nodded. The army of Void Warriors that fled in panic should be the army that he had destroyed in the Rodu Star Field of the Qilin clan with one move.","After some small talk outside the base camp, everyone entered the camp.","The monstrous void power from before was no longer there. What replaced it was a quiet and ethereal divine power cloud.","Outside the deserted giant hall, the beautiful female disciples of the Divine Life Palace had planted all kinds of ancient grass and divine flowers, which made it look a little elegant in the solemn atmosphere.","Jian Wushuang could only sit down after being welcomed by Supreme Xue Bo and the others.","At this point, the hundred people in the hall had been talking for nearly ten days.","Lu Ting and Lu Gong also gradually blended into the atmosphere.","They had a common goal, and they worked hard to achieve it, which made Lu Ting’s prejudice begin to blur.","It seemed that these guys could really die for the Divine Power Universe.","‘What a bunch of stupid guys,’ Lu Ting shook his head and sighed in his heart.","The discussion lasted for nearly 15 days, until Jian Wushuang finished his deployment.","He waved his hand and put away the scroll of divine power. After everyone began to walk to their respective chambers, the hall was already empty.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his eyes tiredly. In another day, the Divine Life Palace would start its counterattack and purge the remaining Void Warriors in the Divine Power Universe.","It had been tens of thousands of years since the Divine Power Universe had been declared fallen, and more than half of the Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms had been infiltrated by the Void Warriors.","It would also take a long time to get rid of them. Fortunately, the void power required by the Void Warriors could not be obtained in the Divine Power Universe, and their strength was also more or less affected.","The reason why Jian Wushuang had eliminated them first was that he was worried about Void God who had yet to return. He wanted to organize the Divine Power Universe as soon as possible before Void God broke through the seal.","“Husband, you must be tired. Quickly rest for a moment.” Leng Rushuang, who was dressed in a snow-white robe, walked out of the bedroom slowly with a bowl of medicine in her hand.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly got up and took the medicine. “It’s been hard on you, my love.”","Leng Rushuang shook her head gently and smiled. “As long as it’s for my husband, It’s not hard on me. Drink it while it’s hot.”","Jian Wushuang was slightly dazzled as he looked at the medicine in his hand that was emitting smoke.","“What’s wrong, husband? Do you feel uncomfortable somewhere? Quickly drink some medicinal soup to nourish your body,” Leng Rushuang said anxiously.","Jian Wushuang did not say much. He sat down with the medicine in his hand and did not rush to drink it.","“Aren’t you a little too impatient?” Jian Wushuang suddenly said indifferently.","Leng Rushuang was startled, but she still forced a smile. “What’s wrong, Husband?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head slowly, his eyes cold. “Who are you? how dare you pretend to be my wife?”","Leng Rushuang’s expression changed. She smiled eerily and ran away!","A vast amount of divine power surged like a huge wave and wrapped around the figure that was pretending to be Leng Rushuang.","Jian Wushuang send out a thought, and the divine power captured Leng Rushuang immediately.","Leng Rushuang, who had been captured, smiled eerily and said in a hoarse voice, “We meet again.”","As if the ice and snow had melted, he was the only one left in the vast hall, as if everything that had just happened was an illusion.","“There’s an enemy attack–”","Extremely miserable cries resounded from the battlefield and then stopped.","Jian Wushuang flew into a rage and his body instantly dashed out of the giant hall.","He saw that the dark, chaotic, and unordered battlefield outside the Offworld Battlefield had been completely occupied by the army of Void Warriors.","It was like a huge wave that rose up from the sky, mighty and intimidating!","With just a glance, Jian Wushuang knew that the number of Void Warriors surrounding the base camp was several times more than the number of Void Warriors surrounding Rodu, who was attacking the Qilin clan!","The sky-high void power suppressed the rules of divine power. Countless Void Masters had red eyes, waiting for an order to tear the base camp in the Offworld Battlefield into pieces.","Several divine power lights shot down to Jian Wushuang’s side, and they all looked solemn.","“Dammit! When did these bastards come, and where are the patrolling disciples?” Supreme Xue Bo bellowed in rage.","Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly. The disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were in charge of patrolling the periphery were at most at the Intermediate Supreme realm. In this long-planned battle, there were many Void Masters of the Six Scar level. How could they have prevented it?","At the front of the army, two figures in black robes appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Based on his intuition, Jian Wushuang felt that the figure who had pretended to be Leng Rushuang in the palace was one of the two mysterious figures.","“All disciples of the Divine Life Palace, hear my order.” Jian Wushuang’s deep voice reverberated throughout the entire base camp. “All of you who are at the Supreme realm, come forward with me to face the enemy. Disciples below the Supreme realm, retreat to the great hall, and fight to the death!”","Jian Wushuang was already determined to die!","All the disciples of the Divine Life Palace answered in unison. Those below the Supreme realm retreated to guard the great hall, while those above the Supreme realm followed Jian Wushuang to face the Offworld Battlefield together!","Lu Ting felt that he was very unlucky, and his resolute face was full of anger.","He had not even had time to drink a mouthful of hot tea when he encountered the invasion of the Void Universe. He was so anxious that he wanted to curse.","As the Second Prince of the Qilin clan, he was not going to die in his own clan’s battlefield. Instead, he was going to die in this desolate Offworld Battlefield?","He was unwilling, but his Sixth Brother’s eager expression made him even more depressed.","‘What should we do? Should we run now?’ This was what he thought, but he quickly rejected it.","Fleeing at the last minute, he probably would not even be able to take a single step before that Half Ancestor from his own camp would kill him.","There was no way out, so Lu Ting gritted his teeth and risked his life to catch up with Jian Wushuang.","A total of nearly 500 Supreme experts were suspended in the air. Facing the army of nearly 200,000 Void Warriors that covered the sky, they felt a little sad.","The chaotic astral wind was raging and Jian Wushuang’s hair was fluttering.","Old Master, who was wearing a black water robe, stood quietly behind Jian Wushuang like a statue.","Ninth Kalpa King was expressionless as before, but the divine power aura belonging to a Half Invincible Supreme was already at its peak.","Jun Fu, Tian Yi, Lan Lan, and Leng Rushuang pushed their divine power to the limit, ready to fight to the death!","The aura of a Half Ancestor began to surge around Supreme Xue Bo’s body, and this genuine aura made Lu Ting feel a little more at ease. After all, a Half Ancestor was an existence that had transcended the shackles of the world, and he could suppress an Invincible Supreme with a wave of his hand.","Lu Ting had already made up his mind. Once the battle started, he would pull Lu Gong along and follow behind Supreme Xue Bo.","Just as Lu Ting made up his mind, two vast void powers suddenly gushed out in front of the army of Void Warriors, causing his entire face to turn green.","It was the aura of two Half Ancestors!","Since when did Half Ancestors appear so easily everywhere?"]},{"number":4624,"title":"Chapter 4624 Elegy of Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["4624 Elegy of Heaven and Earth","Lu Ting was a little speechless. His Invincible Supreme realm cultivation that he was so proud of was actually of little use in this situation...","At the forefront of the Void Universe, the two men in black robes raised their heads slowly. Their eyes, one blue and one red, focused on Jian Wushuang.","“We meet again.”","The two black-robed men spoke at the same time, and their overlapping voices were intimidating. Without realizing it, the ordinary Supreme martial artists had already been affected by it.","The black water staff struck the ground, and a series of ripples immediately dispelled the bewitching overlapping sound.","The war had begun!","Boom!","A vast divine power suddenly gushed out and countless speckles of golden light around Jian Wushuang’s body slowly condensed into divine patterns.","Like a real God, the gilded divine pattern coated Jian Wushuang’s body with a complete aura.","An invisible sword quietly condensed in his hand!","Where the sword pointed, was its territory!","The battle shook the sky like a dark sea pouring down from the sky. Close to 50 Six Scar Void Masters were the first to attack, and their power was even more ferocious than the previous battle when Void God was around.","In just one blow, nearly 30 ordinary and Intermediate Supreme experts from the Divine Life Palace were killed by the Six Scar Void Masters before they could even fight back.","Such a tragic scene caused more than 100 Intermediate Supreme experts to self-destruct and charge forward to meet the attack.","Boom! Boom boom!!","The violent explosion tore the sky apart, and more than a hundred Supreme experts turned into a bloody mist, trying to stop the army of Void Warriors.","However, these self-destructions only caused some light injuries to the Six Scar Void Masters at the front. They did not die at all!","His golden eyes looked at the entire battlefield, and then a Sword Intent that seemed to have gathered all the power of the ancient stars shot up into the sky!","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, first move, Star!","Like the most brilliant and beautiful stars that were born and then destroyed, the Sword Intent broke free of the constraints of rules and suddenly descended!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s Supreme treasure form appeared behind him. His long hair danced in the sky and he looked majestic.","The lustrous gold divine pattern soared into the sky, and the void caved in. Wherever the Sword Intent passed, even the Six Scar Void Masters were reduced to nothingness!","Under this extremely shocking sword attack, nearly 15 Void Masters at the Six Scar level were turned into dust before they could react or even scream.","The power and magnificence of the sword strike directly tore a hole in the army of Void Warriors that covered the sky.","“Kill!” Xue Bo, who was in the Half Ancestor realm, took the lead to attack, and two Void Masters of the sixth mark were immediately killed.","Supreme Tian Yi pulled his divine bow to the fullest, and a total of 24 sharp divine powers were shot out, instantly sweeping away the Void Masters.","Supreme Jun Fu was like an ancient almighty from the primordial chaos. Wielding his divine axe, he performed the most straightforward ‘Sky-Splitter’ move, and each swing of his axe was enough to take away several first scar void Venerables.","Ninth Kalpa King was still indifferent, like the purest snow lotus on the snow mountain. Every time he made a move, he would take away any enemy in front of him, whether it was a Five Scar Void Master or a Six Scar Void Master!","If Jian Wushuang could easily kill Six Scars with his Half Invincible Supreme realm, why can’t I, Ninth Kalpa King, do the same?","After forcing back the nearest Six Scar Void Master, Ninth Kalpa King waved his hand and used his divine power, ‘Annihilation’.","The Void Master’s vision blurred for a moment, and in the next moment, his head rolled off his neck.","Ninth Kalpa King, who had left afterimages in the void, United and casually crushed the headless Six Scar Void Master into powder.","Lan Lan and Leng Rushuang joined hands and managed to deal with some of the Five Scar Void Masters. From time to time, they would kill the Two and Three Scar Void Masters that were left behind.","Perhaps it was because he was infected, or perhaps it was to save his life, but Lu Ting had already summoned the phantom form of Qilin, which was the power of an Invincible Supreme. Even the Six Scar Void Masters of the same cultivation realm did not dare to look at it.","Other than the fact that the Qilin clan’s physical body was as strong as the Dragon clan’s, it also had an innate healing effect.","The precious image of Qilin behind long ting emitted a seven-colored light. Under the protection of this light, the remaining Intermediate Supremes of the Divine Life Palace recovered from their injuries at an extremely fast speed.","A palm with the power of a mountain directly destroyed a Five Scar Void Master. Lu Ting’s Sixth Brother, Lu Gong, roared at the sky!","The depression that he felt when he was in the Qilin clan’s Rodu Star Field was all released at this moment.","Both of them were unrivaled Supreme realm experts, so Lu Gong and Lu ting rushed to the front and started a massacre.","Divine blood stained the sky. Heaven and earth were crying, and the Star Fields were being torn apart. At this moment, warriors from both the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe had bloodshot eyes!","The Star-level Void Warriors were not afraid of death. If they were not strong enough, they would group together and the Void Explosion caused by their combined strength was enough to kill an ordinary Supreme expert!","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace had already made up their minds to die. As soon as the battle began, they had already activated their self-destruction.","They knew that their strength was not enough to kill a Void Master of a higher level, so they found the right time to rush into the group of Star-level cultivators and explode!","Each self-explosion was enough to take away nearly 1,000 Star-level Void Warriors. Countless bones and remains fell into the shattered void.","The elegy of heaven and earth!","Jian Wushuang had long become one with the invisible sword in his hand. Every move of his vast Sword Intent could easily tear apart the encirclement of the army of Void Warriors.","Old Master stood behind him and shook the black scepter in his hand, freezing all the Void Masters that came close to Jian Wushuang.","When the last violent explosion resounded, the nearly 500 Supremes from the Divine Life Palace were all killed. Not a single one survived!","They used their own bodies to consume nearly 50,000 Star-level cultivators from the army of Void Warriors.","The army of Void Warriors that had covered the sky finally had a huge and irreparable wound.","With another mighty Sword Intent, the two ghostly black-robed figures emerged from the army and quietly floated in front of Jian Wushuang.","There was a faint divine might in his eyes, and the invisible sword in his hand instantly bombarded the two mysterious people.","The sword strike that easily killed Devour Two disappeared before the two figures.","A boundary surged between the two of them. Naturally, it was the boundary that absorbed Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent.","There was no expression on Jian Wushuang’s handsome face. The corners of his mouth curved up slightly. “You can absorb my attack, right? I’ll let you absorb slowly.”","“Ancestral Skill, Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate.”","The vast Heavenly Gate opened, and the giant palm that was enough to confront Void God’s True Shadow descended with unparalleled divine power.","Feeling the unrivaled pressure from the broken sky, warriors from both the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe stopped.","Everyone raised their heads to look at the pressure in the sky.","With God’s judgment, punish my sin."]},{"number":4625,"title":"Chapter 4625 Dragon and Phoenix Rescue","paragraphs":["4625 Dragon and Phoenix Rescue","Many of the remaining troops who had retreated from Rodu saw this scene and their bodies trembled.","They wanted to escape, but they were terrified to find that it was too late!","The brilliant scarlet-golden light was like 100 suns shining together, driving away the chaos and darkness of the Offworld Battlefield.","That move was based on the Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate. The Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate was independent of the Transcendence Heavenly Gate, and it was extremely powerful, absorbing the aura of nearly 10,000 divine weapons in the Land of Sorrows. It was so powerful that it even destroyed Void God’s True Shadow!","The might that could pierce through all things had transcended all the pressure before.","The phantom images of almost 1,000 divine weapons appeared, forming a destructive force that descended with endless divine might!","All the army of Void Warriors retreated in a panic. Those who retreated a little slower were immediately turned into dust by the divine power.","However, the two strange black robes standing in front of the army of Void Warriors did not retreat even half a step. Looking at the heavy falling divine might, they joined hands and an enchantment barrier appeared again.","This time, the barrier was like a bloody mouth, directly facing the vast divine power!","Swish!","The power of the divine weapon that was enough to shatter Void God’s True Shadow was slowly absorbed when it hit the barrier!","Everyone from the divine power universe was shocked. The move that could destroy even a Six Scar Void Master and a Half Ancestor had been absorbed!","The edges of the barrier quickly bulged up, absorbing all the energy bit by bit.","The army of Void Warriors, which had been fleeing in panic, attacked again.","A Six Mark Void Master waved his arm and created a Void Explosion that hit Lan Lan and Leng Rushuang.","An arm covered in golden armor blocked in front of them and directly crushed the Void Explosion.","“Be careful,” Lu Ting said as he retracted his arm. After glancing at the two, he once again rushed to the front.","At this moment, everyone was ready to die. No one had the thought of running away. Even Lu Ting had gone completely crazy. He wanted to drag a few more Void Masters down with him before he died!","The barrier that was like a huge bloody mouth finally devoured the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate completely, and its majestic divine might dissipated bit by bit.","The battlefield turned dark again. The two mysterious figures raised their heads at the same time and stared at Jian Wushuang with their blue and red eyes.","“Cut your own throat, we will keep your corpse intact.” The strange overlapping sound came from the two people’s mouths.","Jian Wushuang’s golden eyes gradually became clear. He pursed his lips and said, “Really? ”","The next moment, the closed part of the barrier suddenly rose up!","In the blink of an eye, it had grown into a huge pile, and there seemed to be something inside it that was trying to break free of its restraints and struggling wildly.","“Quickly retreat!” The two mysterious figures who were closest to him immediately moved their bodies and retreated. The army of Void Warriors who were surrounding him did not know what was going on. When they saw the huge pile rising from the void, it was already too late!","Trillions of red-gold beams broke through the barrier and shone on the Offworld Battlefield.","The boundless divine might exploded with a huge amount of potential power.","The nearest hundred or so Void Masters did not even have time to scream before they were evaporated into smoke.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and pushed the few remaining people in the Divine Power Universe back at light speed.","The divine might that burst out from the void was like a waterfall.","Even Six Scar Void Masters would die.","Upon seeing such a miserable scene, the two mysterious figures that were rapidly retreating stopped in their tracks. Facing the overwhelming divine might, they completely released their Half Ancestor auras.","The tragedy that happened in the Qilin clan’s Rodu Star Field must not happen again!","The Offworld Battlefield was collapsing, and a bloody crack that almost split the void in half appeared!","The endless void power transformed into many shrieking skeletons that emerged from the cracks and collided with the brilliant divine might.","The destructive explosion was something that even a Six Scar Void Master could not withstand. The ordinary Void Masters who were far away from the center of the explosion vomited a large mouthful of blood, and the Star-level cultivators who were of a lower realm had their internal organs shattered, dying a miserable death.","The people who were protected by Jian Wushuang, even the Supreme Xue Bo, could not help but feel their hearts beat faster and their faces turn pale.","Lu Ting felt a sweet taste in his throat, and a wisp of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth. He hurriedly swallowed the divine blood that was about to flow out.","At this moment, both the Void Universe’s camp and the Divine Power Universe’s camp were affected by the explosion.","Jian Wushuang looked at the center of the explosion calmly, as if he already knew what was going to happen next.","The light of the polar day dissipated, and the sky of the Offworld Battlefield was completely torn apart. Even the void was destroyed, leaving behind a terrible scar that could never be recovered.","The crack in the blood abyss disappeared, and so did the glorious Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate.","In the unrecoverable silent void, two figures that had almost been blown to pieces stopped in their tracks.","The flesh and blood were torn apart, almost turning into two bloody skeletons, but they were still staring at Jian Wushuang.","Something even more bizarre happened. The arms of the two bloody skeletons wrapped around each other, and they actually fused into one skeleton.","The figure put on the black robe again, like an unparalleled existence that ruled the chaos and darkness.","“All the people of the Void Universe, I saved you. It’s time to repay me.”","A strange overlapping sound resounded. The army of Void Warriors, which had been protected from great casualties, revealed a fanatical look in their eyes.","In the next moment, the army of Void Warriors became even more brutal and rushed toward the few remaining people in the Divine Power Universe.","Among the few remaining people, only Jian Wushuang, Old Master, Xue Bo, and a few others could still fight.","Everyone’s body was stained with divine blood, which added a bit of tragedy.","Lu Ting slowly closed his eyes. The vigorous and majestic divine power in his body had long been exhausted, and he was bound to die here!","“Second Brother, it seems like we can’t go back.” Lu Gong grinned. A terrifying wound on his left arm was flowing with divine blood.","Taking a deep breath, Lu Ting sent a secret voice transmission, “Don’t talk. I’ll self-destruct later to buy you some time. You should try your best to leave this place.”","When Lu Gong heard this, his eyes were filled with shock. Just as he was about to speak, a Phoenix cry that seemed to come from the Nine Heavens and clear the darkness resounded through the world!","Swish–","The giant phoenix with its wings spread out like a cloud in the sky descended from the distance. Its nine tail feathers with destructive power swayed in the air, emitting brilliant flames.","Countless flames fell and could even burn void power!","Roar!","The deep roar that sounded like a great bell shook the world. Even though they did not see the full form, the suppressing ancient bloodline made everyone tremble.","A scarlet-golden giant Dragon floated in the broken void space. It surged in the chaotic darkness, and every scale reflected dense Dragon patterns.","The crimson-gold Dragon was so huge that its claw was like a giant pillar that held up the sky!"]},{"number":4626,"title":"Chapter 4626 Wordless Monument","paragraphs":["4626 Wordless Monument","Boom boom boom!","Nearly 1,000 Star-level Void Warriors at the forefront could not dodge in time and were instantly crushed into a mist of blood by the giant claw.","As the fire domain descended, the Phoenix flames, which were like maggots in one’s bones, could burn fiercely just by following the void energy emitted by each Void Warrior.","In an instant, the battlefield turned into a sea of fire.","Behind the Phoenix, tens of thousands of Phoenix clansmen were charging into the battlefield!","Each of the handsome young men was topless. They flapped the fire wings on their backs and rushed to the camp of the Void Warriors.","As the giant Dragon that seemed to be born with the heavens appeared, tens of thousands of Dragon clan clansmen also rushed to the battlefield!","The innate arrogance of the Dragon clan spread across the sky. Every Dragon descendant with a peak physical body stepped into the army of Void Warriors!","A one-sided battle ensued. The Dragon clan had sent out nearly 20 Invincible Supreme experts, while the Phoenix clan had also sent out over 20 Invincible Supreme experts.","The most ancient bloodline in the Divine Power Universe gave them unparalleled power.","In the same realm, the Six Scar Void Masters no longer had any advantage!","Seeing this, even the calm and steady Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned red.","Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes were also wet, and then he burst out laughing.","Xue Bo Supreme, Jun Fu, Tian Yi, and the others were all in tears.","Lan Lan smiled and then fainted in Leng Rushuang’s arms.","Lu Ting and Lu Gong gave each other a big hug. At this moment, the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan, who were almost mortal enemies, did not seem so annoying anymore.","The mourning birds were everywhere. Even the Six Scar Void Masters were dying rapidly under the attacks of Feng Qi, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, and Dragon Emperor Linhe of the Dragon clan.","The mysterious fused figure was trembling at this moment, as if he was about to explode out of pure fury.","He had paid an almost unbearable price in this war. Nearly 1,000 Scar level Void Masters, nearly 50 Six Scar void Masters, and hundreds of thousands of Star-level Void Warriors had been buried here.","As the great Guardian, he had wanted to kill Jian Wushuang and take his head as a gift for the return of Void God.","But everything was wrong!","This battle had been lost the moment the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan joined the battle.","“Devour One, I’ll kill you.” He could not hold back his anger and shouted the word “retreat” with difficulty.","All the Void Warriors who had been struggling to resist in the fire domain finally fled in panic, leaving behind nearly 200,000 corpses.","This battle that could be called a tragic song finally ended with the participation of the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan.","Looking at the broken void that could never be repaired and the countless broken limbs, everyone fell silent.","A teardrop that contained all of Jian Wushuang’s emotions finally fell into the dark void.","“Palace Master Wushuang, we won, we won...” Xue Bo said softly.","Jian Wushuang was silent as he looked at the countless corpses in a daze.","Dragon Emperor Linhe, who had taken on his human form, led his tens of thousands of Dragon clan descendants and came before Jian Wushuang with heavy steps.","He wanted to say something, but he hesitated. In the end, he cupped his hands and said, “Palace Master Wushuang, the Dragon clan is late.”","The Ancestral Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, Feng Qi, glanced at Dragon Emperor Linhe with a look of fear. Then, she brought over 10,000 of her Phoenix clansmen and said, “Palace Master Wushuang, the Phoenix clan is here to fulfill our promise.”","Jian Wushuang came back to his senses and shook his head slowly. “No, none of you are late. I, Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, would like to thank the two clans and I will definitely repay your kindness in the future.”","The few remaining members of the Divine Life Palace on the Offworld Battlefield solemnly cupped their hands together.","“Everyone, you’ve worked hard. Come with me to the base camp to rest for a while.” Jian Wushuang forced out a smile.","Linhe and Feng Qi acknowledged this.","After that, Xue Bo was in charge of welcoming the 20,000-odd Dragon and Phoeni clansmen into the base camp.","The two brothers, Lu Ting and Lu Gong, also had complicated looks in their eyes after seeing the figure of Dragon Emperor Linhe.","Just as their father had guessed, he was not dead. Lu Ting remained silent and followed the group back to the base camp.","The disciples of the Divine Life Palace who were stationed in the base camp had also suffered heavy losses. There were originally more than 9,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace, but now there were less than 4,000 left. If it were not for the barrier set up by Old Master, the Divine Life Palace would have been completely destroyed in this battle.","Using the power of Creation, Jian Wushuang opened up a sleeping hall behind the great hall that could accommodate tens of thousands of people. After settling the Dragon clan and Phoenix clan in, he left the great hall.","In the cold dead zone, Jian Wushuang took a black mountain and carried it back to the Offworld Battlefield.","He used the Tarot Divine Sword to carve the mountain into a giant monument.","It was a wordless monument.","There were no words on the monument, and it was so clean that it could reflect the figure.","After carving the wordless monument, Jian Wushuang set it up not far from the base camp.","Then, he sat cross-legged in front of the wordless monument.","Only Old Master was behind Jian Wushuang. He did not bring anyone out. Old Master was like his shadow. He would never take the initiative to speak. He would only stand behind him silently.","For ten consecutive days, Jian Wushuang did not change his posture at all. The wordless monument reflected his and Old Master’s unmoving figures.","Ninth Kalpa King, Supreme Xue Bo, Supreme Jun Fu, and Supreme Tian Yi came to the wordless monument in succession and stood behind Jian Wushuang.","In front of the giant hall, Dragon Emperor Linhe looked at everything from afar. Something in his heart had unknowingly become firm.","Two steady figures stood behind Dragon Emperor Linhe.","The secret voice was transmitted into the ears of the two figures.","“Remember what I said. From now on, until I die, I will form an alliance with the Divine Life Palace. He will never forget what belongs to us.”","The two steady figures did not hesitate at all and nodded.","Meanwhile, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, Feng Qi, who was standing with the Dragon Emperor Linhe, was filled with both fear and anger.","“Damn it, this old thing is still alive.”","The Qilin clan was weak in the base camp, and only the two brothers were there, Lu Ting and Lu Gong. Out of sight, out of mind. The two brothers simply closed their doors and focused on healing their injuries.","After more than a month, Jian Wushuang, who was sitting in front of the wordless monument, slowly opened his eyes.","Everyone knew the meaning behind the wordless monument, but no one retreated. From the moment they stood in front of the wordless monument, everyone had the will to die and would fight to the death.","Perhaps time would rewind, and the universe would reincarnate. Even if everything they did would be swallowed up by the unknown, which was so long that even death would perish, they were not afraid.","Perhaps all of them would be lying under the wordless monument one day, but they were not afraid.","What they were most afraid of was that all the people of the Divine Power Universe would be lying under the wordless monument, whether they were alive or dead."]},{"number":4627,"title":"Chapter 4627 Drastic Changes in the Qilin Clan","paragraphs":["4627 Drastic Changes in the Qilin Clan","After he left the wordless monument, everyone who was close to Jian Wushuang felt that he had changed.","Maybe it was perseverance, maybe he was cold-blooded, maybe he was gradually losing the compassion in his heart, but no one could be sure.","After much thought, Supreme Xue Bo finally spoke, “Palace Master Wushuang, are you alright? Do you want to rest for a while?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and covered up the fatigue in his eyes, “It’s fine. The Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan have been on the Offworld Battlefield for more than a few months. I can’t neglect them.”","After that, Jian Wushuang led everyone back to the base camp.","Dragon Emperor Linhe, who had been meditating with his eyes closed, was the first to wake up. He stood up and cupped his hands. “I, Linhe from the Dragon clan, pay my respects to Palace Master Wushuang.”","On the other side, Feng Qi was shocked to hear that Dragon Emperor Linhe had lowered his status in front of Jian Wushuang.","One must know that the Dragon clan was famous for their arrogance in the entire Divine Power Universe. Other than Cosmos God, even the other Half Ancestor level experts would not be able to gain any face from the Dragon clan.","Could it be that they had some strange deal?","Frowning, Feng Qi’s mind raced. Without hesitation, she stepped forward and cupped her hands. “Feng Qi of the Phoenix clan greets Palace Master Wushuang.”","“No need to be polite.” Jian Wushuang nodded and walked into the hall.","In this battle, 60 percent of the Divine Life Palace had fallen, and only Jian Wushuang and a few others were left in the Supreme realm. They were not strong enough to defend the Offworld Battlefield.","After Jian Wushuang explained the situation to the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan, Linhe Dragon Emperor immediately said, “Don’t worry, Palace Master Wushuang. The 12,000 Dragon clan disciples that Linhe brought with him will be under your command the moment they set foot on the Offworld Battlefield.”","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, Feng Qi said, “Palace Master Wushuang, we also have more than 10,000 disciples at your disposal. We have also prepared Phoenix breath for the other disciples of the Divine Life Palace, which can nourish their meridians and improve their cultivation quickly.”","Jian Wushuang felt helpless as he looked at the two of them. He cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for your help at the most critical moment.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe stroked his beard and smiled. “Palace Master Wushuang, although the war in the Offworld Battlefield has been settled, according to the style of the Void Universe, it is very likely that it will make a comeback in the next period of time. I wonder what your next plan is, Palace Master Wushuang?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang repeated his plan.","After he finished speaking, Dragon Emperor Linhe nodded. “Palace Master Wushuang, you mean that the Alliance is now divided into two parts. One part will clear the Void Universe forces stationed in the various Star Fields, and the other part will be responsible for patrolling the crack?”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Before he could speak, Feng Qi said, “I’m willing to follow Palace Master Wushuang and wipe out the bastards from the Void Universe with the disciples of the Phoenix clan.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe glanced at Feng Qi and cupped his hands. “I’ll follow Palace Master Wushuang’s orders.”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking. The large number of Void Warriors stationed in the Divine Power Universe was like a bomb that could explode at any time. If they did not remove them as soon as possible before Void God broke free from the seal, the consequences would be unimaginable.","And he had a faint premonition that the time seemed to be getting closer and closer.","“Second Brother, why don’t we also show our appreciation?” Lu Gong’s secret message entered Lu Ting’s ears.","The corners of Lu Ting’s mouth twitched. “What do you mean? All we have are the clothes on our backs. Are you going to give them away?”","Lu Gong scratched his head. Just as he was about to speak, he suddenly felt the communication stone in his arms start to heat up.","He took out the communication stone that was unique to the Qilin clan. A violent wave of divine power surged out from it, attracting everyone’s attention.","“Ting’er, Gong’er, quickly ask for help. The Spring of Chaos under Rodu Star Field has cracked!","Jian Wushuang, who had been to Rodu Star Field to communicate with the Qilin Patriarch, immediately recognized the slightly panicked voice as Lu Shan’s.","Along with Lu Shan’s panicked voice, there was a strange ethereal sound that was like a whale sucking in a tsunami. Everyone who heard it was shaken.","Lu Ting and Lu Gong shuddered at the same time. Before they could speak, the communication stone seemed to be unable to hold on any longer and shattered with a loud bang!","In the hall, only that weird sound could be heard.","Linhe and Feng Qi frowned at the same time. Having been immersed in the Half Ancestor realm for countless chaos cycles, their control and understanding of their auras had long since reached the pinnacle.","They could not tell what kind of power it was from the aura coming from the communication stone, but it was strange and powerful.","Lu Ting and Lu Gong could not sit still any longer. They cupped their hands at Jian Wushuang and wanted to rush out of the hall.","“Wait a moment, I’ll go with you two.” Jian Wushuang stopped them.","Lu Ting hesitated for a moment, then nodded and agreed. With Jian Wushuang’s strength, which was comparable to a Half Ancestor, it would be easier to deal with the following matters.","“This Lord will also go together. The opening of the Spring of Chaos is no small matter, I must seal it again.” Dragon Emperor Linhe took a step forward and stood behind Jian Wushuang.","“I’ll go too. One more person means one more power.” Feng Qi walked over quickly.","Lu Ting and Lu Gong looked at each other and did not dare to say anything, only nodding.","After deploying the base camp in the Offworld Battlefield, Jian Wushuang activated the Cosmic Boat first.","As for the Offworld Battlefield, with Half Ancestor Supreme Xue Bo and the Dragon and Phoenix clans guarding it, there were not many dangers for the time being.","The three Half Ancestor level almighties stood at the head of the Cosmic Boat. Lu Ting and Lu Gong looked bitter. They did not know if it was a blessing or a curse to be gathered in the Qilin clan.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and turned to look at Lu Ting. “What exactly is the Spring of Chaos sealed under Rodu that can cause such a great panic?”","Lu Ting pondered for a moment before slowly saying, “Not many people really know about the Spring of Chaos. Even our Qilin clan only knows a little about it. We only know that since the beginning of chaos, it has only opened once.”","“That split caused our Qilin clan to be unable to recover. Nearly 10,000 of our descendants were killed before it was sealed again.”","“Is there something sealed in the Spring of Chaos?” Jian Wushuang said with a grave expression.","Lu Ting shook his head and said, “I’m not sure. My father didn’t know what it was until the moment it was sealed. He only told us later that the Spring of Chaos was the weakest point of the entire Divine Power Universe and the only extreme point.”","“The weakest point, the only extreme point. What is it exactly?” Jian Wushuang murmured softly. He had a bad feeling."]},{"number":4628,"title":"Chapter 4628 Shattering the Extreme Point","paragraphs":["4628 Shattering the Extreme Point","The Dragon Emperor Linhe and the Phoenix Matriarch, Feng Qi, were frowning. The fact that there was a Spring of Chaos sealed under the Qilin clan’s Luo du Galaxy was known to both the Dragon and Phoenix clans.","It was also because of this knowledge that he knew the importance of the Spring of Chaos.","They had almost reached the peak of the entire universe and had already begun to comprehend the laws of divine power. Naturally, they knew that the universe was not a vast universe that included countless Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms.","As early as the moment the universe was formed, the place where it finally condensed was the extreme point of the entire universe, which was also the weakest point of the universe. It was called the Spring of Chaos by the Qilin clan.","No one knew what was in the Spring of Chaos. Even the Qilin clan, who guarded the spring, did not have the slightest intention of exploring.","At this moment, the Dragon Emperor Linhe’s murky eyes began to clear up.","He looked at Lu Ting and finally said, “May I ask, when was the first time the Spring of Chaos split open?”","Lu Ting glanced at Dragon Emperor Linhe from the corner of his eyes and sneered, “You picked a good day back then, and now you’ve forgotten? Wasn’t it right before you started the war between the three clans?”","It was as if a thunderbolt had exploded in his mind. The body of Dragon Emperor Linhe trembled slightly, and he had to use his palms to support himself on the railing so that he would not fall.","Dragon Emperor Linhe seemed to have realized that his father, the Ancestral Dragon who had disappeared for countless chaos eras, had probably gone to the Spring of Chaos in the Qilin clan and disappeared.","There was dead silence in the Cosmic Boat. No one spoke, and everyone looked thoughtful.","With full acceleration, the Cosmic Boat arrived at the Qilin clan’s Rodu Star Field in less than a month.","Before he even got close, Jian Wushuang felt a strange invisible energy circling in the sky.","The divine power in his meridians started to stir restlessly and Jian Wushuang felt thirsty for no reason.","Then, they looked at each other, activated the divine power in their bodies, and flew toward Rodu.","Only Old Master’s half-closed eyes opened quietly, and his dark eyes looked into the distance.","“Greetings, Junior Patriarch,” When the general guarding the city saw Lu Ting and the others, he hurriedly flew forward.","“Quickly take me to the Patriarch,” Lu Ting said anxiously.","The Qilin clan general glanced at Jian Wushuang and the others, then lowered his voice in a panic and said, “Young Patriarch, something is wrong. The crack in the spring is getting bigger and bigger...”","“Then what’s the point of talking? Let’s go!” Lu Ting hurriedly shouted, his figure immediately flying towards the depths of Rodu Star Field.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the strange aura in the sky and then plunged into the depths.","In the center of the Rodu Star Field, a deep pit the size of a star was spewing out strange energy.","Over 8,000 descendants of the Qilin clan were gathered around the pit. The precious images of Qilin of different sizes were emitting a seven-colored light, as if they were trying their best to seal this place.","Wearing a golden armor, Patriarch Lu Shan was the closest to the pit. The giant form of a Qilin was roaring, as if it was struggling against some kind of power.","Stepping into the area, the referee subconsciously shouted when he heard the situation.","Lu Shan turned his head subconsciously, and the phantom form of the Qilin instantly became much dimmer.","Boom boom boom!","A huge amount of strange energy winds rose from the pit in the abyss, broke through the suppression, and completely gathered in the sky.","All the descendants of the Qilin clan took a few steps back and suffered different internal injuries.","In the next moment, the deep pit quickly collapsed, and a star-sized skull poked out of it!","The aura of someone who had reached the peak and was able to change the color of the entire Star Field instantly swept through Rodu.","Jian Wushuang was shocked and he immediately activated his boundless divine power.","Feng Qi immediately turned into her Natal Phoenix, covering the sky. She looked at the head in the abyss as if she was facing a great enemy.","Only Dragon Emperor Linhe stumbled backward and almost fell to the ground.","The awe-inspiring skull that emerged from the abyss was the head of a Dragon!","Everyone’s faces were extremely pale.","As the Dragon head of the Bone Dragon broke through the seal, its entire body made of white bones tore through the abyss and stretched across the sky!","The indescribable terrifying aura had even surpassed the pressure brought by Void God.","The Bone Dragon, which was larger than the entire Rodu Star Field, had exceeded the rules of the Divine Power Universe and could not possibly exist!","However, now, it was hovering above the entire Rodu Star Field, and a dark aura was seeping out from every single bone in its body. It was as if it could destroy the entire Qilin clan with a single claw.","“Let’s go!” Lu Shan roared. He had never thought of resisting the Bone Dragon’s peak strength.","All the descendants of the Qilin clan did not hesitate at all as they circulated their divine power and ran for their lives.","Feng Qi directly turned into a human and fell to the ground.","“Why aren’t you running? Do you want to wait for death here?!” Feng Qi said anxiously and grabbed Jian Wushuang’s hand to escape.","However, Jian Wushuang reached out to hold Feng Qi’s hand and struggled to break free.","“Are you crazy? If we don’t run now, are we just waiting for death?” Feng Qi was already a little flustered and exasperated. In her opinion, fighting an Ancestor realm expert head-on was already an act of courting death, let alone this existence that seemed to have exceeded the Ancestor realm.","Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly, “If I leave, the Divine Power Universe will be finished.”","Feng Qi could not help but say angrily, “Who do you think you are? Even if you can fight a Half Ancestor, you’re not even one-tenth of an Ancestor! Not to mention this big guy. You’re not trying to save anything, you’re just looking for death!”","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","“Alright, if you’re willing to court death here, I won’t accompany you anymore!” Feng Qi stomped her foot, and her body turned into a Fire Phoenix, flying into the distance.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang looked at Old Master behind him, “Senior, can you help me?”","“You little brat, you’ve really brought me trouble.”","A faint sigh came from the old man’s mouth.","The hood was slowly pulled down, revealing a sickly face. “This universe has a great restraint on me, but it’s enough.”","As soon as he finished speaking, black water ripples surged out from under Old Master’s feet. He slowly stepped into the air to face the white Bone Dragon that was entrenched in the sky.","Jian Wushuang also activated his divine power to the extreme. The purple “Chuan” character between his eyebrows had become extremely lustrous.","Dragon Emperor Linhe looked up at the giant Dragon in the sky. As tears streamed down his face, his peak Half Ancestor realm divine power was activated.","The black scepter of power stomped in the air, creating ripples that immediately caught the attention of the white Bone Dragon.","The next moment, the huge bone c;aw tore the sky apart and crushed toward Old Master. Every inch it traveled, there were explosions.","“Heavenly Gate — Extreme Darkness!”","Brilliant and majestic divine power spread out, and unparalleled divine power pressed down at the same time."]},{"number":4629,"title":"Chapter 4629 Battling the Ancestral Bone Dragon","paragraphs":["4629 Battling the Ancestral Bone Dragon","The Ancestral Skill that could kill a Half Ancestor expert and barely had a fraction of an ancestral being’s true force crashed into the Bone Dragon in the sky without any resistance.","Rather than saying that there was no obstruction, it would be better to say that there was no avoidance at all.","The awe-inspiring Bone Dragon raised its head and spewed out a chaotic and dark dragon breath.","A shocking scene appeared.","The mighty Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate landed on the head of the Bone Dragon, but it only dispelled the dragon breath and left a shallow mark on its skull.","Then, two balls of star-like death light shone from its eyes and shot out two vigorous Death Lights at Jian Wushuang.","Before Jian Wushuang could do anything, Old Master in the sky made a move and repelled the Death Light.","Layers of black water rippled in the air, and the sky suddenly collapsed. A huge palm formed by black water slammed down on the Bone Dragon’s head.","The two extremely special and majestic energies collided, and the shock wave that was produced instantly tore the sky and the earth apart.","The Bone Dragon’s raised head seemed to have collided with a sky-splitting hammer, and it fell to the ground along with its entire body.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and he hurriedly flew up into the sky.","Rumble, rumble!!!","The Bone Dragon’s body was simply too massive. It was almost the size of the entire Rodu Sky Field, and when it fell to the ground, it crushed nearly a thousand Qilin clan descendants to death.","The earth was rapidly collapsing, and the entire Rodu’s crust seemed to be unable to withstand the pressure as it split open, forming many deep chasms.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang looked at Dragon Emperor Linhe beside him. The conversation between the two of them in the Dragon clan that day came back to his mind.","“Does this Bone Dragon have some sort of connection with your Dragon clan?” Although he had a rough idea, Jian Wushuang still asked for confirmation.","Linhe shook his head and replied bitterly, “It’s the source ancestral bloodline of the Dragon race. He’s also my father who disappeared for no reason.”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and finally said, “Does the Dragon clan have any secret skills that can help us survive this tribulation?”","Dragon Emperor Linhe shook his head again and heaved a long sigh. “No, but I will try my best.”","The Bone Dragon that fell to the ground shook its head hard, then roared towards the sky. The dark dragon breath directly destroyed Old Master’s attack.","His black water robe fluttered in the wind. It was the first time Jian Wushuang had seen Old Master in action.","Back when he fought the Devourers, who had advanced to the Ancestor realm, Old Master had attacked him almost casually. The strange feeling of suppression on a peak Ancestor realm expert was still deeply engraved in Jian Wushuang’s memory.","At this moment, the old man was like a Heavenly River that had descended. He brought with him the endless power of the black river and crushed down on the ancestral Bone Dragon.","The Bone Dragon roared fearlessly at the sky. Its four sky-high claws supported itself on the ground, and its head spat out a violent jet-black Dragon Breath at Old Master.","Whoooosh–","The two collided and the invisible impact waves spread in all directions. Jian Wushuang, who was closer to the center of the battle, felt a sweet taste in his throat and a stream of blood gushed up.","Jian Wushuang was completely shocked. He had the characteristics of a Perfect Life From and the Chaos Overlord Body, but he was still bleeding from the aftershock. What level of collision was this?","Dragon Emperor Linhe, who was a Half Ancestor, spat out a huge mouthful of divine blood. The aftershock had exposed all the hidden injuries in his body.","Some of the Qilin clan’s descendants nearby exploded into a mist of blood.","The sky above Rodu was torn apart, and the Spring of Chaos in the center was also expanding.","Lu Shan’s eyes turned red when he saw more than half of his descendants die. He let out a loud roar and transformed into a Qilin, charging forward.","A Half Ancestor’s aura was usually an extremely powerful existence. However, right now, it might not even be able to withstand the aftermath.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand to stop him but he was pushed away by the divine power that surged around Lu Shan.","The original indomitable Qilin form seemed much smaller in front of the Bone Dragon.","As if sensing the aura of injustice, the Bone Dragon, which was spewing Death Light, suddenly flicked its tail, which was covered with ferocious bone spikes, and directly whipped Lu Shan’s body.","The phantom image of the Qilin, which was shrouded in the seven-colored brilliance, was shattered directly. Lu Shan’s figure fell straight to the ground like a kite with a broken string.","Jian Wushuang leaped forward and stretched out his hand to drag Lu Shan’s body over with the divine power.","More than half of his golden armor had been shattered, and his chest had caved in. Divine blood flowed down his armor to the ground.","At this moment, Lu Shan was already breathing heavily.","“Why do you have to do this?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes dimmed.","Lu Shan opened his mouth and coughed out a large mouthful of blood, his eyes wide open.","“Father!” The Fifth Son, Lu Shanm, ran over from afar, his eyes red.","“You guys... You have to lead the Qilin clan to live and leave Rodu. This place is no longer under your control.” Lu Shan instructed with a calm expression. His body, which was originally at the Half Ancestor realm and close to indestructible, began to age due to the suppression of the strange energy.","Once one aged, it was a sign that could not be changed.","Lu Shan slowly stretched out his hand and firmly held onto Lu Ting’s palm. His eyes seemed to convey a message.","In the end, Lu Shan died in Jian Wushuang’s arms.","The Fifth Son knelt on the ground and cried.","Jian Wushuang slowly put Lu Shan on the ground and looked at the fiercest battle in the sky.","The damage caused by a battle that broke through the constraints of the universe’s laws was unimaginable.","All of Rodu, whether it was the earth or the sky, had been shattered, and the impact was beginning to spread to the other Star Fields.","A huge spine with a dark aura was pulled out by Old Master and crushed into powder.","The Bone Dragon was in pain and roared toward the sky. Its mouth, which was big enough to swallow the entire Star Field, was about to swallow Olf Master.","With a wave of his arms, the black water formed a special flowing barrier in front of him. The Bone Dragon slammed into it, but it was as if it had stepped into cotton. The black water barrier instantly dissipated and clung to the head of the Bone Dragon like maggots in tarsal bones.","Old Master’s body gathered and scattered, quietly arriving on the back of the Bone Dragon. Just as he was about to swing his arm to chop off its head, countless dark auras escaped from the cracks of the Bone Dragon, turning into chains that wrapped around Old Master.","Jian Wushuang knew that something was wrong and he immediately flew into the sky.","At the same time, the Tarot Divine Sword appeared in his hand, and a vast amount of Starlight swept toward the back of the giant Bone Dragon.","Clang!!!","The sound of metal clashing resounded throughout the world. The chain formed by the dark aura was torn into half by Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent.","Then, Old Master’s palm seal, which had a suppressing force, came down.","The clear sound of bones breaking reverberated throughout the entire Rodu Star Field.","The Bone Dragon wailed as the spine behind its huge head was destroyed. It could no longer support itself and fell to the ground in a miserable manner.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Just as he was about to land, he was stopped by Old Master."]},{"number":4630,"title":"Chapter 4630 Reuniting","paragraphs":["4630 Reuniting","He shook his head, and then looked at the ground with his dark eyes.","The Bone Dragon, whose head had been miserably separated from its body, fell to the ground again, but at the same time, an even more powerful dark Qi swept out from the Spring of Chaos.","An unimaginable amount of energy gushed out, which shocked Jian Wushuang.","The black Qi that was so dense that it seemed to have substance turned into thousands of threads and attached themselves to the Bone Dragon’s head and the broken body, actually healing them back together.","The dark Qi filled the sky, and the Bone Dragon came back to life. Its broken spine was filled with that strange energy. Its four claws were on the ground, and its eyes were staring at Old Master, preparing the Death Light.","“Lead it to the sky and try to stall for time. I’ll go and block the spring.” After saying this, Old Master disappeared, leaving Jian Wushuang with a confused face.","“W-what? You want me to stall for time...” Jian Wushuang felt a headache coming on. The Bone Dragon, which could burn a Half Ancestor realm expert to death with one breath, naturally stared at Jian Wushuang after Old Master disappeared.","He opened his mouth and spat out a dragon breath.","Jian Wushuang was shocked and he immediately activated his divine power to fly higher into the sky.","The air was burned wherever the dragon breath passed. Jian Wushuang dodged it and then hit the Bone Dragon’s head with the Ancestral Skill, the Transcendence Heavenly Gate.","The brilliant divine power lit up the entire Star Field. A giant finger reached out from the Heavenly Gate and fell towards the Bone Dragon.","This Ancestral Skill that even Half Ancestor beings would not dare to easily confront was no different from a scratch to the Bone Dragon.","The Bone Dragon did not dodge at all. The vast finger left a shallow mark on its head before it dissipated.","It raised its head and roared. Then, the Bone Dragon’s huge body rose up and went straight for Jian Wushuang.","He, who was ascending with all his might, subconsciously looked back, and his face almost turned green.","The Bone Dragon’s massive, almost bloated body flew up at an inconceivable speed and gradually closed the distance between the two.","Jian Wushuang was terrified and at the same time, he tried his best to ascend.","A Dragon’s roar reverberated behind him. He felt the air around him was like a swamp, instantly limiting his flying speed.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. When he turned around, a skull that was almost the same size as the sun was already in front of him.","At this critical moment, Jian Wushuang felt a gentle divine power clinging to his waist and then dragging him back quickly.","A crisp Phoenix cry resounded through the world.","Jian Wushuang said excitedly, “You’re here.”","“If I didn’t come back, you would have become Dragon food, right?” The Fire Phoenix spoke in the human language, and her fiery eyes were filled with anger.","Sitting on Feng Qi’s broad and soft back, Jian Wushuang scratched his head in embarrassment.","“Sit tight,” Feng Qi warned. With a flap of her wings, she travelled a million miles!","The Bone Dragon was furious. It twisted its huge body and followed closely.","The newly reformed Old Master raised his head to look at the sky where the wind and clouds were surging. Then, he turned his gaze to the Spring of Chaos that was still expanding under his feet.","All kinds of strange and unknown forces intertwined and surged, occasionally transforming into various strange shapes.","Old Master slowly pulled out his defeated palm from his sleeve, and a jet-black power that seemed to have the same root appeared.","Then, it gradually flowed down like water, as if it carried the power of the entire black river and roared from his palm.","They fell into the eye of the Spring of Chaos, stirring up black clouds and smoke.","At the same time, the Spring of Chaos was slowly closing.","The Bone Dragon, which was chasing Jian Wushuang and Feng Qi, seemed to have sensed something. It turned around and swooped down at Old Master.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang hurriedly said, “Quick, stop it. Don’t let it go down!”","Feng Qi glared at Jian Wushuang with her huge Phoenix eyes. She flapped her wings and rushed toward the Bone Dragon.","The Phoenix’s breath, which could burn everything, was extinguished in an instant when it hit the Bone Dragon’s back.","The Bone Dragon turned around and shot out two rays of Death Light, approaching Feng Qi.","The speed of the Death Light was too fast, and two Death Lights hit Feng Qi’s abdomen.","With a miserable shriek, the giant Phoenix turned into a human and fell to the ground like a broken kite.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He used all his divine power and reached out to pull Feng Qi into his arms.","“How are you?” Jian Wushuang was extremely anxious. He looked at Feng Qi in his arms, who was barely breathing and whose chest had almost collapsed, just like Lu Shan’s.","After coughing out a mouthful of divine blood, Feng Qi said with her eyes half-closed, half-opened, “I’m a little sleepy. I want to have a good sleep... It’s so cold.”","Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice. At the same time, he injected his divine power into Feng Qi’s meridians and said, “Don’t sleep. Wake up. Think about all the descendants of your Phoenix clan. You still have to lead them and fight with me.”","Hearing this, Feng Qi forced a smile. “Then don’t you leave me.”","Jian Wushuang did not think too much and nodded.","Wisps of fiery flames rose from Feng Qi’s body. The Phoenix clan’s secret technique, Nirvana Inferno, had already been activated.","...","The Bone Dragon let out a deafening roar and charged towards Old Master with all its might, towards the Spring of Chaos.","Dragon Emperor Linhe, who had been silent all this while, appeared and stood in front of Old Master.","His cloudy eyes had become clear and full of youth.","He opened his arms and shouted, “Father, Linhe is here!”","A voice that seemed to be able to pierce through the clouds resounded throughout the entire Rodu Star Field.","“Father, Linhe is here!”","...","The Bone Dragon’s massive body carried an endless force, and this strike was enough to destroy any Star Field. Rodu would no longer exist.","In the face of this terrifying Bone Dragon, Dragon Emperor Linhe did not show the slightest fear. Instead, he calmly watched what was about to happen.","The destructive aura he had imagined was like a gentle breeze, not dissipating at all.","A huge white Bone Dragon head seemed to have passed through the ages. With a doubtful gaze, it stared at the thin figure who dared to stand in front of it.","The dragon’s breath swept across the land. Looking at the white Dragon head that blotted out the sky, Dragon Emperor Linhe slowly reached out and touched it.","In the next moment, the majestic dragon breath belonging to Dragon Emperor Linhe surged. The precious image of a red-gold giant Dragon rose up and occupied the body of the huge white Bone Dragon.","The Bone Dragon seemed to have gradually regained its consciousness. The Death Light in its eyes was no longer there, and in its place was a dim light.","“You are my son, Linhe?” the old voice resounded.","The Dragon Emperor Linhe nodded with tears in his eyes. “Yes, it’s me.”","“I thought that it would be difficult for me to see you again in this life, but I have finally met you today. The heavens have been kind to me.”","Words of relief came from the Bone Dragon’s mouth, but they were also filled with endless guilt.","“What I regret the most is that I shouldn’t have searched for that Wang Mi Secret Realm, which resulted in today’s irreparable consequences.”"]},{"number":4631,"title":"Chapter 4631 The Descent of Void God","paragraphs":["4631 The Descent of Void God","Dragon Emperor Linhe’s eyes were bloodshot. He did not know how to say the words that he had been keeping in his heart for a long time.","“It’s just that you and the entire Dragon clan suffered during the time I was away.” The Bone Dragon sighed, and its huge white Bone Dragon head slowly lowered.","Dragon Emperor Linhe shook his head. “It’s not. Our Dragon clan is still prosperous now, and we will definitely continue to prosper in the future.”","“That’s good. Linhe, you have to take good care of the Dragon clan. I can’t help you anymore.” The Bone Dragon raised its head and looked at the broken sky with a sense of nostalgia. “When my consciousness falls into chaos again, it will be the time for my body to die and my Dao to disappear.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe was at a loss for words as he could not see any living characteristics from the Bone Dragon.","!!","The reason why the Bone Dragon was able to recognize him and wake up from its chaotic consciousness was probably because of that last bit of obsession in its heart.","Now that its obsession had been dispelled, the Bone Dragon no longer had the will to live.","The dark aura that had gathered around his body began to dissipate, and his white bones began to dismember.","The light in the Bone Dragon’s eye sockets finally dissipated. As it did so, he turned to Dragon Emperor Linhe and said, “Warn the entire Dragon clan not to try and find the realm of Wang Mi, or they will end up like me.”","After saying this, the Bone Dragon was dismembered, and its huge skeleton scattered across the shattered Star Field like dust.","After the Ancestral Dragon died, the original bloodline and fortune of the entire Dragon clan, which had disappeared, were all returned.","The Dragons, which had been unable to grow for countless chaos cycles and had never produced a single Half Ancestor in their descendants, were now being nourished by the ancestral bloodline.","The ten thousand Dragon clan descendants that were patrolling and guarding the base had all broken through.","Every single Dragon descendant would be able to advance a whole realm, from Primary to High, High to Top, Top to Half Invincible, and finally to Invincible Supremes.","As for Long Yan and Long Chi, the two Supreme experts of the Dragon clan who had been at the peak of the Invincible realm for countless years, they had both touched that cultivation upper-barrier at this moment. They hurriedly waved their hands to create their Divine Kingdoms and entered them without any delay to grab that trace of fate energy.","It had been too long, so long that they had already lost all hope. Now that such an opportunity had appeared, they would definitely not give it up.","On the shattered land of the Rodu Star Field, Dragon Emperor Linhe silently felt the return of the Dragon clan’s ancestral bloodline.","He was still at the Half Ancestor realm. Even the return of the ancestral bloodline could not help him break through the shackles.","This was because the hidden disease in Dragon Emperor Linhe’s body was an ancient curse set by the Phoenix Patriarch and the Qilin King during the war between the three clans. It would not be weakened with the passage of time.","Dragon Emperor Linhe was relieved when he felt the ancient curse lingering in his body like maggots.","He wanted to protect the Dragon clan while he was alive, and it would be the same even after he died.","Looking at the five wailing sons of the Qilin family, Dragon Emperor Linhe was already filled with killing intent.","With the strength of a Half Ancestor, the Qilin’s Five Sons, whose highest realm was only at the peak of the Invincible Supreme stage, would definitely die!","Just as Dragon Emperor Linhe was about to strike and kill the Dragon Prince with a single strike, the entire Rodu trembled. The shattered sky caved in, and the earth split apart.","The eye of the chaos that was almost completely sealed by Old Master suddenly shattered, and a huge amount of dark and unknown aura spewed out.","It was so terrifying that even a Half Ancestor would not be able to stand near it.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene in front of him, and the bad feeling in his heart had already happened.","“Do you want me to take you out of here?”","In the blazing fire domain, a tall and perfect figure stepped on the flames and a fire lotus formed by thousands of flames bloomed around her. She looked at Jian Wushuang with her Phoenix eyes.","Feng Qi, who had walked out of the Nirvana of raging flames, had a peak aura. There were even faint signs of a breakthrough.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said seriously, “I can’t leave before the crisis is over.","Feng Qi unhappily pouted and mumbled, “Idiot.”","He stood up and looked at the strange dark aura. Jian Wushuang vaguely felt that it was familiar.","The five sons of the Qilin had already stood up. After Lu Ting took a deep look at Dragon Emperor Linhe, he left the Rodu Star Field with the surviving descendants of the Qilin clan.","Jian Wushuang came to Old Master’s side and asked softly, “Is something wrong?”","The old man nodded slightly, and his eyes became alert.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to be careless. He secretly mobilized his divine power to deal with what was going to happen next.","The Holy Land of the Qilin clan, Rodu, was completely shattered. The continent turned into broken stars that drifted into the depths of the universe.","Only the eye of the chaos erupted with unparalleled and terrifying energy.","It was like a giant door leading to an unknown realm, and a towering shadow slowly condensed inside.","The next moment, a phantom figure stepped out of the spring of chaos!","Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly shrank. The phantom that seemed to have stepped out from ancient times was Void God, who had been sealed into the space-time turbulence by Cosmos God!","After nearly 20,000 years, he had finally returned from the chaos.","However, what Jian Wushuang had never expected was Void God actually returned from the extreme point of the Divine Power Universe!","It would be an unimaginable disaster for the Divine Power Universe.","The black fog surrounding his body dispersed, and Jian Wushuang saw the true appearance of Void God for the first time.","A black and gold three-pronged Emperor’s crown was tied up in his long hair, and his angular face was full of endless evil majesty. His robe was woven with black and gold threads, and it fluttered even though there was no wind.","Without any communication, Void God pointed his finger at Jian Wushuang!","The great terror of life and death surged in his heart. The sense of powerlessness once again made Jian Wushuang return to the first time he was suppressed by a wave of his hand.","It was as if it had gathered the power of an ancient evil, and even the void collapsed under this finger.","Jian Wushuang also used his strongest Sword Intent immediately.","The vast Sword Intent rose from the laws of the universe, carrying endless power, and collided with the finger of Void God.","The bright stars cut through the thick darkness and collided with each other.","Everyone was completely shocked. No one could believe that Jian Wushuang would dare to fight a real Ancestor realm existence with a mere Half Invincible Supreme realm!","Was he a lunatic? He must be crazy! Feng Qi’s heart trembled as she looked at that slim figure in disbelief.","However, Jian Wushuang’s most brilliant and pure Sword Intent only stopped Void God for a moment before it shattered.","The monstrous finger that could suppress the heavens had finally descended!","Every pore of Jian Wushuang was stained with blood, and his crimson eyes were filled with madness.","He did not care about the consequences, he used the forbidden technique at all costs.","Divine power surged and burned, its brilliance like the sun, making people not dare to look directly at him.","Jian Wushuang burned his blood essence at the cost of his life source!"]},{"number":4632,"title":"Chapter 4632 The Real Great Catastrophe War (1)","paragraphs":["4632 The Real Great Catastrophe War (1)","It was an irreversible forbidden technique. At the cost of one’s own body, one could burst out with nearly ten times the energy of one’s body.","Once it was used, it would be a situation where they would fight to the death.","He burned his Half Invincible Supreme cultivation base to face Void God with determination.","Like a burning sun, Jian Wushuang’s body was at its peak!","The black robe could not withstand Sheng Ji’s divine power and broke on its own, revealing his chest that was full of majestic divine patterns.","!!","Then, Jian Wushuang raised one hand to the sky and met the finger.","The already shattered sky, earth, and Star Field turned into void space. The entire Rodu Star Field, along with the surrounding 20 subsidiary Star Field, were eventually reduced to dust.","Under this indescribable and terrifying explosion, even Half Ancestors could not stand still!","Feng Qi, who had rushed over recklessly, spat out a mouthful of divine blood. Then, she fainted and fell into the void.","Dragon Emperor Linhe was similarly overwhelmed and fainted after spitting out a mouthful of divine blood.","There were only three figures standing in the vast and broken void.","Jian Wushuang received the terrifying finger attack from Void God. The divine patterns on his body were extremely dazzling.","Blood gushed out of his three hundred and sixty million pores at the same time, but it was instantly evaporated by the overwhelming divine power.","Jian Wushuang did not hide the burning hatred in his eyes. The past was sad, but he never forgot to take revenge.","Even a Void God could not help but be surprised by the tiny but strong figure that could withstand one of his fingers.","The ant from back then could actually grow to such an extent?","This child must not be left alive!","Void GOd struck again. The palm that could shatter the void rose.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were burning with a desire to fight. He was no longer passive, but integrated Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate into his body and collided with it resolutely.","He had already made up his mind to die, and all his strength was in this one move!","The brilliant divine power illuminated the void as if it was daytime. The Extreme Darkness Heaven Gate allowed Jian Wushuang, who was a Half Invincible Supreme, to touch the edge of that mysterious layer.","At this moment, there was a sigh. “Sigh, silly child...”","Old Master slowly opened his eyes and looked at the extreme point that was about to bloom. Then, he quietly disappeared.","In the next moment, a black shadow appeared behind Jian Wushuang quietly. It grabbed the back of his neck with one hand and then disappeared.","Boom boom boom–","The two peak auras collided, and even the void was destroyed. This indescribable explosion made it impossible for any living creature to survive here.","Void God frowned when he saw what happened just now.","“Ouch, ouch, ouch...” Jian Wushuang gasped and shouted in pain.","Old Master snorted and released his grip on the back of Jian Wushuang’s neck. At the same time, he slapped Jian Wushuang’s chest with a strange energy.","When the strange and majestic energy entered his body, the burning origin blood essence actually stopped burning!","The blood essence that he had lost seemed to be flowing back slowly. Jian Wushuang was completely shocked.","Before he could speak, a gentle force pulled him away.","Feng Qi, who had turned into a giant Natal Phoenix, threw Jian Wushuang on her back. Her Phoenix eyes were full of anger. “You! Do you really think that you can just let yourself die like that? It’s simply the behavior of a reckless man!”","“I’ll only say one thing. If you die, I’ll immediately lead the Phoenix clan to surrender to the Void Universe. You’re on your own then!”","Jian Wushuang scratched his head in embarrassment.","Old Master stood there with his hands behind his back. He looked at Void God with the three-pronged crown and said unkindly, “I’ll give you three breaths to get out of my sight.”","Void God’s expression was calm as he looked at the old man. A sky-reaching palm print that was ten times stronger than the previous one pressed down.","Old Master snorted in anger, took a step forward, and waved his sleeve.","The void trembled as the black lightning easily destroyed the palm print.","“Since you don’t want to leave, then you can stay!”","Endless sighs sounded. In the dark and broken sky, a roaring Black River suddenly fell.","Void God’s eyes focused. He seemed to have realized something. Fear flashed in his eyes.","He no longer stood where he was, and with his hands behind his back, he was about to leave.","However, from the Black River, a giant arm shot out and hit Void God.","With a wave of his sleeve, endless void power formed layers of barriers in front of him.","However, the giant arm easily penetrated all the defenses and hit Void God’s body.","A terrifying energy as deep as the abyss exploded. Void God could no longer remain calm, and he crossed his arms to block the attack.","There was no dazzling explosion, but an extremely dull sound.","Void God’s robe sleeves were all torn and he was in a bad state. Even the three-pronged crown on his head was slanted.","Void God was completely shocked. How could there be such a person in the two universes who could suppress him with one move?","“You don’t belong here!” Void God looked at the old man and said slowly.","“So what?” Old Master took a step forward and said calmly.","Void God took a deep breath and looked at the old man. Then, he turned into a black cloud and fled.","Old Master squinted his eyes and reached out his hand to strike the last blow.","Endless lightning appeared above the broken void, and together, they descended the divine punishment.","Void God who was trying to leave at full speed grunted. His black and gold robe was torn to pieces, but he did not stop. Instead, he left at an even faster speed.","At this point, the entire Rodu Star Field was completely silent.","Old Master looked at the eye of Spring of Chaos that rose from the void and blocked it again.","...","Like a dim star, the Cosmic Boat was traveling under the starry sky of a dead zone.","The deck was dead silent.","After this incident, less than one-tenth of the Qilin clan’s descendants died, and a large number of Intermediate and High Supreme experts died.","There were less than ten thousand Qilin clan members left.","All the descendants of the Qilin clan glared at Dragon Emperor Linhe as if they wanted to tear him apart.","If not for that Ancestral Bone Dragon from the Dragon clan, the Qilin clan would not have suffered such heavy losses!","However, the Qilin clan did not even have a single Half Ancestor. How were they going to kill Dragon Emperor Linhe?","Only when the last Heaven’s Favorite of the Qilin clan returned would they be able to take revenge.","Burying the endless hatred in their hearts, Lu Ting and the other four sons began to comfort the remaining descendants of the clan.","Old Master seemed to be a little tired. Jian Wushuang used his divine power to create a chair for Old Master to sit on.","The current situation between the Dragon clan and the Qilin clan was not something that Jian Wushuang could mediate.","With the return of Void God, chaos was brewing. Even he felt helpless.","With the suspicious and domineering nature of Void God, a great war that would really collapse the Divine Power Universe might have already begun."]},{"number":4633,"title":"Chapter 4633 The Real Great Catastrophe War (2)","paragraphs":["4633 The Real Great Catastrophe War (2)","Although Old Master had used a special method to trace back the blood essence that had been burned, the residual effects were reflected in every single way.","As his meridians became chaotic, Jian Wushuang could only grit his teeth and sort them out bit by bit.","Perhaps she saw his pain, Feng Qi directly put her palm on his back and slowly transmitted the vast and pure Phoenix breath.","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled slightly, and then he said stiffly, “Thank you.”","“How insincere. Do you know how many times I’ve saved your life? How dare you treat your savior like this?” Feng Qi said unhappily.","!!","“I really don’t understand you. You were so excited, you even took off your clothes.”","“...”","After leaving Rodu Star Field, Jian Wushuang carried the last of the Qilin clan and headed towards the base camp of the Offworld Battlefield.","After working at full force for more than a month, the Cosmic Boat finally arrived at the Offworld Battlefield.","The scene that Jian Wushuang was most worried about did not happen. The base camp in the Offworld Battleground was peaceful. The patrol teams of the Dragon clan and the Phoenix Clan were still patrolling.","Supreme Xue Bo and the others had been waiting outside for a long time.","Jian Wushuang flew over and said in a deep voice, “Void God has broken the seal and returned.”","The faces of Supreme Xue Bo and the others changed when they heard this. Then, they said, “It seems that the person who forced his way into the crack a few days ago should be Void God.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang quickly asked Supreme Xue Bo to continue.","“About ten days ago, a powerful void power gushed out from the depths of the Divine Power Universe, but it didn’t clash with the base camp. Instead, it went straight into the crack, and the Dragon and Phoenix clans who were stationed there lost nearly 100 Supreme experts.”","Jian Wushuang frowned. It seemed that Void God had returned to the Void Universe. The time for the next Great Catastrophe was getting closer and closer.","It could be 1,000 years or 10,000 years.","“Will Void God be afraid of Old Master’s existence in the Divine Power Universe and not dare to launch the catastrophe or extend the time?”","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang denied the first point.","Old Master was alone in the Divine Power Universe, who could stand in an undefeatable position. However, there were mighty figures besides Void God in the Void Universe.","The True Shadow that Devour One had summoned in the Polar Sea Star Field gave Jian Wushuang great pressure with just one glance.","Devouring Emperor, who was extremely mysterious, must be much stronger than Void God.","Meanwhile, all the Divine Power Universe had was Old Master.","Jian Wushuang did not dare to think about it anymore. The three Ancestor realm experts in the Void Universe almost made Jian Wushuang feel despair.","Supreme Xue Bo gestured to the others and said softly, “Palace Master Wushuang, I have good news as well. Two members of the Dragon clan have advanced to the Half Ancestor level not long ago.”","“What? Half Ancestor?!” At this moment, whether it was Feng Qi of the Phoenix clan or Lu Ting of the Qilin clan, they all widened their eyes.","So far, only Feng Qi was a Half Ancestor in the Phoenix Clan. Lu Shan of the Qilin clan died and they did not have a single Half Ancestor, while the Dragon clan already had three Half Ancestors.","Two Half Ancestors! This meant that the Dragon clan had once again trampled the Phoenix clan and the Qilin clan under their feet.","Upon hearing this, the vexed expression on the face of Dragon Emperor Linhe eased up. The heavens have blessed the Dragon clan! The heavens have blessed the Dragon clan!","A touch of sadness flashed in the depths of Lu Ting’s eyes, and his firm heart began to waver.","Feng Qi furrowed her brows, thinking about something.","After hearing the news, Jian Wushuang’s face relaxed.","Half Ancestors could also influence the battle, and could greatly reduce the loss of their living forces.","Jian Wushuang had a premonition that the Great Catastrophe War would start again in at most 1,000 years after the return of Void God.","During this period of time, breaking through was his most urgent task.","At the same time, after the last battle, the Divine Life Palace had lost almost half of its members. Jian Wushuang decided to gather the individual cultivators during this time.","One by one, the Cosmic Boats left the base camp, and the gathered orders were like starlight and scattered in the Divine Power Universe.","He was going to tell all the itinerant cultivators in the Divine Power Universe, as well as the clans and sects that were resisting tenaciously, to finish the battle in one go and face the most intense battle in the future!","After giving all these instructions, Jian Wushuang flew directly to the Wordless Monument and concentrated on breaking through the barrier.","When he burned his blood essence to fight against Void God, Jian Wushuang felt that the unbreakable realm had started to shake.","No matter what, he had to break through Half Invincible Supreme and enter the Invincible Supreme realm!","Jian Wushuang was looking forward to it. If he could defeat a Half Ancestor level expert when he was only at the Half Invincible Supreme realm, what about the Invincible Supreme realm?","Sitting in front of the huge Wordless Monument, Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and focused his mind. He began to comprehend the previous breakthrough point.","Waves of charm enshrouded his body, causing slight ripples.","Old Master stood behind Jian Wushuang calmly, as if he had fallen into a deep sleep.","Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, 500 years had passed.","During this period, the Cosmic Boats that had left the base camp began to return one after another. They brought back powerful itinerant cultivators.","They were either cultivators whose clans and sects had been destroyed or cultivators who had survived the last Great Catastrophe.","Every one of them was extremely powerful.","Just the first batch of returning Cosmic Boats brought back close to 50,000 cultivators.","There were more than five thousand ordinary Autarchs, and there were nearly twenty-plus who had taken part in the first war of the apocalypse, then gone into hiding.","With the appearance and participation of every cultivator, it meant that the chances of victory in this Great Catastrophe War were higher, but at the same time, it also meant that it was more tragic.","All the cultivators who came to the Offworld Battleground knew that this battle would bet the lives and luck of many generations of the Divine Power Universe.","They could not lose, so they gathered here to finish the battle in one go.","Following the return of the first batch of Cosmic Boats, the second and third batches also returned.","One after another, cultivators descended from the Cosmic Boat. At the same time, there was an endless stream of cultivators who lived in the open and stepped into various Star Fields, coming from everywhere in the Divine Powe Universe.","Stepping into the base of the Offworld Battleground, everyone had different expressions on their faces, but most of them were silent and determined.","Every cultivator knew what position they would be in in the upcoming catastrophe.","In the face of an enemy that was several times stronger, they did not know if their death could be exchanged for a chance for their descendants to breathe.","However, even so, they still came.","Supreme Xue Bo and the others saw that nearly 300,000 cultivators had arrived at the Offworld Battlefield, they were already in tears.","No one knew how far a war would progress when one’s life was at stake, because most people would either die peacefully or tragically in the process.","The huge Offworld Battlefield did not become lively even after the large influx of cultivators.","This place would forever be filled with death and coldness."]},{"number":4634,"title":"Chapter 4634 Prologue","paragraphs":["4634 Prologue","For 800 years, cultivators kept coming to the Offworld Battlefield. Cities rose up one after another with the base camp as the center.","The initial 300,000 cultivators had now gathered to over 2 million.","At the same time, there were many familiar forces that joined, causing Supreme Xue Bo to sigh with emotion.","The Nine Emperor Pavilion, which had been destroyed in the last battle of the Great Catastrophe War, reappeared. Supreme Hong’er and the Zi Fa Supreme joined in one after another.","The Starry Sky Sword Sect, who was on the run, also rushed to the Offworld Battlefield. Wu Jianxian was as calm as ever, but there was a hint of killing intent in her indifference.","White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, heard the order to assemble from the Divine LIfe Palace and brought his descendants to the Offworld Battlefield in the first hundred years.","What surprised Supreme Xue Bo the most was that the Great Void Temple, which he thought had already died, did not surrender. Great Void Divine Emperor was just like tens of thousands of years ago, cold and indifferent.","When he saw that the Xue Bo had not died and had instead broken through the Invincible Supreme realm and become a Half Ancestor, he did not say much. He only asked to see Jian Wushuang.","Supreme Xue Bo did not reject him. After pointing in the direction where Jian Wushuang was, Great Void Divine Emperor left.","After that, the crazy alcoholic and old beggar, who were wandering cultivators, arrived. He was carrying a wine gourd with his snowflake sword. He was wearing a tattered Daoist robe and had two blushes on his face.","He was even more drunk than he was 20,000 years ago, but those who knew him well knew that he would never get drunk.","The Sword Alliance that Jian Wushuang had established on the Ancient Path of Stars had all arrived. Nine Stars Saint of the Nine Stars Holy Land and the Moluo clan had also arrived one after another.","So far, in 800 years, they had gathered nearly three million cultivators.","Usually, only one Supreme realm expert could be born in a Star Field, but now there were more than 200,000 of them!","Everything that had happened today had far exceeded the scale of any Grteat Catastrophe!","The endless Star Field of the entire Ddivine Power Universe, no matter how far away, had contributed their own power.","SUpreme Xue Bo took over the position of the Divine Life Palace for the time being and began to adjust the large number of cultivators.","The Wordless Monument not far from the base camp almost became a sight. Every cultivator who came to the Offworld Battlefield would come and look at it, and most of them would secretly cry.","The Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan had sent over 200 disciples to guard Jian Wushuang in turns. Feng Qi, the Matriarch of the Phoenix clan, was also there.","After more than 900 years of being busy, no one felt bored. All the cultivators were trying their best to break through.","Nine Stars Saint of the Sword Alliance crossed his arms and said, “Instead of worrying about him, you should worry about yourself first. He’s a monster that can steal the good fortune of heaven and earth.”","Overlord smacked his lips and stole a glance at Ninth Kalpa King who was not far away. He then lowered his voice and said, “Do you think Jian Wushuang is much more powerful than NInth Kalpa King now?”","Nine Stars Saint glanced at Overlord and shook his head. “I don’t know, but Jian Wushuang has never disappointed me. Now, he is the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace. Do you know what that means?”","“And I heard that before Jian Wushuang went into seclusion, he could already fight against Half Ancestor realm experts.”","Overlord suddenly realized that there was a Half Ancestor in the Divine Life Palace, who was even more terrifying than his own Patriarch.","And for Jian Wushuang to become the Palace Master, it meant...","Overlord did not dare to think further. Although Jian Wushuang was also an unparalleled genius in his heart, it was too terrifying for him to fight against a Half Ancestor with a Half Invincible Supreme realm...","Taking the wine gourd from the tip of the crazy alcoholic old beggar’s sword, Ninth Kalpa King saluted Jian Wushuang’s back from a distance and then took a big gulp.","“How’s it, Kid? Is my wine strong?” the old beggar asked with a smile.","Ninth Kalpa King grinned and said, “It’s fierce!”","The old beggar was overjoyed, as if he had just heard the best praise. He snatched the wine gourd and took another big gulp.","The old beggar let out a long burp, his eyes hazy from the alcohol.","“In my long life, I’ve only fought a single battle of the Great Catastrophe War. It was the battle where Lord Cosmos God died.”","“Do you know why I didn’t participate in the first Great Catastrophe War?”","Ninth Kalpa King shook his head.","The old beggar grinned, “That’s because I’m too selfish.”","“Selfish?” Ninth Kalpa King was confused.","As if reminiscing, the old beggar’s eyes seemed to be filled with the past. “I became famous before the first Great Catastrophe War, but I did not participate in the great battle. At that time, I traveled around the world, but I claimed to be independent and that everything had nothing to do with me.”","it was not until the start of the Great Catastrophe War that I vaguely realized that no one was an independent existence. At that time, most of the Divine Power Universe had fallen, and everything I loved was destroyed silently.”","“It was during that great battle... I saw the glory of a group of people, and for the first time, my empty Dao Heart began to have something to pursue.”","“I finally fought alongside them during the last Great Catastrophe, but they all left one by one. I’m the only one who’s still alive.”","“I used to selfishly think that if I grew stronger step by step with the ultimate goal of protecting others, that would be too boring.”","“But fortunately, the long years have taught me a lesson and made me realize that I have finally reached this path.”","The old beggar had been smiling the entire time. “The once young me witnessed Cosmos God who single-handedly turned the tide. Now, my greatest hope is to witness the rise of the next Cosmos God and lead the entire Divine Power Universe to live on well.”","At this point, the old beggar turned around and strolled away. “A selfish person like me hopes that there will be fewer and fewer universes with divine power.”","Ninth Kalpa King looked quietly at the crazy alcoholic old beggar in his unkempt Daoist robe. For some reason, he overlapped the elegant swordsman in green.","Perhaps the old beggar was just as reckless when he was young.","NInth Kalpa King, who had regained his senses, looked at the figure sitting in front of the Wordless Monument with a spirited gaze. “You, I’m looking forward to witnessing your growth.”","...","1,200 years had passed in the blink of an eye, but the spring and autumn of the human world had changed, and the new snow had replaced the sun and spring. For these cultivators who had embarked on the path of cultivation, it only added a little bit of mental state.","The figure sitting under the Wordless Monument finally moved after a long time.","As the dust drifted, a thread of majestic divine glyphs quietly surged."]},{"number":4635,"title":"Chapter 4635 Invincible Supreme","paragraphs":["4635 Invincible Supreme","The brilliant divine pattern was like a flowing river that flowed along with Jian Wushuang’s hair.","Old Master, who was like a clay sculpture, suddenly opened his eyes. After glancing at Jian Wushuang’s back, he fell silent again.","After that, Feng Qi also woke up from her sleep after sensing the fluctuation of Jian Wushuang’s aura.","“What is this guy doing... He’s still not awake?” Feng Qi was puzzled. She looked around Jian Wushuang from a distance and then stopped.","As time passed, the divine pattern river around Jian Wushuang became purer, like a star that was shining with blue light.","His breath was longer and he would only slowly exhale once every hundred years.","And that layer of illusory shackles was also gradually weakening.","The number of cultivators that had gathered for the Offworld Battlefield had gradually stopped at five million.","The base camp was no longer enough for all cultivators to settle down, so Supreme Xue Bo could lead the Dragon and Phoenix clans to expand.","Nearly 60 vast cities formed a defensive formation, surrounding the base camp and rising up.","All the cultivators were already waiting in formation.","“It has been more than 1,000 years. With Jian Wushuang’s talent, he should have woken up,” Overlord touched his chin and said thoughtfully.","“Hmph!” White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, smacked him on the back. “Do you think that advancing to the Invincible Supreme realm is as easy as eating and drinking? Back then, it took me more than ten chaos cycles to advance to the Invincible Supreme realm.”","Overlord touched his head and said, “I had a feeling that Jian Wushuang would wake up soon.”","White Ape did not speak again. He looked at Jian Wushuang’s back with a little expectation.","“Little guy, you must break through the Invincible Supreme realm.”","In these 1,000 years, the Offworld Battlefield was not peaceful.","The Void Warriors who served as scouts kept breaking through the cracks, trying to find out the situation in this universe.","Supreme Xue Bo was well prepared. Every 100 Supremes formed a ladder team, making it a total of 10 ladder teams. A total of 1,000 Supremes took turns to guard the crack.","As more and more Void Warriors rushed out of the crack, the friction between them grew from small to big. Every cultivator vaguely realized that the unprecedented catastrophe was about to start.","The cultivation systems of the two universes were different. The restriction of the void power caused difficulties for the Void Warriors. Those from the Void Universe would find it challenging to go too deep.","This also greatly saved time and the degree of casualties.","After dealing with all these matters, Supreme Xue Bo walked out of the base camp, exhausted. He had not rested much for more than 1,000 years, and even his Half Ancestor body could not take it.","Supreme Tian Yi and Jun Fu accompanied him as he advanced.","“How long do you think it will take for Palace Master Wushuang to wake up from his meditation?” Supreme Tian Yi spoke.","Supreme Jun Fu shook his head. “It’s hard to say. The invincible Supreme is a natural chasm. Given Palace Master Wushuang’s terrifying aptitude, I’m afraid it’ll be even more difficult for him to break through than us.”","Supreme Xue Bo laughed heartily. “Both of you have guessed wrongly. In my opinion, Palace Master Wushuang will wake up in two years at most.”","The two of them nodded with a smile as they looked at the Supreme Xue Bo, who was keeping a secret.","As expected, in the second year, Jian Wushuang, who was sitting under the Wordless Monument, woke up from his Enlightenment.","The divine pattern river that flowed all over his body was like clear air surging up, transforming into billions of stars. The rules of Great Dao that could not be seen clearly in the Offworld Battlefield were reconstructed, and the treasure light rose around Jian Wushuang.","The dark and broken void became clear for a moment, and a special nomological Dao was added to his body.","At this moment, all the Invincible Supremes in the base camp were looking at this scene.","All of the Invincible Supremes were stunned. They could clearly remember how terrifying the Lightning Tribulation that had descended upon them when they had first become Invincible Supremes was. If they had been the slightest bit careless during their advancement, they would have ended up in a miserable state.","However, why was it that the way he advanced to the Invincible Supremes level was different from the way they did it?","It was as if an Emperor was being crowned. The Supreme divine punishment Lightning Tribulation turned into a monstrous divine power and slowly descended. The surrounding million miles were bathed in the vast divine power.","At this moment, the magical equipment worn by all the cultivators trembled slightly, as if they were worshiping.","Looking at the figure that was hanging in the sky like a big sun, those who knew Jian Wushuang smiled. This guy who had braved adversities and ran all the way to this day had not disappointed anyone.","With the support of the Invincible Supremes Great Dao, the dazzling divine patterns around Jian Wushuang’s body slowly receded.","Leng Rushuang, who was standing beside Lan Lan, could not help but burst into tears. Jian Wushuang was his husband and his pride.","As the divine power slowly dissipated, Leng Rushuang could not hold back any longer and was ready to rush forward.","However, a fiery red and beautiful figure arrived in front of Jian Wushuang first and cast a gratified and admiring look.","Leng Rushuang’s eyes dimmed and she stopped in her tracks.","“What are you still standing there for? Don’t you miss your husband?” Lan Lan chuckled, grabbed Leng Rushuang’s wrist, and followed the crowd to Jian Wushuang.","“As expected, he didn’t let me down. He’s really a monster to be able to break through to the Invincible Supreme realm in just over 1,000 years.” Feng Qi nodded in satisfaction.","Jian Wushuang smiled, “I was really lucky.”","Feng Qi continued, “Back then, you were able to suppress a Half Ancestor when you were only a Half Invincible Supreme. Now that you’re an Invincible Supreme, doesn’t that mean...”","“It’s not as exaggerated as you think. I don’t think there’s much change,” Jian Wushuang said.","Just as they were speaking, the Divine Life Palace, the Dragon clan, and the Phoenix clan, as well as some powerful cultivators, gathered.","Looking at so many cultivators, Jian Wushuang did not know how to react.","Xue Bo laughed and told Jian Wushuang everything that had happened in the past 1,500 years.","Jian Wushuang only came back to his senses after he finished speaking. He murmured, “These are the cultivators that have gathered here. They are cultivators from the Divine Power Universe.”","The remaining members of the Divine Life Palace were all filled with emotions.","From the beginning when he was alone, to the addition of the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan, to the gathering of nearly five million cultivators, everything was like a dream to Jian Wushuang.","He had never dared to hope for such a situation. For a moment, his heart was surging.","Five million cultivators had gathered here, trying their best to break through under the heavy pressure of the Void Universe.","Nearly 200,000 Supremes consisted of almost the entire fate energy of the Divine Power Universe. They could not lose this battle... They could not afford to lose.","A slight commotion suddenly broke out among the cultivators who were gradually gathering in front of the Wordless Monument. Then, the crowd gradually parted to the sides, leaving a path for them.","The two thick auras caused everyone to look over."]},{"number":4636,"title":"Chapter 4636 Dueling to Stop Conflict (1)","paragraphs":["4636 Dueling to Stop Conflict (1)","The two figures who were walking over slowly had a strong aura but were extremely restrained. Their figures were completely hidden under the loose black robes.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang could clearly sense that the two figures were Half Ancestors.","The atmosphere in front of the wordless monument suddenly became so heavy that one could hear a pin drop.","Supreme Xue Bo was also at a loss. He did not know when two Half Ancestors had been hiding among the army of cultivators.","Judging from the surging aura, they were probably not here to congratulate them.","Supreme Xue Bo did not dawdle. He quickly stepped forward and asked, “Who are you two?”","The two of them pulled down their hoods at the same time, revealing their aged faces.","“Xiang Qing.”","“Xiang Huang.”","The two extremely old men spoke at the same time, their voices slightly low.","They were too old, as if they had existed since the separation of heaven and earth and the creation of chaos. Xue Bo almost could not find their life force, even when they did not deliberately hide it.","“We are old friends of Cosmos God. We should have entered reincarnation long ago. However, we were still worried in the end and borrowed some fate energy from the universe. We are here to offer our final help.” The two old men spoke at the same time, their voices calm.","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for your help, Seniors. The Divine Life Palace is very grateful.”","The two elders nodded slightly, and their gazes shifted from Supreme Xue Bo to him. “You are the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace?”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","“To be able to reach the Invincible Supreme realm at such a young age, your future will be terrifying.” The slimmer elder nodded, but he immediately changed the topic. “However, I personally think that it is not appropriate for you to lead the Divine Life Palace in the upcoming war.”","As soon as he said that, the people who knew Jian Wushuang looked over. Golden Crow Emperor and Great Void Divine Emperor watched from the side, waiting to see how he would deal with it.","Jian Wushuang did not care. He smiled and said, “What do you think, Old Senior?”","“It’s very simple. Give up the position of the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace and let one of the Half Ancestors here take over,” said Xiang Huang, who was more muscular.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang did not speak.","The Matriarch of the Phoenix Clan, Feng Qi, chuckled and said, “I’m out. I don’t want to participate in this stupid competition.”","Dragon Emperor Linhe also replied, “With the enemy in front of us, the Dragon clan does not want to get involved in unnecessary competition. In my opinion, the responsibility of the Divine Palace should be with Palace Master Wushuang.”","Supreme Xue Bo did not have a good impression of the elder when he spoke. He suppressed his anger and said coldly, “Palace Master Wushuang is the successor appointed by the previous Palace Master, Dao Yan. No one can change this!”","Five of the seven Half Ancestors immediately refused.","As for the two elders, Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang, they remained calm. “This battle concerns the life and death of the Divine Power Universe. As old friends of Cosmos God, we will definitely not watch the Divine Power Universe be destroyed in his hands. Therefore, I will definitely not back down.”","“He’s only an Invincible Supreme realm being. Although he’s extremely talented, he’s like an ant in the eyes of a Half Ancestor, not to mention that the Void Universe has true Ancestor realm existences like Void God. How much use can he be of?”","“Strength is an insurmountable heavenly chasm.” A deep voice resounded across the entire battlefield. Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang released their Half Ancestor realm auras.","In an instant, nearly a million cultivators gathered in front of the Wordless Monument, and they were all infected by the words of the two.","That’s right. No matter how good his foundation root bone was, he was only an Invincible Supreme. He might not even be able to withstand a move from a Half Ancestor, so how could he lead the Divine Power Universe to win this battle?","Feng Qi could not help but burst out laughing after hearing the last part of their conversation. The other Half Ancestors also had strange expressions on their faces.","There was a huge chasm between each realm, but Jian Wushuang was obviously not one of them.","Even Feng Qi, who had reached the Half Ancestor level, did not think about killing Jian Wushuang, but how to escape.","The scene where a Half Invincible Supreme warrior fought Void God was too shocking.","However, Jian Wushuang did not have much of a reaction. After hearing this, he slowly said, “Old Senior, What if I don’t give up the position of the Palace Master?”","“Then I can only force you to abdicate.” With that, two of the purest and most vigorous divine powers rose from the sky. The divine might that belonged to a Half Ancestor instantly shocked most of the cultivators.","“Don’t blame me. I just don’t want to see the Divine Power Universe being destroyed,” Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang said in unison.","Hearing this, Xue Bo was about to take a step forward but was stopped by Jian Wushuang. “I will take care of it. Don’t worry.”","With that, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and the boundless divine power belonging to the Invincible Supreme realm also surged.","The divine power that rose up was actually resisting Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang.","“In that case, I, Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, am willing to learn from you.”","The two of them stopped talking and stepped forward. The power of Half Ancestors pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","The cultivators that were gathered there all stepped back, leaving a large space for them.","“He’s only at the Invincible Supreme realm, yet he dares to fight against Half Ancestors. Is that kid crazy?” Great Void Divine Emperor’s eyes narrowed and he looked at everything that was about to happen in disbelief.","“Is it really okay for Jian Wushuang to fight one against two?” Overlord murmured softly, his eyes filled with shock.","At this moment, everyone had already determined the final outcome of the battle.","Only the disciples of the Divine Life Palace who had participated in the previous great battle remained calm, as if they had already predicted the outcome.","“I don’t know,” Supreme Xue Bo said calmly. “Perhaps dueling to stop conflict is the best choice right now.”","The two sharp auras of Half Ancestors locked onto Jian Wushuang’s retreat and tried to destroy him in one move!","Unparalleled jade-green divine power vines spread out from the two of them, and their Dao Fields and Domains were formed.","In this kind of Domain, it could almost directly reduce the enemy’s strength by a large extent.","Jian Wushuang’s face was calm. Looking at the scene, he could not help but smile, “A Domain? I know it too.”","A layer of dim and undetectable aura quietly climbed up the entire void. It was Jian Wushuang’s gifted divine power, Primordial Universe, which had been hidden from everyone’s eyes.","Jian Wushuang’s current divine power, along with the rest of his divine powers, had been refined by him in the thousand years of meditation. He was no longer the same as before.","Even a Half Ancestor did not know that he had fallen into Jian Wushuang’s Domain.","“For the sake of the Divine Power Universe, we won’t hold back. Be careful,” Xiang Qing said in a deep voice. At the same time, a huge vine grew from the Domain and swept toward Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4637,"title":"Chapter 4637 Dueling to Stop Conflict (2)","paragraphs":["4637 Dueling to Stop Conflict (2)","The divine power that rose up from the sky was like a mountain that was collapsing. Even the Invincible Supremes subconsciously took half a step back to avoid being affected.","“It’s probably over,” Great Void Divine Emperor mumbled. However, following that, the scene that he was most unwilling to believe in appeared.","Jian Wushuang was still standing in the same place, and he slashed out with the Tarot Divine Sword, which exuded a monstrous divine power.","Swish...","With a soft sound, the mountain-like vine was directly split in two.","Jian Wushuang did not stop at all. He jumped up and raised the Tarot Divine Sword high in his hand. Facing Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang, he suddenly slashed down with a sky-opening momentum.","The vast and powerful Sword Intent tore through the void like a huge wave and smashed down.","The two of them waved their hands at the same time, and countless vines formed a barrier to block the attack.","The vast and sharp sword essence easily tore through nearly a hundred layers of barriers before gradually dissipating.","Jian Wushuang turned around and stood with his hands behind his back, his face calm.","Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang looked at each other and then said, “You are indeed capable to be the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace at such a young age. However, your abilities are still not enough in our eyes.”","An even more vast amount of divine power began to surge forth. This was divine power that had been infused with the power of a Half Ancestor for countless chaos cycles, making it even more inclusive and vast.","The invisible aura of a Half Ancestor surged in the void and transformed into transparent chain vines that whipped at Jian Wushuang like a divine punishment.","Taking a deep breath, he sheathed the Tarot Divine Sword. With his hands behind his back, he faced the divine punishment that filled the sky and walked towards Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang.","The chain vines that carried the power of heaven and earth whipped Jian Wushuang’s body heavily, but he did not die.","Each of the attacks had the power of a Half Ancestor, but they did not even leave a mark on his body.","A brilliant divine pattern emerged around Jian Wushuang’s body, and a purple ‘Chuan’ character appeared on his eyebrows.","Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang could not believe it. This guy was only in the Invincible Supreme realm. How could he withstand the whipping in their Domain?","One had to know that even a Half Ancestor would not dare to do this!","Perhaps he did not want to waste any more time. Jian Wushuang raised one hand and a mighty Heavenly Gate descended!","“Transcendence– Heavenly Gate!”","The Heavenly Gate, which was more solid than before, seemed to really exist. Every beam of divine power was like the hottest sun. All the cultivators looked at this scene in shock.","After seeing the vast finger from the brilliant Heavenly Gate, Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang gave up resisting and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","The extreme light made all the cultivators in front of the Wordless Monument close their eyes subconsciously. When the light disappeared, everything was over.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang. He cupped his hands and said with a smile, “Thank you for showing mercy, Old Seniors.”","Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang had yet to recover from their shock. After a long time, they whispered at the same time, “How did you manage to master the Ancestral Skill when you were only an Invincible Supreme?”","Jian Wushuang had no intention of hiding anything. He said, “That’s because before Cosmos God left, he gave me all his lifetime of comprehension.”","“I see, I see...” The two of them pondered for a long time and finally prepared to leave.","“Seniors, please stay,” Jian Wushuang stopped them. “The Divine Power Universe needs you. I beg you to stay and fight the enemy together.”","Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang looked at each other and laughed, “Of course. Even if you chase me away, I will never leave the Offworld Battlefield. This is our fate.”","Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion as he watched the two of them leave.","The Offworld Battlefield was deathly silent, but every cultivator’s eyes were burning with excitement. The Divine Life Palace Master could take on two Half Ancestors when he was only at the Invincible Supreme realm. This gave every cultivator a shot of confidence.","It turned out that there was really hope for the Divine Power Universe...","“Oh my God, Boss, you’re too amazing!” Overlord pounced from afar and gave Jian Wushuang a bear hug.","Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “One day, you will be able to do it too.”","White ape, the Overlord Patriarch, immediately pulled Overlord down from Jian Wushuang’s body and said angrily, “You brat, you are always so rude!”","“I just couldn’t help myself when I saw Boss.” Overlord scratched his head and smiled.","White Ape sighed with emotion. “It’s only been tens of thousands of years since we last met, and Palace Master Wushuang has grown so much. It’s really a blessing for the Divine Power Universe.”","Jian Wushuang replied, “Supreme White Ape, you’re too kind. With the war coming, I can only do my best to improve myself.”","Supreme White Ape nodded. He then looked around and said in a low voice, “What are your chances of winning if you were to face Void God?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. Then, he smiled bitterly and said, “Not even 10 percent. I can only guarantee that I can escape from him.”","White Ape also reacted. He patted his head and said awkwardly, “Look at my head. I’m getting old and confused.”","Jian Wushuang knew what White Ape was worried about. After a moment of silence, he said, “Supreme White Ape, don’t worry. When Void God comes, there will be someone to deal with him.”","Supreme White Ape nodded and stopped asking. He had never doubted Jian Wushuang’s words.","After exchanging greetings with everyone for half a day, Jian Wushuang entered the base camp.","At this moment, more than 1,500 years had passed since he had sat under the Wordless Monument. The premonition of the impending Great Catastrophe was getting stronger and stronger.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes sank as he listened to the constant messages from the guards in the crack.","Just as he was about to make a trip to the crack, the urgent warning from the first echelon rang throughout the entire hall.","Listening to the sharp and urgent training, everyone’s mood instantly fell to the bottom.","This kind of urgent training was the highest level, which indicated that Void Universe had invaded on a large scale!","“Has the fateful day finally arrived?”","Suppressing the restlessness in his heart, Jian Wushuang walked out of the hall slowly.","Everyone’s expression was grave. The cultivators from the dozens of cities gathered in front of the base camp in silence, like sparks of fire gathering.","The five million cultivators were like statues. None of them retreated as they stared at the dark abyss.","Jian Wushuang looked back at the countless cultivators for the last time. His voice, which was enhanced with divine power, resounded in the sky.","“Everything we do from today onwards will be set in history as acts of supreme glory!”","This short sentence completely ignited the hearts of all the cultivators.","Everything in the heart was illusory.","All kinds of divine power shot up into the sky. A total of five million cultivators gathered the fate energy of their respective Star Fields, and at this moment, they were exuding the most vast and brilliant divine might!","The void of the entire Offworld Battlefield trembled. This battle might be the last one."]},{"number":4638,"title":"Chapter 4638 The Great Catastrophe Begins!","paragraphs":["4638 The Great Catastrophe Begins!","Divine power poured out into the void.","With Jian Wushuang as the leader, five million top cultivators gathered in the crack and finished the battle in one go!","Stepping on the outermost part of the Offworld Battlefield, a similarly vast void energy permeated the air.","There were a total of ten columns, and at this moment, nearly eight of them had fallen. The remaining ten ordinary Supreme experts were desperately running back, and behind them, nearly 100 Scar level Void Masters, who were acting as scouts and vanguards, were chasing after them.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold and he struck down with his palm.","Suddenly, the void was raised and a huge palm print directly killed Void Masters!","All the cultivators were shocked. Even a Half Ancestor could not kill hundreds of void Masters with one palm.","Great Void Divine Emperor and Golden Crow Emperor looked at the black-robed figure with a complicated expression. In just a few tens of thousands of years, he had grown to an existence that they had to look up to.","After the void power had completely dissipated, the dozen or so Supreme Masters quickly ran to Jian Wushuang.","One of the slightly older Supreme experts panicked and said, “Palace Master Wushuang, things are bad. The void has cracked open, and they are attacking us from the crack!","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned. Then, he leaped forward quickly, followed by more than five million cultivators.","The void crack was located at the border between the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe. In that mysterious area, both divine power and void power were weak.","When the army of the Divine Power Universe arrived at the border, all the cultivators gasped.","At the intersection of the barrier of cracks, a huge chasm had opened up on both sides. It was like a Heavenly Gate, and countless void power was escaping from it.","The army of Void Warriors gushed out of the crack like a black fog.","Those ‘old friends’ also appeared.","Void Mater Ba Huang, who was covered in black fog, led more than 200,000 scouts and cultivators to look at Jian Wushuang from a distance.","200,000 scouts meant that there were nearly 50,000 Scar level Void Masters. Their role was to act as a sharp knife and stab into the heart of the Divine Power Universe.","The two Half Ancestor Void Emissaries who had been killed by Jian Wushuang were now charging over with the army of Void Warriors.","Seeing his nemesis, Void Mater Ba Huang and the Two-In-One Void Emissary almost wanted to kill Jian Wushuang.","However, this was not the end. An endless stream of Void Warriors, seemingly connected to the sky, stepped out of the Void Universe.","A great pressure pressed down on every cultivator’s heart, but no one took a step back. They were silent and dead silent.","On the other side of Vopid God, another earth-shaking phantom image was formed.","As the black mist surged and fell, a majestic treasure figure wearing a black and gold robe and an Emperor’s crown appeared.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened. Devouring Emperor, who had shocked the entire universe in the Polar Sea Star Field, had come!","The appearance of the two Ancestor realm experts made all the cultivators feel despair.","Then, Devour One, who had six Arms of Laws behind him, arrived with six other members of the Devourers!","Three Ancestor realm experts!","Three unparalleled existences appeared in the camp of the Void Universe!","The heavens and earth changed, and even the void shattered when it first descended.","There was no place that could accommodate three Ancestor realm experts.","At that moment, even Jian Wushuang felt helpless.","Ancestor realm beings were beings that truly transcended the laws. Even Half Ancestor realm beings would find it difficult to cause them any harm.","Three Ancestor realm experts were too terrifying.","“Do you really want to destroy my Divine Power Universe?” At this moment, all the cultivators were disheartened.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang took the lead and released a vast amount of divine power. The unparalleled divine power soared along with the divine patterns and actually blocked the invading void power.","At the same time, Feng Qi of the Phoenix clan, Linhe Dragon Emperor of the Dragon clan, Supreme Xue Bo, and Xiang Qing and Xiang Huang — a total of seven Half Ancestors — released their divine forms at the same time.","The void was brilliant, and the divine power that belonged to the Divine Power Universe showed its tough side.","With a surge of monstrous divine power, the old man took a step forward, and an earth-shaking black water treasure form appeared behind him.","Strange and majestic energy instantly dispersed the void power.","All the cultivators looked at this scene in shock, and then their burning and blazing eyes rose again.","it turns out that our Divine Power Universe also has Ancestor realm existences!","White Ape’s eyes turned slightly red. At the same time, the divine power belonging to the peak of the Invincible Supreme realm surged.","Great Void Divine Emperor’s usual expression of joy and anger finally curved up the corners of his lips.","After seeing the old man’s figure, Devour One’s scarlet eyes narrowed, and everything he had experienced in the Polar Sea Star Field came back to him.","“Could it be that he was also abandoned there?”","There was no answer. Devour One’s opponent was not Old Master. He had locked onto Jian Wushuang before he stepped into the Offworld Battlefield.","The monster’s terrifying growth finally made Devour One and his organization feel that something was wrong. No matter what, Jian Wushuang had to die in today’s battle!","Ever since he escaped from Old Master, Void God had just recovered. The fear in his heart made him confront Old Master immediately.","Devouring Emperor, who was extremely mysterious and had been controlling the situation from behind the scenes, looked at Old Master with a strange expression.","For a time, all the power of the two universes was gathered in this cruel and damaged outer space border.","This was going to be the grandest battle since the chaos.","Whether it was the winning side or the losing side, they would have to pay a terrible price.","“If you surrender, I’ll let you all live. Otherwise, you’ll die here!”","Void God said in a voice that sounded like a giant bell. He was high up in the air and his aura was filled with evil energy.","However, no one in the Divine Power Universe replied. Everyone’s eyes were filled with the desire to die and they scoffed at Void God’s words.","Without skin, how can hair attach itself? When the Divine Power Universe completely fell, anyone would become the Void Universe’s plaything to be killed at will.","Jian Wushuang laughed loudly and his golden eyes were filled with disdain. “Such lowly behavior. All of you have worked tirelessly to occupy my Divine Power Universe for a trillion years. Everyone knows your evil heart. Now, you are persuading us to surrender before the battle between the two armies. You are indeed despicable!”","Jian Wushuang’s words were like knives that cut the entire Void Universe.","Void God’s face darkened, and he waved his hand to punish them."]},{"number":4639,"title":"Chapter 4639 Bloody Battle","paragraphs":["4639 Bloody Battle","The void collapsed and the terrifying blow went straight to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang did not dodge. Instead, he faced the terrifying attack of Void God with one hand.","The golden-red divine power and the dark-black void power collided. Everyone felt the space under their feet shake as they all looked forward.","The result that they had imagined did not happen. Jian Wushuang was as stable as a sea-stabilizing divine needle and the monstrous void power was destroyed by him directly!","All the cultivators were in an uproar. Feng Qi and the other Ancestors were even more shocked. In the past, Jian Wushuang could only barely resist Void God’s attack. Now, he was even more terrifying.","His growth made the three Ancestor realm powerhouses wary.","This child can not be left alive!","The army that was filled with void energy had finished gathering, and a sad song was about to be heard in the Offworld Battlefield.","As Jian Wushuang raised the Tarot Divine Sword high, the cultivators behind him took the lead to attack.","The endless divine power turned into an arrow that could not be turned back and ruthlessly nailed into the camp of the army of Void Warriors.","This was a bloody battle between the peak of divine power and void power!","A total of seven Ancestors released their respective Domains immediately.","Feng Qi turned into a giant Phoenix that covered the sky. She let out a clear cry and led the tens of thousands of Phoenix clansmen to charge forward.","The fiercest and most soul-devouring Nirvana Fire Domain in the world spread out in the army of Void Warriors.","Anyone who was infected by the flames, even a Six Scar Void Master, would be destroyed.","Dragon Emperor Linhe conjured his Natal Dragon once again. Every time his body flipped, it was enough to tear the sky apart and destroy the world.","The dragon claw, which was like a giant pillar supporting the sky, descended, turning hundreds of Scar level Void Masters into clouds of blood mist.","Supreme Xue Bo raised his arm and advanced. Countless Blood Shadows filled the void like a swamp, and any Void Master who entered this Blood Shadow Domain would be weakened without them knowing it.","Supreme Tian Yi, Supreme Jun Fu, White Ape Overlord Patrairch, Great Void Divine Emperor, and Golden Crow Emperor — all of them were Supreme experts who had dominated the world for millions of chaos cycles. They led their armies and followed the path of blood that had been opened up by Ancestors, resolutely charging into the army of Void Warriors.","This was the most brutal battle to the death. There was no other way except for the death of one side.","Jian Wushuang was at the forefront of the army of cultivators. His body was surging with brilliant divine patterns, and his huge treasure image was protecting the cultivators below him.","An invisible sword appeared in his right palm.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent rose from the sky!","The vast stars and the Star River bloomed in the star-style Sword Intent!","This sword strike had broken the past and the present, and it had gathered too much of his willfulness and dejection.","It was an extremely proud move, and it was Jian Wushuang’s Sword Dao.","Even Ancestor realm experts have to lower their heads when they see it!","The indescribable swordsmanship suppressed the void. Wherever the sword pointed, hundreds of millions of miles was his territory!","This move turned 100,000 Void Warriors into ashes.","A path that was soaked in blood and covered with corpses was cut out.","Devour One, who wanted to stop Jian Wushuang, did not move. The black water phantom floated in front of the three Ancestor realm experts.","“Attack me together then.” Old Master looked at them indifferently, his words concise.","Void God’s face darkened. “You’re looking for death!”","With that, extreme Ancestor realm power surged, and countless mysterious and dark runes emerged from Void God’s body.","At the same time, two chains engraved with flowing light runes smashed out from Void God’s back and smashed toward Old Master with the power to shatter the void.","At the same time, Devour One also moved. The six Arms of Laws of various colors behind him transformed into illusionary light and pressed down on Old Master.","Devouring Emperor, who was wearing his crown and had been calm all this time, made his move at the same time. A black beam of light suddenly shot out from his black and gold robe.","Three Ancestor realm attacks suppressed Old Master at the same time.","The void was shattered by this attack, and the ripples of destruction caused the void of the star field to collapse.","In the face of this destructive attack, Old Master’s eyes turned from indifferent to serious.","The black scepter in his hand transformed into a rippling barrier, which he used to block the attack.","The three destructive attacks were like clay oxen entering the sea, completely dissipating.","Old Master lifted his hand to remove the barrier, and his pitch-black eyes locked on Devour One.","Persimmons should be picked and pinched, and people should be picked and beaten.","Due to the restraints of the rules of the Great Dao, Old Master had to break through the blockade and blockade as soon as possible under the limits of his body.","Devour One, who had just reached Ancestor realm, was the best choice.","Seeing Old Master’s intense stare, the past came back to his mind again, and even the newly grown Arm of Laws behind him started to ache.","A trace of fear flickered in the depths of Devour One’s eyes, but it was more of madness.","“Even if I can’t defeat you by myself, there are three of us now. Do you think you can still survive?”","After exchanging a glance with Devouring Emperor, the three of them engaged in close combat with Old Master.","The Ancestor level aura caused a phenomenon in the heavens and earth. A rare energy tide swept across the entire battlefield. Some cultivators and Void Warriors with slightly weaker cultivation realms died immediately with their hearts shattered.","The three Ancestor realm powerhouses of the Void Universe were entangled by Old Master, and the battle of the Ancestor level powerhouses was completely tilted toward the Divine Power Universe.","With the Tarot Divine Sword in his left hand and the invisible long sword in his right hand, Jian Wushuang’s destructive power was beyond imagination.","Jian Wushuang alone had annihilated the army of Void Warriors who had served as the vanguard scouts. There were 200,000 Void Warriors and 50,000 Void Masters, but none of them survived.","Looking at the figure who had turned the tide like the guardian of the universe, all the cultivators’ hearts were burning.","‘As long as Jian Wushuang is alive, we will win.’","This belief began to strengthen in the hearts of every cultivator.","The sky-covering giant Phoenix circled around him and the five-clawed Dragon Emperor walked side by side with him. At this moment, Jian Wushuang stood in front of all the cultivators like a real Guardian God.","It was not until the appearance of the Ba Huang that Jian Wushuang was barely stopped.","Void Master Ba Huang, who had taken the last step and was on the verge of breaking through to the peak, surrounded Jian Wushuang with the two members of Devourers.","“Jian Wushuang! All the humiliation you’ve imposed on me, I will return it ten times today!” A deep and sinister voice came out of the mouth of the Void Master Ba Huang.","The powerful aura of a Half Ancestor surged almost instantly.","Jian Wushuang sneered and pointed the Tarot Divine Sword at the Ba Huang. “This time, I’m not only going to take your arm, but your whole head!”","“Jian Wushuang! You deserve to die!”","Void Master Ba Huang was furious. The humiliation of the past and the new hatred made him charge at Jian Wushuang without any hesitation.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing still, smirked. Behind him, Supreme Xue Bo had already released the Blood Shadow Domain.","“I’ll end your life today.”","In the chaotic void, the Blood Shadow Domain shook violently and countless bloody hands grabbed Void Master Ba Huang."]},{"number":4640,"title":"Chapter 4640 Battle to the Death","paragraphs":["4640 Battle to the Death","Void Master Ba Huang was directly trapped in it, and the viciousness on his face did not even have time to retreat.","A sharp beam of light appeared.","Void Master Ba Huang felt a chill on his neck and his eyes darkened.","He lifted the invisible sword in his right hand, and a sharp and imperceptible Sword Intent swept out, directly cutting Ba Huang’s neck.","The head fell to the ground. Jian Wushuang reached out and crushed the head of the Ba Huang Void Master.","His headless body was devoured by Supreme Xue Bo’s Blood Shadow Domain and was completely destroyed!","Everything happened in the blink of an eye. By the time the two members of Devourers realized what had happened, the Void Master Ba Huang had already died.","It was simply too fast! With just a single strike that could not be seen clearly, it had killed a Half Ancestor! How did this Invincible Supreme monster do it?","The two members of Devourers looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","“Since you don’t want to leave, then you can all stay.” Jian Wushuang’s indifferent voice was like a deadly note.","Recovering from the shock, the two members of Devourers looked at each other and shot six cards at Jian Wushuang.","The card glowed with a special metallic color, as if it had strange magic power. Wherever it passed, the space was swallowed and flattened.","Jian Wushuang focused his eyes and the divine patterns exploded around him, shattering the card that was flying toward him.","But two cards still dodged the explosion and shot toward the army of cultivators.","Nearly 20 Invincible Supreme experts and over 500 Top Supreme experts were instantly sealed in the cards because they did not dodge.","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to stop them, the two cards that sealed nearly 1,000 Supreme beings broke on their own. There was no chance of saving them at all.","That strange killing method was truly too terrifying. Even an Invincible Supreme would be sealed within it if they were the slightest bit careless.","Jian Wushuang was both shocked and angry. He directly used the Ancestral Skill, Transcendence Heavenly Gate, in an attempt to eliminate the Devourers!","The majestic Heavenly Gate appeared, and the giant finger descended!","The two Half Ancestor level members of Devourers sensed the Ancestor level aura and immediately prepared to run away.","However, they soon discovered that under the cover of the Ancestral Skill, all their escape routes were blocked by an invisible barrier!","The great horror of life and death gushed out from the bottom of their hearts.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change at all. The giant finger continued to press down.","The two members of Devourers exploded into a mist of blood before they could even scream.","After killing three Half Ancestors in a row, the pressure on him was temporarily relieved.","However, the situation of the war was not optimistic.","The void cultivators had widened the gap between their realms with just one accompanying Void Explosion.","An ordinary Supreme being would almost certainly die if they were to go up against a Scar level Void Master. The power of the Void Explosion was equivalent to the self-destruction of a Supreme expert, and it had almost directly affected the outcome of the battle.","The situation did not look good for the Divine Power Universe.","The number of casualties of the cultivators in the Divine Power Universe had exceeded one million.","As for the army of the Void Universe, under the attack of Jian Wushuang, Feng Qi, Dragon Emperor LInhe, and other Half Ancestor realm experts, the casualties were far greater than that of the Divine Power Universe.","Old Master managed to hold back three Ancestor realm powerhouses from the Void Universe by himself. This was extremely important to the Divine Power Universe.","Without Old Master, even if the Divine Power Universe had dozens more Half Ancestors, it would have been almost impossible to escape the fate of destruction.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at Old Master’s back gratefully. Then, he went all out and killed all the living forces in the Void Universe.","In the sky, the terrifying power that had been defeated was in its most primitive state, floating wildly.","Even Half Ancestors did not dare to set foot there. The aftershock of the four Ancestors was enough to kill any Half Ancestor.","The three Ancestor level experts surrounded him. Looking at this guy, who was neither young nor old, Devour One was completely shocked.","The Ancestor level attacks that were usually able to destroy everything seemed to be unable to cause any damage when they hit Old Master. It was as if he had exceeded the constraints of all laws and was causing a dimensional reduction attack on them.","Three of Devouring One’s arms of rules had been cut off. If were not for Devouring Emperor, Old Master would have killed him almost every time he attacked.","What kind of being was he? How could he survive in the hands of Devouring Emperor, who was also unimaginably powerful?","Could it be that he was someone who had mastered the rules, just like Devouring Emperor?","The more Devour One thought about it, the more frightened he became. In a moment of distraction, Old Master directly reached out his hand and shot out a black light, directly destroying a big hole in Devour One’s abdomen.","Devouring Emperor, who had been wandering around, saw this and sent Devour One out of the battle.","The situation of three against one instantly became two against one. Void God Realm who had been resisting most of Void God’s attacks was almost defeated.","“Devouring Emperor!” Void God shouted Devouring Emperor’s name in a low voice, trying to suppress his dissatisfaction.","Devouring Emperor did not say much. He raised his palm, and a huge chess game appeared above the three of them.","The strange energy that came from the chess game even made the Old Master down his attack.","In the chess game that was densely covered with stars, the stars and the sun began to move. It was as if countless Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms were derived from it.","In every Star Field and Divine Kingdom, there was an endless amount of energy surging and gathering, erupting with a divine punishment that turned the world into a lamenting song.","The moment the chess game above his head sent down divine punishment, even Void God could barely escape from it.","The world-destroying divine punishment landed and exploded with Old Master as the center.","At this moment, the entire Offworld Battlefield collapsed. The darkest astral wind in the universe howled from the broken void.","These terrifying astral winds were the most deadly to cultivators at the Ultimate Ruler realm and Star-level Void Warriors!","Wherever the astral wind passed, the ordinary cultivators and Star Void Warriors were instantly annihilated without even being able to make a sound.","Jian Wushuang had expected this. He immediately shouted, “Defend!”","All the cultivators in the Offworld Battleground turned their divine power into armor and stuck them together.","Countless divine power barriers rose up. The entire battlefield stopped fighting for a moment, which was rare. Then, it became eerily silent.","“Kill!”","Nearly 50 Four Scar Void Masters scars had jumped up and were ready to catch them off guard, but they were all killed by Jian Wushuang with one palm.","His eyes, which were full of blood and divine might, slowly swept across the restless army of Void Warriors. The Void Warriors who were being scanned almost subconsciously retreated."]},{"number":4641,"title":"Chapter 4641 Eliminating Devour One","paragraphs":["4641 Eliminating Devour One","At this moment, both cultivators and Void Warriors were barely able to resist the terrifying dark astral wind.","Void God looked at Devouring Emperor beside him with a complicated look in his eyes, but he suppressed it.","The terrifying divine punishment from the falling stars chess game poured down on Old Master.","These barriers formed by the Black Water could no longer block the boundless divine might. All light and darkness in sight were swallowed.","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled and he immediately moved to help Old Master.","Feng Qi pulled him back and said anxiously, “Do you want to die? You can’t change anything even if you go over there.”","Jian Wushuang knew what Feng Qi meant, but he and Old Master had been going through life and death together these days, and their relationship had long gone far beyond ordinary. He was ready to go to Old Master’s aid at any cost.","Crack–","A clear cracking sound came from the center of the divine punishment. Then, a huge arm that was like a galaxy broke the divine punishment and smashed toward Devouring Emperor and Void God.","The two people’s gazes focused, and they each raised their hands to block.","Under the attack of this galaxy-like arm, even Ancestor realm experts were forced back millions of miles!","The dark void was shattered to the point that it could not be shattered anymore, and the dark matter that was released filled every inch of space.","Seeing this, Devour One, who was recovering from his injuries, hurried to Devouring Emperor.","The huge galaxy arm that forced the two Ancestor realm experts to retreat slowly retracted. At the same time, the huge palm clenched and directly tore the falling star chessboard into pieces!","Old Master’s figure stood proudly on his own, and the majestic Black Water phantom behind him slowly opened its eyes.","Their gazes were like two long Black Rivers that stretched across the ages. The vast and barren aura made everyone feel tiny, like a grain of sand in the great desert.","At this moment, even the mysterious and calm Devouring Emperor could not remain calm.","Void God was shocked and immediately released his Natal Ancestral Form.","A Demon god that seemed to have awakened from an unknown ancient time sat up from the darkness, and his eyes were as large as the Star Field.","At the same time, six ancient chains with scarlet runes were bound to the Demon God’s body. They were extremely ferocious.","This Demon god that seemed to be bound by the laws of the Heavenly Dao was Void God’s Ancestral Form!","Extremely evil black flames shot out of the Demon God’s mouth, which was full of fangs, and collided with the Black River.","Devour One also clenched his teeth and jumped up. The remaining three Arms of Laws behind him turned into huge spears and thrust out.","The Offworld Battlefield was the place with the weakest and most chaotic laws in the universe. It simply could not withstand the combined attack of three Dao Ancestors.","The space of the entire battlefield started to collapse.","The three Ancestor realm attacks finally stopped Old Master’s endless attack.","The shock waves turned into waves of ripples that shook the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Devour One took a few steps back and spat out a mouthful of divine blood. The Arms of Laws behind him were completely shattered.","The phantom form behind Void God also cracked.","Emperor Devourer raised his hand and took back the black-gold imperial crown. His face finally turned serious.","Old Master’s strength had clearly exceeded their expectations. For a moment, the three Ancestor realm experts did not dare to act rashly.","Old Master was just like before, as if he had not been injured from the beginning to the end.","Jian Wushuang, who was below, raised the corners of his mouth slightly and raised the Tarot Divine Sword high. “Fight!”","Brilliant divine power rose to the sky. Jian Wushuang turned his body into a Sword Dao and swept across the battlefield.","The army of more than three million cultivators once again charged at the army of Void Warriors.","If it was not for the Offworld Battlefield, there probably would not be any Star Field that could support such a terrifying war.","The Two-In-One Half Ancestor, who had been almost killed by Jian Wushuang in the previous battle, were now facing Jian Wushuang with hatred.","The Tarot Divine Sword slashed out, but the sword light was strangely absorbed.","At the same time, the -In-One Half Ancestor shook his arms in the air and an invisible boundary directly covered Jian Wushuang.","“This time, I’ll take your life!” He was completely mad, and he kept screaming.","Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. The Tarot Divine Sword released a burning divine light. “If you have the guts, come and take it.”","As the divine power and void power interweaved, broken corpses were laid out in the void.","Above the broken sky, Devour One, the weakest Ancestor realm expert, was already at a disadvantage in this terrible confrontation.","The wound on his abdomen that was about to heal showed signs of tearing again.","Void God sensed that the ancestral form behind him had been shattered to a certain extent and finally stopped.","“You don’t belong to the Divine Power Universe,” Void God said as he looked at the old man.","“So what?” Old Master asked.","Void took a deep breath and said, “Since you don’t belong to the Divine Power Universe, join my Void Universe. I can agree to all your conditions.”","“Is that so?” Old Master leaned forward slightly, his eyes slightly open. “You can agree to any condition?”","Void God nodded. “Any condition.”","“Then, what if I want you all to die?” Old Master’s eyes suddenly opened wide, and indescribable energy spewed out of his palm, turning into thousands of black ribbons that bound Void God.","“You’re looking for death!” The ancestral phantom form of the Demon God behind him suddenly broke free from the chains on his left arm and smashed toward Old Master.","Emperor Devourer and Devour One looked at each other, and they both moved their bodies to face the old man!","The Demon God ancestral phantom form’s huge arm smashed through nearly a hundred black ribbons and pressed down on Old Master.","However, the illusionary Black Waterfall was like a living thing. It was smashed and continuously emerged.","The ancestral phantom form of the Demon God roared in anger, but it was surrounded in an extremely short time.","Old Master waved his arms and slowly trapped Void God.","Void God could feel a strange energy rapidly devouring his void power, and he could not help but be shocked.","Just as he was about to self-destruct his ancestral phantom, Void God suddenly felt a chill behind him. He turned around subconsciously.","Devour One had already jumped high, and the most terrifying power burst out of his hand. It did not go to Old Master, but to his back!","Void GOd’s heart trembled, and his cold and majestic expression reappeared.","He used all his strength, and the huge ancestral form of the Demon God behind him finally broke free from the tens of thousands of black ribbons. Then, his Heavenly arm directly grabbed Devour One, who was shooting at him.","Devour One, who was about to deliver a fatal blow to Void God, was instead controlled by the Demon God’s ancestral phantom form. He did not have time to react at all, and he was thrown at Old Master.","“No–”","Grabbing Devour One’s neck with his palm, Old Master smiled faintly. His black eyes seemed to have an irresistible force that began to consume Devour One’s mind."]},{"number":4642,"title":"Chapter 4642 The Battle Situation Took a Sharp Turn","paragraphs":["4642 The Battle Situation Took a Sharp Turn","The endless reincarnation, the desolation where even time was meaningless, and the sadness of the ancient times were like chains that dragged devour into the eternal dark abyss.","There was only fear left in Devour One’s eyes. His red eyes started to dim, and his Ancestor level power was quickly dissipating.","Everything in the world, including the laws of the Great Dao, sank into his pitch-black eyes.","Devour One, who was at the peak of the universe, the Master of Laws, the real Ancestor-level expert, had died just like that!","The Demonic God phantom form behind Void God was completely shattered. He had clearly suffered heavy injuries.","He suppressed the anger in his heart and looked at Devouring Emperor.","Devouring Emperor’s eyes were calm. He said indifferently, “Devour One went too far. He deserves to die.”","Void God snorted and did not say anything else. The current situation was urgent, and if they were to fall out with each other, it would only cause the virtual universe to fall into a passive state.","“Leave the rest to me,” Devouring Emperor suddenly said as he slowly walked toward Old Master.","His black and gold robe fluttered even though there was no wind, and a strange energy fluctuation was spreading out from his body.","This kind of energy fluctuation seemed out of place in both the Void Universe and the Divine Power Universe.","“You and I are the same, we don’t belong to these two universes, right?” Devouring Emperor said calmly.","Old Master did not speak.","“I think you realized it when you first saw me, right?” if that’s the case, why don’t we join forces?” Devouring Emperor continued.","“You? Are you even worthy?” Old Master finally spoke, his words full of disdain.","Devouring Emperor’s pupils suddenly narrowed, and he smashed Old Master with extreme force!","The power that was enough to overturn any Star Field or Divine Kingdom withered and disappeared when it touched Old Master.","Old Master was filled with killing intent. Countless black water ripples spread out with him as the center.","There was only one person who knew his secret, and it could only be one person. The others had to die!","Devouring Emperor stepped back and released an aura that was beyond the Ancestor level.","The two forces that transcended the laws of the universe collided with each other, and even Void God felt a lingering fear.","“Could it be that what he said was true? That’s where the final realm of Dao vindication is?” Void God’s eyes were solemn. At the same time, he looked at the battlefield below him.","There, Jian Wushuang, who was like a god, had divine patterns all over his body. He held the Tarot Divine Sword in his left hand and a Half Ancestor level Void Master’s head in his right hand.","The two of them looked at each other from a distance. At this moment, even Void God felt a little uncomfortable.","It was as if he had been intimidated by an ant.","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth curled up slightly. After he smashed the head in his right hand into a bloody mist, he rushed into the army of Void Warriors again.","All kinds of Six-Scar Void Masters and even Half Ancestor level experts were annihilated by Jian Wushuang. His divine blood had almost dyed his robe.","He was like a God of Death, and no one could stop him.","Even the Devourers had lost four members because of Jian Wushuang.","Under the leadership of Jian Wushuang and the seven Half Ancestors, the Divine Power Universe gradually reversed the situation and began to devour the army of Void Warriors!","In the sky, Void God was furious. He faced the army of cultivators and sent down divine punishment.","The most terrifying thing about the Ancestor realm was that everyone below the Ancestor realm was like an ant. Even 10,000 peak Half Ancestors could not cause any damage to an Ancestor realm expert.","Jian Wushuang had no time to stop it. The attack of Void God hit the front of the army of cultivators.","Xiang Qing, Xiang Huang, the two Half Ancestors, Tian Yi, the Golden Crow Emperor, and nearly 100 other Invincible Supremes were all turned into dust before they could even dodge.","“Void God, you deserve to die!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes almost popped out.","With that, the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent turned into a long river of Sword Intent and rose against the sky.","Void God looked disdainful. With a wave of his hand, he destroyed the river of Sword Intent, but at the same time, he had a strange expression on his face.","That was because he felt a slight stabbing pain in his arm when he destroyed the river of Sword Intent.","How is this possible? how can a trifling Invincible Supreme make me feel so uneasy?","He stopped thinking about it. Just as Void God was about to kill Jian Wushuang, the battlefield in the sky changed.","Devouring Emperor was forced back. The strange energy around him started to disperse.","Looking at the battered Devouring Emperor and Old Master, who was filled with killing intent, Void God summoned the ancestral form of the Demon God.","Old Master with the Black Water phantom image pressed down. Devouring Emperor and Void God looked at each other and blocked the attack together.","It was as if he was carrying all the stars and realms on his shoulders. The moment the Demon God phantom image behind Void God crashed into Old Master, it began to show signs of cracking.","Devouring Emperor was the same, with blue veins popping up on his face.","Void God had never been as shocked as he was today. This strange-looking old man was actually so terrifying that even the three Ancestor-level experts could not cause him any harm.","Just as Void God felt that his divine body was about to collapse, Devouring Emperor’s deep voice rang out. “You’ve hidden yourself well, but the power you used today has long surpassed the scope of this universe. Do you think they won’t be able to track you down? At that time, everything you have will be for naught!”","It was a short sentence, but it had a huge effect. Void God only felt the Black Water phantom image on his body stop for a moment.","In the next moment, Devouring Emperor sneered coldly. An image of Old Master appeared behind him, and with infinite power, it suddenly shot into the body of the real Old Master.","Everything happened in the blink of an eye, so fast that Old Master could only react.","Time seemed to have stopped, and the Black Water phantom image behind Old Master began to collapse inch by inch.","At the same time, Old Master’s skin, which was the boundary between young and old, began to be covered with cobweb-like ravines.","Old Master did not say anything else. He wanted to crush Devouring Emperor into powder, but he could not even lift his hand.","Devouring Emperor smiled coldly and majestically. At the same time, figures of Old Masters walked out from behind him one after another.","Finally, it stopped at seven. The seven Old Masters looked at the real Old Master with cold expressions.","“You will never win against me, even if it’s in this land.” The seven Old Masters spoke at the same time. “Now, let me devour you.”","The ultimate darkness descended, and even the void was about to be devoured.","Devouring Emperor, along with the seven Old Masters behind him, flew toward the real Old Master.","However, in the next moment, a brilliant divine pattern shot up into the sky, breaking through the darkness with divine might!","Covered in blood, Jian Wushuang appeared in front of Old Master and pointed the Tarot Divine Sword at Devouring Emperor. “You despicable man!”","Devouring Emperor’s face darkened and he was about to kill Jian Wushuang.","The attack of Void God went past Devouring Emperor and hit Jian Wushuang.","The void collapsed. It was almost the full-power attack of Void God. It hit Jian Wushuang right in front of him and exploded in the most tragic way.","Anyone who was close to the center of the explosion was dead."]},{"number":4643,"title":"Chapter 4643 The Divine Power Universe Was Defeated!","paragraphs":["4643 The Divine Power Universe Was Defeated!","The heavens and earth wailed as the tragic explosion destroyed the battlefield. Everything was destroyed.","The entire sky was devoured by the extremely bright light produced by the explosion, and even Devouring Emperor subconsciously covered his face.","This indescribable extreme brightness lasted for nearly half a cup of tea’s time.","Without waiting for the dazzling polar day to dissipate, Devouring Emperor hurriedly looked at the center of the explosion. However, there were no remains or broken arms except for the void.","“Where are the two of them?” Devouring Emperor asked in a deep voice while his endless power pressed down on Void God.","Void God did not show any weakness. His peak void power rose. “Do you think that I can’t kill him by myself?”","Suppressing his anger and urge to kill Void God, Devouring Emperor moved his body to the center of the explosion to check.","“Impossible! Did he really die?” Devouring Emperor was shocked, but Void God’s attack was too terrifying. Old Master was also seriously injured by the attack, so it was hard for him to survive.","Thinking of this, Devouring Emperor suppressed the anger and suspicion in his heart. He did not even look at Void God, but looked down.","There was an army of nearly three million cultivators from the Divine Power Universes there.","“I don’t care if he’s dead or not. The ones who should die now are you ants!” Devouring Emperor was like the real decision-maker. He passed Void God and gave the order, “Kill them all. Leave no one alive!”","The army of Void Warriors hesitated for a moment, then under the leadership of several Half Ancestors of the Devourers, they rushed toward the Divine Power Universe army.","Taking a deep breath, Void God said in a low voice, “Devouring Emperor, you’ve crossed the line.”","When Devouring Emperor heard this, he sneered. “It’s just an order from a universe, and you’re so concerned about it? Don’t you forget your promise.”","Hatred flashed in the depths of his eyes. Void God did not speak again. He controlled the Demon God ancestral phantom form behind him to attack the Divine Power Universe army!","Jian Wushuang and the only Ancestor realm expert in the Divine Power Universe had died. All the cultivators in the Divine Power Universe looked at the scene in shock.","Without Jian Wushuang, who had entered the Sword Dao with his own body and swept through the army of Void Warriors as if he had entered no man’s land, all the cultivators almost instantly lost their benchmark and hope.","The terrifying ancestral Demon God’s phantom image had wiped out an army of over 200,000 cultivators and countless Supreme realm experts.","The Golden Crow clan, the Great Void Temple, and all the disciples of the Nine Emperor Pavilion who had come to help had all died! Not a single one survived!","Just as Supreme Zi Fa and Supreme Hong’er were about to die, they looked at the place where Jian Wushuang had died with a smile in their eyes. After gently muttering ‘Take care, my Young Friend’, they calmly met their deaths.","The Starry Sky Sword Sect’s foundation had been destroyed, leaving only Wu Jianxian and a few others who barely managed to escape the disaster.","The Dragon, Phoenix, and Qilin clans were also severely injured.","After Emperor Devourer joined the massacre, the great army of the Divine Power Universe was annihilated.","Even a Half Ancestor would not be able to put up any resistance.","Leng Rushuang’s face was pale as she looked at the destructive aura calmly.","Swish-","A Phoenix extended its huge wings and blocked Leng Rushuang’s path, as well as the aftermath of the Ancestor realm attack.","Feng Qi let out a miserable cry, and her original Phoenix form was extinguished. She turned back into his human form and fell down.","Leng Rushuang hurriedly reached out to catch Feng Qi. The left half of Feng Qi’s body was broken and bleeding.","“Matriarch!” More than 200 phoenixes tried to save Feng Qi, but they were all killed by Devouring Emperor with a wave of his hand!","Out of the three-million-strong cultivator army, only a million remained.","The Void Universe went completely crazy. Every Void Warrior was like a bloodthirsty demon, rapidly consuming the life of the Divine Power Universe.","Supreme Xue Bo seemed to have aged ten times in an instant as he watched this battle, which was almost certain to end. The words that were most difficult to say were finally uttered.","“All soldiers of the Divine Power Universe, retreat. Save the Last Flame for the last time.”","Every cultivator’s face was deathly pale. After this defeat, the Divine Power Universe would be completely destroyed. No one would be able to stop the Void Universe.","“Leave this place to me.” Supreme Xue Bo’s long robe fluttered in the wind. There was no fear on his face, only indifference after seeing through the profound meaning of life.","One of the Snowflake Swords had been shattered. The old beggar poured the last mouthful of wine into his throat with a slightly tipsy face and entered the Half Ancestor realm.","He, who had been silent and wandering his entire life, had finally gained Enlightenment in this final battle.","A brilliant and majestic Half Ancestor divine power emerged, and the old beggar dressed as a sloppy Daoist disappeared. In his place was a young swordsman with sword-like eyebrows and starry eyes.","“The Divine Power Universe can’t be left without guidance. I’ll leave that to you.” The old beggar who looked like a young swordsman laughed. “I’ve lived for so long. It’s time to find a place to rest.”","The blood-stained Dragon Emperor Linhe also stepped forward and said, “Leave this place to us. Elder Xue Bo, please take good care of the Divine Power Universe.”","Long Yan and Long Chi held back Supreme Xue Bo. “Let’s go.”","An unparalleled void power descended, and the old beggar laughed out loud. An unruly swordsman in green robes transformed his body into Sword Intent, and like a long river, he rose against the heavens.","The old beggar had sacrificed himself to destroy Void God’s attack.","The Sword Intent dissipated like a star waterfall, and the Divine Power Universe also lost a Half Ancestor expert.","Under the old beggar’s attack, all the Void Masters who had crossed the sword waterfall were killed. Even the Half Ancestors had to avoid the attack, buying time for the Divine Power Universe army to retreat.","At this moment, the Dragon Emperor Linhe was the only one left on the shattered battlefield. He stood firmly in the distance.","Looking at the cultivator who was only at the peak of the Half Ancestor realm, without thinking, Devouring Emperor unleashed a palm strike to kill him.","However, the descending palm strike could not move an inch forward.","Devouring Emperor’s eyes narrowed, and a terrifying aura surged.","A white bone dragon claw grabbed Devouring Emperor’s palm attack and tore it into pieces.","Each bone was as large as a Star Field, and they emerged from Dragon Emperor Linhe’s body.","The sun-like eye sockets shot out a majestic light.","Dragon Emperor Linhe’s expression was calm, but his clear eyes were gradually turning cloudy.","He transformed into his scarlet Natal Ancestral Dragon. The two giant Dragons, one gold and one bone, became the last line of defense and defended this place to the death.","The First Generation of the Dragon clan’s Ancestral Dragon, as well as the Dragon Emperor, had both fallen on the Offworld Battlefield.","Devouring Emperor and Void God were injured, and the army of the Void Universe had lost nearly 800,000 soldiers.","Countless corpses filled the void that had turned into nothingness again, and countless divine blood and broken pieces of magic treasures gathered to form a winding river.","This battle of catastrophe was far from over. No one knew when it would end, but it would definitely end with the complete destruction of a universe."]},{"number":4644,"title":"Chapter 4644 Cangwu Platform","paragraphs":["4644 Cangwu Platform","Jade ornaments clanked in her torn clothes, and a slender green lotus whose roots had turned into green jade slowly fell into the bottomless abyss with its master.","Every drop of the divine blood that contained great power fell into the void, like leaves returning to the earth.","Everything was like a bizarre dream, falling into eternal oblivion.","However, in this dream-like darkness filled with unknown dark matter, an extremely pure golden light broke through the chaos.","“Eh? Why are there two people here?” A doubtful yet authoritative voice rang out, and everything returned to silence.","After a long time, the figure who should have died in the hands of Void God, but had somehow survived, slowly opened his eyes.","He only felt that his surroundings were bright and clear, and he could hear the soft sound of a breeze blowing past bamboo.","“Didn’t I die? Is this the reincarnation realm...”","“Could it be that even if a God dies, there will be reincarnation...”","Sitting up slowly from the bamboo bed, Jian Wushuang did not have time to think about any problems before he was interrupted by the sharp pain coming from his body.","“I can still feel pain when I’m dead? Could it be that I’m not dead?” Jian Wushuang murmured softly. He quickly stabilized his heart and carefully checked the meridians in his body.","After checking, he realized that he was not dead!","Other than the broken meridians in his body, even his divine power was slowly going through a cycle of being reborn and destroyed!","“I didn’t die? I actually didn’t die!” The uncontrollable ecstasy made Jian Wushuang forget the pain in his body.","It was not until he had calmed down for a long time that he started to look around the room.","The interior of the room was extremely simple. Every piece of furniture, window decorations, and even the house was made of bamboo. From the degree of roughness, it seemed that the owner had woven it by hand.","Enduring the pain, Jian Wushuang walked out of the room barefooted.","Outside the room, the warm and genial sunlight shone on his face. The two sides of the small room were planted with bamboo gardens.","In front of him was a vast plain.","Looking at the Fairyland-like environment in front of him, Jian Wushuang completely let down his guard. It had been tens of thousands of years and he had never enjoyed a moment of relaxation.","However, he only relaxed for a moment before all the questions came back to his mind!","The brutal battlefield of blood and fire, the army of one million Divine Power Universe cultivators, and the heavily injured Old Master were like sharp knives cutting at his body.","He quickly pushed the door open and entered, only then did he let out a slight sigh of relief.","Inside the room, Old Master was lying on the ground. His aura was calm and he had passed the critical period. However, the dark green patterns on his skin had not disappeared.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang sat in front of the bed and extended his hand to transfer the divine power that was circulating in his body into Old Master’s body.","When the divine power entered his body, it was like a clay ox entering the sea. There was no trace of it at all. However, Jian Wushuang seemed to be sitting still and he just continued to transfer divine power into Old Master’s body.","This continued for many years, and the sun in the sky never rose or fell. Everything was the same.","Until a slight fluctuation was emitted from this continent.","Slowly opening his eyes, Jian Wushuang walked out of the bamboo house as if he had realized something.","From the distant horizon, a gap appeared in the space, and countless figures arrived on this continent.","Looking at the familiar figures and divine power, Jian Wushuang could no longer suppress his emotions and he leaped forward.","Supreme Xue Bo, who was covered in blood, was already at the end of his rope in terms of both his divine body and consciousness. Beside him, Ninth Kalpa King’s usual white robe was blood-red. White Ape, Long Yan, Long Chi, Wu Jianxian, Great Void Divine Emperor, and the others were also in the same state.","There was no light in the eyes of the army of cultivators, which numbered less than a million. Only the Qilin clan, which had suffered heavy casualties, had a look of excitement on their faces.","Jian Wushuang, who was only wearing plain clothes, appeared in front of everyone in an instant.","Supreme Xue Bo smiled and said slowly, “Palace Master Wushuang, I’ve come to see you.”","With that, Xue Bo passed out.","Jian Wushuang hurriedly moved his body to support Supreme Xue Bo.","Wu Jianxian widened his eyes and said in disbelief, “Jian Wushuang? You didn’t die?”","Jian Wushuang nodded with a bitter smile. “I’m lucky I didn’t die. Let’s not talk about this. Let’s find a place to settle down.”","At this moment, everyone’s tense nerves were completely relaxed.","He did not die, and everyone firmly believed that there was still a chance in the Divine Power Universe.","The Divine Power Universe army of nearly a million soldiers set up camp on the plain. After all, every inch of space here was filled with pure godly power, and recovering quickly was the most important thing.","It was not until the severely injured cultivators were properly taken care of that Jian Wushuang noticed that not far away, a middle-aged man in a plain golden robe was looking at him with a smile.","Behind the middle-aged man with an extraordinary aura, the only two survivors of the Qilin’s five sons, Lu Ting and Lu Gong, were standing there.","Almost instinctively, Jian Wushuang realized that the middle-aged man was the master of this world.","“Little Friend, your body is indeed extraordinary. You’ve fully recovered in just a few years.” The middle-aged man, together with Lu Ting and Lu Gong, quickly came to Jian Wushuang.","“Many thanks for Fellow Daoist’s life-saving grace. I can not thank you enough,” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said solemnly.","The middle-aged man laughed heartily. “My name is Lu Ding, the eldest son of the Qilin clan. If you don’t mind, you can also call me Big Brother Lu.”","Looking at Lu Ting and Lu Gong behind the middle-aged man, Jian Wushuang knew that the middle-aged man was telling the truth. Without much hesitation, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands again and said with a smile, “Big Brother Lu.”","The middle-aged man named Lu Ding nodded with a smile. “How many years has it been? This is my personal realm, called the Cangwu Platform. It’s finally of some use.”","“Cangwu Platform, where is this?”","“It’s near the shattered Rodu, near the Spring of Chaos,” Lu Ding explained.","Jian Wushuang nodded. When the Rodu Star Field was destroyed, he vaguely felt that there was a strange energy attached to the Spring of Chaos. Now that he thought about it, it must be the Cangwu Platform.","“I don’t know how many eras have passed since I entered this place as a young man. I don’t know anything about what happened outside. I’ve already wasted half of my life,” Lu Ding said, half reminiscing and half sighing.","“If I hadn’t taken that step, I’m afraid the trial of the Divine Power Universe would have been my eternal regret.”","At this point, a bright light flickered in Lu Ding’s eyes. A sharp aura, which had experienced the vicissitudes of life, emerged.","Jian Wushuang, who was about to comfort Lu Ding, was shocked when he felt everything around him.","The kind of existence that was completely beyond the world, yet controlled the laws of all things, and created laws with every breath. Lu Ding was a cultivator at the Ancestor realm!"]},{"number":4645,"title":"Chapter 4645 Cause and Effect","paragraphs":["4645 Cause and Effect","Another Ancestor realm cultivator!","There should have only been two such godly existences that represented the entire universe and could materialize the entire universe.","However, now, five of them had appeared!","For the Void Universe, there was Void God, Devouring Emperor and Devour One. As for the Divine Power Universe, there was Cosmos God. And now, in the Cangwu Platform near the Spring of Chaos, the Qilin clan had actually given birth to another one?","Jian Wushuang felt that his thoughts were a mess.","Back then, when he was sitting in Enlightenment in the Cloud Palace, he had heard about the fate of the universe and the pinnacle of cultivation realms from Cosmos God.","In short, whether it was the Divine Power Universe or the Void Universe, only two Ancestor realm entities could be born.","In the vast universe, although there was a lot of divine power, there was only 10 percent of fate energy. The most crucial step for someone to reach the Ancestor realm was to grasp that 10 percent of fate energy that was scattered across the entire universe.","Cosmos God and Fengtian Patriarch were good examples.","Fengtian Patriarch was unable to break through to the Ancestor realm because Cosmos Gods had first comprehended that 10 percent of the fate energy in the universe.","The reason why there could only be one Ancestor realm expert in the entire universe was that no matter who it was, the moment they reached the Ancestor realm, they would become the controller of the order of the entire universe. They would become the guardian of the rules of the Great Dao.","The Ancestor realm, from a certain perspective, was equivalent to the representation of the universe.","Unless the previous Ancestor realm expert died, there was no possibility of a second Ancestor realm expert appearing under this Great Dao.","The peak of the universe was the Ancestor level. Jian Wushuang had believed in this without a doubt previously. This was because the rules and divine power that Cosmos God controlled were too vast. He could no longer think of any power that could surpass it.","However, after experiencing all the Great Catastrophe battles, Jian Wushuang’s thoughts completely changed.","Old Master and Devouring Emperor were obviously beyond the Ancestor realm.","Even a true Ancestor realm like Void God would not be able to cause any harm to Old Master.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be walking with a mist, and everything was pushing him forward in the hazy unknown.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and accepted the reality very quickly. At the same time, he was happy that an Ancestor realm expert had appeared in the Qilin clan. It would be an unimaginable impact on the war between the two universes.","Looking at Jian Wushuang, who had just come back to his senses, Lu Ding laughed again. “Palace Master Wushuang is a true Heaven’s Favorite. From your bone structure, I can tell that you’re not even a million years old.”","As soon as these words came out, both Lu Ting and Lu Gong sucked in a cold breath.","Judging from the previous battle, Jian Wushuang was the strongest person below the Ancestor level. He had killed a Half Ancestor with one super power attack, which left a deep impression in everyone’s mind.","They had thought that Jian Wushuang was an old monster who had cultivated with Zeus for countless chaos cycles, but he had only cultivated for 900,000 years?","What kind of genius was that to be able to reach such a stage? One must know that even the most ordinary descendant of their Qilin clan would need ten million years to hibernate once!","To be able to grow to such a level in less than one-tenth of the typical time spent in a dormant state, it only made one feel that all his years of cultivation had been wasted...","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s affirmation, even Lu Ding, who had already entered the Ancestor level, shook his head and smiled bitterly.","So there really were unparalleled geniuses in this world.","After that, Jian Wushuang explained in detail all the major events in the universe over the past hundreds of thousands of years to Lu Ding. Then, he cupped his hands and said goodbye.","He was eager to know the current situation of the Divine Power Universe.","He flew toward the bamboo house. Supreme Xue Bo had already woken up. White Ape, Long Yan, Long Chi, and Wu Jianxian were all sitting in meditation, trying to recover from their injuries as soon as possible.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang, Supreme Xue Bo quickly stood up, but Jian Wushuang pressed him down on the bamboo bed. “Master Xue Bo, you don’t have to be so polite.”","“Palace Master Wushuang, we all thought that you had died and your Dao disappeared. It’s a blessing that we can see you again today.” Xue Bo’s eyes were slightly red as he spoke.","Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion. At the same time, he had some doubts. Based on his divine body and divine power consumption at that time, he could not withstand the full-power attack of Void God at all.","Old Master was also seriously injured by the sneak attack at that time, and he was also unable to resist.","Facing such a terrifying attack, one would definitely die. However, Jian Wushuang was fine. Even after he woke up, there was no sign of any hidden injuries on his body.","Jian Wushuang thought about it for a while and then threw it to the back of his mind.","Then, he began to ask about everything that had happened when he and Old Master had ‘died’.","Everyone’s calm and tragic death resurfaced in Jian Wushuang’s mind. All the geniuses of their respective eras had turned into bones in the desolate Offworld Battlefield. It was so depressing that Jian Wushuang could not breathe.","Everything that should not have happened, the old friends who should not have died, had all left.","Jian Wushuang already had an answer in his heart as to how to stop this scene from happening again.","When he heard that it was Lu Ding who had received the remnants of the entire Divine Power Universe after the battle of the Great Catastrophe War, Jian Wushuang also vaguely knew that he and Old Master had been received by Lu Ding when they were floating somewhere in the universe.","After hearing everything, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “The day we recover from our injuries will be the day we can wield our swords again.”","Supreme Xue Bo never refuted Jian Wushuang’s words. He nodded firmly.","Jian Wushuang walked to another bamboo house after giving some instructions.","Leng Rushuang had been waiting outside the door. She had not closed her eyes for many years and she looked extremely haggard.","Jian Wushuang’s heart ached and he reached out to pull her into his arms.","“Husband, it’s all because I’m useless. That’s why Feng Qi had to pay such a big price to save me,” Leng Rushuang sobbed.","“Silly girl, it’s not your fault. It’s because of Matriarch Feng Qi’s righteousness that she was willing to sacrifice herself to save you.” Jian Wushuang wiped away her tears with his hand and said softly, “Don’t worry. I will definitely help Matriarch Feng Qi get out of danger.”","After leaving Leng Rushuang in Lan Lan’s care, Jian Wushuang quickly walked into the magic barrier set up by the descendant of the Phoenix clan.","As soon as he stepped on it, a scorching flame rose with the wind. Even the divine power in Jian Wushuang’s body felt a burning pain.","At this moment, the remaining 2,000 descendants of the Phoenix clan were all sitting on the ground.","The divine power of an ordinary Supreme expert at the very least formed a huge fire Phoenix with its wings spread out. Together, they drew a Nirvana Array Formation!","And in the center of this array core lay Feng Qi’s thin and weak figure."]},{"number":4646,"title":"Chapter 4646 Three Wishes","paragraphs":["4646 Three Wishes","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang realized that Feng Qi’s current situation was far more serious than he had imagined.","Her shattered divine soul was like wisps of smoke and clouds, dissipating without stopping. She could no longer hold it together.","If she did not belong to the Phoenix clan, one of the three ancient clans, that Void God’s attack would have been enough to kill her.","Perhaps sensing the intrusion of an external force, a bare-chested handsome young man stood up. When he was about to get angry and attack, he saw that it was Jian Wushuang, and the anger in his eyes turned into sadness.","“How’s the situation? Do you need me to do anything?” Jian Wushuang walked up quickly and asked.","The handsome young man wanted to say something, but he hesitated. In the end, he said, “I’m afraid that it will be very difficult for the Matriarch to get through this.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. “That’s impossible. Don’t all the members of the Phoenix clan have the ability to be reborn? I’ve seen Feng Qi use it before. She recovered from the state of near-death very quickly.”","“That’s right. Our Phoenix clan can indeed undergo Nirvana. However, our Matriarch’s soul has already dispersed. We can’t even wake her up, so how can she undergo Nirvana?” The handsome young man’s eyes dimmed. “Even if the descendants of my clan worked together, we couldn’t wake her up.”","Looking at the dissipating soul that could not be suppressed even in the Nirvana Formation, he was afraid that if this continued, Feng Qi would really die.","Without thinking, Jian Wushuang said directly, “Can you let me enter the formation? I’d like to try.”","There was a flash of hesitation in the handsome young man’s eyes. However, before he could say anything, Jian Wushuang directly stepped into the formation.","“Ah!” An anxious voice came from behind, “You must hurry up. I’m afraid that the Matriarch might die at any moment.”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang came to the center of the formation. He looked at Feng Qi, who was sleeping with her eyes closed, and slowly sat down in front of her.","“I’m coming.”","The scorching little flame dissipated with the wind.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be having a heart-to-heart talk with Feng Qi, telling her about the past. From the first time they met to the time they fought side by side, he described it as if he was talking about his family’s treasure.","“I’m very grateful for everything you’ve done. You saved my life in Rodu, and you also saved my wife’s life in the Offworld Battlefield without hesitation. I now owe you two lives. If you don’t wake up, I’m afraid I won’t be able to repay you.”","“After you wake up, I’ll make three promises to you and the Phoenix clan. No matter where I am or when I am, these three promises will be valid forever.”","“In addition, I think that in the coming years, the Divine Power Universe will be too boring if there are no women like you.”","The calm words were accompanied by hair-thin flames that spread in the array.","The handsome young man who was like an ant on a hot pan outside the array had also stopped in his tracks at this moment. His eyes were fixed on the center of the array.","Feng Qi’s soul, which had been constantly dissipating, began to stop dissipating. At the same time, those scattered souls began to transform into the appearance of the little Fire Phoenix and quickly returned to her body.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was overjoyed. He cut open his left wrist and the divine blood that belonged to a Perfect Life Form dripped on the left half of Feng Qi’s body.","The divine blood, which contained vigorous and tough life force, was like a vine, quickly repairing and nourishing Feng Qi’s broken body.","Her skin was filling up rapidly, and every meridian was being repaired. Feng Qi’s pale face was also turning red quickly.","After a long time, Feng Qi slowly opened her eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was nourishing her with divine blood. She said, “I heard everything you said just now.”","Jian Wushuang, who was already a little dizzy, forced a smile and said, “It’s good that you heard me. If you didn’t, I would have wasted my breath.”","“Are you serious about what you said?” Feng Qi continued to ask.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “Naturally.”","Feng Qi looked happy. She did not notice Jian Wushuang’s pale face. “You don’t owe me anything. I saved you willingly.”","After bleeding for nearly half an incense’s time, even Jian Wushuang could not hold on any longer.","“Q-quickly undergo Nirvana. I can’t hold on much longer...”","Feng Qi finally came back to her senses. She hurriedly stood up and covered the wound on Jian Wushuang’s wrist with her hand. “You’re really a fool. You’ve lost so much life source origin blood. Aren’t you afraid of damaging your life source?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head slowly. “Don’t worry about me... Your matter is more important, so don’t delay it.”","“Then wait for me here, and don’t leave no matter what.” Feng Qi bit her lips. “If you leave, I won’t go into Nirvana.”","Jian Wushuang only felt dizzy and could not care about anything else. He could only nod repeatedly.","Feng Qi smiled, turned around, and walked away.","In front of her, a barrier that was burning with terrifying flames had been completely opened.","A pair of fiery wings suddenly spread out behind Feng Qi’s back, and then she entered the Fire Domain.","Her front foot left the ground, and Jian Wushuang fainted in the center of the formation.","The Phoenix clan’s descendants did not dare to step into the formation because of the Matriarch’s order. They could only try to control the fire so that Jian Wushuang, who was in the eye of the formation, would feel more comfortable.","Time passed by. Two days later, tens of thousands of fiery feathers suddenly shot out of the Fire Domain’s boundary that had been calm all this time.","At the same time, a beautiful and valiant-looking woman with a pair of fiery-red wings on her back rushed out.","After the successful rebirth, Feng Qi ran directly to Jian Wushuang, who was sleeping on the eye of the formation.","She raised her hand and cut her wrist as well. The divine blood with the Phoenix breath of the ancestral bloodline dripped into Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","The handsome young man standing at the periphery saw this and hurriedly said, “Matriarch, you must not!”","Feng Qi turned a deaf ear to it, and the ancestral blood of the Phoenix clan continued to drip into his mouth.","“Absorb it, you must absorb more.”","As the divine blood of the ancestral bloodline entered his throat, Jian Wushuang’s 10,000 meridians began to burn at the same time.","At the same time, the shadow of a Phoenix with its wings spread out and chirping appeared in the center of his chest, as if it was alive.","As for Feng Qi, after thinking for a while, she stretched out her right hand and quickly drew something on Jian Wushuang’s left arm.","Immediately, a simple Phoenix totem emerged and was immediately hidden under his skin.","After doing all this, Feng Qi giggled like a child, and then returned to her usual cold and lonely appearance.","Feng Qi did not withdraw her hand until the ancestral blood in Jian Wushuang’s body was full.","Everything calmed down and Jian Wushuang fell into a deep sleep again.","Feng Qi slowly walked out of the formation and said in a low voice, “You guys stay here and take good care of Palace Master Wushuang. Once there’s any news that he’s awake, inform me.”","The handsome young man nodded in agreement and then continued to carefully operate the formation."]},{"number":4647,"title":"Chapter 4647 Half-Ancestor Dao","paragraphs":["4647 Half-Ancestor Dao","As time passed, there was no such thing as day or night on the Cangwu Platform. The abundant divine power made this the perfect place for meditation.","As the Dao Field before Lu Ding’s Dao validation and becoming an Ancestor, the rules of the Great Dao contained here were far beyond any place in the Divine Power Universe.","This Cangwu Platform was equivalent to Cosmos God’s Cloud Palace back then.","And listening to Dao in the Cosmos God’s Cloud Palace was a great fortune that could only be encountered by chance. Usually, only the most outstanding and unparalleled geniuses in the universe would have the chance to sit on a futon and listen to the Dao.","This Ancestor-grade Daoist Field, Cangwu Platform, had opened a new door, allowing these one million cultivators to cultivate and comprehend the Dao.","In just a few months, all the cultivators in the Divine Power Universe had recovered from their injuries, but tens of thousands of cultivators who were severely injured had still died.","At the same time, many cultivators broke through the restraints and entered the Supreme realm.","Jian Wushuang woke up not long after. He had thought that he would lose some of his origin divine power, but not only was it not consumed, it was also accompanied by a strange and surging power.","It was not until the descendant of the Phoenix clan vaguely explained the reason that Jian Wushuang realized that the endless life aura in his meridians was because of the divine blood of the ancestral bloodline that Feng Qi had transferred to him.","Shaking his head helplessly, Jian Wushuang was about to leave the formation when Feng Qi appeared in front of him in a red flowing cloud gown.","Feng Qi’s eyes suddenly lit up. She hurriedly went up and used her palm to check.","Jian Wushuang was embarrassed and quickly covered his exposed chest.","“How is that possible? He should have been able to break through that realm,” Feng Qi frowned and muttered.","After tidying up his clothes, Jian Wushuang said, “What are you talking about? You’re so mysterious.”","Feng Qi did not hide anything and said frankly, “When you gave me your blood essence earlier, I vaguely felt that your aura had already reached the critical point of a breakthrough. But why is there no sign of a breakthrough now?”","“Do you think it’s that easy to break through to the Half Ancestor realm? Which Half Ancestor hasn’t been immersed in the Invincible Supreme realm for countless years before they managed to grasp a small opportunity.” Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled bitterly. “As for me, it has only been 100,000 years since I became an Invincible Supreme. I’m afraid it will take a long time for me to become a Half Ancestor.”","When Feng Qi heard this, she subconsciously pouted and said, “It doesn’t seem that difficult to advance to the Half Ancestor level. I remember that I only took a nap back then, and then I became a Half Ancestor.”","Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded for a moment. Then, he nodded, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. “I’ll try my best.”","Feng Qi said seriously, “You’re different from the others. My intuition has always been accurate. It’s definitely right.”","Looking at the Phoenix Matriarch, who was so determined to believe in him, he felt a lot better.","After saying goodbye to Feng Qi, Jian Wushuang walked slowly on the grassy plain.","Pure divine power filled every inch of space, giving people an indescribable sense of comfort.","Jian Wushuang had already decided that when Old Master’s injuries recovered, he would once again face the Void Universe army led by Void God!","And in this short period of time, the thought that had only appeared in his mind for a moment resurfaced.","“Perhaps I should really try to comprehend that realm?”","Jian Wushuang looked into the distance and saw Lu Ding walking over with a kind smile.","“Shall we go for a walk?”","“Sure.”","The two figures leisurely strolled around the Cangwu Platform, experiencing all kinds of scenery and looking at countless rare and exotic beasts.","In the clouds, the two of them were like banished Immortals in the sky, sitting and watching the strange clouds in the great realm. The mountains and rivers connected the sky and the earth, and the four seasons changed in a flash.","As the wind and clouds changed, Jian Wushuang’s state of mind had already changed.","“When I was young, I only liked to play. All kinds of rare beasts, famous mountains and giant rivers, I never grew tired of them. Later, because of various reasons, I cultivated hard until now. Although my state of mind has changed, my love for fun has never changed.”","As he talked about the past, there was a sense of satisfaction and pride in Lu Ding’s expression. “So I simply moved all the things I used to like to this Cangwu Platform. What you see now is real and has existed before.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Big Brother Lu, your state of mind has already surpassed 99 percent of the people in the world. You are able to maintain your original state of mind as always.”","Lu Ding laughed heartily and looked at Jian Wushuang with a much gentler gaze. “I once thought that I was born by riding on the Heavenly Dao and that I was a rare Heaven’s Favorite in all the realms. But it was not until today that I realized that there is no end to this.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak and waited for the rest.","“This world of the Cangwu Platform that I’ve created is tens of times larger than the Rodu Star Field that my clan used to have. However, it’s like a drop in the ocean when it’s attached to the Spring of Chaos.”","“At the same time, I also know how insignificant I am. The peak of my cultivation realm is only the ceiling of the rules of the underworld.”","At this point, Lu Ding paused for a moment before continuing, “Palace Master Wushuang, do you think that Ancestor realm is the true peak?”","Jian Wushuang only felt that the knowledge that existed in his mind was even more confusing.","The vast and mysterious realm in the Land of Sorrows, the strange words Snake God had said in the Polar Sea Star Field, Old Master who had walked out of the Black River, and the Devourers, the mysterious organization... All of these things had increased his understanding of the world.","“If the Ancestor realm isn’t the true peak, then what is above it?” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said slowly.","Hearing this, Lu Ding laughed out loud. “I don’t know either.”","Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded and then he shook his head, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. He had really gone in a big circle and returned to the original place.","“But one thing is for sure. If you want to know more, you have to jump out of the rules that bind you.”","Lu Ding smiled. “For example, you should make a breakthrough now.”","“Half Ancestor, huh?” Jian Wushuang murmured, “It’s indeed time.”","Endless divine power started to spread out from his body. Like leaves and vines, it stretched out in the air.","Seeing this, Lu Ding smiled and retreated from this world.","Between the rolling clouds, thousands of scarlet-golden divine beams shot up into the sky.","At this moment, all the cultivators in the Divine Power Universe on the Cangwu Platform looked in shock at the direction of the golden sky.","A Half Ancestor vindicated their Dao, their Dao flowed and their treasure light grew endlessly.","Is this guy really going crazy to save the Divine Power Universe?” Great Void Divine Emperor, who was sitting cross-legged in comprehension, stood up slowly. His gaze was as calm as usual."]},{"number":4648,"title":"Chapter 4648 Make a Comeback","paragraphs":["4648 Make a Comeback","The Heavenly Dao vindication had only lasted for ten years, and even becoming an Invincible Supreme had taken 1,000 years.","When all the cultivators saw the sky darken, their hearts trembled.","“Did he fail...? How could he have failed?”","Ninth Kalpa King, Feng Qi, Supreme Xue Bo, and the others were all looking in that direction nervously.","The door of the remote bamboo house, which had been silent for nearly ten years and had never been opened once, was slowly pushed open. Old Master stood by the door with a calm expression.","The two brothers, Lu Ting and Lu Gong, who had gone through many bloody battles with Jian Wushuang, blurted out almost subconsciously, “Brother, did Jian Wushuang fail?”","Lu Ding did not answer, but a faint smile hung on his face. “If he fails just like that, then he’s not the person I approve of.”","The two of them looked at each other. To be able to receive such an evaluation from their big brother, it seemed that Jian Wushuang had succeeded this time.","After ten years, the grass that was originally only an inch long had now reached his knees.","The golden glow in the sky disappeared as quickly as it came. It returned to normal in a very short time.","A gust of wind blew past, and a figure with clouds and mist around him gradually appeared in everyone’s eyes.","However, the unbridled aura of the Immortal Qi made Jian Wushuang, who was only wearing black pants, stand out even more.","Feng Qi laughed out loud. In her memory, this guy seemed to like to rip off his clothes at every important moment.","After that, Feng Qi unfolded the flowing fire wings on her back and took the lead to meet Jian Wushuang.","“Here you go.” Feng Qi stretched out her hand and handed him a white robe. She smiled and said, “You, you can actually break through in such a short time. I really underestimated you.”","Jian Wushuang took the white robe and put it on. He smiled and said, “I was lucky.”","The divine power that spread out from Jian Wushuang’s body was no longer the divine power of an Invincible Supreme. Instead, it was a kind of ethereal and indescribable smoke.","The misty clouds were proof that Jian Wushuang had become a Half Ancestor.","The originally calm atmosphere was completely heated up.","Chu Zhi, who had been rescued by Jian Wushuang from the Void Universe, was watching this scene from a distance.","“Sister Lan Lan, do you think that stupid chess player has reached a very powerful realm? A realm even more powerful than my master’s?”","Lan Lan smiled and rubbed the back of Chu Zhi’s head. “That’s right. He’s already very, very powerful now. He can protect the things he wants to protect.”","Lan Lan was stunned. After a long while, she sighed.","“Sister Lan Lan, do you think that if I want to be the Terrible Chess Player’s Dao Child, will he want me...”","“Don’t worry. If that day comes, he will definitely agree.”","...","A total of 970,000 cultivators, after recuperating for almost ten years, came out of seclusion in the broken Rodu and once again launched an attack on the army of Void Warriors that had invaded the Divine Power Universe.","Every appearance of that tenacious figure who always walked at the forefront of the army was a true transformation.","He was able to fight against a Half Ancestor while he was at the Invincible Supreme realm. Now that he had advanced to the Half Ancestor realm, who could stop him?","Standing on the completely destroyed Rodu Star Field, Jian Wushuang looked back at the endless army behind him. He raised the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand and shouted, “Fight!”","From the Offworld Battlefield to the hinterland of the Divine Power Universe, it had become a dead zone in the ten years since the gate was opened.","The rules of the Great Dao were broken, and his luck was extremely weak.","For some unknown reason, a large area of the Star Field that had become a dead area no longer gave birth to divine power. What replaced it was the birth of weak void power.","Jian Wushuang frowned. In a short ten years, the fate energy of the Divine Power Universe had shrunk to the extreme. It was even affected by the Void Universe and started to be eroded.","As he rushed to the Offworld Battlefield, Jian Wushuang found an army of nearly 10,000 Scar level Void Masters in the Hengyang Star Field area, which had been occupied by Void Warriors.","Jian Wushuang killed the 10,000 Void Masters with a wave of his hand and left a single Six Scar Void Master to ask about the current situation.","After learning that most of the elites of the Void Universe were still stationed in the Offworld Battlefield, Jian Wushuang led the army and killed their way there.","In order to completely destroy the Divine Power Universe, almost every 10,000 Scar level Void Masters formed a unit and rapidly devoured the living forces.","The number of Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms that had been completely destroyed was no less than 10,000!","In the broken Offworld Battlefield, the original base city had been occupied by the army of Void Warriors.","Since the end of the Great Catastrophe War ten years ago, Void Gods had returned to the Void Universe and slept until now.","Even though Devouring Emperor was nowhere to be found, his organization had always been the mastermind behind the plan.","Wherever the Devourers went, no one was left alive.","When the million-strong Divine Power Universe army set foot on the Offworld Battlefield again, all the Void Masters who were guarding the place retreated.","As the sword struck out, a Sword Intent waterfall that seemed to split the world in half surged out. The entire base camp occupied by the Void Warriors was completely destroyed by this sword!","The entire void of the Offworld Battlefield trembled under the Sword Intent waterfall.","Looking at the less than 20 Six Scars Void Masters, Jian Wushuang put away the Tarot Divine Sword and said in a deep voice, “Ask your master to come here and die!”","All the Six Scar Void Masters trembled and turned to flee.","However, in the next moment, the huge crack hidden in the darkness at the intersection of the two universes slowly opened.","Two enormous palms that covered the sky slowly tore apart the barrier.","It was the ancestral phantom form of the Demon God. It had four horns on its head and six dark chains around its body.","Void energy surged, Void God descended from the Demon God phantom form.","When the nightmare-like existence appeared, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and stepped forward.","An equally vigorous and unparalleled divine power rose up into the sky, and an unparalleled phantom image that was unrestrained and sublimated by divine patterns appeared.","This was a true collision between Half Ancestor realm divine power and Ancestor level void power, but the divine power was not suppressed. Instead, it was in a stalemate.","Void God’s eyes were emotionless. Behind him, the countless Void Masters were like demons that had walked out of hell, covering the sky and pressing down.","“The power of the Divine Power Universe is gone. If you commit suicide in front of me, I’ll leave you with an intact corpse.”","Void God’s cold voice resounded. Before Jian Wushuang could speak, the Demon God ancestral phantom form behind Void God raised its arm and pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","The giant palm that was surging with strange runes was repelled by a Qilin when it descended.","The form of Qilin, which possessed the power of extreme yang, appeared behind Lu Ting, and it was filled with the might of the three ancient ancient clans!"]},{"number":4649,"title":"Chapter 4649 Shock","paragraphs":["4649 Shock","His Confucian robe fluttered in the wind. Lu Ding looked at Void God calmly. At this moment, he was like the King of Qilin, releasing the Ancestor-level power of extreme yang.","Void God God’s eyes focused. The supreme divine power surging around the middle-aged man was at the Ancestor realm!","Since when was there another Ancestor realm being other than Cosmos God in the Divine Power Universe?","Before he could even think, Jian Wushuang’s extremely sharp sword had already come down on his head!","He had become a Half Ancestor in ten years.","Only Jian Wushuang knew how great the comprehension he had gained was.","The carefreeness of traversing hundreds of millions of miles in the Cangwu Platform finally laid the foundation for Jian Wushuang to become a Half Ancestor — the comprehension of all things.","Jian Wushuang, who had grown up under pressure, only wanted to protect his people.","It was also because he had comprehended his own Dao too early that everything had come to fruition and he had entered the Half Ancestor realm.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","The second move, River.","The endless Sword Intent condensed into a sword waterfall and river. It was the most ordinary but also the most powerful move, which laid the framework of the entire Wushuang Sword Dao.","The vast and vigorous river of Sword Intent went against the current and faced the ancestral Demon God form!","Looking at the Sword Intent released by his opponent, who was like an ant in the past, even he felt a little scared at this moment.","Void God waved his sleeves, and the ancestral Demon God form behind him roared and waved its two giant arms that were wrapped in chains to counter the attack!","As the two of them clashed, the sword waterfall roared and directly crushed the two arms of the ancestral form. Then, without losing any momentum, it fell on the ancestral Demon God form like thousands of swords hanging in the sky!","At that moment, both the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe were shocked.","With the power of Half Ancestor, he had broken an Ancestor-level Demon ancestral form!","Jian Wushuang’s growth had completely exceeded everyone’s imagination. Even Xue Bo, who was the closest to Jian Wushuang, was in disbelief.","The ancestral Demon God form that covered the sky wailed in grief as it spewed out a huge amount of void energy. Countless Sword Intents pierced through the surface of its body, and it had completely dimmed.","Void God took a step back. He looked at the figure in disbelief. It was only a difference of ten years, but the ant that he could kill with a wave of his hand had become what he was now.","Without giving Void Godany time to catch his breath, Jian Wushuang put his right index and middle fingers together and drew a vast Sword Intent.","He had no sword in his hand, but a sword in his heart.","The vast Sword Intent weaved together like a dense net and covered Void God.","Lu Ding followed closely behind. He smiled slightly, and the form of Qilin appeared behind him, turning into countless forces of extreme yang and attacking the army of Void Warriors.","The power of the Ancestor realm was not something that a Void Master could resist. As soon as the Qilin’s ultimate yang power was released, 300,000 Void Masters who had just entered the Divine Power Universe were all turned into dust.","The destructive power of an Ancestor realm was too terrifying. The life and death of all living things could be determined with a single thought. Even a Half Ancestor could only die on the spot.","In just a moment, more than half of the army of millions that had just been formed from the Void Universe had been wiped out.","Just as Lu Ding was about to strike again, another terrifying being walked out of the chasm.","Devouring Emperor, who was wearing a black and gold robe and had an Imperial Crown on his head, had arrived like the ruler of the darkness!","His appearance put Lu Ding on guard.","However, the Devouring Emperor’s eyes never stopped on him. Instead, he looked at Old Master.","“You really didn’t die!” Suppressed anger filled with unwillingness reverberated through the entire battlefield.","Old Master looked calm and looked at the Devouring Emperor with disdain. “Do you think you can kill me?”","A short sentence ignited the Devouring Emperor. The vooid trembled, and eight True Shadows appeared behind him.","“If I can injure you once, I can injure you a second time. Wait for me to devour you!”","The eight True Shadows were of different colors, but their faces were exactly the same as Old Master’s face.","Like the sudden arrival of extreme darkness, each of the True Shadows with Ancesto realm strength rushed over.","Lu Ding did not have the time to make a move. He immediately turned his thick extreme yang divine power into a barrier to block the army of cultivators.","Boom boom boom!","The combined attack of the eight True Shadows easily tore through Lu Ding’s extreme yang divine power and headed straight for Old Master.","The earth-shaking power even made Lu Ding’s heart palpitate.","That terrifying power that was difficult to understand, was it really Ancestor realm power?","On the other side, Jian Wushuang approached Void God with only one palm raised. He seemed much more relaxed.","He was like a flying Immortal in the sky. Each of his light attacks was enough to damage Void God.","Void God, who could have killed him with one palm back then, could now only barely resist the continuous attacks.","Jian Wushuang pointed forward, and the invisible Sword Intent pierced Void God’s left shoulder.","As the ancestral blood gushed out, his expression became ferocious.","“The worst decision I’ve ever made was to let you live!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s calm mind trembled. “What did you say?”","Void God’s eyes were cold. “I didn’t expect that you could grow to this level in just ten years. If I had known that, I would have killed you on the spot!”","Instantly, the final scene of the Great Catastrophe War ten years ago surged into their minds.","Jian Wushuang finally understood why he and Old Master could survive. It turned out that the attack of Void God, which was enough to destroy everything, had pushed them far away the moment it was about to explode.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice, “Why did you do that?”","Void God sneered. “There’s always a reasonable concern behind all unreasonable things, but I’m still wrong.”","“To make up for my mistake, I’ll completely destroy you today.”","With a deep voice, Void God’s body, which was originally wrapped in black mist, instantly lit up with countless mysterious runes.","Jian Wushuang only felt a great horror of life and death surging in his heart. He almost relied on his instinct to turn sideways and dodged several chains that swept out of Void God’s body.","The clothes on his left shoulder, which had just touched the chain, began to tear quickly.","After missing his attack, the chains returned to his body. Void God, who was covered in mysterious runes, looked at Jian Wushuang with burning eyes.","Void God, who carried the fate energy of the entire Void Universe, was extremely terrifying. Even Jian Wushuang felt a sense of life-and-death crisis when facing him.","“The destruction of the Divine Power Universe is a foregone conclusion. Your appearance is just adding the last sorrowful stroke to the Divine Power Universe. I will remember you, but you must die by my hands.”","Void God’s eyes were burning. After saying this, he did not plan on saying anything else.","The countless mysterious runes around him gradually sublimated into the void and condensed into a strange formation."]},{"number":4650,"title":"Chapter 4650 The Death of Void God, the World Becomes Clear","paragraphs":["4650 The Death of Void God, the World Becomes Clear","The void power was like silk and mist, descending from the ancient formation.","As soon as this vast and strange array was used, both the Supreme realm experts and the Void Masters felt the power in their bodies weaken to a certain level.","Even Jian Wushuang felt that the divine power in his body was suppressed by an unknown force.","The void power spread out, and a vast array appeared above Void God’s head. Countless chains shot out from his body, shooting out in all directions with a destructive aura.","White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, felt a sense of life and death approaching. He subconsciously pushed the Overlord a few hundred meters away.","The chain with Ancestral-level power easily pierced through White Ape’s abdomen, and even his soul was about to be destroyed.","“Patriarch!” Overlord wanted to rush over madly, but he was stopped by White Ape. “Don’t come over, you brat!”","Divine blood seeped out of White Ape’s mouth, and his body quickly turned into dust. He looked at the Overlord with eyes full of reluctance, “Live well. When you win, you can take me back!”","With that, White Ape rushed into the army of Void Warriors at the last moment of his death.","Boom!","The magnificent explosion tore a crack in the army, and several Six Scar Void Masters were killed.","Lu Ding made his move and covered himself with the power of yang, only then was he able to barely repel the chains that were coming at him.","Jian Wushuang’s face was as calm as water. He no longer cared if Void God had changed. He immediately condensed an invisible sword and slashed at him.","A vast Sword Intent rose, and the sword style was like the flowing light covered Void God like a Heavenly River.","There was a ferocious laugh and then two huge palms separated the Sword Intent river. At the same time, the huge head of the ancestral Demon God form bit at Jian Wushuang without saying anything.","Unable to dodge in time, his entire body was swallowed by the ancestral Demon God form.","As far as the eye could see, the endless black fog was like a chain that trapped him in his stomach. The Demon God had its own rules and was nibbling away at Jian Wushuang’s divine power at an extremely fast speed.","The ancestral form shut its mouth in satisfaction and lay down on the back of Void God.","Sensing the increasingly weak struggle in the ancestral form, Void God finally relaxed. He looked not far away, where Lu Ding was already rushing over with the power of yang.","Void God did not dare to be careless since they were both Ancestor realm experts.","“Spit out Palace Master Wushuang!” Lu Ding’s face was livid. “Otherwise, don’t blame me for killing you on the spot!”","As if he had heard the funniest joke in the world, Void God sneered. “I don’t understand. You’re already an Ancestor. Why do you still care about a little Half Ancestor?”","A glint flashed across Lu Ding’s eyes, but he did not say anything. He waved his arm, and a Qilin form surrounded by extreme yang power roared and attacked Void God.","The ancestral Demon God form behind him saw this and swung its two giant arms at the Qilin.","Instantly, the battlefield trembled. After the void power and divine power collided, the light waves produced lit up the darkness.","Void God and Lu Ding both took a step back. Before the Qilin form finally dissipated, it tore off half of the Demon God’s arm.","“Let Palace Master Wushuang out. Otherwise, it won’t be your ancestral form’s arm that’s going to be broken next time,” Lu Ding said in a low voice.","Void God did not say anything. Just as he was about to attack again, the ancestral form behind him suddenly trembled.","In the next moment, a River of swords shot out and exploded the head of the ancestral Demon God form.","At the same time, a figure with divine patterns floating all over his body stepped forward with a sword in hand.","The Tarot Divine Sword was pointed at the ground. Jian Wushuang looked at Void God arrogantly and then he raised the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed down.","This sword was so powerful that it could split the sky!","The ancestral Demon God form crumbled immediately, and Void God raised his hand to resist.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang was fine, Lu Ding was overjoyed. He controlled his yang divine power to attack Void God together.","This attack even destroyed the void. It was like a black hole that devoured all things, absorbing all the divine power and void power that dissipated in the universe.","All the Supreme experts and Void Masters who were fighting were shocked by this scene.","When the light faded, Void God, whose left arm had been destroyed and whose chest had been opened, slowly took a step forward.","The void power dissipated, and it could not even continue to repair his broken body.","Jian Wushuang descended with his sword in hand. He looked at him with a complicated expression.","If Void God had killed him during the last Great Catastrophe War, he and Old Master would have had no chance of survival.","However, in the end, he let them go for some reason.","No one spoke first. Even though most of his body was shattered, Void God still stood upright, and the shadow in their eyes did not change.","“I just want to ask you one thing. We are clearly mortal enemies, so why did you let us go back then?” Jian Wushuang did not carry out the next step. Instead, he used a voice that only the two of them could hear to question Void God.","“There’s no reason why. Everything that has happened today is all because of me. My biggest mistake was underestimating your growth potential.” Void God looked at Jian Wushuang and said slowly, “Your terrifying growth rate has far exceeded my expectations.”","Without saying anything, Jian Wushuang understood why Void God had let him live. However, what had happened had already happened and no one could change it.","An invisible sword with a red-gold divine pattern appeared in his hand. Jian Wushuang said, “You should know the situation that is coming up. I will not let you live.”","Void God’s calm face curved into a smile. “My life isn’t that easy to take. Just come.”","Jian Wushuang was also unusually calm. If this guy stretched out his neck to be killed, he would not be Void God.","He turned his body into a Sword Intent, and the infinite sword way rainbow was like a big river that instantly swept toward Void God.","“Don’t!”","Devouring Emperor, who was being held up by Old Master, shouted. He wanted to help Jian Wushuang, but he could not let go. He could only watch Jian Wushuang’s sword stab at Void God.","Puchi...","The sound of metal penetrating flesh reverberated. The Wushuang Sword Dao’s River poured into Void God’s chest, destroying his ancestral source.","He did not dodge at all. He just stood there and let Jian Wushuang’s long sword pierce through him.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. If Void God fought with all his might, the best outcome would be that Void God would die and he would be seriously injured.","However, Void God did not resist. Instead, after Jian Wushuang’s long sword pierced his body, he reached out his hand, grabbed the sword blade, and pushed it forward.","The void power collapsed, and the Dao that belonged to Void God was being destroyed.","Unparalleled fate energy began to overflow from his body and was fed back to the Void Universe through the chasm.","All the Void Masters who were fighting desperately felt that Void God was about to die, so they all looked at him in despair.","“Jian Wushuang, I destroyed my Ancestor realm fate energy just to ask you for one thing.”"]},{"number":4651,"title":"Chapter 4651 Space-Time Turbulence","paragraphs":["4651 Space-Time Turbulence","Void God’s body disintegrated at a slow speed, then turned into stars that were constantly destroyed.","“Everything started because of me, and it will end because of me. If I die, you can’t hurt a single person in my Void Universe. From now on, the Void Universe will never step into the Divine Power Universe.”","Void God looked at Jian Wushuang, hoping to hear a promise from him.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. Instead, he looked calm as he stabbed the invisible sword into Void God’s body.","“What do you think the Divine Power Universe is? Do you think that you can atone for all your past sins by dying?”","“Then what about those who have died to fight against you in our Divine Power Universe?”","Each word was like a knife, like a cry of blood.","“They!” Jian Wushuang pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword with his left hand and pointed it at all the Void Masters in the Offworld Battlefield. “I’ll count them one by one. None of them can live!”","All the Void Masters trembled as the shadow of death loomed over their hearts.","Void God looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze. He realized that the person in front of him, who had stepped into the Void Universe and set up the formation, and fought to the last moment, was his ultimate enemy.","Unknowingly, this short 100,000 years of growth had turned him into someone even more terrifying than Cosmos God. He was iron-blooded and someone that could unite people.","“Are you... serious?” Void God’s eyes gradually lost their light.","Jian Wushuang’s face was calm, and his words were like heavy hammers. “In order to prevent such a tragedy from happening again, your Void Universe will be annihilated!”","Void God trembled and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief, “No, you can’t.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak, his face as calm as before.","He did not want to waste any more time. Just as he was about to pull out the invisible sword, Void God’s cold palm grabbed Jian Wushuang’s arm.","Looking at the dense runes on Void God’s forehead, Jian Wushuang was shocked and prepared to leave.","However, it was too late. Jian Wushuang felt the space around him become sticky, as if he had stepped into a swamp, and he could not move at all.","“In order to prevent the Void Universe from being destroyed, I can only use my body to seal you into the space-time turbulence.” Behind Void God, the space shattered and a huge whirlpool started to appear.","Jian Wushuang tried his best to leave but it was to no avail. “Do you think that I won’t be able to come back after you seal me into the space-time turbulence?”","Void God’s body was almost gone. He shook his head. “I don’t think I can trap you forever, but if I can make you sink into that place, it’ll be my last effort.”","“Dark and shameless fellow,” Jian Wushuang said angrily. After saying that, he disappeared into the space-time turbulence.","At this point, the master of the Void Universe, the Divine Power Universe’s nightmare, had died!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was pushed into the space-time turbulence!","At this moment, all the Void Masters were like walking corpses, and they no longer had the thought of fighting.","Under the leadership of Feng Qi, Long Yan, Long Chi, and the others, the remaining army of less than 300,000 cultivators went all out to kill the Void Masters!","Seeing this, Devouring Emperor’s heart was like dead ashes. The eight True Shadows returned to his body and released a vast energy to separate Old Master. He then tried to escape.","Old Master did not stop him. Instead, a black scepter appeared in his right hand and he threw it at Devouring Emperor.","The scepter of Black Power was as fast as lightning, and even Devouring Emperor could not avoid it","Without even making a sound, Devouring Emperor fell straight into the void.","The remaining members of the Devourers carried Devouring Emperor and dashed into the crack, disappearing into the Void Universe.","There was a brief silence in the Offworld Battlefield. Nearly a million elite Void Masters of the Void Universe looked at everything in despair.","Old Master slowly descended from the void, his black water robe fluttering in the wind.","Feng Qi flapped her huge fire wings and arrived behind Old Master. At the same time, Long Yan, Long Chi, Xue Bo, and the others also stood behind Old Master.","Although very few people in the Divine Power Universe could hear Old Master speak, what he had done for the Divine Power Universe had long been imprinted in everyone’s hearts.","Looking at the millions of Void Warriors still on the battlefield, Old Master said slowly, “Leave no one alive.”","No one had any objections. Feng Qi led the less than 1,000 descendants of the Phoenix clan and turned into a giant Phoenix that covered the sky. They carried out the final slaughter.","The two Half Ancestors, Long Yan and Long Chi, followed closely behind and also plunged into the army of Void Warriors.","Supreme Xue Bo also descended into the army of Void Masters and sought revenge with grief and indignation.","When the last Scar-level Void Master was killed in the Offworld Battlefield, the war between the two universes, which had been going on for nearly 100,000 years, finally came to an end.","There were less than 200,000 Supremes experts left from the Divine Power Universe that had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War.","None of the nearly ten million elite Void Masters of the Void Universe had survived.","The entire Offworld Battlefield had turned into a burial ground. The remains were piled up several feet high and it was tragic to the extreme.","In this battle, from the very beginning of the primordial chaos to the present, from the Ancestor realm Cosmos God, to the Rulers and Supremes, everyone had fallen.","The war of the apocalypse, which had lasted for countless chaos cycles, had come to an end.","No one knew what the purpose of this war was. It was already a tragedy for the war to have progressed to this stage.","On the battlefield that had been completely destroyed, the wind howled.","The surviving Supreme experts did not celebrate their victory. They all looked at the place where Jian Wushuang had disappeared in silence.","Old Master stood calmly on the spot the entire time, and everyone looked at him nervously.","In the end, it was Supreme Xue Bo who stepped forward and asked, “Senior, can Palace Master Wushuang return from the space-time turbulence?”","Old Master slowly opened his eyes and shook his head, “I don’t know either.”","“Is he not coming back? I don’t believe it,” Feng Qi said anxiously.","Everyone’s mood fell to the bottom of the valley. No one knew what terrifying consequences would come from opening up a space-time turbulence with Ancestor-level power.","Those with weaker spiritual awareness would probably be lost in it forever.","Everyone’s expression was dejected. Only Lu Ding’s eyes flashed with regret and his face was livid, as if he had lost the most precious thing.","“Let’s go!” Lu Ding let out a low growl and led the Qilin clan, which had less than a thousand people, away from the Offworld Battlefield.","After Lu Ting and Lu Gong said goodbye to the crowd, they followed Lu Ding. They made their way into the Divine Power Universe.","Supreme Xue Bo, the Dragon clan, and the Phoenix clan all looked at the Qilin clan with strange expressions."]},{"number":4652,"title":"Chapter 4652 Lu Ding Claims to Be the Lord","paragraphs":["4652 Lu Ding Claims to Be the Lord","The war of catastrophe, which had lasted for countless chaos cycles, had ended with Void God’s death. It was a tragic victory for the Divine Power Universe.","The experts of both universes had been completely annihilated in this war. Even if another million chaos cycles passed, it would be difficult for the two universes to return to their pre-war state.","The world was clear, and there was no longer any war to fight.","The ripples on the Black Water disappeared, and the old man seemed to have aged significantly. He turned to look at the 200,000 Supreme experts behind him and said slowly, “I will be sleeping here. Perhaps I will only wake up when he returns. You all can go back to your own places.”","Jian Wushuang, who had already become the backbone of the Divine Power Universe, had completely disappeared in the space-time turbulence. As a result, even the Divine Power Universe, who had won, had ended up in a miserable state.","Earlier on, every Supreme knew clearly that if Jian Wushuang had not died, they would have launched a counterattack on the Void Universe and carried out a thorough reckoning instead of ending it in such a dismal manner.","However, there were no ifs. Nothing could be changed.","“Counterattack the Void Universe! We want revenge!” a Supreme martial artist roared.","Immediately after, nearly 200,000 Supreme experts shouted at the same time.","“Counterattack the Void Universe! Don’t leave a single enemy alive!”","Supreme Xue Bo and the others looked at Old Master.","Old Master acted as if he did not hear anything. His figure floated forward and turned into a long Black River that flowed in the broken void of the Offworld Battlefield.","In the end, the battle came to a tragic end. Out of the nearly 200,000 Supreme martial artists, 50,000 of them belonged to the Divine Life Palace, while the remaining 150000 were scattered in the sky.","The Dragon clan and Phoenix clan had suffered great losses, and almost all of their Supreme realm experts had died. Nearly 70 percent of the sects that had come had been destroyed, and not a single person was left.","Great Void Divine Emperor stood at the place where Jian Wushuang had disappeared for a hundred years. In this hundred years, other than the disciples of the Divine Life Palace, there was no one else in the Offworld Battlefield.","Great Void Divine Emperor seemed to be thinking about Jian Wushuang and what kind of existence he was.","He seemed to have inherited the Heavenly Dao and appeared silently. He grew from an unremarkable existence to this day, and then led the Divine Power Universe from decline to complete victory.","After the Divine Power Universe had won, he suddenly disappeared without a trace, as if he had completed the task given to him by the Heavenly Dao.","He was like a Ranger, a passer-by, leaving only a fleeting shadow, and never to meet again.","A hundred years later, Great Void Divine Emperor left while laughing.","Under the leadership of Supreme Xue Bo and Supreme Jun Fu, less than 1,000 disciples had joined forces to build the Divine Life Palace the entrance of the Divine Power Universe to the Offworld Battlefield.","At the same time, the news of the Divine Power Universe’s victory spread quickly.","Along with the news of the Divine Power Universe’s victory, there was another piece of news.","The Patriarch of the Qilin race, Lu Ding, broke through to the Ancestor realm in the midst of danger and saved the Divine Power Universe from its crisis. He led all the Supreme experts to fight to the death and finally killed Void God, winning with a Pyrrhic victory.","At the same time, the old era was removed, and a new era began. Lu Ding built the Cangwu Platform in the shattered Rodu to replace the position of Cosmos God.","The Cangwu Platform had become the Dao Plaza of the new generation of Cosmos God Lu Ding.","A series of news spread in the Divine Power Universe and spread throughout the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","At the same time, the most important piece of news was spread.","In order to commemorate the great victory of this calamity, the new Cosmos God Lu Ding opened a Dao Plaza. All Supreme realm experts were allowed to come and listen to the Dao. Every StFr field and Divine Kingdom could even send ten Ultimate Rulers to listen to the Dao and comprehend.","The moment this news was released, countless Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms went into a frenzy. This new Cosmos God was already showing great kindness to everyone. It was only a matter of time before he could listen to the Dao of an Ancestor realm expert and advance to the Supreme realm.","Just opening up a dojo was enough to make the remaining Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms prepare themselves and go on a pilgrimage.","For the next hundred years, all the outstanding geniuses of the Divine Power Universe went to the Cangwu Platform to seek an audience with the new Cosmos God, Lu Ding.","“Preposterous! You’re really shameless!”","A deafening sound of a table being hit reverberated from the newly built Divine Life Palace.","Supreme Xue Bo’s hair and beard stood on end as he looked at the urgent message from the Cangwu Platform on the table. “Shameless bastard! You’re just fishing for fame! You’re stepping on the corpses of millions of cultivators in my Divine Power Universe to get to your position!","Supreme Jun Fu’s face was also unsightly, and he and the 50,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace were filled with righteous indignation.","Ninth Kalpa King immediately rushed out, but he was stopped by Supreme Jun Fu. “Elder Ninth Kalpa, don’t get angry first.”","“I want to seek justice for Jian Wushuang.” Suppressing the rage in his heart, Ninth Kalpa King said in a deep voice. The aura of an Invincible Supreme made him look like a sharp sword.","Supreme Xue Bo came behind Nnith Kalpa King, put his palm on his shoulder, and said, “Right now, there are hundreds of things that need to be done in the Divine Power Universe, and people can’t stand any more turmoil, so let’s just bear with it.”","After taking a deep breath, Ninth Kalpa King only said that he was going into seclusion. He then entered the depths of the Divine Life Palace and never came out again.","“From today on, the Divine Life Palace will be closed. We won’t see any messengers from the Qilin clan!” Supreme Xue Bo said in a low voice.","“Yes!” The 50,000 disciples of the Divine Life Palace cupped their hands in unison.","From then on, the Divine Life Palace was closed.","Urgent messages from the Qilin clan to all the major sects flowed in the universe.","In the Red Sky Star Field, an urgent message from the Qilin clan was placed in front of Feng Qi. However, she did not even open her eyes.","In the hall, nearly 10,000 disciples of the Phoenix clan stood on both sides, looking at their great Matriarch nervously.","“Matriarch, all of the descendants of the race who are Ultimate Rulers and above have arrived,” the handsome young man named Feng Xiao stepped forward and said.","Feng Qi slowly opened her eyes, and her beautiful eyes swept across every Phoenix clan descendant in the hall. She said in a low voice, “From today onwards, the Phoenix clan will close the Star Field, and no one is allowed to go out without permission. If any ignorant brat can’t resist the temptation and goes to the Cangwu Platform, don’t blame me for cutting him into pieces in the future!”","In the hall, all the Phoenix clan descendants responded in unison.","“In addition, tell those fellows of the Dragon clan that if any one of them dares to head to the Cangwu Platform to listen to the teachings, the entire Phoenix clan will fight them to the death!”","Phoenix Matriarch’s prestige was fully displayed. She looked into the distant void, and a trace of sadness flashed in her eyes.","In the same year, the Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan closed their Star Fields, and no one went to the Cangwu Platform to listen to the Dao.","The Great Void Temple, Starry Sky Sword Sect, the Nine Emperor Pavilion, Nine Stars Holy Land, Sword Alliance, and the other ancient sects that had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War all announced that they would go into seclusion in the same year. They did not send anyone to listen to the teachings at the Cangwu Platform.","This was unprecedented in any era."]},{"number":4653,"title":"Chapter 4653 Furnace","paragraphs":["4653 Furnace","Since Jian Wushuang had disappeared for nearly 300 years, the clansmen sent by countless clans had almost all rushed to the territory of the Qilin clan. Now, they were at the center of the entire Divine Power Universe — the Cangwu Platform!","It was still tens of millions of miles away, but all the cultivators who came could feel a vast and supreme divine power.","Everyone’s face was filled with excitement. The Great Dao they felt was the aura of an Ancestor realm!","Over a million cultivators had already arrived in front of the Cangwu Platform from all directions of the Divine Power Universe.","The towering Hall seemed to be built entirely from spiritual Jade, and the vast divine power it emitted nourished every cultivator who came here.","The group of ten came from the Taicang Shrine and stopped in front of the Cangwu Platform. They were all at the Ultimate Ruler realm.","The Taicang Shrine had sent out all five Supreme-being elders to participate in the battle. Four of them had died on the battlefield, leaving only one Top Supreme realm cultivator who had returned with serious injuries.","“Eldest Senior Brother, do you think we’ll be in trouble when we return? We came here to listen to the teachings behind the Second Elder’s back.” One of the cultivators, who was short and fat, said nervously, “Before he went into seclusion, Second Elder even swore that he would break the legs of anyone who dared to come to the sect...”","The leader of the cultivators frowned. “Idiot, if you don’t tell, and if I don’t tell, how would Second Elder know? Besides, we only listened to the Grand Elder’s words and came here to listen to the Dao and sit in Enlightenment. If Second Elder wants to break a leg, it should be the Grand Elder’s leg.”","The only female disciple in this group of ten-plus people looked around her, then whispered, “Eldest Senior Brother, Second Senior Brother, have you noticed that all the cultivators here are the Ultimate Rulers? I don’t even see any Supremes.”","The Eldest Senior Brother coughed heavily, then said in a low voice, “Isn’t that even better? Later on, when Cosmos God opens the Cangwu Platform, we’ll try our best to snatch the futons that are closest to the front!”","When he said this, they became excited. Listening to the Dao under the command of Cosmos God was equivalent to giving each of them an entrance ticket to break through to the Supreme relm!","The female disciple was the only one who scratched her head in confusion.","In the center of the shattered Rodu Star Field, three figures stood in front of the Spring of Chaos that Old Master had sealed with a wave of his hand.","Lu Ding, who was still dressed in a white Confucian robe, stood at the forefront, and behind him stood Lu Ting and Lu Gong.","Lu Ding, who was as imposing as before, was surrounded by a terrifying Ancestor realm aura.","He frowned and looked at the Spring of Chaos that had been sealed by the Black Water without saying a word.","After an unknown period of time, he asked in a deep voice, “How many cultivators have arrived from the outside world?”","Hearing this, Lu Ting and Lu Gong looked at each other, then stepped forward and said, “Big Brother, there are nearly three million cultivators who have arrived at the Cangwu Platform. They are all at the Ultimate Ruler realm. As for the Supreme realm experts, they are... There are less than tens of thousands.”","“Bastard! A bunch of damned things!” Lu Ding roared in anger, and a dark aura that did not match his previous temperament surged from his eyes.","“I have so humbly begged them to come, but they actually don’t know how to appreciate favors.” Suppressing his anger and hatred, Lu Ding’s eyes grew darker.","Turning around, the darkness in his eyes had completely disappeared and was replaced by magnanimity and kindness.","When Lu Ting and Lu Gong heard this, they immediately said, “Big Brother, if you have anything to say, just tell us directly. The three of us brothers will not distinguish between each other.”","Lu Ding nodded heavily and said, “In that case, I’ll have to ask all of you to come out this time. Please invite the Divine Life Palace, the Dragon and Phoenix clans, and all the Supremes and Half Ancestors to the Cangwu Platform. I want to make it up to them. After all, I was in the wrong this time.”","“Don’t worry, Big Brother. No matter what, the two of us will definitely invite them over to show the sincerity of our Qilin clan,” Lu Ting said firmly, “There’s no time to lose. We will definitely invite them over before you start preaching the Dao for people to gain Enlightenment.”","After that, the two of them left.","Looking at the disappearing figure, a dark expression appeared in Lu Ding’s eyes again, which was extremely inconsistent with his Ancestor realm identity.","The entire shattered Rodu Star Field was still in its original state. Looking at the Spring of Chaos beneath his feet, Lu Ding turned his gaze to his left arm.","The next moment, he suddenly raised his right hand, and with his fingers like a knife, he directly cut off his entire left arm from his shoulder blade!","“Ah...” With a muffled groan of pain, Lu Ding’s right hand caught a complete arm.","Supreme divine blood gushed out from the broken part, but Lu Ding did not care at all. He let the divine blood stain his clothes, looking like a terrifying demonic god.","Looking at the arm that was still trembling in his hand, Lu Ding’s eyes were filled with hatred.","“Damn you, Jian Wushuang. You were the perfect host that I was going to latch on to, but you disappeared without a trace. That’s why I went through so much trouble!”","“If you appear in front of me again, I’ll definitely cut you into pieces!”","The divine blood gradually dissipated, and at the same time, his broken left arm grew back. Lu Ding was as calm and composed as before, and he looked majestic.","The severed arm had also changed its appearance at some point in time. It had turned into a flesh-colored small cauldron with intricate patterns carved on it.","I can’t wait any longer. I’ll let you all contribute some nutrients to my clay idol first.","Lu Ding smiled gloomily. He suddenly opened his arms as if he was hugging someone, and leaped into the void.","The vast Cangwu Platform, which had already been constructed into a towering hall, slowly opened its huge door at this moment.","An extremely pure divine power gushed out and all the cultivators who rushed to the Cangwu Platform were bathed in this divine power.","All the cultivators could feel that the shackles on them had loosened.","Roar!","A roar that reverberated through the ages resounded as a Qilin surging with pure yang energy descended!","On the Cangwu Platform, the solemn and majestic giant image of the Ancestral Qilin form appeared.","“To all the people of the Divine Power Universe, I have inherited the Heavenly Dao. In order to save the Divine Power Universe from the disasters and to be qualified for the position of Cosmos God, I have opened a Dao Plaza today and opened the Dao listening praying mats to bestow upon you a great opportunity.”","As Lu Ding’s majestic voice fell, the door of the Cangwu Platform’s giant hall was completely opened.","“Everyone, please take your seats.”","All the cultivators were in a frenzy. They swarmed forward without a care for anything in order to snatch the futon closest to Cosmos God.","The ten people from the Taicang Shrine were at the back of the crowd. Each of them had an anxious look on their faces, afraid that they would not be able to get a futon.","Only the female disciple who was protected by her Senior Brothers was a little confused.","She did not not know if it was an illusion or if her mind was in a trance, but she accidentally saw Cosmos God sitting on top of the Cangwu Platform’s giant hall. There was a hint of strangeness in the vast and sacred aura."]},{"number":4654,"title":"Chapter 4654 The Demoness of Da Qian (1)","paragraphs":["4654 The Demoness of Da Qian (1)","Shaking her head slightly, the female disciple from the Taicang Shrine realized that Cosmos God was looking down at them and hurriedly lowered her head.","“Eldest Senior Brother, Second Senior Brother, why don’t we turn back now?” after hesitating for a while, the female disciple gritted her teeth and said.","When the Eldest Senior Brother heard this, he immediately became anxious. “I say, Jiu Ling, what are you doing now? Do you know how hard it is to get an entrance ticket? You’re making a joke out of your Dao Path!”","The female disciple named Jiu Ling gritted her teeth. In the next moment, she suddenly turned around and squeezed through the crowd, leaving the Cangwu Platform.","“Junior Sister, come back!” the Eldest Senior Brother and the others shouted anxiously, but seeing that she had already made up her mind, they could only stop in regret.","In the crowd of cultivators, Jiu Ling turned back to look at them, and then left resolutely.","“I hope that all of this is just my wild guess.”","Close to 3.5 million cultivators all surged into the Cangwu Platform.","Every piece of unknown spiritual Jade beneath their feet exuded a vast amount of divine power. As the cultivators walked into it, they could feel their bodies being nourished by some kind of mysterious energy.","The entire Cangwu Platform’s giant hall was like a boundless Star Field with countless ancient stars above it, looking extremely profound.","In the vast hall of the vast Cangwu Platform, where the clouds were misty, tens of thousands of Lotus platforms were shining on each other. In the center of the largest lotus platform sat Lu Ding, dressed in a flowing cloud scholar’s robe.","The Great Dao of heaven and earth appeared behind him like a rainbow, with auspicious sounds and precious light flowing.","All the cultivators felt a suppression from the Great Dao of heaven and earth in their hearts. Then, a total of 3.5 million cultivators knelt down at the same time and called out devoutly.","With a smile on his face, Lu Ding waved his sleeve, and the supreme divine power turned into thousands of rainbow shadows, sweeping into the bodies of every cultivator.","At this moment, all the cultivators felt that the elusive shackles were opened, as if the floodgates had opened and they were rising.","Rays of Supreme realm cultivation light shot up into the sky, illuminating the inside of the Cangwu Platform as if it were daytime.","While these cultivators were breaking through their cultivation realms, a shadow flashed across Lu Ding’s eyes. The next moment, a palm-sized flesh-colored cauldron was taken out of his sleeve.","The flesh-colored furnace expanded in the wind and grew to a size of tens of millions of miles in the blink of an eye.","All the cultivators subconsciously looked over.","At this moment, regardless of whether it was near or far, more than half of the stars began to rush towards the Cangwu Platform and fall into the flesh-colored cauldron.","A bright and strange light began to rise from the furnace, turning into a cloud of smoke that rose to the ground.","All the cultivators felt as if they were in a Fairyland, and they had unknowingly lost their way.","Just like that, nearly 3.5 million cultivators floated into the air and then fell into the abyss-like flesh-colored cauldron.","In an instant, the world changed dramatically. With the entire Cangwu Platform as the center, the wind and clouds suddenly changed.","Almost 50,000 Star Fields around the Rodu Star Field were destroyed by this strange change, and the heavens and earth were crying.","Lu Ding sat on the Lotus Throne, still looking at the scene with a kind face. A wisp of power that was not divine power but far stronger than divine power rose around him.","The flesh-colored cauldron, which contained millions of cultivators and countless stars, kept shaking. At the same time, wisps of blood-red patterns began filling up the grooves of the cauldron.","There were no screams, no wails. Everything seemed to be immersed in a Fairyland, until the last moment of death.","When the flesh-colored cauldron stopped shaking, all the phenomena in the world quieted down.","Then, the flesh-colored cauldron slowly changed and finally transformed into a body without any facial features.","Lu Ding waved his hand, and the strange body shrank and fell into his hand.","“Next time, your facial features will grow out.” Lu Ding grinned. “And it’s time for me to break this invisible restraint.”","Heaven and earth trembled. Jiu Ling, who was already far away from the Cangwu Platform, sensed this strange change and hurriedly fled. However, the invisible suction force was simply too terrifying. With her realm as an Ultimate Ruler, she could not even move an inch.","At this critical moment, a Qilin’s roar rang out. At the same time, a force of extreme yang pulled her body and saved her from the suction.","In the vast Cosmic boat, Lu Ting looked at Jiu Ling. “Miss, the Dao Field is already closed. You haven’t entered yet, have you?”","Jiu Ling did not to speak anymore. She looked at the thousands of Qilin clan people in the Cosmic Boat in fear.","“You’re not thinking of us as bad people, are you? We’re all the relatives of the Cosmos God. We’re not bad people,” Lu Gong laughed and said. For some reason, he had a good impression of this woman whose eyes were filled with fear.","However, Jiu Ling only thanked him in a hurry and left the Comisc Boat as if she was escaping.","“Second Brother, you guys can go back first. I’ll be back soon.” After leaving these words, Lu Gong hurriedly followed Jiu Ling’s footsteps.","Lu Ting shook his head helplessly and returned to the Cangwu Platform in the Cosmic Boat.","...","“What is this place...”","“Didn’t I fall into the dark abyss? Did I not die...”","A strange whimper and whisper came into his ears. A figure that was almost torn into two by the chaotic astral wind slowly woke up.","The scabs formed by the divine blood all over his body were repeatedly torn by the astral wind in the space-time turbulence and could not heal. He had already become a bloodied man.","Jian Wushuang’s original appearance was almost unrecognizable. He was like a skeleton that had just grown flesh and blood. He looked at the grotesque and variegated space-time turbulence in a daze.","“If I’m not dead, how am I supposed to go back?”","He lifted his feet and walked through this unknown time and space like a walking corpse. He had lost count of how many years he had been walking.","The most terrifying thing about the space-time turbulence was the unknown. There were no space-time coordinates here. There were only grotesque and variegated realms and astral winds that could easily tear one’s body apart.","However, Jian Wushuang had never given up. He was determined to move forward in the turbulence.","He did not know how much time had passed. Just as he was completely numb, a faint light spot hidden in the turbulence appeared in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang touched it without thinking.","In an instant, tens of thousands of streams of light appeared, stirring up layers of ripples as if they were stirring the water.","Then, the flowing light that burst out was like a dense net that directly absorbed Jian Wushuang’s entire body.","His mind and divine sense were spinning, and he didn’t know how big the world was.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","A beam of light, like a shooting star in broad daylight, streaked across the sky in a white line and then fell heavily to the ground."]},{"number":4655,"title":"Chapter 4655 The Demoness of Da Qian (2)","paragraphs":["4655 The Demoness of Da Qian (2)","Even if the ground was soft, it almost took Jian Wushuang’s life.","The meridians and bones of his entire body broke inch by inch the moment he landed on the ground.","His True Soul and divine soul, together with his brain, were almost thrown out.","Jian Wushuang, who was nearly 100 meters underground and had created a crater within a 10-mile radius, was now lying on his back. It was almost impossible for him to even move his fingers.","His root bone was almost crushed into powder and he was already paralyzed. Even swallowing was an extravagant hope.","However, fortunately, his soul was still there and he had not stepped into the reincarnation stage.","As long as his divine soul was not destroyed, even if he only had a strand of hair or a piece of skin left, he could regrow his divine body.","At the same time, he began to sense that what filled his body was no longer divine power, but another Law, another power.","This kind of power that was not integrated into the body had far surpassed divine power. It was manifolds higher than divine power.","He was completely shocked. “What is this place? Did I not return to the Divine Power Universe?”","Jian Wushuang wanted to check his surroundings, but the only thing he could do was to blink and close his eyes.","With a helpless attitude, Jian Wushuang continued to lie down.","Spring and autumn changed, and the new snow replaced the new spring.","He had been counting days for 500,000 years.","500,000 years was a long time, but Jian Wushuang lay there like a rock for 500,000 years.","As he was unable to absorb any power from the outside world, he could only rely on the divine power that was produced in his Dantian to repair his broken body inch by inch.","After 500,000 years, Jian Wushuang could finally move his body. However, because of his mistake, he had to lie down for another 100,000 years.","Looking at the extremely abundant and powerful power that surpassed any power he had ever seen, Jian Wushuang, who did not believe it, tried to absorb a wisp of the vast and mysterious energy. Then, he lay straight back in the pit.","After learning a painful lesson, Jian Wushuang, who had completely recovered, climbed up from the pit and did not do anything similar again.","For 600,000 thousand years, Jian Wushuang could not help but sigh. It was a double torture to his body and soul.","Feeling the divine power that had filled his body to the extreme, he decided to find a way to leave this place.","He tried to use his vast divine power to tear the space apart, but his divine power, which was comparable to an Ancestor realm expert’s, could not even leave a white mark when it streaked across the space.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to give up.","After walking out of the boundary filled with giant trees, Jian Wushuang finally realized what was strange.","There was not a single living being’s aura here, not even the clear cry of birds.","“Could it be that this place is a dead zone?” Jian Wushuang thought as he leaped into the sky.","Just as he leaped up, a sense of life and death crisis made him subconsciously look down.","In the middle of the dense forest, a purple tail as huge as a Sky-Wwallowing Python whipped toward him.","Jian Wushuang had no time to dodge at all and he was directly whipped down from the sky.","He only stopped after breaking hundreds of towering trees with his body. He felt as if his body had been scattered.","Rumble, rumble!!!","The earth trembled, and the towering trees parted in two rows. A strange, pitch-black beast with a dark purple tail slowly walked out of the darkness.","It had six thick canine teeth, and its mouth was like a bloody abyss.","The giant claw tore the space apart and quickly came for Jian Wushuang.","The explosion of that extremely terrifying aura made him lose all desire to fight and directly jumped away from this attack.","After dodging the attack, Jian Wushuang did not even have time to catch his breath. A dark purple tail whipped him and he was smashed to the ground again.","The strange giant beast arrived in front of Jian Wushuang at a speed that did not match its body shape. It opened its huge bloody mouth and swallowed him directly!","He did not want to save his strength anymore, so he used the Ancestral Skill.","The radiance of the Transcendence Heavenly Gate surged and a giant finger appeared around Jian Wushuang. Then, it stabbed into the mouth of the giant beast.","The attack, which was at the peak of the Divine Power Universe, tore the corner of the giant beast’s mouth apart, and three of its six mountain-like teeth were broken.","The giant beast retreated in pain and then went completely crazy. It opened its mouth and tried to shovel Jian Wushuang.","Seeing that even the Ancestral Skill could not kill it, Jian Wushuang did not dare to fight to the death. He immediately fled madly.","Just like that, a beast chased a man in this huge forest.","Just as Jian Wushuang was prepared for the worst, the giant beast behind him suddenly let out a miserable howl and fell to the ground like a collapsing mountain.","Jian Wushuang turned around with lingering fear and saw that the giant beast was being held back by something and twitching.","A wail came from the beast’s mouth, and it looked at him with pleading eyes.","“Is this guy trying to lure me into his trap?” Jian Wushuang started to doubt.","Just as he was about to turn around and leave this place of trouble, the giant beast actually spoke human language and interrupted, “Save... Save me.”","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang cautiously moved forward. When he was closer, he saw that there was a thick chain tied to the neck of the giant beast.","The chain was deeply embedded in its neck, and its head was almost cut off by its fervent running.","At this moment, the giant beast was already on the verge of death and could not live.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang stopped in front of the mountain-like figure and looked at the chain that was deeply embedded in the bone. After a moment of hesitation, he drew the Tarot DiSine sword and cut the chain in half.","The chains shattered, and the giant beast let out a wail before lying down quietly.","Jian Wushuang did not intend to stay. When he was about to leave, he glanced at the ground from the corner of his eye.","In the middle of the thick chain, a huge iron plate engraved with complex characters came into view.","Jian Wushuang lifted the iron plate and saw the complicated words on it clearly. It was carved by someone and contained the power of rules and restrictions.","The weak giant beast looked up at Jian Wushuang and gave a soft cry. Its eyes were full of fear and horror when it saw the iron plate.","Jian Wushuang did not pay attention to the giant beast’s actions. Instead, he fell into deep thought.","The words on the metal plate should have been carved by a human hand, which meant that this place was definitely not a dead zone. Then what kind of place was this? What would the rules of the Great Dao be like?","No one could answer. In the 600,000 years that Jian Wushuang had been here, the only living thing he had seen was this big fellow."]},{"number":4656,"title":"Chapter 4656 The Demoness of Da Qian (3)","paragraphs":["4656 The Demoness of Da Qian (3)","In the vast forest, a mysterious giant beast with a pitch-black body and a purple tail was flying through the forest.","On the back of this huge beast, a young man dressed like a Ranger was lying on his back, sleeping soundly.","The beast’s soft fur was like mink fur, so Jian Wushuang had been sleeping on its back ever since he subdued it.","Due to the unique characteristics of the giant beast, Jian Wushuang gave it a nice name: ‘Ah Zi’","For more than ten years, the man and the Beast never stopped, running toward the boundary of this realm.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had wanted to learn more about this place from Ah Zi, but it could not give any useful information other than some simple thoughts.","The vast forest was quickly left behind. The further they advanced, the more auras of various living beings gradually increased.","On Ah Zi’s flat and wide back, the drowsy Jian Wushuang suddenly felt a great danger.","He suddenly sat up and saw a huge bird that almost covered the sun flying at a low altitude above the sun. Its pair of eyes, which were surging with green light, locked onto Jian Wushuang almost instantly.","The aura of facing death almost made Jian Wushuang shiver. He slapped Ah Zi’s big head and said, “Run, Ah Zi! Run for your life!”","Ah Zi’s claws dug into the ground and suddenly swept out, like an arrow released from a bow, instantly sweeping thousands of miles away.","However, the huge green bird that covered the sky was even more terrifying. It caught up with Ah Zi almost at the same time.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to pull out the Tarot Divine Sword, the humongous green bird transformed into a graceful figure and fell behind Jian Wushuang.","A slender hand pressed Jian Wushuang’s palm and the Tarot Divine Sword was pushed back into the scabbard.","“Don’t look back. Run...”","A weak voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s ears, and then there was no more sound.","Jian Wushuang was stunned and subconsciously looked back. A blue-haired, beautiful woman in a blue robe and a long dress hugged him tightly from behind. She had already passed out.","Jian Wushuang looked down and saw a palm-sized wound on the chest of the lady in green. Divine blood was flowing out.","After barely recovering from the shock, Jian Wushuang hesitated about whether to throw the woman of unknown origin down. She was obviously being hunted down.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang sighed and did not make up his mind.","He held the lady in green in front of him and pressed his palm against his back, transferring his divine power to her.","As expected, the meridians of the lady in green that contained that kind of energy also rejected the divine power. However, her body did not reject the divine power and was recovering rapidly.","After smelling the restless aura, Ah Zi became even more irritable and fled even faster.","However, the next moment, a deep and sinister voice resounded in the surroundings.","“The b*stards running ahead, if you don’t stop, I’ll blast you all into pieces.”","Oh no! Jian Wushuang cursed in his heart and directly pushed the woman in green in his arms forward. Ah Zi understood his meaning and rolled her into her mouth with a tilt of its head.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang pulled Ah Zi and stopped.","Nearly six figures exuding boundless energy surrounded them from all directions. They all wore loose black robes with golden patterns on the cuffs.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang’s pupils suddenly contracted. The six guys who did not seem to have high status actually had the strength of Half Ancestor realm!","The six figures surrounding Jian Wushuang were not in a hurry to kill him. Instead, they sized him up with a sense of judgment.","“Which sect are you from? Why are you traveling alone in this desolate land?” one of the older men stepped forward and asked in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang had already prepared a script in his mind. He pretended to be timid and said, “I am from the mountains. I have no sect. I was born and raised in the desolate wildlands and have never left this place.”","The elder looked at Jian Wushuang again and said, “Since you have never left this place, let me ask you, have you ever seen a green Luan?”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood that the green Luan He was talking about should be the green-robed lady who had passed out.","“I’ve never seen one before. If there’s any news, I’ll definitely report it to you, My Lords,” Jian Wushuang said in fear.","The elderly man obviously did not want to stay here any longer, but just as he was about to leave, a strong man behind him whispered, “Second Brother, we can’t complete the mission without the green Luan. Why don’t we...”","At this point, they all looked at Jian Wushuang and Ah Zi.","“Forget it. This brat is unlucky. I’ll capture them to make up the numbers,” the Elder ordered, and a total of three streaks of energy formed and shot straight toward the ground.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. He waved his hand and several vast Sword Intents clashed with the three streaks of energy.","How could a Half Ancestor be able to resist a Sword Intent divine power that could content with an Ancestor realm expert?","The vast Sword intent easily shattered the silk and then directly killed the three people closest to it without losing momentum!","Everything happened in the blink of an eye. By the time the Elder reacted, a figure with a cold aura of death had already arrived behind him.","“No, if you kill me, you’ll be offending the entire–”","Without waiting for him to finish, Jian Wushuang directly cut off his neck with his palm.","The remaining two guys, whose legs were shaking like screening chaff, were also killed by Jian Wushuang.","From the beginning to the end, six Half Ancestors were all killed in less than ten breaths.","As soon as he landed on the ground, Jian Wushuang saw that the woman in green, who was hidden in Ah Zi’s mouth, was sitting on Ah Zi’s head and looking at him with interest.","She did not look injured at all.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, the lady in green jumped down from Ah Zi’s head, raised her eyebrows, and said with a smile, “I didn’t know you were so strong.”","Jian Wushuang glanced at her from the corner of his eyes. Obviously, he did not have a good impression of her, so he immediately left.","The green-robed lady was taken aback, and then she hurriedly said, “Hey, I haven’t thanked you yet!”","“Go away, demoness!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","The green-robed woman was immediately flustered. “You brat, you actually dare to call me a demoness? I will make you pay for this!”","With that, a few green powers flew out of her sleeves and headed straight for Jian Wushuang.","“You’re too noisy!” He waved his hand and shot out a ray of divine power, instantly shattering the green power.","The entire forest was shaking."]},{"number":4657,"title":"Chapter 4657 Meeting Cosmos God Again","paragraphs":["4657 Meeting Cosmos God Again","When the Emerald green power was offset, the lady in green was extremely shocked.","“Who are you?” After taking a deep breath, the lady in green transformed into a pair of green wings and flew to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“A passerby.” Jian Wushuang was concise and comprehensive. It was obvious that he did not want to get entangled with her.","Obviously, the woman in green did not realize this. She immediately sat on Ah Zi’s back.","The curiosity in her eyes grew as she looked at Jian Wushuang, “A passerby? I’ve never seen anyone use the kind of energy you just used. It’s really mysterious!”","Ignoring her words, Jian Wushuang looked at the same chain and token on her neck that was exactly the same as Ah Zi.","Sensing Jian Wushuang’s gaze, the lady in green hurriedly hugged herself and said, “You’re despicable!”","His face was full of black lines, but he could only say patiently, “I’m looking at that iron plate!”","The green-robed woman smiled awkwardly and then grabbed the metal plate on her neck. “You’re talking about this? It’s the plate used to bind and record the number. It’s all thanks to that bastard!”","Without saying anything else, Jian Wushuang pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword, picked up the iron token, and easily cut off the iron chain.","The green-robed lady’s eyes widened in disbelief as she looked at the metal medallion that had been broken into two. “H-how is this possible? Even I can’t break this metal plate...”","“Just because you can’t do it doesn’t mean others can’t. Alright, you can leave now. I’m ready to leave too,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“My name is Qingluan.” The lady in green nodded. “Thank you for saving me. I will definitely repay you in the future.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Let’s not talk about that. Let me ask you, do you know any way to leave this universe?”","“So there really are other universes apart from this one,” the woman named Qing Luan said in surprise.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. “Do you have any way to leave? I’ve been here long enough.”","Qingluan stopped talking, as if she had made a decision. Finally, she nodded and said, “I can, but with my ability, I can only tear a gap at most.”","Jian Wushuang did not have any hope. He immediately nodded and said, “That’s enough, that’s enough!”","Qiangluan nodded. “Then, take me to the place where you first came from.”","Unable to contain his excitement, Jian Wushuang immediately led Qingluan and directed Ah Zi to gallop back to the place where he first came from.","Jian Wushuang was eager to return to the Divine Power Universe. 600,000 years was probably enough to wipe out the memories of most people.","All he could do was seize the slightest opportunity and return to the Divine Power Universe.","More than ten years later, the two humans and one beast arrived at their original location.","Looking at the crater that had become a huge lake, Jian Wushuang sighed with emotion. Who would have thought that he had come to an unknown universe and lay there for 600,000 years?","“Did you first enter from here?” Qingluan asked. At the same time, wisps of strange green energy surged around her body.","Jian Wushuang nodded and pointed at a direction with great precision.","“To be honest, I’m afraid you’ll be the first and last person to break into the Great Yan Domain on your own. I can’t imagine it. Qing Yuan shrugged. anyway, I wish you good luck.","‘Great Yan Domain? It sounds a little weird,’ Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","The next moment, Qingluan let out a long cry and her entire body turned into a sky-covering green bird that soared into the sky.","She pecked at the void with her emerald-green beak, and ripples appeared in the void.","Then, a crack the size of a needle appeared. The Qingluan tore it apart with all her might, and the crack immediately expanded to an inch long.","“Now!” Qingluan cried.","Jian Wushuang patted Ah Zi’s big head and then leaped toward the crack.","The violent aura of the space-time turbulence emerged again. Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and cupped his hands at Qingluan. “Thank you for your help. We don’t owe each other anything now.”","Qingluan, who had returned to her human form, smiled faintly. “Alright, we don’t owe each other anything.”","“If you can, send Ah Zi to a more desolate place. Don’t let it be caught again,” Jian Wushuang added, and then strode into the space-time turbulence.","“Wait a moment!” Qingluan suddenly called out to him, “Will we meet again in the future?”","“I’m afraid we won’t have the chance to meet again.” After taking one last look at Qingluan, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and disappeared into the space-time turbulence.","Looking at the sealed space-time crack, Qing Yuan stood there in a daze. She only left after a long time.","This ancient and desolate savage land had returned to peace. If it was not for the fact that a young Ranger had accidentally entered this place for 600,000 years, it would probably have remained silent.","As soon as Jian Wushuang stepped into the space-time turbulence, the turbulent astral wind that could even cut the divine soul attacked him again.","To Jian Wushuang’s surprise, although the chaotic astral wind was as terrifying as before, it did not hurt him as much as before.","This change made him extremely excited. At least, he did not have to worry about dying in this space-time turbulence all of a sudden.","As he watched the tiny light spot behind him disappear, Jian Wushuang leaped into the turbulence and searched for the aura of the Divine Power Universe carefully.","As he continued to search, a faint and familiar aura came from an unknown direction. It was like a coordinate that guided Jian Wushuang forward.","It was that aura that allowed Jian Wushuang to change his route and move forward with difficulty in the space-time turbulence.","It was unknown how many years they had been traveling in the turbulent flow, but that incomparably intimate aura had also become more and more intense.","When Jian Wushuang suddenly crossed a turbulence, a figure sitting in space-time appeared in front of him.","“C-Cosmic God!” Jian Wushuang was completely shocked. Looking at the figure sitting there, he could not think.","Cosmic God, who had sealed Void God in the space-time turbulence with his own body slowly opened his eyes.","It was as though a trillion years had passed. Cosmos God smiled, “Little Friend Wushuang, we meet again.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned red and he charged at Cosmos God.","In his eyes, that kind elder had already gone through too much.","“Little Friend, get up quickly. This old man can’t endure this bow of yours.” Cosmos God helped Jian Wushuang up and smiled. “You’re already the master of the rules of the heaven and earth. I can’t be worthy of your bow anymore.”","“A teacher for a day, a teacher for life. It is also a rule for a disciple to bow to a teacher,” Jian Wushuang said. He knelt on one knee and bowed solemnly to Cosmos God."]},{"number":4658,"title":"Chapter 4658 Becoming an Ancestor Realm Expert While Lying Down","paragraphs":["4658 Becoming an Ancestor Realm Expert While Lying Down","Cosmos God’s eyes were filled with relief and heartache as he helped Jian Wushuang up.","“You’ve matured,” Cosmos God said emotionally. “You’ve already grown from a Young Friend who listened to the Dao in the Cloud Palace to a true Cosmos God.”","Jian Wushuang laughed bitterly, “The world has changed. I’ve been away for over 500,000 years. I don’t know what will happen to the Divine Power Universe in the meantime.”","Upon hearing this, Cosmos God smiled, “There’s no need to worry. The laws of the Great Dao are different. The 500,000 years that you have experienced might not be as long in another universe. You can still make it in time.”","He nodded thoughtfully. “It’s still not too late...”","“Go back. I’ll show you the way. The Divine Power Universe can’t do without you.” With a smile, Cosmos God extended his withered palm and pointed in a certain direction.","Jian Wushuang said anxiously, “Teacher, now that I have seen you in the space-time turbulence, how can you not return with me? The Divine Power Universe needs you.”","Cosmos God shook his head slowly, “I can’t go back anymore. My life source has already dried up. If I hadn’t been waiting for your arrival here, I would have died long ago.”","As if to confirm his words, the figure of Cosmos God started to dim rapidly. He started to shatter from the bottom of his feet, just like countless stars scattering.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He quickly released his divine power in an attempt to stabilize Cosmos God’s body. However, it was of no use.","“The last thing I can do is to send you back to the Divine Power Universe.” Cosmos God smiled and nodded. At the same time, he pushed Jian Wushuang away gently.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were bloodshot. He looked at Cosmos God who had already disappeared into the space-time turbulence and knew that he could no longer go back.","Countless tiny rays of light gathered to form a river that extended into the distance.","After adjusting his dejected state of mind, Jian Wushuang leaped and ran into the distance.","The silver river formed by Cosmos God’s body finally stopped before a vortex before it dissipated completely.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang stepped into the vortex.","Countless rays of light rose and turned into thousands of ribbons.","He only felt an indescribable invisible restraint pressing down on his body. Then, he had an Epiphany. That was the Heavenly Dao law that belonged to the entire Divine Power Universe. Even if he reached the Ancestor realm, he could not defy it.","The darkness before his eyes instantly cleared up. In the blue starry sky, a figure dressed in a black Ranger’s outfit stood in the distance.","The surging divine power completely replenished his almost dried-up meridians, and the divine power derived from nearly a hundred Star Fields was supplied to him.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. The rules of Great Dao flowed around him, and the lightning snake floated above his head like a divine punishment. He looked extremely majestic.","He was worried that everything had changed.","After standing still for a long time, Jian Wushuang decided to face it.","As he traveled through the deserted star area, Jian Wushuang soon felt that something was wrong.","There was not a single trace of life in the nearly 10,000 Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms. One had to know that even the Star Fields in the extreme north of the universe had been explored.","However, how could there be no sects living in this Star Field with abundant divine power and no bad turbulence?","Could it be that in the years that he was gone, a tremendous change had already happened?","With doubts in his mind, Jian Wushuang flew across the starry sky. He wanted to rush to the extraterritorial battlefield to see his old friends and the unfinished business.","Finally, after crossing hundreds of millions of star areas, Jian Wushuang felt a Star Field Divine Kingdom with the aura of living beings.","He was close to a relatively prosperous and vast Star Field. It was filled with divine power and good luck, which was very suitable for cultivation.","Walking among the mountains, Jian Wushuang came to the biggest sect in the Divine Kingdom of the Star Field — the True Sword Sect.","There was some history between them. During the battle of the Great Catastrophe War, the True Sword Sect sent out seven Supreme realm experts. Their Sect Master, Elder Yue Zhi, was a Half Invincible Supreme martial artist, and had a brief discussion with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang went straight to the True Sword Sect. However, he found it strange that there was not a single Ultimate Ruler realm expert among the hundreds of thousands of disciples in the Divine Kingdom.","“Who is it, and why are you here?” a red-lipped, white-teethed boy holding a sword walked out from behind the mountain Gate and asked Jian Wushuang curiously.","“I’m a disciple of the Divine Life Palace, and an old friend of your Sect Master. I’m here to ask about some things,” Jian Wushuang cupped his hands and said.","The sword-wielding boy’s eyes flashed with a touch of sadness. Then he raised his head and said, “Senior, please go back. My Sect Master died in the Offworld Battlefield 200 years ago. Six Elders also died with him.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. He sighed in his heart and finally said, “I see that your sect has almost no disciples at the Ultimate Ruler realm. Why is that?”","The sword-wielding boy continued, “The new Cosmos God has ascended and is calling for the entire universe. All Ultimate Rulers are to head to the Cangwu Platform and sit on praying mats to listen to his teachings. The remaining 100 or so Ruler realm Senior Brothers in my clan have already rushed there to listen to his teachings.”","When Jian Wushuang heard this, he was stunned for a moment. But he soon understood. During the period of time that he had disappeared, Lu Ding had claimed the position of the new Cosmos God.","Jian Wushuang had no objection to this. After all, the Divine Power Universe could not go a day without a master. Lu Ding was a generous, kind person and had the demeanor of a Lord. He was far more suitable to be Cosmos God than Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, opening up the Cangwu Platform’s prayer mats was a great act of kindness after the battle of the Great Catastrophe.","“In addition, I would like to ask you one more thing. How many years has it been since the last Great Catastrophe?” He asked, feeling a little apprehensive.","“About 200 years,” The sword-wielding boy said after some thought.","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “In that case, I won’t bother you anymore.”","The boy holding the sword lowered his head and smiled.","He took two steps back and stopped. Then, he turned around to face the entire True Sword Sect and sprinkled down a layer of vast divine power halo.","The sword-wielding boy felt warm all over his body. Then, the layers of shackles in his body were broken, and his divine power rose crazily like bamboo shoots after a rain.","A pillar of red light rose up and dyed the space around him a dozen miles. Everything was shrouded in a hazy divine power.","This red-lipped and white-teethed sword-wielding boy had shed his mortal body and entered the Supreme realm.","With a ‘plop’” he fell to the ground in a daze, then stood up and looked into the distance.","In the misty clouds, there was no trace of the newcomer.","Above the starry sky, Jian Wushuang looked back at the True Sword Sect and then smiled helplessly.","“I’m already at the Ancestor realm, huh...”","He had slept for 600000 years under the vast universe and reached the Ancestor realm when he returned to the Divine Power Universe.","This time, he really became an Ancestor while lying down.","Only 200 years had passed, so there was still time."]},{"number":4659,"title":"Chapter 4659 Great Void Divine Emperor Had Died","paragraphs":["4659 Great Void Divine Emperor Had Died","The clouds and smoke were ethereal, and divine power was vast.","At this moment, only a flesh-colored cauldron remained on the Cangwu Platform that was situated above the entire Rodu.","Behind the furnace, there were thousands of lotus peaks. In the center of the lotus peak, Lu Ding was as warm and gentle as it had been 200 years ago.","However, what was surging around him was no longer a vast divine power, but an unknown power and aura. He looked even more unfathomable.","In this huge hall of the Cangwu Platform, the cauldrons were filled with spiritual movement and exuberant vitality.","For the second time, almost all the Last Flames in the universe was gathered. A total of five million cultivators were thrown into the strange flesh-colored cauldron.","Each and every cultivator’s voice and appearance could be seen in the rising clouds and smoke.","In the 200 years since then, close to 10 million cultivators had died in the flesh-colored furnace.","Looking at the cloud and smoke rising from the furnace, a sinister smile emerged on Lu Ding’s face.","The furnace slowly transformed, and in the blink of an eye, it turned into a pure white body. On the head of the body, a strange face that resembled both men and women slowly grew.","Lu Ding waved his hand and his physical body floated in front of him.","He stood up slowly and walked around the body, admiring it. Then, he cut open the abdomen with his finger.","Dark red blood that was filled with vast divine power gushed out.","That strange body had surpassed the Half Ancestor level, and it was only one step away from the Ancestor level.","“Just one last step, one last step... You’ll have your heart.” With a wave of his hand, he closed the hollow abdomen and put on a long Confucian robe over the body.","At first glance, he actually looked 70 to 80 percent similar to Lu Ding.","At the same time, the main door of the Cangwu Platform’s giant hall slowly opened, and a somewhat haggard-looking Lu Ting strolled into the hall.","He raised his head and glanced at Lu Ding and the strange body, then lowered his head again.","“How is it? Haven’t any of them arrived yet?” Lu Ding said in a deep voice, his eyes unable to hide his anger.","Lu Ting shook his head. “I haven’t received any reply from any sect so far. I’m afraid...”","Lu Ding did not say anything more. He closed his eyes and pondered.","A moment later, he said, “Spread the news that I already know about Jian Wushuang. At the same time, tell them that the Spring of Chaos in Rodu is fluctuating abnormally.”","“What’s wrong?”","Taking in a deep breath, Lu Ting said, “In recent years, there have been some bad rumors from the Great Void Temple. They say that you are using the excuse of passing along teachings of the Great Dao to attract countless cultivators to die in order to cultivate your evil path...”","Lu Ding was expressionless as he said, “It’s been 200 years. It’s time for me to go out and take a walk. Second Brother, continue to do as I say. I’ll personally make a trip to the Great Void Temple to retrieve an item.”","Lu Ting nodded and quickly ran out of the giant hall.","A moment later, Lu Ding and the strange body behind him disappeared as well.","“What? There’s news of Jian Wushuang?!”","In the Red Sky Star Field, Feng Qi jumped up from the fiery throne, staring at the messenger of the Qilin clan. “Are you telling the truth?”","The envoy from the Qilin race had a pale expression. Without any hesitation, he nodded his head. “Cosmos God said so himself. At the same time, the Spring of Chaos in Rodu has also begun to fluctuate.”","After asking the envoy some more questions, Feng Qi immediately rushed to the Cangwu Platform.","“Matriarch...” Feng Xiao hesitated, “Aren’t you worried that this news is fake?”","Feng Qi was startled, but then she said firmly, “If he dares to lie to me, I’ll skin him alive even if I die!”","Seeing Feng Qi walk out of the Crimson Sky Hall first, Feng Xiao gritted his teeth and directly led more than 1,000 Supreme martial artists to follow her and head to the Cangwu Platform.","At the same time, the Dragon clan, which had its Heavenly Gate tightly shut, was also opened, with a group led by Long Yan and Long Chi to the Cangwu Platform.","In the dark hall, the sun never shone in.","In a place where the light could barely be seen, a figure dressed in black and gold was sitting quietly.","Behind this figure, there were nearly a hundred other figures.","“I told you to leave. Why didn’t you leave?” Great Void Divine Emperor opened his eyes slowly and said calmly.","An Elder holding a staff took a step forward and cupped his hands. “Your Highness, all the disciples of the Great Void Temple should leave. Those who should die are already dead. The remaining old guys will accompany Your Highness for the last time.”","“Since that’s the case, let’s walk the final path together,” Emperor God Taixu stood up slowly and looked at the figures, ” but before that, you have to help me do one last thing. Warn the dragon clan and Phoenix Clan, as well as the divine Palace of life, not to go to the Cangwu Platform.","“Yes.” The old man cupped his hands in acknowledgment and then disappeared into the sky with nearly a hundred figures.","Looking at the empty hall, Great Void Divine Emperor left and stood outside the Great Void Temple.","For seven consecutive days, it was only when the clouds in the sky had darkened and a giant face that was changing the Great Dao fell that Great Void Divine Emperor opened his eyes slowly.","The clouds collapsed, and the moon and stars shattered. A figure that seemed to have inherited the Heavenly Dao appeared under the giant face.","Immense divine power interweaved with the rules of Great Dao. The moment Lu Ding appeared, Great Void Divine Emperor realized that he was suppressed to the point where he could not move at all.","With the arrival of Lu Ding, his unabashed Ancestor realm aura could almost wipe out an entire dimension with ease.","Behind him stood a strange-looking figure.","Looking at this existence that was already at the peak of cultivation, Great Void Divine Emperor’s expression remained extremely calm, “Aren’t you afraid that Jian Wushuang will come back and settle the score with you in the future?”","Lu Ding walked towards him slowly, a dark look growing in his eyes. “Jian Wushuang? Who the hell was he?! I’m the Savior of the entire Divine Power Universe. Instead of thanking me, you’re all avoiding me?”","Great Void Divine Emperor laughed coldly, “Savior? Don’t you think that it’s very shameless to say that?”","Lu Ding was not angry. He just said coldly, “Say what you want to say. I’ll send you on your way myself later.”","“Do you know what I regret the most? I just didn’t let Jian Wushuang kill you in the last battle.” Great Void Divine Emperor said calmly, “None of them realized it except for me. Although you are from the Divine Power Universe, the energy that is mixed in the divine power you use is the same as Devouring Emperor of the Void Universe.”","Hearing this, Lu Ding chuckled. “You’re smart indeed, but it’s too late.”","After saying that, Lu Ding extended his palm and clenched it in the air. The power of the rules of the Great Dao crushed Great Void Divine Emperor’s heart directly."]},{"number":4660,"title":"Chapter 4660 All the Supreme Martial Artists Gather","paragraphs":["4660 All the Supreme Martial Artists Gather","His chest caved in, and even the essence of the Invincible Supreme was instantly shattered.","The destruction of the life source meant that there was no turning back.","A stream of divine blood flowed out from the corner of Great Void Divine Emperor’s mouth and his face turned red.","“You will regret everything you have done. You won’t even have the chance to redeem yourself,” he said slowly.","Lu Ding felt both disgust and fear towards this man, who was merely an Invincible Supreme, yet had never shown the slightest fear towards him from the beginning.","Just as Lu Ding was about to consume him, an extremely sharp spear directly stabbed into the strange body like a flash of lightning.","Countless shrill screams rang out, and a vast amount of Blood Qi gushed out.","Great Void Divine Emperor’s tensed face finally broke out in laughter. The spear that had accompanied him in his battle for the eternal chaos cycles helped him get the final laugh in the end.","Lu Ding could not remain calm any longer and he crushed Great Void Divine Emperor into powder. After that, he used his divine power to seal the crack on the chest of his corporeal body.","“Damn bastards, all of you can go to hell!” Lu Ding was furious. He waved his hand and suppressed the entire Star Field, turning it into dust.","An Invincible Supreme of a generation, Great Void Divine Emperor, died just like that.","He, who had participated in several Great Catastrophes and did not die in the Offworld Battlefields, eventually died in the hands of the new Cosmos God.","The Star Domain collapsed, and the planes that had existed for countless chaos cycles finally vanished.","Lu Ding’s figure disappeared. He could not wait to rush to the Cangwu Platform. There must have been hundreds of thousands of Supreme martial artists gathered there, as well as several Half Ancestors.","...","After hearing that Jian Wushuang could possibly return from the Spring of Chaos, over 100,000 Supreme itinerant cultivators from all the Star Fields in the Divine Power Universe gathered here after several years.","Led by the Dragon clan and the Phoenix Clan, all the Supreme powerhouses who had participated in the last battle of the Great Catastrophe were gathered in front of the Cangwu Platform.","Their faces were no longer filled with the silence they had when they first entered the Offworld Battlefield, but with excitement and anticipation.","In just a short two to three hundred years, many Supreme martial artists who had yet to recover from their injuries had all come.","Not for anything else, but to hear some news about that person.","Feng Qi and the two Half Ancestors of the Dragon clan stood at the forefront of the army, in front of the Cangwu Platform. No one came close.","“Do you think he really has any news about Jian Wushuang?” Feng Qi looked at Long Yan and Long Chi with a frown.","“Then why are you here?” Feng Qi asked, puzzled.","“We have to take a gamble. And I have a feeling that Master Wushuang is about to return,” Long Yan said.","Feng Qi curled her lips. “Then why do you think that no one from the Divine Life Palace came?”","Long Yan said, “They have their own concerns. Perhaps they will arrive soon.”","Just as they were speaking, the doors of the Cangwu Platform’s giant hall opened.","The giant figure of the Ancestarl Qilin form, which stretched for thousands of miles, gradually floated up into the sky, showing its Ancestor realm power.","Even Supremes felt a strong sense of worship.","“You guys are here,” the giant ancestral form opened its mouth and said kindly.","At this moment, even Feng Qi, who was extremely repulsed by Lu Ding, could not find any fault with him.","“I’ve already gotten some information about Palace Master Wushuang of the Divine Life Palace. Please come to the Cangwu Platform and find out what’s going on,” Lu Ding said as he extended his hand.","Feng Qi, Long Yan, and Long Chi looked at each other and then said loudly, “Cosmos God, there is no need for us to disturb you in the Cangwu Platform. We are all in a hurry. Please tell us about Jian Wushuang so that we can be mentally prepared.”","As soon as these words were spoken, more than 100,000 Supreme experts echoed in unison. It was obvious that no one had any intention of entering the Cangwu Platform.","Lu Ding’s giant form still looked peaceful. “I’m not too sure when Palace Master Wushuang will return, but recently, I’ve felt Palace Master Wushuang’s aura overflow from the Spring of Chaos.”","“So I’m sure that Palace Master Wushuang will return from the Spring of Chaos in the future. But even I can’t break the seal on the Spring of Chaos. That’s why I want to work together with all of you to break the seal and wait for Palace Master Wushuang’s return.”","Hundreds of thousands of Supreme experts were shaken at this moment. Only Feng Qi, who had participated in that battle, frowned.","As the extreme point of the Divine Power Universe, there was a high possibility that Jian Wushuang would come from the Spring of Chaos if he returned.","However, the seal was personally sealed by Old Master, and even Lu Ding himself could not break it. Could it be broken by gathering the power of more than 100,000 Supreme experts?","She always felt that Lu Ding’s purpose was not that simple, but she could not refute it at the moment.","“Let’s give it a try. Otherwise, there’s no point in us gathering here,” Long Yan said in a low voice.","Feng Qi did not say much. After looking around, she immediately walked into the giant hall of the Cangwu Platform.","Looking at the hundreds of thousands of high-level Supreme experts rushing in, the giant Qilin form remained calm and peaceful, but its lifeless eyes were full of greed.","“The more, the better. This way, my clay idol will fade faster...”","Feeling the warm energy coming from the jade brick under her feet, Feng Qi’s vigilance gradually faded.","“It’s best to be careful. Previously, the emissary from the Great Void Temple said that none of the cultivators who came to the Cangwu Platform returned. They have all disappeared.” Long Yan was beside her, using a secret voice transmission that only the two of them could hear.","Feng Qi replied, “I’ve also heard about it. Instead of letting him come to our door, I’d rather see what he’s up to.”","“Anyway, we must be careful. Palace Master Wushuang’s whereabouts are unknown, and no one from the Divine Life Palace has come. We have to be careful,” Long Yan said in a deep voice.","Lu Ding, who had already materialized, led the way, guiding the crowd.","The further they advanced, the more the ancient and resplendent walls around them shattered. Finally, the giant hall began to disappear.","What replaced it was a broken Star Field. In the center of the broken star field, there was a Spring of Chaos that gave off a dark blue light, rippling like a lake.","This was the ruins of the Rodu Star Field that the Qilin race had once controlled.","Lu Ding leaped forward and then stood on the Spring of the Chaos. Ten thousand rays of yang divine power flickered around him.","“Everyone, please lend me a hand and open the seal together!”","With that, the immense yang divine power transformed into the precious image of a Qilin and crashed into the Spring of Chaos.","Hundreds of thousands of Supreme experts also released their vast divine power at this moment.","A power that was enough to destroy the world exploded above the Spring of Chaos.","The indescribable explosion instantly tore through the imprisonment barrier.","Countless strange energies gushed out like a river flowing backward.","At this moment, the entire billions of miles of space was shrouded in a strange aura that had never been seen before."]},{"number":4661,"title":"Chapter 4661 Wushuang","paragraphs":["4661 Wushuang","With thousands of invisible Great Dao’s on his body, Lu Ding stood high above at the peak of the Spring of Chaos, giving off a demonic aura.","The chaotic energy swept across the entire broken Star Field.","All the Supreme martial artists felt a slight shiver in their hearts.","Seeing that the seal on the Spring of Chaos had been broken, Feng Qi, who had originally planned to stop, suddenly realized that she could no longer control the divine power in her body.","Long Yan and Long Chi’s expressions changed drastically. They also felt that the Spring of Chaos was like an endless black abyss, trying to drag them all in.","Feng Qi suddenly looked at the broken sky and saw a strange figure standing behind Lu Ding. The figure’s facial features were extremely faint, as if they had not grown out yet.","All the Supreme experts’ hearts sank, and the divine power in their bodies poured out uncontrollably.","After absorbing the divine power of nearly 150,000 high-level Supreme realm experts, the strange body behind Lu Ding was growing facial features, hair, meridians, and internal organs rapidly.","The seemingly kind and benevolent Lu Ding had also revealed his ugly face at this moment, his dark and crazy eyes looking down on them.","“To be able to fuse with my clay idol is your greatest honor. Why do you need to resist?” Lu Ding said in an intoxicated manner.","“You f*cking piece of sh*t!” Feng Qi shouted angrily. “You killed more cultivators than the entire Void Universe! You should be hacked into pieces!”","Lu Ding gave a strange smile and slowly bent down. “I’ve said it before. It’s your honor and your destiny. Only by making some contributions to me will I show you mercy and show you a more profound realm.”","“When the time comes, you will realize how lamentable it is for you to be stuck in your own ways.”","Every Supreme martial artist’s body was rapidly declining, and their respective cultivation levels were also starting to decline.","Even Feng Qi, who was a Half Ancestor, could feel her cultivation level dropping.","She tried to get rid of that terrifying power, but she found that it was useless. She could not even mobilize her divine power.","Long Yan and Long Chi were the same, looking at the sky in despair.","As he absorbed the divine power, the strange body behind Lu Ding was filled with energy. His facial features gradually straightened, and his black hair reached his shoulders. Countless fine meridians began to wriggle under his skin.","At the same time, the Great Dao that symbolized the Ancestor realm began to fall on his body.","The vast divine power was like an abyss and a huge sea. Energy that made one’s heart palpitate surged out from the pores of his body.","All the Supreme martial artists had witnessed the birth of an Ancestor realm expert.","Everything was too unbelievable. At most, a universe only had enough fate energy to allow for one Ancestor realm cultivator. How could there be two?","In the next moment, the entire Cangwu Platform’s giant hall, along with the Star Field, could not withstand the descent of the two Ancestor realm experts and directly shattered.","That strange physical body, the moment it reached the Ancestor realm, it completely possessed intelligence.","The fate energy of the universe that he had plundered, as well as the boundless divine power, were all sucked into his mouth. His face, which was exactly the same as Lu Ding’s, was filled with greed.","Looking at the completed clay idol, Lu Ding nodded in satisfaction and said excitedly, “Now, let’s use your bodies as your last contribution.”","With that, countless wisps of extreme yang power emerged from his palm, covering the sky and pressing down heavily.","Feng Qi, who had already fallen to the Supreme realm, did not have the power to fight back and could only watch herself die.","However, in the next moment, an even more vast and mysterious divine power suddenly swept over. Like a biting cold wind, it directly crushed the net-like ultimate yang power.","Lu Ding suddenly turned his head and looked fiercely at the place where the attack had come from. With one look, his eyes narrowed.","In the completely shattered void, a total of more than 50,000 Supreme martial artists broke through the fog and arrived in an earth-shattering manner.","At the forefront of the majestic army, Supreme Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, Supreme Jun Fu, and the other representatives of the Divine Life Palace were all dispatched.","At the same time, in front of them were two figures completely covered in loose black robes, giving Lu Ding an invisible pressure.","“Old man Lu Ding, you should know that even though you are an Ancestor realm being, you only have one life.”","The majestic voice carrying the divine punishment of the Nine Heavens resounded. The mysterious figure at the front slowly pulled down the hood on his head, revealing a determined and pure face. The brilliant golden patterns floating in his hair made him look like a majestic God that could not be looked at directly.","“Jian Wushuang! How could it be you?” Lu Ding cried out.","At this moment, all of the 100,000 Supreme realm cultivators, who had been trapped and fallen into great despair, were ecstatic.","Even though he had disappeared for nearly 300 years, Jian Wushuang’s appearance was like a calming pill for everyone.","“If it wasn’t for me, were you planning to wipe out the entire divine universe?”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and his divine power, which was close to crushing, swept up like a Heavenly River.","Ancestor realm aura!","Feng Qi looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief with her eyes wide open.","He had only disappeared for 300 years. How could he become an Ancestor realm cultivator in such a short time?","Lu Ding’s face was extremely gloomy. He waved his sleeve to offset the influence of Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, he had already thought of retreating.","Jian Wushuang’s ferocity was clear to Lu Ding in the last battle. He was a terrifying existence who could kill Void God with the power of a Half Ancestor realm.","Now that he was Ancestor realm, his power had probably transcended the restrictions of the universe.","At the thought of this, Lu Ding immediately pushed the clay idol and tried to escape.","Whoosh...","A wave of Black Water ripples spread out between heaven and earth, and under the wide black robe, Old Master’s face appeared.","Lu Ding’s figure stopped in place for a moment.","Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows were tightly knitted together as he slashed down with the Tarot Divine Sword.","The unparalleled sword radiance that seemed to be able to split the heavens and earth apart slashed at Lu Ding.","Lu Ding had no choice but to fight Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, if you leave now, I will let bygones be bygones. If you continue to be stubborn, you will die!” Lu Ding said ruthlessly as he struck out with his palm and used the infinite power of extreme yang to offset the sword radiance.","Jian Wushuang laughed coldly, “Destroy your own life source now, and I can spare your Qilin clan from extermination for the crimes you committed. Otherwise, I will not spare a single one of your entire clan!”","“Jian Wushuang, do you really think you can defeat me?” Lu Ding was furious. He swung his palm at Jian Wushuang and shouted, “Kill him!”","At the same time, the strange clay idol behind him also laughed eerily. Controlling its still stiff body, it also slapped down.","An aura as deep as the abyss was revealed.","With the Tarot Divine Sword in front of him, Jian Wushuang broke through the Ancestor realm power with one move. His Sword Dao, which had long reached the perfection of martial arts, suddenly rushed toward the clay idol, which was closer to him."]},{"number":4662,"title":"Chapter 4662 Suppressing the Ancient Era, Ascending to Become Cosmos God (1)","paragraphs":["4662 Suppressing the Ancient Era, Ascending to Become Cosmos God (1)","Lu Ding was startled. At this moment, he almost gave up all his thoughts and stretched out his arm to block the clay idol.","Swish...","The sound of the blade cutting into flesh rang out. Under the Tarot Divine Sword’s blade, which could even cut off the Laws of the Great Dao, Lu Ding’s entire arm was cut off from the root. Divine blood with Ancestor realm aura scattered in the void.","Groaning in pain, Lu Ding summoned the giant Qilin and forced Jian Wushuang to retreat.","His body trembled, and his severed left arm grew out again. Lu Ding looked at him with eyes full of hatred.","“Fine, fine. Since you want to die so badly, I’ll send you to reincarnation realm today!”","In the next moment, the sky-covering Qilin transformed into flowing fire stars and scattered.","Lu Ding stood where he was, absorbing the divine light of the Qilin form. At the same time, the countless fire stars were like a curtain of rain, enveloping him within.","Every tiny stream of fire turned into a scale, adorning Lu Ding’s body.","Melting stones into armor, turning flames into robes.","With the Great Dao supporting his body, he was like the first Qilin King Ancestor, shaking the world.","With a raise of his hand, the power of yang burned deep marks in the void.","Lu Ding’s body was wrapped in flowing flames. He condensed a ball of fire that was like the sun in his hand and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes focused, and he was not afraid at all. With the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand, he stepped forward to meet the attack.","A light green invisible barrier surged around Jian Wushuang. The two of them collided and a brilliant and terrifying divine power fire burst out!","It was as if a vast rain of fire had descended. All the Supremes of the Divine Life Palace unleashed their divine abilities to protect the 150,000 Supremes realm experts who had been weakened to a certain extent.","“Thank you, Divine Life Palace, for your timely assistance. Otherwise, I’m afraid we would have all died here today,” Feng Qi said with lingering fear as she looked at Supreme Xue Bo and the others.","Supreme Xue Bo nodded and smiled. “You should thank Palace Master Wushuang. If he hadn’t decided to set off immediately, I’m afraid we would have needed dozens of days to hear the news.”","Feng Qi’s face blushed. She did not know if it was because of her injuries or some other reason. Then, she said in a low voice that only she could hear, “I naturally have to thank him alone.”","Above the shattered Void, three Ancestor realm experts were fighting, and even the distant starry sky was torn apart.","Jian Wushuang was not at a disadvantage at all even though he was fighting against two people. Every time he struck, he could create a deep gully on Lu Ding’s flame melting armor.","As for the clay idol that looked exactly like Lu Ding, its body was like a ghost. Every time it attacked, it would bring with it countless sorrowful wails, which sounded extremely strange and terrifying.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate floated in the void, and its brilliant divine power illuminated the world.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had performed an Ancestral Skill since he became an Ancestor realm expert. A giant finger that reached the sky came down.","The attack that was far beyond what he had comprehended earlier caused Lu Ding’s eyes to narrow. He retreated quickly almost subconsciously.","However, the clay idol did not react at all. Instead, it raised its palm and prepared to meet the blow.","“Don’t!”","Lu Ding, who was retreating rapidly, rushed back almost madly when he saw this. He did not care that the heavenly finger had already descended, and he immediately pushed the clay idol out.","Boom boom boom!","With one finger, even the void was easily destroyed. Lu Ding, who had transformed into a giant Qilin, roared angrily. His two arms wrapped around the tip of his finger and engaged in a crazy contest of strength.","All the cultivators were watching the shocking battle between the Ancestor realm experts.","Above the broken void, it was as if thousands of suns had risen, and extremely bright light swallowed and covered everything.","Under the radiance of light, even Half Ancestors could not look at it directly.","Time seemed to have stopped, and only the light was eternal.","In the bright sun, the Tarot Divine Sword slowly returned to its sheath. Jian Wushuang stood in the same place, his face calm, as if everything that happened next was within his expectations.","The extreme light produced by the explosion dissipated, and the void shattered even more.","In the center of the most broken area, a miserable figure knelt down.","The power of yang in his body dissipated, and that huge figure that was like a demonic god had already returned to its original state.","The fire melting armor was also completely shattered. In the process of blocking, the Ancestor realm divine body also injured its origin.","Divine blood gushed out from every pore of Lu Ding’s body, making him look like a blood man.","Jian Wushuang walked slowly to him, not worried that he would attack.","He coughed out a large mouthful of divine blood and stared at Jian Wushuang with undying unwillingness in his eyes. “I really didn’t expect that you would grow to such a terrifying level in less than three hundred years. Even if I shed my body, I can’t compare to you?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as calm as water. He suppressed his anger and said, “You have already advanced to the Ancestor realm and are Cosmos God of the entire Divine Power Universe. Why did you kill nearly ten million cultivators so cruelly?”","“Those guys?” Lu Ding chuckled. “They’re just a bunch of ants. It’s a kind of sublimation for them to integrate into my body.”","“Jian Wushuang, your growth is far beyond my imagination. As long as you let me go, I will tell you a big secret. Are you only willing to waste your time guarding this place?” Lu Ding struggled to get up, his eyes full of the desire to live.","Jian Wushuang did not speak anymore. Instead, he stretched out a finger and pointed at him.","In an instant, the rules of the Great Dao were shattered, and the divine power was forcibly extracted from Lu Ding’s body. The Ancestor realm fate energy was completely returned to the universe.","The Ancestor realm origin that contained countless Great Dao comprehensions was also removed by Jian Wushuang.","Lu Ding stood up shakily, and his crazed eyes became clear, which was a rare sight.","“Jian Wushuang, if you want to find the ethereal realm one day, you will definitely repeat my mistake.”","“When the time comes, I’ll be looking forward to seeing your decision.”","After saying this, Lu Ding’s divine body shattered and turned into countless ancient stars, scattering all over the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Lu Ding, who had become the Cosmos God of the Divine Power Universe 300 years ago, and killed tens of millions of cultivators in the Divine Power Universe, had been destroyed by Jian Wushuang.","What Lu Ding had done was even worse than what the Void Universe had done.","The Last Flames of the universe, over ten million of them were all killed by Lu Ding.","The Divine Power Universe was on the verge of collapse.","Even if he had killed Lu Ding, it would not be enough to offset the consequences of his actions.","Jian Wushuang found it hard to understand how the easy-going and generous Lu Ding had become like this.","At that moment, Lu Ding’s clay idol, who had also been seriously injured by the finger, stood up slowly. After taking a deep look at Jian Wushuang, it turned into a black light and scattered among the stars.","As it was too fast, it had completely disappeared before anyone could react."]},{"number":4663,"title":"Chapter 4663 Suppressing the Ancient Era, Ascending to Become Cosmos God (2)","paragraphs":["4663 Suppressing the Ancient Era, Ascending to Become Cosmos God (2)","The clay idol, which had everything about Lu Ding, and was even more bizarre and cunning, had disappeared just like that.","Jian Wushuang was shocked, but when he wanted to look for it, he realized that he could not find it.","After all, the Divine Power Universe was too vast. Even a Star Field or Divine Kingdom was just a drop in the ocean.","The disappearance of the clay idol was like a hidden danger that was deeply imprinted in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","However, none of the Supreme realm experts cared about that. They only cared about Jian Wushuang’s return!","From the moment Lu Ding ascended to the position of Cosmos God, all the Supremes who had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War and survived had all gone into seclusion in their respective sects.","In their hearts, only one person was qualified to become the next Cosmos God.","A total of 200,000 Supreme martial artists surrounded Jian Wushuang like a tide.","Looking at the Supremes experts, whose realms and divine power had been exhausted to a certain extent, Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand to send down the Laws of fate energy.","In just an instant, they had all returned to the peak of their cultivation realms.","Feeling the abundant divine power in their bodies, all the Supreme martial artists half-knelt on the ground, cupped their hands, and said in unison, “Thank you, Palace Master Wushuang!”","Then, Feng Qi looked at Jian Wushuang with her beautiful eyes and chuckled, “They all call you Palace Master Wushuang, but I don’t want to. How about I call you Lord Cosmos God?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned and then waved his hand hurriedly, “Don’t joke around. I’m definitely not up to the task.”","The rest of the people also understood tacitly. Supreme Xue Bo cupped his hands and said, “Palace Master Wushuang, the Divine Power Universe can’t go a day without a master. The Divine Power Universe is not completely stable now, and it needs someone to lead it. Besides Palace Master Wushuang, no one else is qualified to do so.”","Long Yan and Long Chi also cupped their hands. “The Dragon clan has also come to request Palace Master Wushuang to ascend to the position of Cosmos God.”","Jian Wushuang ddi not say anything. He looked at the broken and barren Star Fields and then at the cultivators who had been running around. Finally, he slowly lifted the corners of his mouth and said the simplest word.","“Alright.”","...","The heavens and earth were clear, an auspicious sign.","In the same year, Jian Wushuang, the Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, became the Cosmos God.","The whole world was celebrating.","The entire grand occasion was expected to last for a hundred years.","In the mortal world, old people’s lives were extended by 20 years. From then on, the weather would be smooth for 100 years, and the divine power in the Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms would be ten times more abundant.","The large ancient sects that received the birds gladly sent their disciples who were restricted by their cultivation. Even a few hidden sects also moved out.","It had been nearly 20 years since the great migration of tens of millions of cultivators, whether they ascended on swords or rode on boats and carriages, came to the center of the entire universe — the Cloud Palace.","Every cultivator who came here was shocked by the scene in front of them.","On the old site of the broken Cloud Palace, a magnificent and majestic Cloud Palace rose up again.","On the hundreds of ancient pillars on both sides of the square, there were a total of 100 true dragons, all of which were at the Supreme realm.","Then, above the clouds, hundreds of fire Phoenixes cried in unison and flew up. Their extremely beautiful tail feathers no longer sprayed down fatal flames, but beautiful tassels.","At the same time, the people who were lined up in the vast square were all Supreme experts who were almighty and powerful.","Every cultivator walked forward with their eyes wide open. Everything they saw was shocking their understanding.","At this moment, there were nearly 200,000 Supreme experts standing in front of the square in front of the palace. Every one of them was smiling from the bottom of their hearts.","They had all participated in the battle of Great Catastrophe and fought side by side with that person. From the mountain of corpses to the sea of blood, they had never retreated.","There were more than five million cultivators who had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe, but only less than 200,000 were left. It could be said to be the most tragic battle in history.","Together, they resisted external enemies and would also witness the arrival of a true Cosmos God.","Lord River Spirit had also changed into a new set of clothes and was guarding the morning bell beside him with a happy expression. He was waiting for the clear and turbid to be determined before he rang the bell.","Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, Jun Fu, and the others all changed into new clothes, waiting for the moment to come with happy expressions.","Old Master was still wearing a black robe, and his cold face had a rare touch of peace.","Almost ten million cultivators from the Divine Power Universe had gathered in the center of the vast square, but no one dared to make a noise.","On both sides of them were the legendary Supreme True Dragons, above their heads was the giant Phoenix, just like the True Dragons, and in front of them were 200,000 terrifying Supreme martial artists waiting for battle...","Even the most talented of Heaven’s Favorites actually had no face to speak of here...","When the clear and turbid Qi of heaven and earth had just separated, Lord River Spirit, who had been waiting for a long time, pushed the morning bell with all his might.","The celestial sound spread to the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","At that moment, all the cultivators were looking at the Cloud Palace, which was located in the clouds and smoke.","The door of the hall slowly opened to the sides, and smoke formed by divine power rose.","A young man in a plain white robe with a Jade Lotus hanging on his waist strolled out.","Around him, seven-colored rainbows of the Great Dao flashed across the sky and the earth. With every step he took, thousands of colorful lotuses bloomed.","The majestic divine patterns flowing through his hair made him look like the embodiment of Laws. His every movement contained the Great Dao.","Behind him was a Daoist boy with red lips and white teeth, his hair tied into two buns.","Lan Lan, who was standing beside Supreme Xue Bo and the others, smiled sincerely when she saw this scene. However, her eyes soon turned red.","She seemed to see another kind of continuation when she looked at Chu Zhi.","All the Supreme realm cultivators could no longer hide their excitement. They half-knelt on the ground and said solemnly, “Civilians of the Divine Power Universe pay their respects to Cosmos God!”","As the atmosphere was unconsciously infected, the nearly ten million cultivators who had gathered here all half-knelt on the ground and said solemnly, “Citizens of the Divine Power Universe pay their respects to Cosmos God!”","Looking at the tens of millions of cultivators on the square and all the Last Flames in the Divine Power Universe, Jian Wushuang laughed happily. He had never felt so good before.","With a wave of his hand, the breeze formed by the Great Dao lifted all the cultivators.","“Everyone, there’s no need to be so formal. Although I’m a Cosmos God, my more important identity is that I’m also a member of the Divine Power Universe.”","“I rose from insignificance. Naturally, I will return the favor.”","“In the past million years, I’ve witnessed the rise and fall of the Divine Power Universe. What shocked me the most was not how terrifying the Void Universe was, but the tenacity of the cultivators who participated in the Great Catastrophe War and saved the Divine Power Universe from defeat after defeat.”"]},{"number":4664,"title":"Chapter 4664 A Tiny Start, Finally the Great Dao","paragraphs":["4664 A Tiny Start, Finally the Great Dao","The eyes that exuded a majestic great Dao slowly looked at every Supreme martial artist in the vast Dao Plaza.","the Void Universe was completely defeated, and our godly power universe finally welcomed peace. The Heavenly Dao reappeared, and order remained.","The celestial music was boundless. Jian Wushuang waved his sleeve and the unparalleled halo of the Great Dao descended. An indescribable mysterious divine power fell on every cultivator.","All of the ten million cultivators who had come to the Cloud Palace, no matter how many chaos cycles they had been stuck in, were able to make a breakthrough here.","A wider path of cultivation appeared in front of every cultivator.","Jian Wushuang, who controlled the Great Dao divine power of the entire universe, also felt the recognition of the universe at that moment.","From Ultimate Rulers to Half Ancestors, everyone felt the subtle changes.","Xue Bo, Feng Qi, Long Yan, Long Chi, and the others all trembled. The unparalleled cultivation that they almost did not dare to look up to and had no way to break through had actually opened for them at this moment!","The Great Dao had been opened to them. Although the fate energy of the Divine Power Universe could no longer support a second Ancestor realm expert, this directly showed that everything that they received from Cosmos God, they had the right to inherit!","Long Yan and Long Chi bowed to Jian Wushuang from the bottom of their hearts.","No one else knew, but they knew that if they had not participated in the war and lost nearly 100,000 of their descendants, the Dragon clan, which looked bright on the outside but was rotten on the inside, would have been wiped out after the Great Catastrophe War.","However, the Dragon Emperor Linhe’s gamble paid off. The Dragon clan would finally receive the protection of the Great Dao from Cosmos Gods. They would no longer be restricted by their cultivation levels and would be able to live forever with the universe.","Tens of thousands of Phoenixes arrived, and they all had rings of fire in their mouths, symbolizing that life and death would not change.","Ninth Kalpa King and the other Invincible Supremes all felt the loosening of their cultivation realm. It was only a matter of time for them to break through to the Half Ancestor realm.","At the same time, all the hidden injuries in the bodies of the Supreme experts who had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War had disappeared, and their cultivation, which had almost stagnated, had advanced to another level.","Even their bloodlines in the future would have a certain level of protection from the Great Dao.","The clouds in the sky rolled and the white clouds faded. Time passed and everything was finally back on the right track.","Clear and bright.","It started from insignificance, was born from the Heavenly Dao, and finally turned the tide when the universe was defeated and destroyed.","Jian Wushuang nodded in respect and finally achieved the Great Dao.","At this moment, the tens of millions of cultivators clasped their hands together devoutly and said in unison, “Cosmos God is kind.”","...","In the meantime, Jian Wushuang, who had become Cosmos God, had a simple meditation session.","Jian Wushuang looked at the Last Flames from the Divine Power Universe and asked a question that he had answered before.","“My Young Friends, what do you think Dao is?”","Everything was brand new, and it was a vigorous continuation.","A hundred years later, Jian Wushuang heaved a long sigh of relief as he looked at the empty Cloud Palace.","There was nothing better than the continuation of the next generation of the Divine Power Universe.","He stood up and stood alone in the vast Daoist Rite temple, waving his hand to repair the broken Great Dao of the Heavens.","The soul essence left behind by Supreme Dao Yan had long grown into a green lotus with a jade root. Jian Wushuang was immersed in the Great Dao all the time, and he had long possessed an ignorant mind.","Another 10,000 years passed. Jian Wushuang did not stop to repair the Great Dao and finally, he finished.","The damage caused by the Void Universe’s invasion had been repaired. Countless Star Fields and Divine Kingdoms had returned to their starting point, and their fate energy was flowing again.","However, it was difficult for the dead to have a chance to be resurrected.","After that, Jian Wushuang summoned Feng Qi, who refused to leave the Cloud Palace.","“What’s the matter, Lord Cosmos God? You’re finally willing to summon us.” Feng Qi, who had changed into a plain robe, walked over among the flowing clouds and looked disdainfully at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang smiled helplessly, then took out the green lotus that he had worn for tens of thousands of years from his waist and handed it to Feng Qi.","“This green lotus is formed from the spiritual essence of the previous Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Dao Yan. He has been comprehending by my side for tens of thousands of years and has long developed intelligence. Now, I ask you to send this green lotus to the human world and let him undergo training.”","Feng Qi nodded. “I’ll send him to a good family?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and laughed. “If you throw the green Lotus into the air, you will throw it to the family where its aura eventually spreads to. This is his good fortune and the foundation of his future cultivation.”","Feng Qi nodded again and smiled. “You are really becoming more and more like a Cosmos God.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled helplessly.","Feng Qi held the green lotus in her hand, and just as she was about to rush to the human world, she said to him softly, “Sleep for a while. We have your back.”","He was slightly startled, but then his expression relaxed. “Yes, it’s time to sleep. I haven’t slept in tens of thousands of years.”","Jian Wushuang walked into the Cloud Palace slowly under the guidance of Chu Zhi.","Before he fell asleep, Jian Wushuang summoned Supreme Xue Bo and the others who were not in seclusion. He asked them to open the Ancient Path of Stars and the Path of the Heavenly Gate, which had stricter rules, so as to start the competition among cultivators.","After that, Jian Wushuang slept for a million years.","In these millions of years, due to the countless luck and blessings he had given, countless rising stars and rare geniuses had all been born by riding on the Heavenly Dao.","Hundreds of millions of cultivators, old and new, were trying to break through the mysterious Heavenly Dao.","A million years later, the Ancient Path of Stars closed slowly. Another hundred peerless geniuses came to the Cloud Palace with longing and excitement.","It was already a great blessing for them to have the opportunity to come to the Cloud Palace. If they could also obtain the right to listen to the Dao on Cosmic God’s futon, they would definitely reach the peak of their cultivation journey in the future!","Lan Lan and Overlord, who was already the Clan Leader of the Overlord clan, were in charge of the Ancient Path of Stars. They were naturally the ones who received the cultivators who passed the assessment.","Even these Heaven’s Favorite experts did not dare to tease this ice-cold emissary Lan Lan. However, they were much more active when it came to the carefree Overlord.","One of the swordsman-like Supremes said in a low voice, “Big brother Overlord, that legendary Lord Cosmos God has really fought alongside you before. He can’t be lying to us, right?”","Overlord, who was about to laugh, was glared at by Lan Lan and quickly covered his mouth.","“Damn you guys, do you know what this place is? If you say one more word, I’ll throw you out...”","For a moment, the vast heavenly Cloud Palace, which was located on the top of the clouds, calmed down again.","What they saw next were countless Supreme martial artists walking out like clouds.","These Supreme experts who had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War a million years ago were legends. They all stayed in Cloud Palace to meditate and comprehend the Dao."]},{"number":4665,"title":"Chapter 4665 The Reason for the Clay Idol","paragraphs":["4665 The Reason for the Clay Idol","More than 100 Heaven’s Favorites were selected from the Ancient Path of Stars. They stayed in the Cloud Palace and reached the Supreme realm after 100,000 years.","They did not see Cosmos God. That was because he had heard from the red-lipped and white-teethed Little Daoist that the Cosmic God was still in deep sleep and had no idea when he would wake up.","However, their goal was no longer the qualifications to sit on the futon and listen to the Dao, but the more desirable disciple’s seat.","The Path of the Heavenly Gate, which was established by Cosmos God and had stricter conditions, was the only way to obtain a seat as Cosmos God’s disciple.","One could only see the top existences of the Divine Power Universe in the great Path of the Heavenly Gate.","It was said that there were True Shadows of existences that surpassed the Invincible Supremes on the Path of the Heavenly Gate. Even if one stepped into it to cultivate, it would be fate.","Countless cultivators yearned to rise above the rest on the Ancient Path of Stars and step into the Path of the Heavenly Gate. Naturally, the competition was far more intense than the Ancient Path of Stars.","Everything was being reborn.","Heavenly Performance Platform, Cloud Palace.","In an exquisite Daoist Rite Temple at the top of the clouds, Old Master, Supreme Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, Feng Qi, Long Yan, Long Chi, and the others were all sitting together, sipping tea and watching the clouds.","Jian Wushuang, who was still in deep sleep, was also sitting on the stage, drinking tea secretly.","“It’s so comfortable here. Drinking tea with my old friends is much more comfortable than teaching the way,” Jian Wushuang said leisurely.","Everyone laughed. Feng Qi curled her lips and said, “You’ve been drinking this tea for more than 100,000 years. Are you still not tired of it?”","Jian Wushuang took another sip with a smile, “Of course not. This tea is a treasure from the Chaos Tea Tree in the True Sword Sect. It’s especially good for the spleen and stomach.”","When the rest of the people heard this explanation, they almost spat out the tea in their mouths.","This guy, who was already standing at the peak of the entire universe and even controlled the Heavenly Dao, actually wanted to drink tea to protect his spleen and stomach.","However, on second thought, the fact that Cosmos Gods liked to drink tea could also be considered a hobby they had found in their boring days.","After drinking tea for more than ten years, Jian Wushuang said seriously, “Everyone, I’ll leave everything in the Cloud Palace to you.”","Putting down his teacup, Supreme Xue Bo asked, “Lord Cosmos God, are you preparing to do this?”","“I’m preparing to head to the heavens and look for that clay idol that disappeared in the Cangwu Platform,” Jian Wushuang said.","Feng Qi hurriedly said, “But it’s already been a million years, and that thing still hasn’t shown any signs of appearing. Could it have already died out?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “It’s because of this that I’m uneasy. If it continues to grow, the consequences will be unimaginable. I don’t want the Divine Power Universe to be in turmoil again.”","Feng Qi’s lips were tightly pursed. Obviously, she also knew the importance of this matter.","After all, Lu Ding’s clay idol was too strange. It was formed by absorbing the blood essence of nearly ten million cultivators.","“I’ll go with you.” Without waiting for Feng Qi to speak, Ninth Kalpa King, who rarely spoke but was extremely serious, spoke.","The current Ninth Kalpa King had already broken through that layer of shackles and reached the terrifying Half Ancestral realm after obtaining Cosmos God’s Great Dao Comprehension a million years ago. His entire person was like a heavy sword that had a hidden edge, but no one dared to question his sharpness.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and patted his shoulder with a smile, “Good Brother, although I want you to go with me, I can’t let you forsake the training at the Path of the Heavenly Gate. You’re helping me by guarding that place.”","“Just let Elder Jun Fu guard that place,” Ninth Kalpa King said.","Supreme Jun Fu shook his head repeatedly. “I’m not going. I’m getting old and I need to rest more before I can continue fighting alongside Cosmos God.”","“You, please help me keep an eye on the Path of the Heavenly Gate. I’ll go with Old Master and finish it quickly. We’ll be back soon.” Jian Wushuang laughed as he hugged Ninth Kalpa King.","“Alright, you have to come back within a million years. By then, the cultivators on the Path of the Heavenly Gate should also come out,” Ninth Kalpa King said.","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile. “Come on, let’s drink for another year. I’ll leave after a year.”","A year later, two figures walked out of the Cloud Palace on the clouds and headed to the clouds.","In the clouds, Jian Wushuang, who was dressed like a Ranger, looked at Old Master beside him and said, “Old Master, I want to ask you something.”","“I know what you want to ask. All the information about that clay idol?” Compared to millions of years ago, Old Master’s unapproachable aura had almost disappeared. At this time, he was like a sect elder who liked to doze off, with a bit of peace.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “I still don’t understand why Lu Ding, who has already reached the peak, would do that.”","“That’s because he has reached the point where he has no choice but to do so.” Old Master looked into the distance and said faintly, “His strength and cultivation realm have already reached a point where it can not be hidden. It has far exceeded the Ancestor realm.”","“What? Beyond the Ancestor realm?” Jian Wushuang was shocked. “There are more than just Ancestor realm experts at the peak of the universe?!”","“If the pinnacle of the universe is the Ancestor realm, then what am I?” Old Master said calmly, “He, who comprehended from the Spring of Chaos, should have naturally borrowed that power and reached the peak of this universe.”","“He controlled that power, so he naturally knew the ultimate truth and the limits of everything. That’s why he used that method.”","“Using the divine blood of billions of living beings to forge a divine body. Using this as the body of the mortal body that you shed, you can retain your complete power and Ascend there.”","Jian Wushuang was shocked. Old Master had made it very clear that the reason why Lu Ding had lured and killed tens of millions of cultivators was to forge a divine body and act as the mortal body that he should have shed so that he could retain all his power.","What exactly was in that unknown place that made Lu Ding so inhumane?","The two of them fell silent. After a long time, Jian Wushuang suddenly said, “Before Lu Ding died, he said something to me. He said that I would also reach this level one day. Is it true?”","Old Master did not answer. Instead, he called Jian Wushuang’s name, which was a rare occurrence. “Wushuang, do you remember the three promises we made?”","Jian Wushuang nodded. “I remember.”","“Then, does it still count?”","“It definitely counts.” Jian Wushuang nodded firmly. Then, he seemed to have understood something and said, “Let’s start after we finish this.”","Old Master smiled and said, “There’s no hurry. I’ve been asleep for god knows how long. It’s fine to wait a little longer.”"]},{"number":4666,"title":"Chapter 4666 Frost Crow Lady","paragraphs":["4666 Frost Crow Lady","The two figures, one old and one young, roamed the universe.","The universe was huge and the rules were uncountable. Although each Heavenly Domain coexisted, they were independent existences.","This naturally made it more difficult for Jian Wushuang and Old Master to find the clay idol.","From then on, their journey would no longer be counted in the thousands of years. The most optimistic estimate was that it would probably take a million years.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was also a little curious. From the fight a million years ago, the Ancestor realm clay idol was ruthless and brutal. There was no reason for it to be isolated and not have any rumors about it.","Jian Wushuang was confident that even if the Ancestor realm clay idol only released its aura for a moment, he would be able to sense it instantly.","However, a million years had passed and the clay idol did not leak any aura. Jian Wushuang began to suspect that the clay idol had died or was sleeping.","If it was the latter, Jian Wushuang could not imagine what kind of energy he was accumulating and what kind of damage it would cause to the Divine Power Universe.","Therefore, no matter what, he had to find and kill the Lu Ding clay idol within this one million years. Otherwise, when the Path of the Heavenly Gate ended, he would have to delay for a while.","With Jian Wushuang and Old Master’s speed, even if they searched countless star Fields and Domains in the next 10,000 years, they still could not find any aura of the clay idol.","However, in many Star Fields, he found some Void Masters who had almost exhausted their void power and were about to die.","After killing them mercilessly with a wave of his hand, the two of them continued to move forward.","None of the ancient Star Fields were left behind.","“Old Master, how long do you think it will take for us to find that clay idol?”","In a bustling market somewhere in the vast ancient world, Jian Wushuang and Old Master were sitting by the window in a teahouse.","Old Master took a sip of the tea on the table and said indifferently, “At least a hundred thousand years, perhaps a million years, and at most ten million years.”","“Why is it at most ten million years?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Old Master said, “Because when the time comes, his blood essence will dry up, and he won’t be able to hide it anymore.”","“That’s true, but it’s been quite a long time for us.” Jian Wushuang touched his chin and frowned, “I have to think of a way...”","While the two of them were chit-chatting, there was a rough noise in the market on the street.","Dozens of men in tight-fitting leather armors walked out from the corner of the street, each of them exuding a powerful cultivator’s aura.","And in the middle of these men, a prison cart wrapped in black cloth was being pushed forward.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting by the window, used his divine power to probe and saw that there were nearly 30 to 40 thin and small bodies squeezed in the prison carriage. He unconsciously wanted to go forward and check it out.","Old Master said calmly, “This universe is so big that what’s happening now is just a flash in the past. Even if you save them, it’s meaningless.”","Jian Wushuang sat back in his original position. Old Master’s words made sense. These people were just a moment in reincarnation. Even if he saved them, he could not change anything.","Although this was what he imagined, his mind still followed the cultivators and looked over.","In the middle of the street, a group of more than ten people stopped. The burly man in the lead looked extremely tired, and there was even a hideous wound on his exposed left shoulder that had not yet healed.","With a ‘whoosh’, he directly lifted the black cloth on the prison carriage and revealed the contents inside.","Perhaps it was because of the light, but the prison carriage was restless.","More than 30 dark-skinned women with black wings on their backs looked at the cultivators in fear.","These bird-like women’s entire eyeballs were covered by a turbid membrane, and they could barely see anything. They lived in the deep mountains and swamps all year round and rarely came into contact with other living creatures even when they died.","After seeing what was inside the carriage, most of the cultivators’ eyes dimmed and they retreated without hesitation.","The eyes of a small group of cultivators lit up and they quickly began to chat.","“What’s the price?” some cultivators asked.","The brawny man in the lead said tiredly, “10 Heaven Crystals. Anyone who wants to bargain can get lost.”","The cultivators were reluctant to pay the price, but there were very few cultivators from the Frost Crow clan who would catch them. If they missed it, they did not know when they would find it again. In the end, they still handed over dozens of Heaven Crystals.","For low-level cultivators, things that could improve their bodies were far more important than a secret technique.","The heads of the Frost Crow clansmen had a pearl that could enhance the five senses, which was why they could be sold at a high price.","With the Heaven Crystal that contained extremely pure divine power in his hand, the muscular man ordered the others to open the carriage and quickly pick the women.","The burly man cut the skull of the chosen Frost Crow woman with his finger and took out a dark bead from her head. Then, he handed it to each cultivator.","Once the condensed pearl was removed, the Frost Crow woman would not be able to survive and would die immediately.","The petite figures in the prison carriage were also decreasing in number.","Just as the burly man was busy stripping the condensed beads, a slightly intimidating voice sounded from among the cultivators.","“I’ll buy the rest.”","As far as the eye could see, a young cultivator dressed like a Ranger squeezed through the crowd and walked over with a dozen Heaven Crystals.","The burly man glanced at him, then looked at the prisoner carriage and said, “There’s only one left. If you want it, 8 Heaven Crystals.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and gave him nearly 20 Heaven Crystals. “I want this one alive.”","The sturdy man raised his eyebrows and smiled. Many descendants of aristocratic families had their own hobbies, so he did not want to interfere too much.","He pulled the iron chain and dragged out the last scrawny Frost Crow lady. Then, he handed her to Jian Wushuang.","“These demon beasts are the most durable. You just need to feed them a mouthful of water and dry food for a few months,” the sturdy man added considerately.","However, at this moment, another impatient voice rang out, “I, Xiao Wang, want this last one.”","Jian Wushuang, who was about to leave, was surrounded by more than ten low-level cultivators.","A domineering and gloomy-looking young man in luxurious clothes quickly came in front of him and stretched out his hand to snatch the Frost Crow girl.","In the next moment, what welcomed the young man in luxurious clothes was a powerful and heavy kick.","With a miserable cry, the young man in luxurious clothes was sent flying before he could even release the energy in his body. His huge head and neck were almost kicked severed by the sheer force of the kick.","“Where did this wild dog come from?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently. Then, he left slowly with the lady from the Frost Crow clan. No one dared to stop him."]},{"number":4667,"title":"Chapter 4667 Coffin-Carrying Cultivator","paragraphs":["4667 Coffin-Carrying Cultivator","By the time nearly 1,000 cultivators barged into the teahouse, the tea had already gone cold.","This small incident ended with the departure of Jian Wushuang and the others.","As for the Frost Crow lady, who had been redeemed, he stayed by his side out of compassion.","After leaving the star area, Jian Wushuang did not stop and went to the other worlds to look for possible clues.","No one knew how long this seemingly endless search would last.","Jian Wushuang had also made up his mind. If he could not find Lu Ding’s clay idol within a million years, he would stop the matter and rush back to the Cloud Palace.","The extremely weak Frost Crow lady followed him, and her lifespan, which was only 1,000 years, was extended. At the same time, she broke through the shackles of fate and embarked on the path of cultivation.","100,000 years later, three black-robed figures stood under an extremely remote starry sky, looking at the dead silent and cold Star Field.","Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “Han Ya, are you sure this is the place?”","The Frost Crow woman, whom he had saved and given a simple name, had her eyes tightly shut. Her five senses were spreading throughout the world.","A moment later, Han Ya opened her eyes and nodded firmly. “My Lord, the aura of death came from here.”","There were thousands of Great Dao, and the Frost Crow’s perception of living creatures’ aura was far superior to the other races. This was why the condensed bead in the Frost Crow clan’s head had become a spirit treasure that cultivators were after like crazy.","Jian Wushuang had discovered this by chance, which saved him a lot of time.","Since the Lu Ding clay idol did not show its shape, Jian Wushuang changed his way of thinking and began to search for the Star Field with the heaviest death Qi.","After searching for a while, he found that more than 100 major heavenly regions had been turned into dead regions.","Without saying anything more, the three figures stepped into the Star Domain that was filled with death Qi.","“Eh, something’s not right. The death Qi here is so dense, but why don’t I see any dead spirits? Instead, it’s as prosperous as an ordinary market?”","As he landed on the street, Jian Wushuang looked at the crowd of cultivators and could not help but wonder.","“Han Ya, are you sure the death Qi is the densest here?”","Han Ya was confused as well. “S-Sir, I can clearly feel that this is the place. How can there still be so many living people?”","Jian Wushuang was also puzzled. Could it be that this place was the same as the God-Refining Sect in the Voido Universe, where death Qi was used as the foundation for cultivation?","He seemed to have noticed something and glanced at the cultivators on the street.","They seemed to be surrounding him?","Although Jian Wushuang was a little puzzled, he was already on guard.","The next moment, a clear voice sounded above the three of them.","“I say, you barged into this place without permission. Don’t you want to live?”","Looking over, they saw a young cultivator carrying a coffin on his back on the roof of a tavern, looking at them lazily.","After that, the young cultivator suddenly jumped up, picked up the extremely exaggerated coffin on his back, and smashed it down!","The coffin, which contained a violent divine power, smashed down and sent the dense group of cultivators around him flying nearly a hundred meters away.","At the same time, the young cultivator stepped on the coffin and shouted, “Come with me if you want to live. Otherwise, your lives will be in danger.”","With that, the young cultivator picked up the coffin that had fallen to the ground and acted as the vanguard to smash the cultivators who had surrounded him again.","All the cultivators who were hit by the coffins were scattered like dirt and disappeared.","At that moment, even the Han Ya sensed that something was wrong. It turned out that these cultivators, who were no different from living people, had no divine souls.","Jian Wushuang and Old Master looked at each other and confirmed for the first time that Lu Ding’s clay idol might be hidden in this Star Field.","In order to avoid alerting the enemy, they did not release their respective powers. Instead, they quickly followed behind the young cultivator who was holding the coffin like a hammer.","Jian Wushuang had a whole new level of respect for him because of his power at the Ultimate Ruler realm. After all, it was an amazing thing to cultivate to such a realm where divine power was extremely thin in a Star Field so far away.","In the hands of that cultivator, the huge coffin seemed to have become a powerful weapon that had never failed. Every time it smashed down, nearly a hundred cultivators who had lost their souls were annihilated.","In the next half a day, the young cultivator showed his might and quickly eliminated all the cultivators in the area.","Just in case, the three of them sat on the roof under his instructions.","“Tell me, how did you get here? I don’t see that your realm is very high. Could it be that you’re also the survivors of this place like me?” the young cultivator looked at the three of them and asked with a gloomy expression.","Jian Wushuang did not answer his question. Instead, he asked with a puzzled look, “What happened here? Why is the death Qi so dense? Why did those cultivators attack us?”","When the young cultivator heard this, he could not help but sigh. “That’s because everyone here is dead, including the cultivators who attacked you just now. They’re all dead.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang had a clear idea. “Then do you know what happened in this realm, the cause and effect?”","“Of course I do. Although it has been hundreds of thousands of years since it happened, I still remember it clearly.” The young cultivator said, “Do you want to know?”","“Please explain, this is a matter of great importance.”","“It’s no big deal. I haven’t talked to an outsider for more than 100,000 years. It’s just to relieve my boredom.”","The young cultivator heaved a sigh of relief and began to explain.","“A few hundred thousand years ago, this place could be considered to be in the prime of cultivation, and all the sects were at their peak. It’s not like now, where it has become a dead zone. It was all because of that day.”","As if reminiscing, the young cultivator’s eyes were filled with fear.","“That day, the entire sky was replaced by darkness. Even the sun was swallowed up, and then a strange, ferocious face replaced the entire sky.”","“The moment that hideous face opened its mouth, all the divine power in the world and the aura of living beings were sucked away by it. Not a single cultivator could escape from it.”","“I only realized that a grand robbery was coming when I saw them turning into empty shells without their souls.”","“Because the dharmic formulation I’ve learned is extremely unique, it can barely change life and death. It’s because of this that I hid in the coffin and escaped this calamity.”","“Speaking of which, I’ve only awoken from my coffin in recent years and have been living alone in this world until now.” The young cultivator’s face was expressionless, as if he was narrating someone else’s story."]},{"number":4668,"title":"Chapter 4668 The Appearance of the Clay Idol","paragraphs":["4668 The Appearance of the Clay Idol","After hearing the young cultivator’s words, Jian Wushuang nodded to himself. Judging from the general timing, it was indeed in line with the behavior of Lu Ding’s clay idol who had disappeared, as it could mobilize such terrifying energy to devour the souls of the cultivators in the entire Star Field.","After roughly confirming that this was where Lu Ding’s clay idol was located, Jian Wushuang asked again, “Over the years, have you noticed the place with the most death Qi or other energy in this world?”","The young cultivator pondered for a moment and then nodded. “Of course I’ve seen it before. In the Pishui Frontier in the far north, a dense turbid gas would rise every 100,000 years. The turbid gas would cover the sky and the sun, and I would have to lie in a coffin to take refuge.”","“I think the Pishui Frontier is about to be filled with dense and turbid Qi.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and exchanged glances with Old Master. He cupped his hands and said, “Thank you for the information, young friend. We’ll part ways here. See you again.”","“Wait, we’re going to say goodbye? Where are you guys going?”","“The Pishui Frontier you speak of, my Young Friend.”","“What are you guys doing there? Could it be that you’re tired of living?” the young cultivator said in shock.","Jian Wushuang smiled and cupped his hands again. He was about to stand up.","“Forget it, I’ll go with you!” The young cultivator stood up and said, “I’m tired of living like a coward. Why don’t I go with you to find out what’s going on? I’ll die knowing why.”","Jian Wushuang was speechless, but he did not refuse. The four of them flew toward Pishui Frontier.","This was the Genyang Continent, a Star Field, and a Divine Kingdom. Its territory was considered one of the more advanced regions in the Divine Power Universe.","A huge river that seemed to run through the entire Genyang Continent was extremely vast.","But now, the completely dried-up river bed was like a giant skeletal dragon that wriggled menacingly on the continent.","At the same time, a yellow fog that covered the sky suddenly appeared in the distance.","“Not good, the foul air is rising. It’s almost back to the ground.” The young cultivator who was flying on the coffin was shocked when he saw this.","However, when he saw that Jian Wushuang and the others were unmoved, he immediately said nervously, “This foul gas is no joke. Even a Supreme realm expert would have to die on the spot!”","“Little Friend, don’t worry. I’m here.” Jian Wushuang turned around and smiled. Then, he continued to move forward firmly.","For some reason, the young cultivator’s heart calmed down after hearing this.","“F*ck, if we die, so be it!” he shouted in a low voice and leaned on the coffin, looking ahead nervously.","The turbid air that blotted out the sky and covered the earth was like a bloody mouth that kept pushing forward, devouring everything.","The next moment, an extremely clear and pure sword light shot up into the sky like a dragon rising to the sky or a heavenly River flowing backward.","The cultivator on top of the coffin looked at the battle before him in shock. From what he could remember, even the strongest Patriarch of the Genyang Continent would noto be able to survive for even an instant here.","The surging Sword Intent easily destroyed the turbid gas.","The world was clear again.","However, what happened next made the young cultivator suck in a cold breath.","In the dried-up river bed, countless cultivators ‘corpses were piled up like a flowing river of corpses.","Perhaps sensing the arrival of an external force, the countless corpses of cultivators piled up on the entire riverbed began to tremble.","The next moment, a terrifying arm made up of corpses rose from the riverbed and grabbed at Jian Wushuang.","A terrifying sonic boom tore through the sky.","Jian Wushuang looked calm. He looked at the huge palm that was about to grab him and pointed with his finger.","The profound Law instantly condensed into a line and ground the entire palm into powder.","After crushing the earth-shaking palm, nearly a hundred more similar arms rose from the riverbed and attacked from all directions like tentacles.","The young cultivator was completely numb. The war that did not belong to this plane at all appeared in front of him at such a close distance, making him feel like a firefly competing with the bright moon.","Han Ya was also in disbelief. Everything was beyond her knowledge.","The Lord that she had followed for over 100,000 years was an existence that she could not touch at all.","Jian Wushuang sneered as he looked at the terrifying energy that was crashing toward him.","He did not even want to use his Wushuang Sword Dao. He reached out and waved his hand in the air.","Instantly, the power of the entire Heaven-Earth Law pressed down.","The hundreds of terrifying arms made up of countless corpses could not withstand the Laws of heaven and earth at all. They immediately crumbled and turned into a huge amount of sand.","“Lu Ding, if this is all you’ve gained over the years, you’re going to die an ugly death,” Jian Wushuang shouted coldly, and his majestic aura spread.","Rumble...","The ground began to crack, and ravines appeared. Countless dark and strange energy surged up from the earth’s core.","The strange energy gradually gathered in the air and transformed into a giant statue.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s been a million years! Why are you still not willing to let me go?” A bitter and shrill voice resounded from the mouth of the giant statue.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were calm. “Because your appearance was a mistake. In order to prevent this mistake from getting worse, I can only erase it.”","“Crown Prince, do you think you can defeat me now?” the giant statue roared in a deep voice.","“Don’t fight like a trapped beast anymore. Remove your natural life source. Since you didn’t want to do it, I promise you that you can enter reincarnation,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","The giant laughed sinisterly, and in the blink of an eye, it shrunk, revealing the origin of the clay idol.","“I should be the one saying that to you. Do you really think that I’m someone Lu Ding can compare to?”","The terrifying aura of an Ancestor realm being surged out of the clay idol’s body, instantly causing the color of heaven and earth to change, and all living things began to be destroyed into dust.","“I was supposed to be Lu Ding’s scapegoat. However, the Heavenly Dao changed, and I escaped. He died, but I’m still alive. In the end, I should thank you, Jian Wushuang, the most.”","“In order to thank you, I’ve decided to devour you and torture you to death bit by bit!”","Ancestor realm energy burst forth from the clay idol’s body, transforming into countless terrifying bolts of light that swirled over. The heavens crumbled, and the entire Genyang Star Field was annihilated into nothingness.","At the same time, the resentment formed an evil Dao Field and wrapped everyone in it."]},{"number":4669,"title":"Chapter 4669 I Am the Great Dao, Who Can Kill Me?","paragraphs":["4669 I Am the Great Dao, Who Can Kill Me?","When the Dao Field formed by extreme resentment swept over, Jian Wushuang waved his hand in the air.","The invisible Laws of the Great Dao protected everyone, with him as the center.","As he looked around, he felt that the world had fallen into extreme darkness. The clay idol, which belonged to the peak of the universe, had an Ancestor realm aura that could actually resist Jian Wushuang.","In the center of the evil Dao Field, the clay idol smiled gloomily. With a wave of his hand, a chasm appeared in the void. At the same time, countless terrifying and strange souls struggled from within, wailing in pain and hysteria.","The moment the demonic sound was heard, Han Ya and the young cultivator lost their consciousness. Blood gushed out of their mouths and noses. They were on the verge of death.","Old Master tapped the scepter in his hand lightly, and the Black Water barrier enveloped the two of them, then pushed them out of the battle range.","The countless souls were cultivators that the clay idol had crazily killed and devoured in the past million years. The resentment that could not be quelled and the terrifying power made even Jian Wushuang have to guard his heart to prevent his mind from being eroded by the demonic sound.","The Tarot Divine Sword appeared in his hand, but he was shocked.","The fierceness and ruthlessness of the Tarot Sword’s Sword Embryo had actually been triggered, and it could bite back at its master at any time.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and put the Tarot Divine Sword back into its sheath. Then, he summoned the Invisible Sword.","The Invisible Sword was formed by the purest Sword Intent after he had mastered the Wushuang Sword Dao, the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","Even one of the Seven Supreme Great Ancestral Weapons, the Tarot Divine Sword, could not be compared to it in terms of compatibility or purity.","From a certain perspective, the Invisible Sword was also an Ancestral Weapon that belonged to Jian Wushuang.","With the Invisible Sword in his hand, Jian Wushuang did not stop at all. He immediately released the first move of the star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","“Star.”","The Laws of the Great Dao in the majestic temple were all condensed in this sword strike, turning into a soaring sword will that slashed forward.","At the same time, an earth-shaking ancestral image appeared behind Jian Wushuang and also swung its heaviest sword.","The evil Dao Field collapsed in an instant. The countless souls that rushed out of the chasm only had time to let out a scream before they were all destroyed by the vast Sword Intent.","Hundreds of beams of light rose into the sky, completely crushing the arrangement of Lu Ding’s clay idol.","Under this resistance, even the great sun hanging above the Star Field seemed to show signs of falling.","“Become my nourishment. I promise to take you to find Wang Mi Secret Realm.” He opened his arms and looked at Jian Wushuang with an intoxicated expression.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. He could feel the compass formation beneath his feet weakening his divine power.","The next moment, countless ghost hands of resentment rushed out of the compass formation and tried to grab the two.","Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and was about to attack, but the Old Master was one step ahead of him. The black scepter in his hand suddenly stopped.","A unique power that surpassed the level of divine power spread out like waves, and the resentful ghost hand that had just risen was immediately destroyed.","Even the strange compass formation had countless cracks on it.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang took a step forward with steady momentum. He raised the Invisible Sword in his hand and threw it at the clay idol.","The brilliant divine power pierced through the eternal darkness and hit his heart.","The extreme light flickered, and the clay idol, which was almost cut into two by the Invisible Sword, stood in place in a daze, as if he had not reacted.","The next moment, the void twisted quickly, and the clay idol smiled strangely. His body, which had almost been cut in half, was restored in an instant, leaving no trace of injury.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. He had grown so strong in a million years?","With his arms still wide open, the Lu Ding clay idol laughed sinisterly. “I am the Great Dao. Who can kill me?”","As soon as he finished speaking, a scepter that was like a giant pillar directly smashed down on his head.","With a ‘bang’, the left half of the Lu Ding clay idol’s body shattered.","The power belonging to the Ancestor realm gushed out uncontrollably. He screamed and covered the torn wound with force.","Jian Wushuang sneered, “You dare to call yourself the Great Dao? Aren’t you afraid of karma?”","Barely stopping the energy from leaking out of his body, the Lu Ding clay idol had already weakened to another level.","The clay idol gave the two of them a venomous look, then turned around and turned into thousands of dim lights, scattering into the void.","“You want to leave?” Jian Wushuang sneered and pulled at the void. The Laws of Great Dao collapsed and closed.","The clay idol that had turned into a ghostly light was caught by the Laws of the Great Dao and could not move at all.","“No, you can’t kill me!” Perhaps it had a premonition that it was facing a great horror of life and death, so the Lu Ding clay idol was extremely frightened.","“I’m the incarnation of the Laws of the Great Dao. None of you can kill me!” He continued to clamor.","After using his unparalleled divine power to compress it into the size of a grain of dust, Jian Wushuang looked at the struggling clay idol between his fingers and was ready to kill him.","However, what shocked him was that although the clay idol’s body was easily destroyed, it only condensed back together a moment later. It was extremely strange.","“He has already transcended the restrictions of this universe. You can’t kill him,” Old Master said calmly.","Jian Wushuang thought about it carefully and understood. He no longer insisted on killing the clay idol. He then extracted the clay idol’s life source and sealed it.","After doing all this, he heaved a sigh of relief. The disappearance of the Lu Ding clay idol had been a sore point in his heart for millions of years. Now that it had been suppressed, everything was finally back on track.","“This time, it’s finally completely settled down.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","“What’s your next step?” Old Master asked.","Jian Wushuang replied, “I’ll return to Cloud Palace and take care of some matters. Then, I’ll lead the army into the Void Universe and eradicate it completely.”","Old Master nodded and did not say anything else.","Using the power of Great Dao, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and restored the Genyang Star Field that had been destroyed in the battle.","The spring grass came back to life, the protective water surged again, and all living things were born in it.","However, the countless cultivators who were killed by the clay idol could not be resurrected. As all living beings were resurrected, their bodies gradually turned into a handful of sand.","Feeling a sharp pain in his body, the young cultivator who was unconscious on the coffin lid woke up from his coma.","“What’s going on? Didn’t this place get destroyed?”","The young cultivator murmured as he looked at the green grass on the ground. However, his eyes quickly turned to himself and he could not help but exclaim.","His entire body emitted countless rays of white light."]},{"number":4670,"title":"Chapter 4670 A Million Years Later","paragraphs":["4670 A Million Years Later","As if it was about to disintegrate, the divine power that filled his body also slowly scattered into the air.","“What, what is going on...”","He was a little flustered, but he found that he could not even do the simplest movement.","Han Ya, who had also woken up, saw this scene and a hint of sadness flashed in her eyes. She was extremely sensitive to death Qi, so how could she not understand what was happening?","Jian Wushuang and Old Master landed on the ground and slowly walked in front of him.","Leaning against the coffin, half of the young cultivator’s body had already turned into white light and dissipated.","“Am I already dead?” He raised his head with some difficulty and looked at the god-like man in front of him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes dimmed and he nodded slowly.","Earlier, when they first met, Jian Wushuang had already noticed that the young cultivator did not have any aura of life.","Perhaps it was because of the Lu Ding Clay Idol that he retained his consciousness and existed in this world as a dead body.","Now that Jian Wushuang had sealed the Lu Ding clay idol, the source of power that maintained his body had naturally disappeared.","After calming down from the initial panic, the young cultivator said, “It turns out that I’ve been like them for a long time. I thought I was the only survivor. But this is fine. After hundreds of thousands of years of boredom, it’s time for me to have a good sleep.”","After saying this, the young cultivator’s body finally turned into a white light.","Jian Wushuang picked up the white light and turned it into a bright star. Then, he decorated the sky.","“Let’s go. We’ll leave everything here to our descendants.” Jian Wushuang smiled and the three figures finally disappeared.","The mission that was supposed to take a million years was completed 800,000 years in advance. Jian Wushuang and the others returned to the heavenly Cloud Palace.","At the end of 300,000 years, Jian Wushuang and Old Master finally returned to the Cloud Palace.","As for the taciturn Lady Han Ya who regarded Jian Wushuang as her everything, she had already passed away one day in the past 200,000 years.","For high-level cultivators, 200,000 years was just a period of seclusion. However, in the universe, the mortals with thin divine power, the peddlers who could not cultivate, and the demon beasts who had a little bit of Enlightenment were the foundation.","200,000 years was the longest and most exciting life for Lady Han Ya.","Jian Wushuang looked at the giant hall, which had been peaceful for hundreds of thousands of years. He smiled and entered the Cloud Palace.","The two Dragon clan’s descendants who were guarding outside the palace sniffed and went back to sleep.","Lan Lan, Overlord, and the others had been stationed on the Ancient Path of Stars and rarely returned to the Cloud Palace. The Supreme Xue Bo led more than 100,000 Supremes to guard the Offworld Battlefield, while Ninth Kalpa King, who had successfully broken through the Invincible Supreme realm and entered the Half Ancestor realm, was stationed on the Path of the Heavenly Gate.","As for the Dragon clan and the Phoenix Clan, they had returned to their respective Star Fields, leaving only a hundred of their descendants to guard the heavenly Cloud Palace.","As time passed, the new moon replaced the sun with spring.","In a flash, another 500,000 years had passed.","On the Cloud Peak, Jian Wushuang was fishing in the sea of clouds with a jade fishing rod in his hand.","At his side was Old Master, Chu Zhi, and of course, Feng Qi.","The small fish made of divine power writhed in the sea of clouds. Every time it was time to take the hook, Jian Wushuang would raise the fishing rod to prevent the fish from touching it. He repeated this repeatedly and never got tired of it.","“I say, Jian Wushuang, you’re so boring. You’ve been fishing with us for more than 100,000 years, but we’ve never caught a single fish,” Feng Qi’s face was full of black lines as she angrily said.","“Fishing is a matter that takes patience and physical strength into consideration. It’s only been 100,000 years and you want to catch a fish? Let’s fish for another 100,000 years,” Jian Wushuang said in all seriousness.","Slightly shaking his head, Feng Qi stopped complaining and also started fishing.","Fishing in the sea of clouds for 500,000 years was also the time when everyone was the most unrestrained.","No one knew what would happen next, not even Jian Wushuang, who stood at the peak of the universe.","In the following time, Supreme Xue Bo and the others, who were stationed in the Offworld Battlefield, began to return to the heavenly Cloud Palace.","What awaited them was the opening of the heavenly door for the first time after the Great Catastrophe War.","Every 100,000 years, a batch of unparalleled geniuses would emerge from the first Ancient Path of Stars. However, only those who had gone through the Path of the Heavenly Gate would have a chance of entering the heavenly Cloud Palace and becoming the disciples of Cosmos God.","The Path of the Heavenly Gate was another trial path that Jian Wushuang had started after he became Cosmos God. If one wanted to enter Cloud Palace, one had to first pass the test of the Path of the Heavenly Gate.","Everyone was secretly looking forward to it. What kind of amazing geniuses would be able to obtain the recognition of nearly 20 Invincible Supremes and a Half Ancestor realm expert?","However, special existences like Jian Wushuang, who had already surpassed the level of a genius, were no longer within the scope of consideration.","One million years later, the morning bell rang, and the sound of celestial music resounded throughout the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Everything was going on in an orderly manner, and all the big shots gathered in the heavenly Cloud Palace.","Jian Wushuang sat in front of the palace. He was obviously looking forward to something and he looked into the distance with a smile.","In the vast clouds and smoke, Ninth Kalpa King, dressed in a white robe, slowly stepped in front of the Cloud Palace, and behind him were more than 20 Invincible Supremes.","“Replying to Cosmos God, the Ninth Kalpa and the others were fortunate to have not failed you,” Ninth Kalpa King cupped his hands and said.","Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand. “Thank you for your trouble.”","Enveloped by unparalleled brilliance, Ninth Kalpa King and the others felt the fatigue in their divine bodies dissipate, and their divine power was full.","Then, at the end of the square, six young figures appeared before everyone’s eyes.","Facing the mighty True Dragons on the pillars on both sides, the six figures were not afraid at all, and they walked forward steadily.","At the very front of the six figures was a handsome young man in a green robe.","There was no fear in his eyes, only calmness.","At the same time, he did not understand why he did not feel the slightest sense of strangeness or fear when he came to the most mysterious place in the entire universe, the heavenly Cloud Palace. Instead, he felt an inexplicable sense of familiarity.","After shaking off the unrealistic thoughts in his head, the young man in green gradually increased his pace.","Recalling everything they had experienced in the vast and terrifying Path of the Heavenly Gate, the other five people shivered at the same time and quickly stepped forward.","Not many of the Supreme martial artists present in the Cloud Palace knew just how few people had passed the test of the Path of the Heavenly Gate.","However, they knew clearly that those who had been recognized by the Supremes who had participated in the battle of the Great Catastrophe War were extraordinary geniuses who could stand proudly among the top percentile of the Divine Power Universe."]},{"number":4671,"title":"Chapter 4671 Dao Yan","paragraphs":["4671 Dao Yan","When he arrived in front of the heavenly Cloud Palace, the young man in green finally felt an inexplicable tension in his heart.","The divine power was so dense that it was almost tangible, and the few of them could not breathe. The endless number of Supreme experts were like insurmountable mountains and rivers, breathtaking.","At the same time, they saw that there were several of those unimaginably terrifying existences!","In the middle of those terrifying existences sat a handsome man in white. He had an extraordinary aura.","The atmosphere was extremely tense, and cold sweat unconsciously poured out of their temples.","“You guys are finally here?” the white-robed man sitting at the head of the table said with a smile. His voice seemed to have descended from the Nine Heavens.","The young man in green finally reacted. He hurriedly cupped his hands and bowed, “Greetings, Cosmos God.”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, “My Young Friends, you don’t have to be so formal. We will be together for quite a long time in the future.”","“Tell me, how long have you been cultivating, and what your cultivation level is.”","The six of them nodded in agreement. The green-robed young man was the first to reply, “Replying to Cosmos God, my name is Qing Qu. I have cultivated the Dao for over 1.73 million years, and my cultivation is at the Primary Supreme realm.”","As soon as he said that, all the Supreme martial artists in the Cloud Palace looked at him with shock in their eyes.","1.73 million years to reach the Supreme realm was simply an unimaginable matter. One must know that for millions of high-level cultivators, this was merely the time they had just entered deep Enlightenment!","Even Feng Qi, Long Yan, Long Chi, and the others were a little surprised, and they all looked at the boy named Qing Qu with scrutinizing eyes.","Only Ninth Kalpa King remained calm. Perhaps becoming a Supreme martial artist in more than a million years was an unimaginable thing for all Supreme martial artists.","However, it was obviously not enough for Ninth Kalpa King, who had entered the Cloud Palace with Jian Wushuang millions of years ago.","It was because Jian Wushuang’s cultivation resume had forcibly elevated Ninth Kalpa King to another level.","The year he reached the Supreme-being level was less than 850,000 years...","“That’s right, he’s a Heaven’s Favorite.” Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction and then looked at the other five.","Although the cultivation path of the next five people was not as shocking as Qing Qu’s, it was still incredibly impressive.","Among them, the oldest was a middle-level cultivator who had cultivated for no more than 30 million years.","It was conceivable that these few unparalleled geniuses who had passed the Path of the Heavenly Gate would definitely grow to the Invincible Supreme realm in the future. Even the young man in green might be able to grow to the Half Ancestor realm.","Jian Wushuang asked a question with a smile after asking about the cultivation situation.","The six of them looked at each other, but then they began to talk.","Compared to the ordinary people in the mortal world, they were much more exciting and enthusiastic because they were connected to the world.","However, no matter how wonderful and passionate it was, in the near-endless years, who would follow their hearts, or even have their hearts intact?","Five answers, five seeking Immortality.","Only the young man in green had a blank look on his face from the beginning to the end. It seemed that he had no original intention since he stepped on the path of cultivation, and everything seemed to be logical until today.","“Replying to Cosmos God, I, I don’t know...”","There was silence in the heavenly Cloud Palace. All the Supreme martial artists nodded and smiled, not saying a word.","Jian Wushuang laughed. He laughed in a very pleasant manner.","After a moment, he looked at Xue Bo, who was sitting beside him. Ninth Kalpa and the others smiled and said, “Everyone, please choose your beloved disciples.”","“Yes.” Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa, Feng Qi, Long Yan, and Long Chi cupped their hands and agreed.","The five Half Ancestors had chosen their respective candidates, but none of them had chosen the young man in green.","Disappointment appeared in his eyes. Perhaps it was the sentence ‘I don’t know’ that ruined his cultivation path.","Just as he was feeling dejected, the majestic voice rang out once more. “Qing Qu, are you willing to become my disciple?”","Qing Qu’s body trembled as he looked up at Cosmos God in disbelief.","The next moment, he knelt on the ground and said in a trembling voice, “I am willing.”","Jian Wushuang lifted him up with a smile and said, “Don’t be so formal. From now on, you are my disciple. I will give you two words as an address.”","“I’ll listen to you, Master,” Qing Qu said excitedly.","“What do you think of the two words ‘Dao Yan’?” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Qing Qu muttered a few words in his heart, then cupped his hands and said solemnly, “Disciple Dao Yan thanks Master for choosing the words.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He looked at them and said, “Sit down. I have some questions to discuss with you.”","At this point, all the Supreme experts bowed their heads and retreated, gradually retreating from the Cloud Palace.","The start of this event indicated that these six people’s future achievements would definitely not stop at the Invincible Supreme realm.","As for the green-robed young man who had been affected by the Dao of Cosmos God, no one could guess how far he would go.","Looking at the Cloud Palace that was gradually disappearing among the clouds, Feng Qi smiled faintly.","In just over two million years, the green lotus that had been sent to the lower realm had finally grown to this current state.","Two million years ago, he was a green lotus by the side of Cosmos God. Two million years later, he became a disciple of Cosmos God. Everything seemed to have been predestined.","Feng Qi turned around and pulled the Ninth Kalpa King’s sleeve, “I say, comparing the talent of the disciple that Jian Wushuang took in, how does it compare with Jian Wushuang?”","Ninth Kalpa smiled and said, “The Jian Wushuang of that year was much more terrifying than the little guy in the green robe now. He was a guy who made everyone pale in comparison to him.”","Looking at Ninth Kalpa King’s figure, Feng Qi shrugged. “That’s right. Only Jian Wushuang can make such an arrogant guy say such words.”","The clouds in the sky rolled and spread, and this prayer mat listening session continued for nearly a hundred years.","The sound of the Great Dao rang out continuously above the clouds.","When the clouds and mist in front of Cloud Palace gradually dispersed, six figures blessed with the Great Dao of heaven and earth walked out slowly.","Without exception, all of them had become Invincible Supremes.","Their eyes were no longer filled with confusion, but with their own beliefs and goals.","Since then, the six Invincible Supremes had all stayed in the heavenly Cloud Palace.","...","“Elder Xue Bo, Elder Jun Fu, aren’t you curious why I used the two words ‘Dao Yan’ on Qing Qu?”","“We didn’t understand it at first, but now we’ve been Enlightened.”","“Haha, he is Senior Brother Dao Yan’s new life, like a reincarnation. But he is no longer Senior Brother Dao Yan. In the end, he is just a place for me to entrust my respect to Dao Yan, a consolation.”","Three figures sat in a row on the top of the immortal cloud, reminiscing about the past. A long wind blew, and soon everything was covered."]},{"number":4672,"title":"Chapter 4672 Settling the Score","paragraphs":["4672 Settling the Score","In the same year, Supreme Xue Bo announced that he would step down from the position of the Vice Palace Master of the Divine Life Palace. The Divine Life Palace welcomed a new Vice Palace Master — Qing Qu — who was the one who had been chosen by the Dao of Cosmos God.","Compared to hundreds and thousands of years ago, he was much calmer. There was no joy or sorrow in his eyes, as if he had experienced the birth and death of all things. However, the only thing that had not changed was still the heart of a young man.","In the past millions of years, the Divine Power Universe had not completely recovered after the Great Catastrophe War and the chaos of Lu Ding. There were only 200,000 Supreme realm cultivators left, and the Ruler realm experts of the entire generation were almost all dead.","With Jian Wushuang’s re-opening of the Great Dao fate energy, the situation was alleviated, but it would still take a long time.","The internal strife had been settled, and the complete reckoning of the Void Universe had already been put on the agenda.","Nearly 200,000 Supremes had gathered in front of the Divine Life Palace on the Offworld Battlefield.","These Supreme experts who had survived the Great Catastrophe War and had been cultivating in front of the heavenly Cloud Palace for millions of years were all old monsters.","200,000 Supreme experts. 200,000 Invincible Supreme experts. Every single one of them was an existence that could destroy a Star Field.","Right now, they were all gathered in front of the Offworld Battleground!","Stepping into the Offworld Battlefield again, the past came back to him. Jian Wushuang, who had changed into a Ranger’s outfit, looked into the depths of the abyss.","This time, the Void Universe would be completely destroyed. From the mortal world to the Star Field and the Void Kingdom, they would spare no one.","This was a guarantee for the Divine Power Universe and also a promise to Old Master.","After looking back at the Supreme cultivator army behind him, Jian Wushuang took the lead and rushed to the Offworld Battlefield.","Old Master, Supreme Xue Bo, Ninth Kalpa King, Feng Qi, Long Yan, and Long Chi all followed Jian Wushuang without any hesitation in their eyes.","Almost 300 years after the battle of the Great Catastrophe War, Jian Wushuang, who had become Cosmos God, began to counterattack and settle accounts with the void universe.","With a wave of his hand, he used his supreme divine power to tear open the crack between the two universes. The divine power and the void power collided at this critical point.","The crack was torn into a heavenly chasm. Behind the primal Chaos void energy was the void energy universe’s Star Field.","As soon as he stepped in, Cosmos God Jian Wushuang, who represented the peak divine power of the universe, burst a large area of the Star Field.","Due to the death of Void God, the fate energy of the Void Universe had declined to a certain extent, and the rejection of the Great Dao Laws had little effect on the Supremes of the Divine Power Universe.","When the Invincible Supreme stepped into the Void Universe, he was still an Invincible Supreme, and there was no suppression in his cultivation realm.","The destruction brought by an Ancestor realm existence in another universe was unimaginable.","With a wave of his hand, the starry sky receded like a tide. Countless Star Fields and Void Kingdoms were destroyed and turned into dust.","The 200,000 Invincible Supremes were scattered in the Void Universe at the same time.","Every attack from an Invincible Supreme expert would directly and thoroughly shatter a Star Field.","This counterattack was terrifying and firm. It had already reached a point where one side would not rest until one side died.","In terms of the area of mass destruction, the destruction brought by a Half Ancestor was no weaker than an Ancestor.","Every time Feng Qi made a long bow, the endless Fire Domain would easily turn everything into a sea of fire. Even void power would be burned.","In the Void Universe, they could no longer organize an effective resistance team, because 99 percent of the Void Masters in the entire universe had died in the Offworld Battlefield, and even the Star-grade Void Warriors had suffered heavy casualties.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as calm as water as he waved his hand to destroy nearly 1,000 Star Fields and Void Kingdoms.","He seemed to be waiting for something. He did not split up the Supreme martial artist army behind him, and moved forward cautiously.","Wherever the army passed, the Star Field and Void Kingdom would collapse. Even some of the Heavenly realms with orthodoxies could not escape from such a fate.","This sort of reckoning was usually complete destruction. Even the starry sky origin source that gave birth to void energy would be destroyed.","In just a year, the millions of Star Fields around the crack had all disappeared. The intersection point of the two universes had been greatly reduced. The destroyed Star Fields and starry skies could no longer produce void energy, and had become a desolate space.","In the face of such a group of vengeful enemies, even the surviving individual cultivators and Void Masters had no will to resist and fled into the depths of the universe.","If it continued at this rate, the Void Universe would definitely disappear completely in less than ten chaos eras.","However, nothing was absolute. When the special aura of the Devourers appeared in front of him, Jian Wushuang realized that the most difficult enemy has appeared.","The void power that had already been exhausted to a certain extent suddenly became extremely rich and came from the depths of the Void Universe.","Immediately after, tens of thousands of Six Scar Void Masters appeared in a formation of stars surrounding the moon. In front of them were more than ten members of Devourers.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. Even through the strange mask, he recognized Devour One at a glance!","Devour one, who was killed by Old Master in the battle of the Great Catastrophe and could not be more dead, had appeared again!","Old Master’s brows furrowed slightly, and a hint of doubt rose in his heart.","At the same time, another ancestral image with supreme power descended from the sky.","As if an Emperor was being crowned, lightning snakes as thick as dragons and pythons floated around the precious image.","Devouring Emperor, who had been severely injured by Old Master’s last attack, also appeared.","All the Supreme experts’ hearts sank. This battle was inevitable.","Looking at the unimaginable energy floating around him, Jian Wushuang realized that Devouring Emperor had not been seriously injured or killed in the past three million years. Instead, he had improved.","However, Devouring Emperor did not attack first. Instead, he said in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang, I don’t want to fight with you anymore. Return where I came from and forgive you for what happened.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “Return the way we came? Do I have to wait until you’re done recuperating, and then wait for you to make a comeback?”","Devouring Emperor’s eyes narrowed. “Jian Wushuang, do you know what you are doing? You can’t bear the consequences of completely destroying the Void Universe. Even the universe behind you can’t bear it!”","After a short pause, Devouring Emperor looked at Old Master and said coldly, “You are all just pawns used by him!”","“So what if we’re just a chess piece? Do you think that you can stop the Void Universe from being defeated with just this sentence?” Jian Wushuang said calmly, his eyes still calm.","Devouring Emperor was stunned for a moment. Then, he sneered and said, “In that case, you can all stay here.”","As his voice fell, hundreds of pitch-black flags appeared out of thin air and were instantly thrown into the void."]},{"number":4673,"title":"Chapter 4673 Besieging and Killing Devouring Emperor (1)","paragraphs":["4673 Besieging and Killing Devouring Emperor (1)","After seeing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked. The hundreds of black flags that appeared out of thin air were the Fengtian Flags that had been lost in the Void Universe!","However, the Fengtian Flags were no longer only effective against the Void Universe. Each of them was like a formation eye of a mighty formation, firmly fixed in the void and sealing all the Supreme experts from the Divine Power Universe.","Jian Wushuang did not know what kind of secret technique the Devouring Emperor had used to make the Fengtian Flag of the Divine Power Universe his own, but he knew that they were in trouble.","Once the Fengtian Flag fell into the void, it cut off their connection with the universe and the divine power in their bodies could no longer be derived.","Jian Wushuang waved his arm and the unparalleled divine power of the Ancestor realm blasted at the endless Fengtian Formation, but it did not move at all.","Devouring Emperor sneered and said, “You think you can break the Fengtian Great Formation? All of you, die!”","With that, Devouring Emperor, who was also in the Fengtian Great Formation, released a power that exceeded the Laws of the Great Dao against the entire army of the Divine Power Universe.","The void shattered. Only Ancestor realm experts could withstand such terrifying energy!","All kinds of divine skills came one after another. Jian Wushuang released the Ancestral Skill and slashed out the Sword Dao River at the same time!","However, the power that exceeded the rules of the Great Dao easily destroyed the Transcendence Heavenly Gate. Even the long river of Sword Dao only stopped it for a moment before it was completely destroyed.","The terrifying power was getting closer and closer to Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","However, Old Master made his move next. He extended his hand to block the attack, causing endless Black Water ripples to appear.","The two attacks collided, creating an extremely dull explosion that numbed all the Supreme experts’ limbs and made their hearts beat wildly.","The unimaginably terrifying energy slowly dissipated and Jian Wushuang’s face turned grave.","He could feel that Devouring Emperor had become stronger and had become an existence that had transcended rules and Laws.","Without any pause, Devouring Emperor locked onto Jian Wushuang and released an even more terrifying energy.","However, in the next moment, Old Master stood in front of him and held Devouring Emperor in place.","As Devouring Emperor attacked, the ten or so members of the Devourers also joined the battle. Each of them had the terrifying power of a Half Ancestor.","After nodding slightly at Supreme Xue Bo and the others, Jian Wushuang leaped forward to meet Devour One.","“We meet again.” A strange and deep voice came out of Devour One’s mouth, and it looked at Jian Wushuang with his scarlet eyes.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Devour Oone gave him a very strange feeling, as if he was a semi-finished product that was randomly pieced together with a pile of parts. Whether it was his speech or his movements, they were extremely stiff.","A puppet with strings. This was the most direct feeling Jian Wushuang had.","“Is Devour One no longer the same person?” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. Then, he raised the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed at Devour One.","A strange scene appeared. Devour One did not dodge at all, and the vast Sword Intent directly twisted him into countless pieces.","But then, several small black holes appeared in the void, and Devour One’s body, which was already broken, slowly reappeared.","“You can’t kill me,” Devour One said in a strange way and then raised his palm to bombard Jian Wushuang with terrifying power.","Jian Wushuang did not think too highly of himself and immediately released the second move of the Transcendence Heavenly Gate, the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate.","The divine light as bright as the sun rose, and the purest attack crushed toward Devour One.","The divine light flickered for a moment, and his entire body turned into dust again under this attack.","Jian Wushuang did not relax at all when he saw Devour One disappear completely. He looked ahead with a slight frown.","Then, as if sand had gathered to form a tower, Devour One, who had been turned into dust, reappeared.","Without a sound, the two figures collided heavily. The power of the Ancestor realm collided, and a wail of the Great Dao was heard.","Jian Wushuang cut off Devour One’s head, but it grew back after a few seconds, which confused him.","He could feel that although he could severely injure Devour One, he still could not hurt his life force.","On the contrary, every time Devour One attacked, he left ineffable damage on Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","Jian Wushuang only realized something after he had cut his divine body almost a hundred times.","“Is it possible that this Devour One has always been the True Shadow of the Devouring Emperor?”","With an attitude of giving it a try, Jian Wushuang cut it into two with one stroke of his sword and reached out to hold the life source of Devour One.","Devouring Emperor, who was fighting with Old Master, trembled. He looked at Jian Wushuang and shouted angrily, “How dare you?!”","At the same time, a great light swept toward him. Jian Wushuang sneered and took advantage of this critical moment to take the life source of Devour One into his hand.","This time, Devour One’s strange body could not be condensed again.","“Jian Wushuang, you deserve to die!” Emperor Devourer, who had been calm and majestic, no longer cared. He pushed Old Master away with one palm and went straight for Jian Wushuang.","The unparalleled energy that was as deep as the abyss seemed to have swallowed the entire universe. Even Jian Wushuang, who had reached the Ancestor realm, felt the great horror of life and death!","If he faced this attack directly, the best result would be a serious injury!","It was already too late for Old Master to rush to his aid.","At this critical moment, Jian Wushuang threw out the Lu Ding clay idol’s life source almost instinctively.","The life source of the Lu Ding clay idol was exposed in the void, and the clay idol could not wait to drill out of the Nailstone.","“Jian Wushuang, I want you dead!” the clay idol of Lu Ding shouted in anger. However, before he could do anything, he felt like he was being stabbed in the back.","He turned around slowly, and in the next moment, he was devoured by the terrifying energy of Devouring Emperor.","It was as if billions of suns had exploded within the entire great Fengtian Formation, and the vast shock waves directly tore the great Fengtian Formation to pieces.","Thanks to the ‘sacrifice’ of Lu Ding’s clay idol, Jian Wushuang and the Supreme cultivator army behind him were unharmed. However, tens of thousands of Six Scar Void Masters were killed by this indiscriminate attack.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang looked at the void.","The indestructible Lu Ding clay idol did not have a trace of his life source after taking on this attack...","Devouring Emperor was furious. His long hair fell from his crown, and he looked like a mad demon.","Jian Wushuang felt the Ancestor realm life source in his hand and finally understood that it was Devouring Emperor’s clay idol True Shadow.","After being sealed in the Nailstone, the energy flowing around Devouring Emperor’s body also weakened slightly.","After a long while, the enraged Devouring Emperor calmed down and said gloomily, “Return that life source to me. I will no longer interfere with the life and death of the Void Universe.”","Old Master floated to Jian Wushuang’s side and said softly, “If you want to go back, you’ll have to go through me first.”","The atmosphere was strange and deathly silent. Devouring Emperor suppressed the anger in his heart. “Do you really want to fight to the death?!”","“It wasn’t my Divine Power Universe that wanted to fight to the death. It was you, the Devourers!” Jian Wushuang said coldly."]},{"number":4674,"title":"Chapter 4674 Besieging and Killing Devouring Emperor (2)","paragraphs":["4674 Besieging and Killing Devouring Emperor (2)","Devouring Emperor stared at Jian Wushuang and said, “You will regret it, but there is no room for regret from now on.”","After he said that, the starry sky began to collapse. Nearly 10,000 Star Fields collapsed at the same time, and countless lightning snakes fell from the ancient void.","A unique energy that did not belong to the Void Universe was born and strengthened Devouring Emperor.","The Great Daos belonging to the Void Universe could not withstand it at all and collapsed on their own.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of familiarity when he sensed the unique energy around Devouring Emperor.","Old Master’s usually calm face finally furrowed its brows at this moment, and the hand holding the black scepter of power tightened.","“Wushuang, take them back to the Divine Power Universe,” Old Master said slowly.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Obviously, he also felt that there was something unusual about this. “Okay, you come with us.”","Old Master shook his head. “Don’t worry about me. Leave quickly!”","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to speak, Devouring Emperor, who was standing in the void, waved his hand and released a dark halo, which enveloped everyone.","“All of you should stay. There’s no turning back,” Devouring Emperor said in a deep voice as he slowly opened his arms. The mighty energy he released made the Great Dao collapse.","Jian Wushuang smiled, “Since we can’t leave, let’s kill him!”","The pure and sharp Sword Intent rose like a reverse river, and the Ancestor realm divine power broke through the siege and fought against Devouring Emperor.","Old Master, who was standing next to Jian Wushuang, followed the river of Sword Dao and chased after Devouring Emperor.","With a wave of his hand, layers of divine punishment descended. The ethereal secret text was like thousands of arrays, stopping Old Master’s figure.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang held an Invisible Sword in his hand and rushed forward.","The mighty divine punishment was shattered by the Sword Intent, allowing Old Master to face Devouring Emperor!","The black scepter of power transformed into a massive palm that blotted out the sky, and it continued to smash toward him.","With a smile, Devouring Emperor retreated quickly. From the broken sky, a giant ugly face suddenly appeared and bit Old Master.","“Die!” A cold shout that seemed to come from another world resounded. The Tarot Divine Sword turned into a slash that split the sky and easily destroyed the ugly face.","The two black-robed figures attacked Devouring Emperor together.","Although the power was still terrifying, it could not cause any serious injuries to Old Master or Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to use all his divine powers in an instant, trying to severely injure him!","Devouring Emperor barely managed to turn around to suppress Old Master’s full-power attack, but his back was now exposed to Jian Wushuang.","Transcendence Heavenly Gate, Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent. He unleashed everything he had on Devouring Emperor’s back.","It was as if the galaxy in the sky was surging, directly covering the entire shattered starry sky.","Jian Wushuang and Old Master retreated quickly and looked at the starry sky with serious expressions.","Only when the vast Sword Intant completely dissipated did a figure slowly appear.","The black and gold clothes on his body were mostly torn, and the Tarot Divine Sword was stuck in his chest.","Emperor Devourer’s face darkened. He reached out his hand and straightened the crown on his head with difficulty, then pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword from his heart.","“My Lord!”","The remaining six members of Devourers surrounded him.","Devouring Emperor let out a wry smile. He shook his arm, and the Tarot Divine Sword, one of the Supreme Ancestral Weapons that could cut through everything, was broken into two.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank. The Tarot Divine Sword that had accompanied him for millions of years and killed by his side to this day was actually broken!","Devouring Emperor threw the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword in front of Jian Wushuang.","He reached out his hand and caught the hilt of the sword. He could no longer suppress his anger. He raised the Invisible Sword high and slashed at Devouring Emperor!","At the same time, Old Master also moved, and a world-shaking Black Water phantom form came over.","Devouring Emperor’s eyes glowed with black light. He waved his arms, and two rays of black light expanded in the wind, lashing at the two.","After cutting the black light, Jian Wushuang attacked again. At the same time, Old Master’s attack also came down.","Jian Wushuang’s strongest attack broke the strange energy around Devouring Emperor and the Black Water image suppressed it.","Rumble...","The endless energy turned into a rolling tide, devouring everything. The six members of the Devourers who could not escape in time were all swallowed up.","The starry sky collapsed on a large scale, revealing the ancient and dead void.","Jian Wushuang stood still and gasped for breath. His entire right arm was cracked and divine blood gushed out.","When the energy tide slowly receded, Devouring Emperor showed up in an extremely miserable state.","He suddenly coughed out a mouthful of divine blood. Even though he was in a sorry state, he still looked majestic.","“You’ve lost,” Jian Wushuang stepped forward slowly and said in a cold voice.","“I... lost?” Devouring Emperor seemed to be saying to him, but it also seemed to be saying to himself, “How can I lose?”","Devouring Emperor raised his head and looked at him and Old Master. “How can I lose?”","With that, a vast black light surged from his raised palm and entered the ultimate void.","Buzz...","The black light, which was like a giant pillar that held up the sky, did not dissipate for a long time. Layers of dim halos spread out in the void like waves.","Jian Wushuang did not understand what this meant, but Old Master’s expression changed.","Seeing Old Master’s face change, Devouring Emperor laughed as if he had vented his anger. “How can I be defeated? How could I possibly lose?!”","“Since you want me to die, don’t even think about having an easy time. I think they will soon sense my aura and lock onto this place.”","“I want all of you to be buried with me!” He coughed out another mouthful of divine blood. Devouring Emperor had gone mad.","“However, there’s one more way. The choice is in your hands. Let me go, and I will never let them find this place.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Old Master and he had a clear idea.","“Do you know what I hate the most?” A deep voice came from Old Master’s mouth, and his eyes gradually turned cold. “I hate threats the most!”","In the next moment, the black scepter suddenly stopped, and thousands of Black Water chains wrapped around Devouring Emperor, dragging him toward Old Master.","The birth and death of all living things were reflected in its pitch-black pupils, and even time was in its desolation.","“No! You can’t kill me!” Devouring Emperor finally cried out in fear.","“Jian Wushuang, if I die, Xuan Yi will definitely not agree!” Devouring Emperor looked at Jian Wushuang as if he was looking at his last life-saving straw.","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled when he heard the name, “How much more do you know about him?”","“I-I know a lot, as long as you let me...” Before he could finish, Old Master had already killed him completely, not even leaving behind his divine soul."]},{"number":4675,"title":"Chapter 4675 Immortal From Above the Heavens, Ding Baiyi (1)","paragraphs":["4675 Immortal From Above the Heavens, Ding Baiyi (1)","Devouring Emperor, one of the people who pushed the two universes to fight to the death, had been killed!","The mysterious Devourers also disappeared into the sky as if they had never been there.","However, the death of Devouring Emperor did not make anyone feel good.","Old Master’s brows were tightly furrowed, and his face had never been so serious before.","Jian Wushuang’s mind was in a mess. This was not the first time he had heard news about Xuan Yi from outsiders. However, every time, it would stop at the beginning and end abruptly.","“Master, what kind of existence are you!? Why can’t I get any news of you even though I’ve already reached the peak of the Dao?” Jian Wushuang looked at the void and suddenly felt a little weak.","“Old Master, I’m a little tired.” He slowly closed his eyes.","Old Master turned to look at him and nodded. “Let’s go back then.”","“No, as long as the Void Universe is not eliminated, the Divine Power Universe will be like a thorn in my back. I don’t want my juniors to be shrouded in the shadow anymore.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with determination, “I will eliminate the biggest threat for my juniors!”","However, in the next moment, a wave of chaotic and vast aura swept over the broken sky like a light mist.","However, this chaotic aura only existed for a moment before it disappeared completely.","However, everyone could sense this aura that had come from nowhere and disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled and he could not help but look at Old Master.","A moment later, Old Master said in a deep voice, “The Spring of Chaos spring has loosened.”","“Retreat!” Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to delay any further and immediately gave the order to retreat.","Without any hesitation, all the Supreme experts released their divine power, turned around, and rushed in the direction of the Divine Power Universe.","The Spring of Chaos, the symbol of the extreme point of the Divine Power Universe, was the weakest place. Every time it loosened, it would bring great terror.","At the same time, no one knew where the Spring of Chaos would lead to, and even Old Master was extremely afraid of it.","Jian Wushuang could not imagine what would happen if the Spring of Chaos was opened again.","Devouring Emperor’s dark light and words before he died had made him feel a sense of fear.","After the retreat of the army of Supremes, the place where Devouring Emperor had been killed began to show fine black patterns.","...","Two years later, Jian Wushuang and the others stepped into the Offworld Battlefield from the Void Universe and went straight to the Divine Life Palace.","The Divine Life Palace, which protected the entire Divine Power Universe, was still peaceful.","Thereafter, the Vice Hall Master Supreme Dao Yan brought over ten disciples and rushed out of the palace. He cupped his hands and said, “Disciple greets Cosmos God.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then asked, “In the past few decades, has there been anything strange in the universe?”","Dao Yan pondered for a moment, then shook his head and said, “Everything is as usual. There is nothing unusual. However, there have been special energy fluctuations in the vicinity of Rodu Star Field in recent years. The disciples I sent to investigate have yet to return.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately said, “All the Supremes are to guard the Cloud Palace. All the Half Ancestors are to come with me.”","No one had any objections. The army of Supreme experts, which had not suffered many casualties, stayed where they were. Jian Wushuang led the group of Half Ancestors and rushed to Rodu Star Field.","After all these incidents, the Rodu Galaxy had been raised to the highest level of vigilance. There were nearly 1000 Invincible Supreme martial artists taking turns to guard the place.","They would take turns every thousand years, and it had been millions of years.","However, now, the further they went, the weaker the divine power of the Invincible Paragon became, almost undetectable.","“Damn it, please don’t let anything be wrong.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and sped up.","Everyone heaved a sigh of relief when the shattered Rodu Star Field returned to normal.","The thousands of Invincible Supremes who were stationed there all flew out of the city and came before Jian Wushuang. “Greetings, Cosmos God.”","“Are there any abnormalities in the Spring of Chaos?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” The leading Supreme said, “Replying to Cosmos Gods, there hasn’t been anything unusual for the past million years.”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief in his heart. However, before he could speak, the Spring of Chaos that had been in a state of silence suddenly gushed out an earth-shaking energy.","The domineering aura that could easily suppress divine power was like a boundless galaxy that filled the entire sky.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang immediately released his Ancestor realm divine power, which turned into a barrier and blocked all the Invincible Supremes behind him.","At the same time, Old Master beside him murmured softly, “They are here.”","The barrier formed by the Ancestor realm divine power was almost instantly covered with cracks. Under the earth-shaking energy, it only lasted for a moment before completely collapsing.","Old Master then raised his black scepter to block the attack, barely managing to resist the mighty energy.","All the Half Ancestors present were shocked. Jian Wushuang and Old Master had to join hands to resist it. What kind of almighty being could emit such energy?","He did not dare to be careless and focused his eyes on the center of the blazing energy.","The next moment, a young man with sword-like eyebrows and starry eyes walked out slowly. The rules of the Great Dao of the Divine Power Universe were very repulsive, but they turned into powder when they got close to him.","His long hair, which was casually tied behind his back, fluttered in the wind, and he looked like an Immortal who had come out of the world. He was extremely elegant.","Jian Wushuang’s mood instantly fell to the bottom. He could feel that the energy was not weaker than that of Devouring Emperor, and might even be stronger!","The channel of the Spring of Chaos closed slowly, but the energy of the galaxy filling the sky did not decrease at all.","As for the young man who descended from the Spring of Chaos, he first sized up the universe he was in. Then, he stretched out his palm to feel his own energy and finally looked at Jian Wushuang and the others.","He looked at Old Master for a moment and was a little confused. But in the end, he stopped at Jian Wushuang.","Then, he slowly stretched out his palm and pointed at Jian Wushuang, “I am very familiar with your aura. Was it you who barged into the Great Yan Domain millions of years ago?”","As soon as he heard this, Old Master’s eyes widened. He had never lost his composure like this before. “You’ve been to the Great Yan Domain?!”","When Jian Wushuang heard the three words ‘Great Yan Domain’, he instantly understood.","The majestic world that had been swept into the space-time turbulence by accident and laid there for 500,000 years was the Great Yan Domain.","“Back then, I was swept into the space-time turbulence and entered a large realm. I think it should be called the Great Yan Domain,” Jian Wushuang said to Old Master in a low voice."]},{"number":4676,"title":"Chapter 4676 Immortal From Above the Heavens, Ding Baiyi (2)","paragraphs":["4676 Immortal From Above the Heavens, Ding Baiyi (2)","Then, he raised his head and looked at the young man who was as graceful as an immortal. He said softly, “That’s right.”","The young man was slightly stunned. Then, he said in a clear voice, “There’s no point in talking any further. Will you give me your head of your own accord, or will I take it myself?”","Jian Wushuang was depressed and began to suspect that he had a body constitution that attracted trouble.","He had walked step by step until now, and there were countless people who wanted to kill him all the time. Now, this guy who came from nowhere wanted to take his head off. This made Jian Wushuang angry. “You want my head? I’m afraid you have the heart but not the strength!”","The young man sneered, “Then I’ll come and take it.”","“I’m the Sword Immortal, Ding Baiyi. I don’t kill nameless people. Tell me your name, and I’ll take your life.”","“Jian Wushuang,” Jian Wushuang said coldly as an invisible long sword appeared in his hand.","The young man who claimed to be Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi’s disdainful gaze gradually disappeared when he saw the invisible long sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“I didn’t expect to find such pure swordsmanship in this world. I’m so lucky,” Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi murmured. “Forget it. I’ll kill you after I admire your swordsmanship.”","With that, he reached out and flicked the sleeve at his waist, and a True Sword with Immortal Charm materialized.","Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat, and an extremely pure Sword Daoo spread out.","“Old Master, once we start fighting, you must leave quickly.” After he whispered these words, he held the Invisible Sword in his hand and floated in the air.","Ding Baiyi waved his hand, and the vast energy formed a field that enveloped the two of them.","“One sword move, one sword form. You may start first.” Ding Baiyi took half a step back, his sword on his back.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He directly swung the Invisible Sword in his hand and released the first move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Eternal Night.","The Dao Field suddenly dimmed, and the darkness that could devour all things descended.","“Huh?” Ding Baiyi exclaimed. Then, he used his left hand, which was not holding a sword, to carve a sword technique out of thin air, which directly broke the first move of Eternal Night!","However, at the same time as the Eternal Night was destroyed, an even more vast Sword Intent soared into the sky. The aura that controlled the growth of all things in the universe came from all directions.","The new moon, snow, sun, spring, and autumn rose one after another, entering this place alone as if it was eternal.","Ding Baiyi’s plain clothes fluttered in the wind, and his calm eyes gradually turned fiery. He raised his True Sword, which was brimming with Immortal energy, and slashed out!","He had combined the Four Seasons of the Tarot Divine Sword with his own thoughts, but he had lost. He had lost without any suspense.","The Extinctive Sword Strike easily broke through the Four Seasons Sword Technique and continued forward without losing momentum, shattering the shoulder blade of Jian Wushuang’s left shoulder.","Divine blood gushed out, and divine bones were broken.","“Jian Wushuang!” Feng Qi screamed and was about to rush forward, but was stopped by Old Master. “With me here, Wushuang will be fine.”","Hearing this, although Feng Qi gave up, her eyes were full of nervousness.","In the Dao Field, Jian Wushuang let the divine blood on his left shoulder flow freely as he stared at Ding Baiyi.","Ding Baiyi smiled in return. “The sword technique you used just now was not your own. Although it was extremely exquisite, it had long lost its wisdom, so it can not be considered superior. If I had insisted on taking your head just now, I’m afraid you would not be as intact as you are now.”","“If this is all you’ve got in the way of the sword, I’d advise you to stretch out your neck and wait to be killed. Don’t make a fool of yourself.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything. He slowly raised the Invisible Sword in his hand and thousands of Sword Intents spread out in the air like vines.","At the same time, a majestic and unparalleled image condensed behind him!","“Interesting.” Ding Baiyi grinned, and the sword in his hand hummed. In the next moment, he turned into a stream of light and thrust forward.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes. The vast Sword Intent was like thousands of silver rivers flowing out. The purest straight cut fell heavily.","With just one strike, the Dao Field that was built up could not withstand it and shattered. The indescribable Sword Intent surpassed any of his previous strikes!","The two extremely pure Sword Intents collided and a magnificent explosion instantly swept across the entire world with Jian Wushuang as the center.","The Sword Intents was torn and destroyed, and the magnificent peerless image behind Jian Wushuang was finally torn apart.","Heaven and earth wailed, and the invisible Great Dao became restless.","It seemed that the most tragic explosion was actually the sharpest Extinctive Sword Strike that pierced through all his Sword Intent. All the Sword Intents were like layers of barriers, breaking one by one.","Jian Wushuang’s face was bitter. Was he going to be defeated like this?","Even Old Master could no longer remain calm and raised his foot to rush to help.","However, in the next moment, time seemed to have stopped. The layers of destruction seemed to have stopped at the last moment.","The Invincible Sword also trembled and finally stopped in front of the last layer of Sword Intent.","A gust of wind blew past, messing up his hair.","Looking at the True Sword that was only a finger away from his neck, Jian Wushuang turned to Ding Baiyi.","The hand holding the hilt of the sword trembled uncontrollably. Ding Baiyi’s handsome face began to turn pale, and a drop of scarlet divine blood dripped from his nose.","“What, what...” Without saying a word, he fell unconscious.","Jian Wushuang used his divine power to wrap Ding Baiyi’s divine body and lay him flat in the void.","Seeing this, Old Master, Supreme Xue Bo, and the others quickly came to Jian Wushuang.","Old Master exchanged a glance with Ding Baiyi, then raised the black scepter and prepared to kill him.","“Old Master!” Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his mouth and reached out to stop the old man. He shook his head and said, “You can’t kill him. I can feel that he doesn’t have a strong killing intent towards me. Moreover, if you kill him, it would be an unfair victory.”","“Are you serious? Do you know that if he took another step forward, the consequences would be unimaginable?” Feng Qi said anxiously.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he finally said, “We can’t kill him. In the beginning, he allowed me to start first with one move, so I’ll take it as returning the favor.”","The Half Ancestors sighed and stopped talking.","Old Master slowly put away the black scepter and nodded at him.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang looked into the distance and said, “Let’s go back to the Cloud Palace.”","The Spring of Chaos was sealed again, and apart from the more broken sky, it was as if nothing had happened.","After returning to the heavenly Cloud Palace, Jian Wushuang opened another divine pavilion and placed the white-robed Ding Baiyi in it. Then, he used his unparalleled divine power to seal off the surroundings of the divine pavilion.","As soon as he woke up, Jian Wushuang could instantly sense him.","Such a Sword Immortal who could possibly come to the Divine Power Universe from the extremely mysterious and secretive Great Yan Domain... This calmed Jian Wushuang’s thoughts gradually."]},{"number":4677,"title":"Chapter 4677 The Ultimate Level of the Great Dao, the Great Yan Domain!","paragraphs":["4677 The Ultimate Level of the Great Dao, the Great Yan Domain!","In the past tens of millions of years, everything that seemed to be without order seemed to have developed in one direction.","Ever since he had heard from the Snake God that the peak of the universe was not the Ancestor realm, and he had met Old Master who had surpassed the Ancestor realm, and Devouring Emperor, who was at the same level of power. Everything had been developing deeper.","The two of them were definitely not members of the Divine Power Universe or the Void Universe, but they seemed to be working hard for the same goal.","The elder, Shi Ting, who acted as the guide in the Land of Sorrows, the strange Lu Ding clay idol, and Xuan Yi, who the Devouring Emperor knew, were all unknown to him.","Jian Wushuang was eager to know the answer. He felt that he was shrouded in an even larger cloud.","After a year of silence, he walked out of the heavenly Cloud Palace and went to the sea of clouds behind the palace.","Old Master’s thin figure was still fishing in the sea of clouds.","After fishing with Jian Wushuang for hundreds of thousands of years, Old Master, who had no desire before, seemed to have started to have a hobby of fishing.","A jade fishing rod with a string but no hook was thrown into the sea of clouds. Jian Wushuang then sat down next to Old Master.","“How many fish did you catch?”","“I haven’t caught a single one yet.”","“It’s no wonder. These fish have been fished by us for hundreds of thousands of years. They’ve long gained intelligence and know that they can’t take the bait.” Jian Wushuang began to tell Old Master about his experience of fishing over the years.","A smile gradually appeared on Old Master’s calm face. He had only revealed that imperceptible smile to two people in the past millions of years, one was Jian Wushuang, and the other was Chu Zhi.","In the end, Old Master looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled. “Do you have a lot of questions to ask me?”","Jian Wushuang scratched his head. “Yes, I have some questions, but I don’t know where to start...”","“Then let me answer you one by one,” Old Master said faintly. “I originally wanted to wait for you to grow up slowly before telling you everything you wanted to know. I thought that day would be far away, but I didn’t expect it to come so soon.”","“Wushuang, do you know about the Great Yan Domain?”","Jian Wushuang thought about it for a while and then told Old Master in detail everything that had happened from the time he was dragged into the space-time turbulence by the Void God to the time he entered the mysterious world.","“I see. I didn’t expect you to be able to enter that place.” Old Master’s tone was calm. “The so-called Great Yan Domain, the simplest and most clear explanation, is the ultimate level of the Great Dao, the beginning of all things.”","“At the same time, it’s just a general term. In the Great Yan Domain, the Immortal world, the divine world, and all other worlds co-exist.”","Jian Wushuang was moved and asked, “What kind of existence is an Ancestor realm expert in the Great Yan Domain?”","Old Master looked at him and smiled. “It’s a very common existence.”","He was already a peak existence of an endless universe, but he was only a very common existence in the Great Yan Domain?","He could not imagine what was beyond the Ancestor realm.","“Did that Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi come here from the Great Yan domain?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Old Master nodded. “He should be. Other than the Great Yan Domain, even if there are other universes, no one can cause you harm.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Did the Devouring Emperor come from the Great Yan Domain?”","“Naturally, the derivative strength that he used that was beyond the scope of divine power proved his identity.” Old Master said and looked at Jian Wushuang. “As for me, I’m an independent existence without a place to live.”","Jian Wushuang was confused and did not know how to ask.","“Wushuang, do you know what the predecessor of the Great Yan Domain was?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","As if reminiscing, Old Master muttered, “The original form of the Great Yan Domain was actually a universe, a universe that was the same as the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe.”","“The original form of the Great Yan Domain was called a ‘Jie’, and I was in another universe called ‘Yan’.”","“These two universes also experienced a Great Catastrophes War. In the end, as the other universe was completely destroyed, it became the Great Yan Domain.”","“And that universe called Yan was the one that was eventually destroyed.”","Listening to Old Master’s description, Jian Wushuang began to feel that his brain capacity was not enough. From the universe to the Great Yan Domain, it seemed to be more complicated and somewhat familiar.","“Why are the two universes fighting to the death? Is it just because they want to destroy the other and advance to the Great Yan Domain?” Jian Wushuang asked in a deep voice.","Old Master shook his head. “The factors involved are too complicated. It’s just like the endless war between your two universes.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. He finally understood the feeling of deja vu.","After the battle of Great Catastrophe between the Jie Universe and the Yan Universe, the Yan Universe had been destroyed, and the Jie Universe advanced to the Great Yan Domain.","Wasn’t the current Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe the same as this route?","He was shocked and seemed to have understood something.","The three conditions that he had set when he first met Void Master in the Polar Sea Star Field.","The first condition was to completely destroy the enemy universe, leaving no living beings behind!","If the only condition for a universe to advance to the Great Yan Domain was to completely destroy an enemy universe, then was not agreeing to Old Master’s condition the only way for a universe to advance to the Great Yan Domain?","Jian Wushuang fell silent. After a long time, he looked at Old Master and said, “Old Master, as long as the Void Universe is destroyed, the Divine Power Universe will be promoted to the Great Yan Domain?”","“It won’t. This Great Dao’s ultimate world can’t contain a second Great Yan Domain. Only by eliminating the first Great Yan Domain can one advance.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not speak anymore.","Old Master did not speak again. After a long time, he slowly said, “Actually, the conditions I mentioned before were just a joke. You don’t have to take them seriously.”","“What are you talking about? There’s a saying in the mortal world that a gentleman’s words can not be taken back. I will keep my promise.” Jian Wushuang laughed and then pretended to be careless. He raised his hand and gently patted Old Master’s shoulder. “This is an agreement between the two of us.”","Old Master shook his head and smiled, no longer speaking.","The conversation in the clouds did not last long, but the vast amount of information contained in it and the extremely complicated source almost directly elevated Jian Wushuang’s existing knowledge.","This allowed him to finally know that the ultimate level of the Great Dao was not the Ancestor realm, and there was still a Grandmaster beyond the Grandmaster.","Could it be possible that his master, Xuan Yi, had walked out of the Great Yan Domain, which contained the beginning of everything and the Ultimate Dao?","When the water parted, the moon could be seen. When the clouds parted, the sun could be seen."]},{"number":4678,"title":"Chapter 4678 Leaving and Discussing the Sword Dao (1)","paragraphs":["4678 Leaving and Discussing the Sword Dao (1)","The Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi, who had comprehended the Sword Dao to the extreme, had appeared with a mighty Fairy-like appearance. His simple and pure Sword Dao had almost completely elevated the Sword Principle to a whole new level.","After the fight with Ding Baiyi, Jian Wushuang did not suffer any setbacks. Instead, he began to comprehend and chip away at the mysterious and obscure level.","His own swordsmanship had long reached the ultimate level. He was bold and unrestrained, full of a sense of cold and aloof arrogance.","However, Ding Baiyi’s sword was the most ordinary of swords, yet it had also reached the peak of perfection. His every move, every form, and every release and retreat were simple and pure, as plain as eating a meal or sleeping a night.","However, it was this most ordinary move that had turned into a fatal sword strike that forced Jian Wushuang into a dead end time and time again.","Jian Wushuang’s current cultivation was to learn how to withdraw his power.","Ding Baiyi, the Sword Immortal from above heavens, had slept for 20,000 years. Jian Wushuang had also cultivated for 20,000 years in the divine pavilion on the Cloud Palace.","In order to have some fun in the dullness of the moves, Jian Wushuang planted a peach tree seedling in the center of the huge Dao Field in front of the divine pavilion.","In 20,000 years, the sapling had grown into a towering tree. The spiritual monsters nurtured in the tree would lie on the treetops every day and watch Jian Wushuang practice his sword skills.","One day, 20,000 years later, the gate of the divine pavilion opened, and Ding Baiyi, who was wearing a plain robe and had a pale face, walked out slowly.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was sitting under the peach tree with a smile, and said with a slightly displeased expression, “Hey, why didn’t you kill me then? Why are you torturing me all day?”","Jian Wushuang grinned and threw the True Sword, which was full of Immortal Qi, at Ding Baiyi.","Ding Baiyi took it and pretended to be mean. “You didn’t kill me when I was unconscious. Aren’t you afraid that I’ll kill you now?”","“Killing you back then was an unfair victory, and I disdained it. If you kill me now, it’s also an unfair victory. What do I have to worry about?” Jian Wushuang laughed. “Why? Are you a sinister person?”","Ding Baiyi was at a loss for words, but he did not know how to retort. With an angry snort, he leaped onto the roof of the divine pavilion with his sword in his arms and fell asleep.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and continued to practice his moves under the peach tree.","The reason why Ding Baiyi had fainted back then was purely because the space-time turbulence had unknowingly eroded his meridians. In addition, he had fought like he was on steroids from the start. To protect himself, his meridians had cut off the supply of Yan power. That was why he had fainted as if he had crashed.","This guy seemed to be seeking revenge, but because he was affected by the cold wind, after saying those harsh words in front of his enemy, he directly fell to the ground and did not wake up like a dead pig.","Fortunately, he had met Jian Wushuang. If it had been anyone else, his divine soul would have been destroyed.","In this way, another thousand years passed. Jian Wushuang did not slack off for even a moment. Even the simplest straight cut could be practiced for 100 years.","Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of Sword Dao had obviously exceeded Ding Baiyi’s expectations.","Ding Baiyi also gradually realized that the suppression he had received back then was not in terms of comprehension of Sword Dao, but in terms of pure realm...","Naturally, this self-proclaimed Sword Immortal had once again provoked a battle.","“I haven’t forgotten the main purpose of my visit. Are you going to wait for me to kill you, or do you want me to get it myself?” Ding Baiyi said coldly from the side of the training hall.","Jian Wushuang shrugged his shoulders, “There have always been people who wanted to take my head, but they all died in front of me one by one. If you want it, you can take it yourself.”","“What big words.” Ding Baiyi sneered. He took a step forward, waved his hand, and pulled off a branch from the peach tree, which still had peach flowers on it.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed, and then he reached out and pulled off a branch with a peach flower.","A vast amount of divine power rose in an instant and occupied the sky above the entire Dao Field like a frightened Dragon.","Ding Baiyi immediately released an even more terrifying Yan power and confronted Jian Wushuang from afar.","Yan power was a special energy that suppressed and contained divine power and void power. It belonged to the Great Yan Domain of higher Laws, and what Devouring Emperor used was Yan power.","Jian Wushuang did not relax his vigilance at all as he looked at the slightly thin white robe. He had practiced the Sword Dao for tens of thousands of years and was ready to defeat him one day!","“use your own sword Dao against me. Otherwise, I can guarantee that you won’t be able to hold on for the next ten breaths,” Ding Baiyi said calmly.","“Naturally,” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and smiled. “Wushuang Sword Dao, the second move of Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, River!”","Countless Sword Intent was derived from the Wushuang Sword Dao, surging and roaring like a Heavenly River, majestic and grand!","The Heavenly River flowed backward, and all of them charged toward Ding Baiyi with boundless might.","As for Jian Wushuang, he was standing in the middle of the Sword Intent like a mountain. He raised the peach blossom branch in his hand and slashed down!","“Interesting.” The corner of Ding Baiyi’s mouth curled up slightly. He stuck the branch behind his neck and faced the vast Sword River like a lightning bolt!","He took a step forward. The surging Sword River did not cause any harm to Ding Baiyi. Instead, he used the force to approach Jian Wushuang.","The peach branch in his hand instantly flicked at Jian Wushuang’s face.","If one were to slow down the speed of this seemingly ordinary sword strike, one would be able to see that it had definitely been used no less than 100,000 times!","100,000 strikes all turned into one sword move. What a crazy sword technique!","Jian Wushuang’s body slanted and he had no choice but to block it.","However, the 100,000 swords were so powerful and terrifying that they broke his defense and cut off all the peach branches in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","The remaining 50,000 swords were all nailed in front of him.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s divine body was indestructible, he still felt his chest tighten. If it had been a real sword and not just a tree branch, there would have been countless holes in his body.","However, Jian Wushuang was not discouraged at all. After forcing Ding Baiyi away with his divine power, he broke off another peach branch and cut at him.","The Wushuang Sword Dao’s bold and powerful attacks landed on Ding Baiyi’s peach blossom branch one after another.","It was as if tens of thousands of divine weapons were crashing down, and even Ding Baiyi felt a suffocating feeling in his chest.","“This fellow is really not bad.” Ding Baiyi was bewildered. Just as he was about to counterattack, the branch in his hand suddenly broke.","Jian Wushuang did not linger in the battle. He retreated and threw him another branch. “Again!”","“Then let’s do it again!”"]},{"number":4679,"title":"Chapter 4679 Leaving and Discussing the Sword Dao (2)","paragraphs":["4679 Leaving and Discussing the Sword Dao (2)","As time passed, the Sword Dao discussion in the Cloud Palace had been going on for 100,000 years.","The peach blossoms were still the same, and the little peach tree spirit from back then had already become graceful and graceful.","The two people under the tree seemed to never know fatigue, and even the peach branches on the peach tree were almost completely bent.","‘Stop fighting already. If you keep fighting, I’m going to lose all my hair.’ This became the peach tree spirit’s catchphrase, but it did not seem to be of much use.","The broken branches had already piled up into two small mountains.","One of them was a figure in plain clothes. His Sword Dao had changed from the restraint and subtlety of hundreds of thousands of years. It was like a sharp Extinctive Sword. Every attack was extremely sharp.","The other black-robed figure’s Sword Daoo had also changed from its bold and unconstrained style from more than a hundred thousand years ago. It was like a treasured sword hidden in a box. Every attack became as slow and heavy as water.","They were already learning from each other!","When the black-robed figure’s final sword strike forced the other figure back, and just like that the 100,000 years Dao discussion finally came to a halt.","“I’m done, I’m tired.” Ding Baiyi stretched his body and threw the branch to Jian Wushuang. Then, he jumped up and lay on the roof of the divine pavilion again.","Jian Wushuang smiled and threw the branch to the peach Immortal. Then, he also jumped onto the roof.","Looking at the clouds in front of him, he asked, “Why did you want to kill me in the first place?”","“It’s as simple as that,” Ding Baiyi said. “I’ve been entrusted by someone to return the favor.”","Jian Wushuang was even more confused now. “I only entered the Great Yan Domain unintentionally. I didn’t even have time to do anything and I’ve already planted an enemy?”","Ding Baiyi looked at him and asked, “Did you kill the Young Emperor’s trusted aides in the Desolate Land?”","Jian Wushuang was about to retort when he suddenly recalled something. He then said in astonishment, “Could it be that the few guys I killed casually were a powerful force in the Great Yan Domain?”","Ding Baiyi’s mouth twitched. “It doesn’t matter if you kill a hundred of those lowly cronies. But what happened after that was the key that led me to come and take your life.”","“When you left the Great Yan Domain, did you let go of a green Luan?”","Jian Wushuang said embarrassedly, “It seems that I have let one go...”","“Then do you know that that green Luan is an Emperor? You’ve let an Emperor go!” Ding Baiyi said grumpily.","“I didn’t know anything at that time. I only helped her because she begged me. Whatever happened after that had nothing to do with me,” Jian Wushuang said hurriedly.","“You...” Ding Baiyi shook his head helplessly and said no more.","He probed, “You’re not planning to kill me?”","“I’m too lazy to kill you. I suddenly have no interest.” Ding Baiyi said lazily, “Besides, if I kill you now, wouldn’t it be an unfair victory?”","“If you don’t kill me, how are you going to explain it to the young Emperor? Aren’t you afraid that the young Emperor will find out?”","Ding Baiyi sneered disdainfully. “I’m only doing this to repay his Imperial Father’s kindness in the past. If I say I’ve killed you, then I’ve killed you. Who would dare to refute me?”","Looking at his domineering face, Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “Then when I have the strength to fight, let’s have another competition?”","He adjusted himself into a comfortable position. “Even if that day comes, I’ll definitely kill you with my own hands to complete my Sword Intent.”","“But that day will probably never come.” Ding Baiyi fell into a deep sleep after saying these words.","Jian Wushuang smiled, leaped down from the divine pavilion, and returned to Cloud Palace.","After sleeping in the divine pavilion for a hundred years, Ding Baiyi was ready to leave.","Jian Wushuang and the old master sent him to Rodu Star Field.","In front of the Spring of Chaos, Jian Wushuang waved his hand to erase the seal in the Spring of Chaos. Then, a majestic and strange energy gushed out, as if a door of Ascension had been opened.","Ding Baiyi stood before the vast energy in his usual plain clothes, looking like a peerless Sword Immortal.","No one spoke. Ding Baiyi slowly walked forward. After dozens of steps, he slowly turned to look at Jian Wushuang and then walked forward.","“Ding Baiyi,” Jian Wushuang shouted loudly and then threw the item in his hand forward.","Ding Baiyi caught it without turning his head. It was a peach branch.","“We won’t see each other again.” The hand that was tightly holding the peach blossom branch gently waved, and then his figure completely disappeared into the vast energy.","Jian Wushuang sealed the Spring of Chaos again and looked at Old Master. “Old Master, do you think Ding Baiyi is really fine after entering the space-time turbulence?”","“Of course. With his cultivation realm, nothing will go wrong. At most, he’ll feel a little uncomfortable,” Old Master replied.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. “I’ve invited another terrifying genius away. I can finally settle down and settle the score.”","Old Master did not speak and followed Jian Wushuang steadily.","In the heavenly Cloud Palace.","At that moment, only Jian Wushuang and Old Master were sitting side by side in the huge hall. On the table in front of them, there was a dark light bound by divine power.","That was one part of Devouring Emperor’s life source, which was also a clay idol.","“Old Master, is there any way to destroy it?” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","Old Master nodded and stretched out his palm to stamp on the ball of light.","The runes with a destructive intent rose up, and several wisps of black smoke that were like wisps of mist surged. Finally, they completely dissipated, not leaving a single trace.","“So, Emperor devouring is truly dead, right?”","Old Master nodded.","Jian Wushuang was relieved. He then held his chin with his hand and asked, “What is a clay idol? Lu Ding did not hesitate to destroy the heavenly Dao and kill tens of millions of cultivators to form a clay idol, and even Devouring Emperor has a clay idol?”","“Generally speaking, a clay idol is the collective name for past obsessions, mortal cultivation, and all one’s comprehensions.” Old Master explained, “The first step to entering the Great Yan Domain is to cut off the past of the mortal world.”","“Lu Ding wanted to enter the Great Yan Domain?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Old Master said, “We can’t rule out this possibility, but if he removes the clay idol from himself, even if he enters the Great Yan Immortal realm, he will be seriously injured. That’s why he lured so many cultivators to devour them, forming his clay idol.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Now that the internal and external chaos has been quelled, it’s time to enter the Void Universe again.”","Old Master nodded. “In another 100,000 years. I need to adjust my breathing for a while.”","After analyzing for a few more days, Old Master left the palace and returned to his residence.","Standing in the vast square, Jian Wushuang started to regulate his breathing.","Now that the Devourers and Devouring Emperor had disappeared, the gate of the Void Universe was completely open.","What Jian Wushuang had to do at the end was to eliminate the Divine Power Universe’s nightmare once and for all!"]},{"number":4680,"title":"Chapter 4680 Old Master Disappeared","paragraphs":["4680 Old Master Disappeared","To a Supreme realm expert, 100,000 years was merely a period of time for one comprehension.","At this point, over 100,000 Invincible Supreme experts went into seclusion at the same time to make full preparations for the upcoming reckoning.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang entered a state of selflessness and repeatedly confronted Ding Baiyi’s Sword Dao in his divine sense.","During the 100,000 years of Sword Dao discussion, Jian Wushuang learned to withdraw his force, which was indispensable for the framework of the entire Wushuang Sword Dao.","At the same time, he was also looking forward to the day when he would be able to have a real confrontation with Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi!","Above the clouds, the clouds rolled and the great path flowed slowly.","In these 100,000 years, the secular world rose and fell, the ancient sects fell and rose, all at the same time.","As for the Supreme martial artists who had transcended the boundaries of life and death, it was just a snap of the fingers.","100,000 years later, all the Invincible Supreme martial artists who had been in seclusion woke up one after another. Their divine power had already been adjusted to their peak state.","The Dragon clan and the Phoenix clan had gathered almost all of their Supreme realm cultivators in front of the heavenly Cloud Palace for this final moment.","If they could completely erase the Void Universe, it would be unparalleled merit for them!","Dao Yan, who was dressed in a green robe, came to Jian Wushuang slowly and said softly, “Master, they are all here.”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and the aura of the Great Dao flowed around him.","He looked behind him out of habit, but he did not see Old Master.","Jian Wushuang calmed himself down and said, “Chu Zhi, please invite Old Master here.”","Chu Zhi responded and quickly rushed to Old Master’s residence.","“Master, this time I want to go with you to gain some experience.” Supreme Dao Yan said solemnly, “I hope Master will agree.”","Jian Wushuang laughed, “You should come along this time.”","Upon hearing this, Supreme Dao Yan was overjoyed. “Thank you, Master.”","At this moment, Chu Zhi’s slightly flustered figure appeared. “Y-your Excellency, Old Master is not in his residence. He seems to have disappeared!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled and he immediately flew to Old Master’s residence.","Xue Bo and the others looked at each other and followed Jian Wushuang.","Feeling the dense divine power around him, Jian Wushuang’s heart sank. Then, he pushed the door open and entered.","On the wooden bed, a black-robed figure had his back to him.","“Old Master?” Jian Wushuang asked softly.","Then, the figure on the wooden bed got up, and Old Master’s unique face appeared in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. However, before he could speak, Old Master spoke first.","“Wushuang, I’m leaving. I’m going to the place where I should go. Just pretend that I’ve never been here, don’t miss me.”","“As for the conditions I mentioned to you before, just treat them as a joke. Forget about them. I don’t want you to end up like that. What I’ve gone through can’t happen a second time.”","“No, where are you going?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and tried to stop Old Master from leaving. “Are you going to the Great Yan Domain alone?”","However, this was only the last shadow left by Old Master, and he could not touch it at all.","Old Master finally looked at Jian Wushuang with a smile in his eyes. “The days I spent with you were one of the few pleasant days I had. Staying by your side makes me feel like I’ve returned to my younger days, but I have to leave now.”","“Remember, never come to the Great Yan Domain. This is something you shouldn’t know. Forget everything.”","After saying this, Old Master’s figure finally disappeared.","Jian Wushuang reached out to grab it subconsciously, but he only managed to grab a handful of tiny stars.","At this point, Old Master had completely disappeared. He had disappeared too cleanly, as if he had never existed in the universe.","Jian Wushuang retreated slowly and sat on the wooden bed, exhausted.","To him, Old Master was both a teacher and a friend. Without him, the entire Divine Power Universe would have been destroyed long ago, and all living beings would be in misery.","However, now that the Divine Power Universe had won, he had disappeared like a passerby.","Jian Wushuang could not accept this. In his heart, Old Master was almost as important as Xuan Yi.","Xuan Yi was his Teacher, and Old Master was his friend. But now, both of them had disappeared without a trace. It was even inexplicable.","They were like passers-by in Jian Wushuang’s life, who had given him supreme fate and help. However, for some unknown reason, they disappeared without leaving any clues.","“The Great Yan Domain, everything must be related to that damned Great Yan Domain! All the answers I want to know are definitely there!” Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his head. He wanted to step into the space-time turbulence to reach Wang Mi, but he gave up.”","If he left, what would happen to the Divine Power Universe? As long as the Void Universe was not destroyed, the Divine Power Universe would not be at peace.","However, in fact, he could not bring himself to totally destroy the Void Universe.","After all, the Void Universe was too vast, and there were no fewer living beings than the Divine Power Universe.","If they were all killed, the killing path they created would be too terrifying.","Old Master seemed to have seen through Jian Wushuang’s thoughts and left quietly.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang looked down at the mottled star in his hand and murmured, “Old Master, I’m sorry.”","The door of the small house closed quietly, and he had been silent for 1,000 years.","Although Xue Bo and the others did not know what had happened, they had a rough idea. They all returned to the Cloud Palace and waited for Jian Wushuang’s arrival.","Only Supreme Dao Yan had been waiting quietly outside the door.","1,000 years passed in the blink of an eye, and the closed door opened again.","Jian Wushuang looked a little haggard. He looked at Supreme Dao Yan, who was waiting respectfully at the side, and forced a smile. “Why didn’t you leave?”","“I can feel Master’s sadness, but I don’t know how to share it. I can only wait outside the door. I’m stupid.” Supreme Dao Yan said, slightly embarrassed.","Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. Then, he extended his hand and patted Supreme Dao Yan’s shoulder, “Come with me. I want to show you something.”","Supreme Dao Yan nodded his head and agreed. Then, he followed Jian Wushuang and reached out his hands, flying into the distance.","Under the starry sky, the invisible Great Dao flowed slowly, and countless destiny was born again.","The Divine Power Universe, which had experienced the most brutal catastrophe, was gradually recovering under the protection of Cosmos God.","Supreme Dao Yan followed behind Jian Wushuang and moved forward without stopping.","The plane that had given birth to life and the broken Star Field were all swimming in his eyes, as if it had been 10,000 years.","The closer they got to the edge of the universe, the more intense the killing intent became. It was the God Burial Ground formed after the battle of the Great Catastrophe!","Supreme Dao Yan followed Jian Wushuang and finally stepped into the Offworld Battlefield."]},{"number":4681,"title":"Chapter 4681 Changing the Laws","paragraphs":["4681 Changing the Laws","Feeling the blood left behind by their predecessors, an uncontrollable desolation surged in their hearts.","Looking at the endless road of bones that was almost made of countless divine corpses, he was shocked even with his calm mind!","It was hard for him to imagine what kind of Great Catastrophe had happened here that even Ancestor realm experts had fallen!","Half Ancestors, Invincible Supremes, and Half Invincible Supremes had all been buried here, and the rich aura of death had become the main color of the Offworld Battlefield.","This was before Dao Yan was born. Dao Yan wore fresh clothes and rode horses. He used his sword to traverse the world. His unimaginable talent in cultivation made him proud of all the heroes.","There were also super sects that tried to assassinate him, but they were destroyed by him with one sword strike. There were also friends who traveled with him freely. However, above the tens of thousands of miles of the galaxy, this was the first time he faced true cruelty.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. Instead, he waved his hand and cast a vast scroll.","The entire desolate battlefield seemed to come to life. The miserable corpses turned into the people in the tornado.","One by one, the people who had once been extremely lively gradually woke up.","An old beggar holding a wine gourd on his Snowflake Sword smiled and transformed into a river of Sword Dao to block the advancing army.","White Ape, the Overlord Patriarch, who had the power of Ancient Overlords that could reach the heavens, was going to die generously.","Fengtian Patriarch used his death to create a chasm and left a fighting chance for the Divine Power Universe, allowing the Last Flames to escape.","There was even Cosmos God who used his body to imprison Void God and disappeared together into the space-time turbulence.","There were also countless unknown cultivators who died in the Offworld Battlefield.","The purest blood and fire kept attacking Dao Yan’s heart. It was the first time he had truly felt the tragedy and the unspeakable elegy.","The scroll painting ended with Jian Wushuang destroying the Void God with one strike and everything returned to normal.","Jian Wushuang looked back at him and said, “This is what happened millions of years ago.”","Dao Yan’s eyes dimmed. “I will remember the kindness of my predecessors and will not forget it until I die.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and then said, “Let’s continue.”","With that, the two figures flew toward the chasm between the two universes.","With a wave of his hand, Jian Wushuang tore the crack of the Void Universe apart and stepped into it.","In the Star Field that had already been shattered into nothingness, nearly 100 Star-grade Void Warriors endured the tearing of the astral winds and stood guard at the edge of the crack.","The moment they saw the crack being torn apart and the appearance of Cosmos God, whose vast brilliance could easily annihilate them, all the Star-grade Void Warriors were in despair. They could not even make any move to escape.","A touch of hatred rose in Dao Yan’s eyes. He raised his hand and was about to kill these Void Warriors.","However, Jian Wushuang waved his hand to stop Dao Yan. He shook his head slowly and then floated forward.","Dao Yan withdrew his palm, glanced at the hundred or so Void Warriors coldly, and followed Jian Wushuang.","The hundred or so Void Warriors felt as if they had just walked a circle around death. They were all sweating profusely. They looked at each other. The Void Warrior with the highest cultivation realm and the oldest took a deep breath and said, “Inform the nearest Star Field to escape as far as possible.”","“But who can escape?” A Void Warrior with a broken arm laughed miserably. Then, he extinguished his own life force and turned into a handful of ashes.","That’s right. Even Void God was killed by him, so who could escape?","Above the endless void, Jian Wushuang’s figure moved forward slowly as if he wanted to engrave all the scenes in the Void Universe into his mind.","Then, millions of Void Warriors began to rush out from the various star areas. They all looked at Jian Wushuang in despair.","The Dao yan Supreme had already accumulated his divine power and was ready to fight.","Jian Wushuang ignored the tens of millions of Void Warriors below him.","To him, even if there were double the number of Void Warriors, he would just kill them casually.","What he was about to do now was something he had never done before.","He wanted to change the Great Dao rules of the Void Universe!","After an unknown number of years, Jian Wushuang arrived at the center of the Void Universe. The number of Void Warriors surrounding him had already become endless.","Jian Wushuang slowly spat out the rules of Great Dao of the Divine Power Universe and the brilliant divine brilliance around him started to be restrained.","Then, a cold and lonely aura began to appear.","The appearance of this aura shocked all the Void Warriors to the extreme.","That was void power! The void power that represented the Void Universe!","As the dark and lonely aura increased, Jian Wushuang’s divine pattern turned into void patterns when it reached a certain critical point!","Dao Yan was shocked too. He was so shocked that he couldn’t be any more shocked. That was a cosmos God who represented the peak of the Divine Power Universe and controlled the rules of Great Daos. He could actually cultivate void power?","As Jian Wushuang became a Void God, his boundless void power surged and the rules of Great Dao in the entire Void Universe drew closer to him.","His golden eyes had turned completely black. His aura was even colder than that of a Void God, which terrified all the Void Warriors. They couldn’t believe what was happening in front of them.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes slowly swept across the universe and then he raised his hand to grasp the Great Dao!","The Great Dao of the Void Universe landed in his hand obediently and flowed slowly.","Then, he began to modify the Laws!","The heavens and earth trembled as they continued to merge and change. The Laws of the Great Dao contained too many things. Everything, cultivation, heaven and earth, man and God, were all changing bit by bit.","From a certain perspective, Jian Wushuang’s comprehension of the Great Dao had already surpassed Ancestor realm!","As the rules of the Great Dao of the Void Universe were modified, everything gradually became more concrete.","The destroyed heavens began to reconstruct. The void power remained, but the accompanying skills of every Void Warrior in the Void Universe had been removed.","The Void Explosion power that broke the balance and was inborn was erased by Jian Wushuang from the Laws of the Great Dao!","Furthermore, it would be completely wiped out and would no longer remain in the bloodline.","Each of the Void Warriors could feel the changes in their bodies. The Dantian that was specially used to store Void Explosions had disappeared, as if it had never appeared.","After Jian Wushuang had done all this, he converted the vast void power into divine power.","His main purpose in coming to the Void Universe this time had been accomplished.","If he didn’t completely destroy the Void Universe, he would have to make it reach a delicate balance with the godly power universe.","And this balance was to completely remove the void explosion from the Great Dao rules of the Void Universe!","From a certain perspective, Jian Wushuang had given up on settling the scores of the Void Universe.","From now on, Void Warriors could no longer suppress cultivators by lowering their cultivation realms without Void Explosions!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang resolutely buried a part of the origin in the rules of Great Dao of the Void Universe. This way, even in the distant future where time was meaningless, he could still protect the Divine Power Universe.","“I’ve already completed the Great Dao fate of the Void Universe. From now on, no one from the Void Universe can take a step into the Divine Power Universe in the Void Universe. Anyone who violates this will be killed by the Great Dao.”"]},{"number":4682,"title":"Chapter 4682 I Want to Enter the Great Yan Domain","paragraphs":["4682 I Want to Enter the Great Yan Domain","The last sentence was a restriction that Jian Wushuang had planted in the Great Dao as a Void God.","This was another guarantee. Even if the universe was destroyed, it would not disappear, unless there was a stronger powerhouse that reconstructed the Laws.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang did not look at the universe again and flew toward the crack.","He stood at the edge of the crack and looked back at the universe. He looked at the Dao Yan and said, “Remember, your mission is to protect the Divine Power Universe.”","“This disciple will remember it, and will never forget it.” Dao Yan said solemnly.","Jian Wushuang nodded and waved his hand to seal the crack completely with his supreme divine power. He also sealed the other hundreds of cracks.","The two universes might no longer have any connection after this blockade. It would take a long time for another Void God to appear in the Void Universe.","After sealing up the crack, Jian Wushuang went to the Land of Sorrow again. He had never forgotten the place that reignited hope in the Divine Power Universe.","There was no sign of Elder Shi Ting in the God Burial Ground of the Land of Sorrows. It was still silent, and countless corpses of gods were lying there, still alive.","After reaching the Ancestor realm and standing at the peak of the universe, Jian Wushuang vaguely realized that every divine corpse in the Land of Sorrows was beyond the Ancestor realm and did not belong to the Divine Power Universe.","However, if it did not belong to a universe with divine power, why would it use divine power? This was what Jian Wushuang was most puzzled about.","Jian Wushuang left in disappointment as he could not find Shi Ting.","At this point, the internal and external troubles of the Divine Power Universe had been eliminated, and the era of clarity had come.","...","Beside the heavenly Cloud Palace, in front of the Dao Field of the divine pavilion.","Jian Wushuang lay on the branch of the peach tree and looked at the sea of clouds around him.","Little peach fairy climbed up and down his body, greedily sniffing the Great Dao on Cosmos God’s body.","Dao Yan, who had changed into plain clothes, was sitting under the peach tree in Enlightenment. A few days ago, Jian Wushuang had given him some mental cultivation methods, which were greatly beneficial for him to break through to the Half Ancestor realm.","Ninth Kalpa King and the others gathered together to accompany Jian Wushuang during his nap.","The Divine Power Universe was gradually on the right track after the battle of the Great Catastrophe War. With the blessings from the heavens that Jian Wushuang had promised, the divine power that filled the world was several times more than what it had been before. It was enough to make up for the gap between the realms.","“What are you thinking about? It’s been ten years. I saw that you’ve been in a daze since you came back from the Void Universe.” Ninth Kalpa King, who was beside Jian Wushuang, said slowly, “You’re too tired. You need to rest. Forget about Old Master for the time being.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. After a long time, he said, “What do you think of Dao Yan?”","Ninth Kalpa King opened his eyes and glanced at him, then said, “He has a calm heart, plans before making a decision, and has a rare fearless spirit. Earlier, on the Path of the Heavenly Gate, he resisted the Heavenly Punishment of the other five people with his own power. The only shortcoming is that he is easily too rigid.”","Jian Wushuang smiled but did not speak.","Ninth Kalpa King then sat up and looked at him with a firm gaze, “You’ve already paid enough for anyone and anything. Don’t waste yourself anymore and settle down.”","“Just like a Cosmos God, protecting this place. The Divine Power Universe is already big enough.”","Jian Wushuang also sat up from the branch and reached out to pick up little peach fairy.","“Ninth Kalpa, you know that I can’t just stay here. The Divine Power Universe is out of danger, but everything I want to know is still hidden in the fog. I have to find it.”","“I thought I could know everything I wanted to know by standing at the top, but now I know that it’s still too early.”","Ninth Kalpa King’s brows slowly furrowed. “You’re going to look for Old Master?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said softly, “Yes, but I’m not just looking for Old Master. I’m also looking for other people. I want to completely understand the so-called ultimate realm that has been bothering me.”","“Where do you want to go?”","“A place, perhaps it’s a very distant place.”","“What is this place?” Ninth Kalpa King said seriously.","Jian Wushuang laughed silently and looked into the distance with determination. “I want to enter the Great Yan Domain alone!”","...","In the center of the vast Dao Field, Jian Wushuang was the only one.","He sat in the center of the Dao Field with a deep breath. The Great Dao around him flowed slowly, forming golden water patterns. It was extremely sacred.","The conversation he had with Old Master in the Cloud Palace rang in his ears.","“The so-called clay idol is generally the collective name for the three aspects of past obsessions, mortal cultivation, and one’s own comprehension.”","“The first step to entering the Great Yan Domain is to cut off the past of the mortal world.”","Like the echoes of a clear spring, they turned into flowing characters.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. He was already standing at the peak of the universe. His original mortal body had long transformed into an Ancestor realm body through the cultivation realm breakthroughs.","In addition, he was a Perfect Life Form, so the meaning of the word ‘clay idol’ did not hold any weight for him.","What Jian Wushuang understood was that he wanted to completely cut off his past self, whether it was cultivation or memory.","However, once he cut off the past, even the injuries suffered by Ancestor realm cultivators would be difficult to predict.","After millions of years of cultivation insights, obsessions, and memories had disappeared... What else could he have left?","Could it be that the conditions to enter the Great Yan Domain were so terrifying?","After a brief moment of hesitation, Jian Wushuang carried out the ceremony resolutely!","In an instant, the Great Dao wailed, and the Ancestor realm fate energy began to leak out of his body, returning to the world.","At that moment, all the Half Ancestors and the Invincible Supremes woke up from their meditation and looked at the Dao Field above the heavenly cloud Palace in disbelief.","Supreme Xue Bo woke up from his meditative state. After sensing this scene, he staggered and fell to the ground.","Ninth Kalpa King and the others were also in disbelief. They instantly rushed to the top of the palace.","However, due to the restriction, none of the Half Ancestors could get close to it. They could only watch Jian Wushuang’s body gradually dim and his Ancestor fate energy return to the heaven and earth.","He was breaking his Ancestral source!","“Jian Wushuang, stop!” Feng Qi madly hit the barrier, “Do you know what you are doing? You’ll die!”","Leng Rushuang’s tears fell from her eyes. As his wife, how could she not feel that Jian Wushuang’s fate energy was returning to the heavens?","Even the calm Ninth Kalpa King could no longer remain calm. He rushed to Reng rushuang and said with red eyes, “You are his wife. Only you can persuade him. He is destroying his Ancestral source!”"]},{"number":4683,"title":"Chapter 4683 Yan Immortal","paragraphs":["4683 Yan Immortal","“I respect his decision,” Leng Rushuang said with a bitter smile.","Ninth Kalpa King took a step back and lost his soul. He had never expected that Jian Wushuang would be so determined to destroy his Ancestral source in such an intense way!","The Ancestor realm supreme fate energy dissipated between the heavens and earth, and it was impossible to gather it back.","There was no turning back.","“Master, Dao Yan asks you to stop.” Dao Yan knelt heavily on the ground, his eyes filled with tears.","“Why are you doing this, cosmos God?!” Elder Xue Bo wept. “Is the universe that you’ve been protecting all this time not enough for you? Aren’t you going to miss us?”","“Alright! Fine! This old man will go with you.” Without hesitation, Elder Xue Bo reached out to destroy his life source, but he was held back by Long Yan and Long Chi.","“No, there must be a reason for Jian Wushuang’s actions. Otherwise, he would have no reason to do so...” Feng Qi slowly got up and murmured.","At the same time, Ninth Kalpa King also recalled the conversation he had with Jian Wushuang.","One of the most important words was the Great Yan Domain!","Ninth Kalpa King seemed to have realized something. Could Jian Wushuang’s scattering of the Ancestral fate energy be related to the Great Yan Domain?","The Ancestor fate energy returned to the thousands of Daos in the heavens, and every Half Ancestor felt the shackles on their bodies begin to loosen.","Supreme Dao Yan was Half Ancestor realm.","Everyone’s eyes were slightly red as they looked at the figure whose aura was gradually weakening.","In the hazy fate energy, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes with great difficulty. He looked at his old brothers who had walked out of a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood. He smiled and finally lowered his eyes.","At first, the thousands of rays of the Great Dao enveloped his body, but in the end, they dissipated in the same way.","The peak Ancestor realm expert of the universe no longer existed.","Jian Wushuang himself felt extremely relaxed and ethereal. His divine soul seemed to have flown up to the Nine Heavens, but he did not know where it was.","At the same time, the divine power in his meridians and Dantian began to dissipate, and in its place was an unknown energy.","The energy was like clouds and mist, but it was majestic and vast.","That was – Yan power!","When this kind of energy was born in the meridians, it would burn directly in the meridians, and even the soul would find it difficult to bear the pain.","Jian Wushuang suddenly opened his eyes and a shadow began to be peeled off from his back.","The past that was formed from obsession, mortal cultivation, and all of one’s own comprehension began to take form.","Divine blood gushed out from every pore of Jian Wushuang’s body, soaking his white shirt in blood. However, he remained silent and slowly removed his past self from his divine body.","It was the most lustrous light, different from the red light of the sun, which was bright in the Dao Field.","A clay idol that was exactly the same as Jian Wushuang began to take shape.","A large area of the Dao Field collapsed, and the clouds gathered.","When the sun in the heavens beyond the heavens shone its brilliant rays of light again, everything fell silent.","The divine blood dissipated in the air. Jian Wushuang, who was wearing a white robe, sat on the spot, without any color of blood.","He forced his eyes open and then passed out.","Behind him, a True Shadow with a bright glow around it slowly opened its eyes.","The consciousness of the primal chaos was slowly born, and the clay idol began to look at everything in front of it with curiosity and confusion.","On the clouds, everyone rushed forward. Leng Rushuang crazily held Jian Wushuang, who had passed out.","As for Ninth Kalpa King and the others, they were shocked as they looked at the True Shadow that was exactly the same as Jian Wushuang.","“I’m... Hungry...” The clay idol opened its mouth and looked at everyone.","In the next moment, he was actually lying on the top of the clouds, looking at the clouds that were formed by pure divine power, and he began to eat heartily.","“This... Is that Jian Wushuang too?” Feng Qi was dumbfounded. She could not believe her eyes. She looked at the guy who was lying on the clouds, eating the clouds like eating cotton candy.","“Delicious, delicious...” the clay idol mumbled as it ate, like a child.","Everyone looked at each other and then hurriedly welcomed Jian Wushuang into the Cloud Palace.","As for the clay idol, it was directly carried by Ninth Kalpa King on his shoulder and sent into the heavenly Cloud Palace.","In the Cloud Palace, looking at the True Shadow that was almost the same as Jian Wushuang, everyone looked at each other. No one spoke first, but they all could not take their eyes off him.","Jian Wushuang had been led into the inner hall, and Leng Rushuang, Feng Qi, and the others were taking care of him.","Only ‘Jian Wushuang’ was left sitting in the same place, grinning foolishly...","In the end, it was the Ninth Kalpa King who probed, “Uou are Jian Wushuang?”","The clay True Shadow laughed foolishly. “I’m hungry...”","...","“What’s your name?”","“I’m hungry.”","...","After asking a series of questions and only getting the words ‘I’m hungry’, everyone understood that this fellow’s intelligence was probably not much stronger than a newborn baby.","No one could do anything about this guy who had been extracted from Jian Wushuang’s body. They would only have an answer when Jian Wushuang woke up.","In the inner hall, Chu Zhi was carefully placing pieces of the Ice of the Extreme North on Jian Wushuang’s body.","Feng Qi was sitting on one side of the bed, her eyes closed as she tried to sense his life force.","Previously, in the Cangwu Platform, she had transferred most of her Ancestral source into Jian Wushuang’s body. In some ways, only Feng Qi knew Jian Wushuang’s body condition better than anyone else.","However, Jian Wushuang’s current situation made Feng Qi feel helpless.","The current Jian Wushuang was like a big cocoon that was completely sealed off. It naturally rejected divine power.","No one could see his condition, but they could feel that his aura was stabilizing.","“Sister Feng Qi, how is Wushuang’s condition?” Leng Rushuang asked nervously.","Feng Qi frowned and said in a low voice, “His breathing is stable. There doesn’t seem to be any major problems. However, I’m afraid that his Dao will never come back.”","“It’s good that he survived. No matter what he becomes, I’ll always be with him,” Leng Rushuang said firmly.","Feng Qi did not say anything more and slowly walked away. Her back seemed to have aged a lot in an instant.","In the huge inner hall, only Jian Wushuang was left, whose Great Dao had disappeared.","When the last trace of divine power was expelled from his body, the vast Yan power finally surged!","A mysterious state was added to his body.","In the endless darkness, Jian Wushuang’s divine consciousness seemed to be swimming in eternal darkness.","The extremely intense feeling of weightlessness made him feel extremely uncomfortable.","It was as if he was falling without end, and an ethereal voice rang in his ears.","“Wushuang, you should not have disobeyed me.”","“You’ll regret this...”","In the pitch-black darkness, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and subconsciously looked at the extreme darkness below him.","The thing that was emitting endless darkness was actually a pair of pitch-black pupils that were like black holes!"]},{"number":4684,"title":"Chapter 4684 A Pot of Wine in the Mortal World","paragraphs":["4684 A Pot of Wine in the Mortal World","Old Master!","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up, sweat pouring out of his sideburns.","The burning pain in his meridians disappeared and was replaced by a cold void.","He clenched his fist, which meant that the Ancestor realm Great Dao had long dissipated and that his fate energy had returned to the universe.","From now on, he would no longer have any connection with the entire Divine Power Universe.","“Is it worth it to search for that illusory ultimate realm? ” he asked himself, but no one could give him an answer, and there was no turning back.","After changing into a green robe, Jian Wushuang walked out of the inner hall slowly and arrived at the main hall of the Cloud Palace.","At that moment, Ninth Kalpa King, Elder Xue Bo, and the others in the Cloud Palace had gathered there and had not left. When they saw Jian Wushuang appear, they were all stunned and then they all ran over.","“Cosmos God, you’re alright. It’s good that you’re alright!” Xue Bo’s eyes were bloodshot as he looked at Jian Wushuang with great reluctance.","Ninth Kalpa King was still a man of few words, but the concern in his eyes betrayed his expressionless face.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “It’s fine. I won’t die for the time being. However, from today onwards, I will no longer hold the position of Cosmos God. The position of Cosmos God will be passed down to each and every one of you here.”","“No, I don’t agree!” Xue Bo immediately opposed. “Palace Master Wushuang, you are the only one who can become Cosmos God. This is definitely not our choice. It is the choice of the Heavenly Dao!”","“We don’t agree either, Lord Cosmos God.” Long Yan and Long Chi nodded at the same time.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “I have returned all the fate energy to heaven and earth. From today on, heaven will make a choice between each of you.”","With that, he returned the 10 percent of the Ancestor realm aura that the Dragon Emperor Llinhe had left behind to Long Yan and the Long Chi. At the same time, he also gave the Heavenly Path’s fate energy that was attached to him to all the Half Ancestors.","At that moment, a voice was heard in the quiet Cloud Palace. Then, a figure that looked exactly like Jian Wushuang appeared.","Their eyes met and Jian Wushuang waved his hand at the True Shadow.","Then, the clay idol turned into a stream of light and flew into his palm.","The flowing light was the size of a broad bean, and it was beating rhythmically like a heart.","“What is this?” Elder Xue Bo asked in confusion.","Jian Wushuang murmured, “This is my past.”","Then, he said, “Everyone, I’m going to leave for a few days to make a trip to the lower realm. To settle some trifling matters.”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","After walking out of the palace, he turned back to look at the towering palace for the last time, then walked into the heavens slowly.","“Have you already decided?” Ninth Kalpa King looked forward into the layers of the universe.","Jian Wushuang nodded. “After I send my past to the lower realms, I’ll prepare to leave.”","“No matter when you come back, you have to remember that we’re all waiting for you,” Ninth Kalpa King said as he turned his head and looked at him.","Jian Wushuang smiled and patted his shoulder. “I know.”","The Divine Power Universe was vast and boundless, including tens of thousands of worlds. However, the one with the largest base was the mortal world, which had thin spiritual energy.","Sitting in the clouds, Jian Wushuang looked at the flowing light in his palm and the past came to his mind.","Once he reincarnated, his millions of years of memories and obsessions would also disappear.","However, Jian Wushuang still threw it down resolutely.","“You didn’t want to keep him in the Cloud Palace, just to throw him into the mortal world?” Ninth Kalpa King was puzzled. “Do you know how many hundreds of years his lifespan will be at most? You won’t even have the slightest bit of Dao affinity?”","He said slowly, “It might not be a bad thing to be able to enter reincarnation.”","Ninth Kalpa King shook his head helplessly and said, “Let’s go. I’ll go with you to the lower realm to see where he will go.”","...","At the Bai Manor in Changping County.","With the sound of a baby’s cry, the storm that had been pouring for ten days finally stopped, and the world became clear.","The Bai Manor was decorated with lanterns and streamers, and red lanterns stretched for dozens of miles. Every servant was full of joy. After carefully accepting the reward money given by the housekeeper, they greeted each other.","The wife who had been pregnant for 11 months finally gave birth to a son. At the same time, the flood that had spread through the entire county city was also dispersed, causing everyone to be surprised.","The news that anyone who went to the Bai Manor to say a few words could receive 10 wens of wedding money spread, and for a time, the people surrounded the Bai Manor’s gate.","At the same time, two figures dressed in plain clothes strolled along the long corridors and pavilions of the Bai Manor, but the servants who were hurrying past ignored them.","“This kid who entered the reincarnation cycle, is that kid you? Or should I say, your past?” one of the handsome young men asked.","The other young man, who was a little thin but had a majestic look in his eyes, replied, “It’s me, but it’s not me. Ever since he left my body, he became an independent little fellow.”","Ninth Kalpa King smiled quietly. “Since you said that he’s an individual existence different from you, then how about I give him Immortal roots and let him acknowledge me as his Master? This way, even if you leave, the heavenly Cloud Palace will have a successor.”","“No, Ninth Kalpa.” Jian Wushuang felt helpless. “In this way, too many hidden dangers may be exposed. Even I don’t know what the consequences will be if I separate him from my body. I might as well let him enter reincarnation safely.”","“Alright, alright, I’ll do as you say.” Ninth Kalpa King teased, “Who asked you to be Cosmos God?”","“After today, I’m no longer Cosmos God. I think Dao Yan should be able to take on the position of Cosmos God.”","“You’ve already decided?”","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at him at the same time, “As for you, you will be my last trump card in this universe.”","Ninth Kalpa King nodded slightly. “I understand.”","As the two conversed, they had already walked through the corridor to a wing room.","They entered through the door. At this moment, there was only a couple in the huge room.","“Madam, you’ve had a hard time,” in front of the half-closed bed, a middle-aged man held the woman’s hand tightly and said gently.","The woman smiled and pursed her lips. “It’s unfortunate.”","In a cradle wrapped in brocade, a baby with red lips and white teeth was staring at two figures with a pair of round eyes.","Ninth Kalpa King made a funny face and then pointed his finger at the little guy’s forehead.","Threads of warm divine power entered his brain.","“Since you don’t want me to give this kid the Immortal root, then I’ll let him live to 500 years old, have descendants, and be free from disease and disaster...”","The little guy chuckled, and the first baby tooth began to grow out of his pink gums.","Jian Wushuang also smiled, and crystal tears fell from his eyes silently.","“Let’s go, Ninth Kalpa.”","“Alright,” he said."]},{"number":4685,"title":"Chapter 4685 Great Yan Domain","paragraphs":["4685 Great Yan Domain","In the 32nd year of Jingjing, the Bai Manor in Changping County gave birth to a strange son who grew old to 527 years old without any illness or disaster. The later generations were amazed.","After experiencing so many tribulations, it was not necessarily a bad thing to reincarnate.","In the Rodu Star Field, which was still in a state of destruction, there were only two figures left.","Ninth Kalpa King stood far away in the void, watching the thin but firm figure move forward step by step.","He did not know when they would meet again after this farewell, but everything was already set in stone and could not be changed.","The peerless genius who had stunned everyone had left just like that.","Jian Wushuang looked back at Ninth Kalpa King for the last time and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. Then, he stepped into the gate of heaven that was as vast as the galaxy.","Whizzzzz...","Billions of divine light rays scattered across the sky like tassels before completely vanishing into nothingness.","Ninth Kalpa King stood on the spot, lost in thought. He seemed to not believe that Jian Wushuang had already left.","However, there was no aura left by Jian Wushuang in the entire boundless Divine Power Universe.","It was as if he had never been there before, and also like a passerby who had stopped in a hurry. No one knew where he had gone in the end.","After a long time, Ninth Kalpa King murmured softly, “The Great Yan Domain? I’ll remember that.”","Along with the terrifying squall in the space-time turbulence, Jian Wushuang felt a sharp pain in his body almost instantly.","He cut off his past completely and stripped off his clay idol True Shadow. All of his Ancestor fate energy was returned to the Divine Power Universe.","While cutting off the Ancestor realm path, he had also entered the Yan Immortal Realm.","It was an even more mysterious realm. It was so mysterious that even Jian Wushuang, who had successfully ascended, could not explain it.","However, the only thing he could be sure of was that the Yan Immortal was a special existence that had surpassed the Ancestor realm.","This was because the symbol of Yan Immortal, Yan power was a mighty energy that was not much higher than divine power but had a unique growth property.","The Yan Immortal was also the symbol of entering the Great Yan Domain.","However, Jian Wushuang’s current situation was a little awkward. Although he had taken that step, his Yan power was still in a weak state and it was difficult for him to resist the space-time turbulence effectively.","One had to know that even the Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi’s realm could suffer a great loss from the space-time turbulence if he was not careful.","He was no longer wandering around like a headless fly in the chaos of time and space like before. There was a weak force guiding him.","He did not know how many years he had been walking in the chaotic darkness. Just when he felt like he was about to run out of oil, a crack of the space that was emitting an invisible white light appeared in front of him.","Jian Wushuang did not hesitate and stepped into it.","Almost at the same time, layers of unparalleled pressure enveloped his body. Jian Wushuang, who was already at the end of his rope, had no power to fight back and directly fainted.","History was always the same. Jian Wushuang, who came to the Great Yan Domain for the second time, was as embarrassing as he was the first time...","The intense pain spread through his limbs and bones, and then he was woken up by cold water.","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up from his unconscious state and saw two servant-like figures looking at him with a faint smile.","“You’re clearly awake, yet you still dare to continue playing dead?” One of the brawny men laughed and pulled out a black bone whip from his waist. The black and purple wind whipped at Jian Wushuang.","Even though he had just woken up from a coma, the battle instinct that was deeply ingrained in his bones made him attack almost instantly. He grabbed the tip of the whip with his large hand and slapped the bearded man at the same time.","It was conceivable that Jian Wushuang’s terrifying move would definitely kill him easily.","But then, a strange scene appeared.","The chain iron medal engraved with complicated patterns on Jian Wushuang’s neck suddenly released a great power that traveled through his limbs and bones, imprisoning him.","“Ah...” Jian Wushuang cried out in pain and knelt on the ground.","The bearded man, whose legs were trembling with fear due to the killing intent, did not dare to be impudent. He immediately screamed and retreated.","At the same time, there were lightning snakes writhing in the dark sky.","The torrential rain fell, washing the earth.","Jian Wushuang lay on his side on the ground. The confinement made him unable to even breathe.","On the ground covered in rough black-gray soil, there were more than a hundred thousand figures with barely any clothes on. As the rain fell from the sky, they were all facing upwards, allowing the rain to wash over their bodies.","Each of them had a chain and metal token wrapped around their neck, imprisoning their divine souls and bodies.","In the heavy rain, an extremely thin figure slowly came to Jian Wushuang. Then, he stretched out an arm, put him on his shoulder, and walked toward a huge cave.","The storm stopped, and the hundred thousand figures slowly entered the cave.","After an unknown amount of time, Jian Wushuang slowly woke up and all he could see was the dim firelight.","“I... Where am I...”","He barely managed to support his body and sit up.","When he saw nearly a thousand figures sitting around him, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","How could there be so many people gathered in a cave like this?","Everyone looked at him with numb and empty eyes, not saying a word.","The thin figure who carried him back into the cave sized him up and said, “Go to sleep. There’s still work to be done tomorrow. Don’t die of exhaustion.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone fell to the ground, and the cave became even more eerily silent.","Slowly suppressing the depression in his heart, Jian Wushuang asked, “What is this place?”","“Your grave,” the thin figure said concisely.","Jian Wushuang did not ask any more questions. Instead, he tried to remove the chain iron plate from his neck.","However, he had only touched it slightly when the mighty power from the chain iron token instantly knocked him out again.","Time passed by quietly. When the last ray of light in the huge cave disappeared, everything was truly dead silent.","“Wake up, it’s time to work.”","With a slight push, Jian Wushuang woke up in a daze.","At this moment, the sky outside had already brightened up, and the people living in the cave began to line up and walk toward the exit.","The thin figure turned his head and left with big steps.","Jian Wushuang got up slowly and followed the team in a daze.","Although the sky was bright, there were no traces of the sun. There were still thick dark clouds in the distance.","Dozens of black mountains that were almost connected to the sky and more than 100,000 prisoners with chains and iron plates on their necks were the main colors of this place.","Jian Wushuang was sure that he had arrived at the Great Yan Domain.","However, the scene in front of him made him suspicious.","How did he come to this place, and it seemed like he had become a prisoner?"]},{"number":4686,"title":"Chapter 4686 The Prisoner","paragraphs":["4686 The Prisoner","Jian Wushuang shook his dizzy head and started to observe the prisoners who were in the same situation as him.","What he saw shocked him. None of the prisoners were lower than Half Ancestors!","What kind of concept was that? Even in the most brutal Great Catastrophe War, there were no more than 30 Half Ancestors in the Divine Power Universe and the Void Universe, and some of them were Devourers.","But now, the lowest rank of these prisoners was actually Half Ancestor?","100,000 Half Ancestors? Even with Jian Wushuang’s composure, he was completely shocked.","Could this be the specialty of the Great Yan Domain?","Even the prisoner’s realm had reached such a level. Jian Wushuang did not dare to imagine what other terrifying existences there were in the Great Yan Domain.","After taking a deep breath and suppressing his shock, Jian Wushuang looked at the black mountain closest to him.","There were more than 100,000 prisoners in total, and they were directly divided into 10 teams. The teams were in the units of tens of thousands people, and they were like long dragons that marched into different black mountains.","Jian Wushuang’s team entered the largest black mountain.","Just as he was about to enter the huge mine, he saw hundreds of black-robed figures walking around.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang felt a sense of deja vu when he saw them.","However, before he could take a closer look, the prisoners behind him pushed him forward.","After entering the deep tunnel, it was not as dark as he had imagined. Instead, a hazy purple light illuminated the entire tunnel, making it look like a dream.","Jian Wushuang noticed that the hazy purple light was coming from a type of purple sand that was distributed in the mine.","As the team went deeper, this team of more than 10,000 seemed extremely small in the deep belly of the black mountain.","At the same time, hundreds of black-robed warden divided the team into more than a hundred teams.","Jian Wushuang’s team of 100 people entered the widest mine tunnel under the guard’s lead.","“What a coincidence. You’ve just arrived here, and you’re about to die.” The slim figure who was walking beside him had a flash of mockery in his eyes. “Prepare well.”","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to speak, a huge black whip lashed at the thin figure, causing him to groan and blood to ooze out of his chest.","The black-robed warden at the front of the group turned around and gave Jian Wushuang a cold look before continuing on.","Looking at the Half Ancestor level warden, Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He then turned his head and asked in a low voice, “What did you mean by what you said just now?”","“Bait,” After Jian Wushuang repeated this several times in his heart, he could vaguely guess what was going to happen next.","The mine tunnel became hotter and hotter the further he went. When he reached the end, Jian Wushuang was surprised to see that the heart of the mountain was empty.","Countless huge black vines that looked like stone sculptures covered the stone walls, as if they could wake up at any time.","At the same time, the stone walls surrounding these pitch-black vines were covered with countless special purple crystals.","The black-robed warden standing at the front slowly turned around and looked at the 100-man team.","“Jump down,” he said in a deep voice.","However, no one stepped forward.","The black-robed warden seemed to have anticipated this situation. He waved his black bone whip and swept up nearly 20 people, throwing them into the abyss.","In the next moment, the most shocking scene appeared. The pitch-black vines that were attached to the stone wall slowly woke up. Like giant pythons, they directly wrapped up the prisoners who fell into the abyss and stuffed them into the unknown darkness.","All the prisoners who saw this scene subconsciously stepped back, shaking all over.","However, the black-robed warden laughed coldly. As he retreated, he used a vast amount of Yan power to block all the exits.","At the same time, a giant python-like vine quietly appeared in front of the prisoners.","Boom boom boom!","The pitch-black vines suddenly reached forward and directly swept away more than half of the prisoners.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his eyebrows. There was no way to retreat as the abyss was right under his feet!","The thin figure beside him glanced at Jian Wushuang and then jumped onto the black vine that was hanging in the air.","The rest of the prisoners followed closely, gritting their teeth and jumping up.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and jumped as well.","His foot was as hard as a rock, and with a little force, the gravel fell.","“This thing is actually a living thing...” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and began to think about how to escape.","The injuries he had suffered in the space-time turbulence had long recovered, and at the same time, the Yan power in his body had reached its peak.","However, the chain iron plate on his neck was like the Laws of the Great Dao, restricting all the Yan power in his meridians.","Jian Wushuang’s strength could hardly reach the ancestor level.","The only thing he was relieved about was that he could still use his Sword Intent and Ancestral Skills, so he had no problem protecting himself for the time being.","Running between the vines was no less dangerous than before.","Each of the vines, which could easily destroy a Half Ancestor, waved wildly like tentacles.","However, in just a few exchanges, there were less than 10 people in the group of nearly 200 prisoners.","“Hang in there. As long as we can hold on until the others enter the pit, we can live!” A thin figure suddenly appeared beside Jian Wushuang and reminded him in a deep voice, “Follow me and I’ll make sure you don’t die!”","Jian Wushuang laughed quietly and said, “Let’s save our own lives first before we talk about other things.”","“You don’t believe me?” The skinny man’s eyes narrowed.","Jian Wushuang continued, “Of course I believe you, but no one can save themselves here, right?”","The slim figure did not say anything. After taking a look at Jian Wushuang, he disappeared into the vines like a ghost.","Jian Wushuang focused on avoiding the attacks of the vines.","When the last scream came to an abrupt end, only two people were left alive above the entire abyss.","One of them was Jian Wushuang, and the other was the thin figure.","Although Jian Wushuang could not tell this guy’s cultivation realm in this situation, Jian Wushuang could vaguely feel that the thin figure was not an ordinary Half Ancestor.","The two of them looked at each other from a distance and then nodded tacitly. Jian Wushuang then asked, “How long do you want to hold on?”","The thin figure slowly raised a finger.","“A day?”","“No, it’s a year.”","“What? A year?”","“Of course not.” The slim man smiled weirdly. “Only after the big guy is full and falls asleep will they let the other teams mine. That will be the best time for us to escape!”"]},{"number":4687,"title":"Chapter 4687 Slaying Yan Immortal (1)","paragraphs":["4687 Slaying Yan Immortal (1)","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and said, “You sound very experienced.”","“Of course. This isn’t the first time I’ve done this,” the thin figure said. “However, you don’t look panicked at all. It’s a little unexpected.”","“Panicking won’t help. It’s better to think about how to leave,” Jian Wushuang looked around and said in a deep voice.","“I advise you not to think about it. Even if you are a Yan Immortal, you can not escape from here,” the thin figure said indifferently, as if he had tried all the methods he could think of.","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and looked down at the dark abyss.","“I forgot to introduce myself. I’m Chun Qiu. What’s your name?” the slim figure said calmly in an extremely remote corner.","“Jian Wushuang,” he said concisely.","The skinny man named Chun Qiu raised his eyebrows and stopped talking.","The pitch-black vines that seemed unwilling to make a big fuss over the two fish that had escaped the net stopped twitching, and the entire abyss fell into a strange, dead silence.","A golden light gushed out of the corner of Jian Wushuang’s eyes. At the same time, the Four Seasons Domain of the Tarot Sword Dao quietly covered the entire abyss.","“Jian Wushuang, did you hear anything?” Chun Qiu raised his head and said warily.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. The next moment, he shouted, “Run!”","However, it was too late. The stone walls around them burst open at the same time, and countless black vines swarmed out like giant pythons, squeezing toward the two.","As Jian Wushuang had already released his Domain to be on guard, he leaped into the air and barely avoided the vines when they came at him.","By the time Chun Qiu reacted, it was already too late. He was directly dragged into the abyss by the vines.","“Jian Wushuang–”","“This guy!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, turned around, and rushed into the abyss.","The radiance of Yan power that appeared in his eyes allowed him to easily see through the darkness.","The further down they went, the more densely the python-like vines piled up, and there was almost no space for them to step on.","As for Chun Qiu, he did not know where he was.","With a wave of his hand, he summoned an Invisible Sword, and the vast aura of the Wushuang Sword Dao immediately surged and raged.","Perhaps sensing the danger, dozens of vines went against the current.","Jian Wushuang raised his sword and broke it.","The vast derivation of power allowed every move of the Wushuang Sword Dao to reach the peak easily. Even though he was bound, the Wushuang Sword Intant still easily tore open the encirclement.","At this moment, Chun Qiu’s thin figure appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","He swung his sword to cut off the vines that bound him. Divine blood gushed out of his mouth and nose.","“Are you alright?” After surviving the tribulation, Chun Qiu asked while gasping for breath.","Jian Wushuang did not answer. He grabbed him by the collar and prepared to leave.","In the next moment, countless vines intertwined above their heads, blocking their way.","“Damn it, does this thing have eyes? Let’s go!” Chun Qiu shouted in a low voice, and a similar majestic aura emerged from his body.","The Ancestor realm!","Jian Wushuang looked sideways at him and then looked down at the abyss.","Jian Wushuang, who never liked being passive, directly released the first move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intant, Star.","The vast Yan power condensed into Wushuang Sword Intent, which swept under the abyss. It was like pouring boiling oil into water, and it completely exploded.","Yan power had elevated the entire Wushuang Sword Dao to another level. Even if it was an Ancestor realm, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could destroy it with one sword strike.","Under this Wushuang Sword Intent, the vines were shattered on a large scale, and human-like screams rang out in the abyss.","Meanwhile, Chun Qiu, who was standing at the side, gulped in disbelief.","This kind of vine that lived in the depths of the black mountain and had the power to steal the Fortune of heaven and earth was so difficult to deal with that even Yan Immortal would be helpless.","However, now, they were all destroyed by this guy who had entered the mountain for the first time. It was too terrifying.","“Since he has such strength, how could he have been captured and brought here?” A series of question marks exploded in Chun Qiu’s mind, but he had no answer.","Almost at the same time as the Sword Intent dissipated, Jian Wushuang flew straight into the abyss.","Chun Qiu was startled, but he gritted his teeth and followed.","The Invisible Sword in his hand cut off all the vines. His eyes, which were surging with brilliant divine patterns, seemed to see the real gaze behind the scenes. He suddenly threw the long sword in his hand.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing resounded. At the same time, a dark figure looked at Jian Wushuang in the dark and was about to leave.","“You want to leave?” Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice and a small Transcendence Heavenly Gate appeared. It crushed the dark figure directly.","Even though it had changed from divine power to Yan power, the purest divine glyph had not changed.","The palm that was surrounded by a seven-colored light descended, illuminating the dark figure with no place to hide.","Only then did the two of them see clearly what the pitch-black figure looked like.","The long face, which looked like the skin of a 10,000-year-old tree, was ferocious and ugly. Perhaps it was because it had lived in the dark for a long time, its eyes had seriously degenerated to the size of green beans.","The python-like vines were the hair of the black figure.","A look of disgust appeared in Chun Qiu’s eyes. “As expected, those who like to suck blood do not have handsome looks.”","The huge palm pressed down on him without any suspense, but Jian Wushuang was not relaxed either. Another stream of divine blood gushed out of his mouth.","He forcefully used Yan power, and the restraint of the chain iron plate on his neck became stronger.","Chun Qiu became even more nervous. “Jian Wushuang, are you really okay?” We can’t stay here for long, I think we should leave quickly.”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything and just looked down.","When the divine light emitted by the Transcendence Heavenly Gate completely dissipated, the dark figure was revealed.","Even though most of his Daoist robe was torn, his life source was not injured at all.","Perhaps he had found out that Jian Wushuang could not do him any harm. He rolled his bean-sized eyes and his body expanded in the wind. Then, he turned back to his original form and tried to swallow the two of them.","Beyond the Ancestor realm, the Yan power that belonged to the Yan Immortal was like the deep sea, roaring and devouring.","Chun Qiu’s face was ashen, and he was so scared he felt like his soul was leaving his body.","Only Jian Wushuang was not afraid. An Invisible Sword appeared in his hand and he stabbed out without any fancy moves.","This ordinary sword strike could flip the sky and shake the earth. It was a sword strike that was independent of the Wushuang Sword Dao.","It was the Sword Immortal Ding Baiyi’s favorite sword technique, the Extinctive Sword.","After the first sword strike, it was 100,000 sword strikes.","100,000 sword rays broke through the darkness and poured onto that pitch-black Yan Immortal’s figure.","The smugness in the eyes of the two green beans did not even show before it was replaced by fear.","How could he use such a suppressive sword strike that belonged to the Profound realm?","However, this sword attack was indeed fully executed, as if Ding Baiyi was helping him."]},{"number":4688,"title":"Chapter 4688 Slaying Yan Immortal (2)","paragraphs":["4688 Slaying Yan Immortal (2)","It could shake the heavens and earth, but it was also like tearing cloth and silk, silent and unmoving.","100,000 swords pierced the chest of the black figure without missing a single one.","The unimaginable power directly blasted his entire figure into fine powder.","Chun Qiu was so shocked that he subconsciously took half a step back.","Jian Wushuang did not let his guard down at all and he looked at the center of the explosion vigilantly.","Then, the black figure that had been blown into pieces slowly condensed, and an unprecedented aura surged.","The entire black mountain’s hinterlands and abyss started to boil!","The pitch-black figure condensed, and a pair of green bean-like eyes flickered with rage.","He suddenly waved his hand, and hundreds of vines condensed by Yan Li swept over.","“Jian Wushuang, dodge!” Chun Qiu shouted in shock.","As soon as he finished speaking, hundreds of vines formed a cage and trapped the two of them.","At the same time, the vines began to quickly secrete mucus, ready to digest them.","With a flip of his hand, a dagger appeared in Chun Qiu’s palm. He then stabbed the vine below him.","However, the vine did not move at all. Instead, because he used too much force, the dagger cut a bone-deep wound in his palm.","Chun Qiu gasped and looked at Jian Wushuang nervously.","Due to the excessive casting of spells, the power of the chain iron plate on his neck almost crushed Jian Wushuang’s divine soul.","The Yan power in his body was being devoured by the chain metal token at an extremely fast speed.","Jian Wushuang wiped the divine blood from the corner of his mouth, his eyes still indifferent.","Then, the Invisible Sword in his hand trembled, and the trickling stream of Yan power turned into more than ten slashes, cutting toward the vines.","Swish...","As if a hot knife had been cut into butter, a faint stench rose up, and the vines under his feet were directly cut open.","Then, Jian Wushuang picked up Chun Qiu and escaped from the cage.","“Arghh!” A furious roar resounded as the pitch-black figure glared at the two.","“Lowly prisoners, who gave you the courage to resist me? Now, obediently come over and let me cut you up alive. It’s better than refining you into vengeful souls later.”","Chun Qiu immediately spat and said disdainfully, “You? If you let us out now, I can spare your life.”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly put his hand on Chun Qiu’s shoulder and his body swayed.","Chun Qiu’s expression changed and he pulled Jian Wushuang back without thinking.","The pitch-black figure laughed gloomily. With a flip of his sleeve, a small black flag rose up in the wind. At the same time, countless souls of prisoners that had been devoured rushed out.","Every time the flag that looked like a soul beckoning banner was waved, a blood mist that was as deep as the abyss would surge out.","Jian Wushuang, who was like a god just a moment ago, was now weak. This shocked Chun Qiu, who had spoken arrogantly. He dragged him back and released Yan power to try to block it.","However, the Yan power that belonged to the Yan Immortal realm was simply too terrifying. It seemed to have devoured Chun Qiu’s attack in an instant.","Chun Qiu’s face was ashen. He was about to die here. Jian Wushuang, who was barely breathing, said, “What a clown.”","In the next moment, an indescribable and extremely pure Yan power rose up.","Jian Wushuang changed his previous fatigue and stood still in the void, looking at the dead souls that were as deep as hell without fear.","Then, he reached out his palm and clenched it!","The most brilliant light of Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate appeared. It was like countless blazing suns shining, illuminating the entire abyss.","Under this extreme daylight, the dark dead soul that was living in the black light started to wail.","Countless divine weapons and divine shadows intertwined and formed a huge palm that covered the sky and pressed down heavily.","The stone walls of the black mountain could not withstand the power and began to crack.","An apocalyptic scene appeared. The mountain collapsed, and even the man-made plank road collapsed together. It was as if the mountains and rivers had fallen and shattered.","When the black figure holding the flag saw this, his small eyes rolled. He knew that he had encountered a tough opponent and immediately flashed, ready to escape.","However, wherever the extreme daylight shone, there seemed to be an invisible barrier that blocked all the aura.","The dark figure was shocked. This was a matter of life and death and he dared not hold back. He stretched out his arms and the surging derivation power turned into a vast black light and attacked Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang only raised his hand, and the dark light was completely destroyed by his Heavenly Gate.","The energy of light and darkness surged, and the pitch-black figure could no longer remain calm. He crazily activated his unparalleled super ability and smashed it toward the monster-like fellow.","However, the various great super powers disintegrated on their own before they could touch Jian Wushuang.","Only Chun Qiu, who was watching from afar, could see clearly that all the attacks from the black figure were neutralized by the brilliance emitted by Jian Wushuang. He did not even need to use his hands!","This was too terrifying. Even an Emperor would find it difficult to keep this fellow!","The sky-covering palm formed a world of its own and finally pressed down on the pitch-black figure.","A miserable howl resounded, and endless black light scattered.","Jian Wushuang looked at the scene calmly from the beginning to the end.","When the extreme daylight and the black light dissipated together, he reached out his hand and clenched it in the air. As if he had expected what was about to happen, he grabbed a mass of dense black light.","“L-let me go!” The dense black light struggled violently in Jian Wushuang’s hand and soon condensed into an almost invisible figure.","The black figure, who was already scared out of his wits, had his Yan power destroyed, leaving behind a trace of his aura.","“Let me go, and all my treasures will be yours,” The dark figure wailed. At the same time, he took out a treasure that contained great power from his arms and presented it to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the treasure bottle gourd, the octagonal talisman, the black copper mask, and so on. He knew that these true treasures were only slightly weaker than the Supreme Ancestral Weapons in the Divine Power Universe!","However, there were only seven Supreme Ancestral Weapons, yet this fellow had taken out more than ten Supreme treasures that were not much different from them.","Even with Jian Wushuang’s composure, he was already wavering a little.","“As long as you let me go, all of this will be yours,” the pitch-black figure said in a trembling voice.","However, Jian Wushuang just looked at him coldly. He exerted force in his palm and the black life source shattered in an instant.","The black figure did not even have the time to open his mouth and beg for mercy before he completely disappeared.","A Yan Immortal who had surpassed the Ancestor realm had been killed by Jian Wushuang.","This was also the first Yan Immortal to die in his hands.","As the pitch-black figure disappeared, the entire black mountain no longer had any mountain spirits. In the end, it completely collapsed, and countless rocks fell down.","“Let’s go!” Chun Qiu, who had just recovered from the shock, waved his hand and summoned up a space to block the falling rocks. “Let’s go! The entire mountain is about to collapse!”"]},{"number":4689,"title":"Chapter 4689 The Young Emperor (1)","paragraphs":["4689 The Young Emperor (1)","Jian Wushuang turned around slowly. The thousands of strands of confinement power that spread from his neck glowed with a dark blue luster and almost covered half of his face.","Chun Qiu took in a deep breath. The chains on each prisoner’s neck contained an extremely terrifying sealing power. Even Yan Immortals could not bear the pain.","He had never seen the confinement power that Jian Wushuang had triggered.","How strong must one’s willpower be to endure such pain?","After taking one last look at him, Jian Wushuang passed out.","Chun Qiu rushed over and held Jian Wushuang up. Just as he was about to escape, he saw the small pile of treasures scattered in the void from the corner of his eye. He waved his sleeves and took them away.","He dodged the falling rocks and carried Jian Wushuang on their back. Like an agile mountain ape, they shuttled through the layers of rocks.","...","As the entire black mountain collapsed too quickly, the remaining 10,000 prisoners fell into the abyss along with the broken mine tunnel.","The black-robed warden was already scared out of his wits when he saw this. He turned around and fled almost at the same time the black mountain completely collapsed.","“Hey, are you just going to leave like this?”","A faint voice came from behind him, and the warden slowly turned around.","At the end of the collapsed tunnel, two figures stood side by side. One of them had half of his face covered in dark blue runes. He raised his hand and directly pulled him over.","Chun Qiu raised a dagger and stabbed it into the warden’s heart.","The two’s coordination was simple and neat to the extreme, everything was completed in an instant.","Then, Jian Wushuang raised his hand and threw the dead warden into the abyss as if he was throwing garbage, ” Lt’s go.”","Chun Qiu agreed and carried him on his back as he shuttled through the shattered mine.","Rumble...","The most magnificent and towering black mountain collapsed from the inside.","Almost at the same time, in a vast hall, a figure leaning on a magnificent bed quietly opened his eyes, and an unparalleled golden light burst out.","“Reporting to the Young Emperor, the black mountains of the Lower Three Heavens have collapsed.”","...","The joy of seeing the light and surviving a disaster lasted for a long time. Hundreds of black-robed wardens directly rushed over from all directions.","Seeing more and more wardens, Chun Qiu rolled his eyes and pretended to faint.","However, no one cared about the two prisoners. They all rushed to the ruins of the collapsed black mountains, not knowing what to do.","“Damn it, why did the black mountains collapse?!” one of the oldest wardens shouted in anger.","“With Lord Shan Ling’s protection, there’s no way the black mountains will collapse. Could it be that Lord Shan Ling has already...”","“That’s impossible. Lord Shan Ling is a Yan Immortal. Even the Young Emperor would not be able to injure him.”","A clamor of voices resounded, and the nearly thousand black-robed wardens were helpless.","“The collapse of the black mountains is not a small matter. If the Young Emperor blames us, no one will be able to bear it.” The older man frowned and looked past the crowd at the two figures on the ground.","“Take him away and interrogate him carefully!”","Chun Qiu’s eyes opened slightly, and then he continued to pretend to be unconscious.","In a daze, the two of them were thrown into a prison cell.","After they left, Chun Qiu sat up from the ground and started to take care of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were tightly shut. His sweat turned into mist and rose from his body. The sealing power that covered half of his face started to fade.","Chun Qiu hesitated for a moment, then took out a dark purple crystal the size of a thumb and tried to stuff it into Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang, who was in a coma, opened his eyes quietly. His gaze was heavy and majestic. Chun Qiu was so frightened that his hands trembled and he almost threw the crystal away.","“Y-you’re fine?” Chun Qiu continued.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. He took the crystal from him and put it into his mouth without thinking.","The moment the crystal entered his mouth, it immediately turned into pure and surging Yan power, rapidly repairing his broken meridians.","Seeing that he was recovering, Chun Qiu heaved a sigh of relief. “That’s good, that’s good.”","“What is this place?” Jian Wushuang turned his head and asked.","“This prison is a place where prisoners who have committed crimes are temporarily locked up. We will be out soon.” Chun Qiu seemed to be familiar with this.","Jian Wushuang nodded and then looked at the chain iron medal on his neck. Somehow, he felt that the lines on the iron medalions were familiar, but he could not figure out where he had seen them.","“I advise you not to use brute force to destroy this thing, even Yan Immortal can’t do anything about it,” Chun Qiu reminded him kindly.","Jian Wushuang suddenly recalled that when he had accidentally entered the Great Yan Domain, the giant beast Ah Zi and the lady in green armor had the same metal plate on their necks.","Could these metal plates be the same?","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts were a mess and he was speechless.","The first time he entered the Great Yan Domain, he had laid in the Desolate Land for nearly 600,000 years. This time, he had made full preparations, but he had instead become a prisoner.","What kind of bullsh*t place this Great Yan Domain is? It was really unfriendly...","In order to make sure that he had not come to the wrong place, Jian Wushuang asked Chun Qiu again.","When Chun Qiu heard this, he looked at him with a stifled smile and said, “I say, Big Brother, if we’re not in the Great Yan Domain, are we in the void? To be exact, we’re in the lower three heavens of the Great Si Region.”","“The Lower Three Heavens of the Great Si Region?” Jian Wushuang was confused.","Looking at the confusion in his eyes, even Chun Qiu felt a little helpless. He explained, “The so-called Great Si Region is just one of the countless realms. It doesn’t have any special meaning. You only need to know that you are now a prisoner.”","“Speaking of which, I don’t believe that they could capture you after you killed that Yan Immortal in the black mountains.” Chun Qiu’s face was filled with curiosity. “Are you an Emperor from some realm?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. From the moment he entered the Great Yan Domain and opened his eyes, he had become like this. Then, he went into some random mountain to mine and even killed Yan Immortals without stopping.","After this series of events, it was as if there was a pair of big hands in the dark, pushing him forward.","“How do I get rid of my prisoner status, and this?” Jian Wushuang pointed at the chain on his neck and said.","“Very simple.” Chun Qiu grinned. “Escape from here, or kill the Young Emperor.”","“Kill the Young Emperor.” Jian Wushuang repeated softly. Just as he was about to ask again, Chun Qiu spoke again.","“If you were once an Emperor like me, then you can only leave this place after killing the Emperor of the Great Si Region.”"]},{"number":4690,"title":"Chapter 4690 The Young Emperor (2)","paragraphs":["4690 The Young Emperor (2)","Jian Wushuang half-leaned in front of the haystack and said slowly, “I’m not some Emperor you’re talking about. I’m just a wandering cloud, a wild crane.”","Chun Qiu did not say anything more and just smiled in return.","“Why were you captured here as a prisoner?” Jian Wushuang turned to look at him and said.","“Because I was defeated.” Chun Qiu did not hide anything and said slowly, “My father was once an Emperor, but he died in the war. As the son of the Emperor, although I was spared from being slaughtered, I became a prisoner. It would be better to have died back then. At least I would have died happy.”","“Do you know how many years I’ve been in this state?” Chun Qiu laughed at himself. “Even the birth and death of the galaxies in the universe has already begun countless cycles.”","“I’ve always wanted to leave this place, but it’s just an extravagant hope.”","Jian Wushuang did not speak. It was difficult to remove the imprisoning chain on his neck, which greatly limited his ability. He could die if he was careless.","So he could not do anything or say anything now. He had to wait for the right time.","Time passed by bit by bit, and several days later, the deathly silent prison suddenly rang with the sound of hurried footsteps.","After which, close to ten black-robed figures appeared.","Jian Wushuang, who was slowly recovering his Yan power, only took a glance and knew that there were at least two Ancestor realm experts among the ten people.","One of the skinny old men took a step forward. After glancing at him and Chun Qiu, he raised his palm and grabbed at the two of them.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. At the same time, he struck out with his palm and used his spiritual Yan power to offset the skinny elder’s palm print.","The skinny old man’s eyes flashed with a touch of shock. Then, he took a deep breath and said, “Are you going to disobey my order?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him calmly, then stood up and walked out slowly. Chun Qiu followed closely behind.","As he was escorted out of the prison, Jian Wushuang saw a vast square.","In front of the vast square, there was an ancient bronze hall located in the clouds and smoke. The clouds and smoke on it changed into various scenes, which were quite mysterious.","Jian Wushuang strolled forward like a majestic Emperor and did not look like a prisoner at all.","The skinny old man was quite resentful about this, but from the fight just now, he could tell that the person the Young Emperor wanted to see was not someone he could fight against.","Chun Qiu, who was following Jian Wushuang closely, raised his head and looked at the bronze hall. The corners of his eyes, which were already slightly wrinkled, trembled. Hatred flashed for a moment before he calmed down again.","The 1,000-feet-tall bronze door opened heavily, and hundreds of clouds drifted out, transforming into chasers and cloud butterflies that circled in front of everyone.","In the depths of the giant Hall, a figure dressed in luxurious clothes, half leaning on a magnificent bed, opened his eyes and looked outside the hall.","“Welcome to this Emperor’s sleeping palace, everyone.” He raised his eyebrows and smiled, slowly raising his arms.","“Greetings, Young Emperor.” the ten-some black-robed wardens knelt down and said respectfully.","With a gentle wave of his hand, the luxuriously dressed figure known as the Young Emperor said softly, “You may all leave. No one is allowed to step in without my order.”","The group of black-robed wardens acknowledged and left the hall.","Getting off the bed barefooted, the Young Emperor stretched lazily and walked forward slowly.","With every step he took, an identical True Shadow appeared behind him. There were already dozens of True Shadows in the originally empty and silent hall.","Extremely dense Yan power filled every corner of the space.","Looking at the increasing number of figures in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s pupils moved slightly. He could feel that all the True Shadows were in the Yan Immortal realm.","This Young Emperor’s strength was unfathomable, and even he felt an inexplicable sense of danger.","A total of nearly a hundred identical True Shadows gathered together, and a strong fragrance with a faint fishy smell assailed his nose.","“Newcomer, do you know where I am?” a True Shadow clung to Jian Wushuang and asked.","Chun Qiu, who had taken a few steps back, was filled with fear. His hand was already gripping his dagger tightly.","Jian Wushuang stood still like a mountain. He closed his eyes for a moment and then opened them again. He looked straight at one of the figures.","Their eyes met and the Young Emperor smiled. He clapped and the hundreds of True Shadows merged into one.","“You do have some ability, but why haven’t I seen you before?” The Young Empyrean Lord laughed and then looked at Chun Qiu behind him. “Eh, I’ve seen you before. The son of Emperor Fenghua, Chun Qiu?”","Chun Qiu’s expression changed drastically, and hatred crawled all over his face. His right hand, which was holding the dagger tightly, suddenly swung out, and the powerful Yan power directly stabbed the Young Emperor’s heart.","The corners of his mouth curled up, and he stood in place without dodging.","In the next moment, the space rippled, and a thin hidden figure in a purple robe appeared.","At the same time, an even more powerful force destroyed Chun Qiu’s attack and smashed into his body.","Chun Qiu groaned as he was sent flying back a few dozen meters, only stopping after he crashed into the bronze door.","He spat out a large mouthful of divine blood. At the same time, many supreme treasures enshrouded in a purple glow fell to the ground.","The Young Emperor’s expression froze. How could he not know what the treasures that fell from Chun Qiu’s arms were? He reached out and all the treasures flew into his hands.","“You killed the Yan Immortal at the black mountains?!” The Young Emperor’s expression turned cold, and he waved his palm to kill Chun Qiu.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly stood in front of Chun Qiu and said, “I killed the Yan Immortal. It has nothing to do with him.”","The Young Emperor retracted his palm as if nothing had happened. He turned around and walked slowly with his hands behind his back.","“Shan Ling, the man who guards the black mountains, is in the Yan Immortal cultivation realm. I’d like to know how you killed him with the chains still on you.”","The deathly silence hall suddenly surged with violent Yan power. The thin figure in the purple robe moved and directly hit Jian Wushuang with his palm.","The Yan power was wielded masterfully. It was mighty, but it did not leak out at all. Even the air did not move. However, the terrifying power contained in it made Jian Wushuang not dare to be careless. He directly activated Yan power to resist it.","The seemingly ordinary palm strike directly pushed him back a few feet, and the raging force dissipated.","Enduring the boiling divine blood in his body, Jian Wushuang was about to fight again when the skinny purple-robed man stopped and turned, walking to the back of the Young Emperor.","“You have some skills. No wonder you could kill a Yan Immortal even with the seal.” The Young Emperor Lord turned around slowly, his eyes gleaming.","“But you have to know that the Yan Immortal in the black mountains is my right-hand man. If you kill him, you’ll be cutting off one of my arms. How should we settle this?”","Jian Wushuang did not speak, but he had adjusted his Yan power to the peak. If they were to fight, he was confident that he could severely injure the Young Emperor."]},{"number":4691,"title":"Chapter 4691 Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes","paragraphs":["4691 Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes","Perhaps he had guessed Jian Wushuang’s intention. The Young Emperor smiled secretly and said, “But I’m happy today, so I’ll spare you from the death penalty. However, you can’t escape punishment.”","“I’ll punish the two of you to go to the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes and help me get rid of some trouble. How about it?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him but did not speak.","“If you get rid of those troubles, not only will I spare you from death, but I will also give you freedom. At that time, I will personally remove these chains for you.”","Chun Qiu was stunned on the spot. The temptation of being able to redeem his freedom was too great!","He had been a prisoner for who knew how many eras. Even the galaxies in the sky had been lit up and extinguished several times. The days of extracting ores from the black mountains day after day had made him extremely painful. He had also thought of destroying his life source, but the shackles on his neck made him unable to even commit suicide!","However, now, when hope appeared, Chun Qiu was not willing to give up. He looked at Jian Wushuang almost madly.","Time passed slowly, and the Young Emperor seemed not to be in a hurry to receive a reply. He half-leaned on the bed and closed his eyes to rest.","After a long while, Jian Wushuang’s voice was heard. “Okay, I agree.”","“Wise choice.” The Young Emperor opened his eyes quietly and said playfully, “Then, let’s set off immediately.”","The sky of the Lower Three Heavens was never illuminated by the sun, just like the end of time that the prisoners could not see.","When the sealed boundary appeared in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, the dozens of figures stopped in the void.","The Young Emperor, who was wearing a snow-white cloak, stood side by side with Jian Wushuang and threw him something.","“This Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror is used for communication between you and me. Every trouble that you help me eradicate, I will know about it through this mirror.”","“Remember what I said. I want the entire Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes to be cleaned out.”","After keeping the mirror, Jian Wushuang looked at him and said, “You better remember your promise.”","With that, Jian Wushuang did not stay any longer. He stepped into the boundary with Chun Qiu.","In the dark sky, the Young Emperor smiled playfully.","“Your Highness, why did you let him enter the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes? Even I don’t want to fight in there. If he goes in, I’m afraid there’s a 90 percent chance of him dying.” The skinny purple-robed man who had been standing behind him finally spoke.","The Young Emperor said, “To me, he’s a variable. I won’t allow any variables to appear. This is just a test. If he doesn’t pass, he’ll naturally die in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes and save me some trouble. If he passes, it’ll be the best thing for me.”","“My partner, you must find out who captured him later,” the Young Emperor narrowed his eyes and said. “if he’s an Emperor, I can’t let him live.”","The purple-robed figure nodded, and then the dozens of figures all disappeared.","...","At that moment, Jian Wushuang, who was shuttling back and forth in the dark boundary, looked into the distance and observed everything.","From his conversation with Chun Qiu, Jian Wushuang knew that this Mysterious Realm was just a drop in the ocean of the Great Yan Domain.","The entire Realm was formed by the Six Heavens. The Lower Three Heavens were where the prisoners gathered and were in charge of mining the purple crystals in the black mountains. The remaining Three Heavens were called Little Lonely Heaven, Big Lonely Heaven, and Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, which we’re about to enter.","The one who controlled the entire Six Heavens Realm was the strange and mysterious Young Emperor who had a feminine appearance.","This entire Six Heavens Realm was also the territory that his Imperial Father had given him.","Jian Wushuang was naturally not interested in these things. What he needed to do most at the moment was to enter the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes and kill all the troubles in order to gain freedom.","The dark barrier was not very long. After flying at full speed for more than half a day, Jian Wushuang stepped into it.","As far as the eye could see, the red sand was the main color of the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyeseyes.","The wind whistled, rolling up a huge amount of red sand.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and created a barrier to block the sandstorm.","Although there was an abundance of Yan power in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, there were too many impurities in it. It was obviously not suitable for absorption, which increased the difficulty.","With a bloody nose and a swollen face, Chun Qiu followed closely behind Jian Wushuang, afraid that he would encounter a great danger if he walked any slower.","Then, Chun Qiu called out to him and took out a dozen more treasures.","Jian Wushuang could clearly see that these were the supreme treasures that belonged to the Yan Immortal, who was at the Black Mountains.","“Didn’t the Young Emperor take all of these?”","Chun Qiu grinned. “He only took seven or eight. The remaining ten or so are naturally with me. You can choose a few to defend yourself. It’s better than nothing.”","Jian Wushuang did not refuse. He directly chose an exquisite Emerald Jade Guord, an Octagonal Talisman, and half a Black Copper Mask.","After keeping the Emerald Jade Guord and the Black Copper Mask, he immediately used the Octagonal Talisman.","He dipped a drop of divine blood into the center of the talisman and threw it into the air. The Octagonal Talisman immediately transformed into a figure that was exactly the same as Jian Wushuang.","Although the puppet only had 60 percent of his power, Jian Wushuang was still satisfied with the effect of the Octagonal Talisman.","After all, having an extra helper in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes would greatly increase his chances of survival.","Judging from the Young Emperor’s behavior, the situation in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes was not optimistic. The so-called ‘trouble’ would probably be far beyond Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","He walked forward slowly. The boundless red sand wilderness was deathly silent, and there was not even the slightest breath of life.","“Be careful. It seems like no one has ever set foot in this Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes. I wonder what kind of trouble is waiting for us,” Chun Qiu said nervously.","Jian Wushuang did not say anything, but the Invisible Sword had already appeared in his hand.","In the next moment, a few gusts of sand suddenly shot out from the depths of the earth’s core.","Like a dragon’s roar, the violent sand that almost touched the sky surged and crushed over.","The blade-like astral wind raged.","Jian Wushuang raised his Invisible Sword and released a vast Sword Intent.","The unimaginable Sword Intent instantly turned into a long river of Sword Dao. Each Sword Intent was like a magnificent wave!","Who would dare to resist the Sword Intent of a Yan Immortal realm cultivator?","The long river of Sword Dao swept through the world, directly crushing the six giant red sand pillars into powder. Then, without losing its momentum, it surged between the heaven and earth, almost covering the sky.","“What an arrogant brat. How dare you tear off a few strands of my beard? What sort of punishment should I dish out to you?”","The mighty voice resounded like a great bell between heaven and earth, and the entire desolte land of red sand began to become restless.","An unimaginably huge face slowly condensed as the sand and stones fell."]},{"number":4692,"title":"Chapter 4692 The Great Emperor of the Past","paragraphs":["4692 The Great Emperor of the Past","Chun Qiu’s expression changed. That mighty aura that connected heaven and earth definitely surpassed that of Yan Immortal in the black mountains!","On the other hand, Jian Wushuang was extremely calm. He looked forward with his hands behind his back.","“B-brother Jian, I think we should leave quickly. I’m afraid this is not something we can deal with...” Chun Qiu’s voice trembled, and he already had the intention to retreat.","In his opinion, leaving did not necessarily mean death, but staying would definitely result in sudden death.","No matter how much he believed in Jian Wushuang, he could not imagine how he could fight against the mighty aura with his Yan power sealed.","As the terrifying yan power astral wind raged, the entire Crimson Sand Wildernesstransformed into that giant face!","Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu stood on the tip of the giant face’s nose.","The two eye sockets were pitch-black like abyssal prisons, like a boundless black sea, making one feel as if they had fallen into an abyss with just a glance.","“Brother Jian, it’ll be too late if you don’t leave now.” Cold sweat started to form on his forehead.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked at him and said, “Do you want to go back and become a prisoner?”","Chun Qiu’s body trembled, and that extremely dark past surged back into his mind. Then, his gaze gradually became determined, and he gritted his teeth. “Then I’ll take a gamble!”","The Crimson Sand Wilderness was sinking. On the huge face formed by the condensation, there was another quicksand-like figure besides Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu.","It was a figure wearing a beautiful Emperor’s robe. Although the Emperor’s robe was torn, it could not hide his majestic figure.","His long, dry hair was like withered grass, swaying in the wind. The one wearing the Emperor’s robe was a tall, thin old man. He was barefooted and looked like an all-powerful Emperor.","However, the tall and thin old man’s expression was particularly unkind. “Are you another lackey of that old man Zhen Wuyang? Who gave you the confidence to disturb me?”","Chun Qiu explained to Jian Wushuang in a low voice, “The old man Zhen Wuyang he mentioned is the Emperor Father of the Young Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and then drew out an Invisible Sword. A surging Sword Intent swept out.","Although he had advanced to the Yan Immortal realm, his realm was firmly suppressed by the imprisonment chain. Fortunately, his Sword Dao was not suppressed, so Jian Wushuang was confident that he could fight with Yan Immortal realm cultivators!","It was obvious that the body of the old man who called himself ‘Emperor’ was damaged. This was only his True Soul.","If they really fought, Jian Wushuang was confident that even if it was difficult to win, he could retreat safely.","“I’m sorry. I’m going to completely purge this Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes today,” Jian Wushuang said in a serious tone.","The tall and thin old man squinted his eyes. “A kid who doesn’t even have hair on his head dares to speak so arrogantly? I can destroy all of you with a flip of my hand, as the saying goes...”","Chun Qiu also moved at the same time. With a wave of his hands, an Octogonal Talisman transformed into a life puppet and followed.","“how dare you humiliate me! You’re courting death!” The tall and thin old man shouted in anger. Nearly a hundred red sand pillars surged up from behind him like the meridians deep in the Earth’s core, and they rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Heaven and earth trembled as cracks appeared in the sky. It was extremely ferocious.","The red sand pillar directly enveloped the two of them and began to devour them.","The tall and thin old man rose into the sky and sat on an Emperor’s throne made of red sand. He looked at the battle leisurely.","Although the aura that Jian Wushuang revealed made the tall and thin old man’s heart palpitate, he was confident that in this red sand world, he was an indestructible existence. Even if Zhen Wuyang came, he would dare to fight him!","The red sand pillars intertwined with each other and formed a round shape. Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu were in it and they could easily feel the Yan power disappearing from their bodies.","At the same time, the red sand’s fluidity was extremely high. It could easily absorb and obliterate most attacks, making it extremely difficult to deal with.","Another Sword Intent slashed over, but it only cracked the red sand and disappeared very quickly.","Seeing the encirclement getting tighter and tighter, Jian Wushuang no longer hid his strength and stabbed out with his sword without any fancy moves.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star, the first move of the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","His Sword Intent soared into the sky, and his unparalleled form appeared behind him. It turned into the most arrogant sword strike and slashed forward!","Hundreds of Sword Intent pillars shot up into the sky and exploded in the red sand.","The expression of the tall and thin old man sitting on the Emperor’s throne suddenly changed as he looked down in shock.","The next moment, the most shocking explosion occurred below the sky.","The red sand, flowing clouds, and vast sky were all crushed into a ball at this moment!","Jian Wushuang put away his sword and stood still, looking at the sky.","“You little brat, now you’ve made me mad!” The tall and thin old man was so angry that he smashed the Emperor’s throne beneath him into pieces. He turned into a thick golden light and shot toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang shouted coldly and suddenly raised his left palm to meet the attack without any retreat.","It was also at this moment that Chun Qiu endured the numbing of his meridians and released a majestic Yan power!","Boom boom boom!","The collision of three extremely majestic Yan power tore this small world to pieces.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and quickly pushed away the dust in the sky with a gesture of his palm, bound with Yan power. Only then did he see that the tall and thin old man’s shadow was no longer in the foggy sky.","Beside them, Chun Qiu spat out a mouthful of smoke and looked around. “Where’s that guy? Did he just disappear?”","“He actually ran away! Chase him!” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and immediately leaped forward.","Chun Qiu was stunned for a moment, then followed closely behind.","Far away from the red sand world, under the dim sky, a slightly embarrassed figure was fleeing in panic.","It was the tall and thin old man, pointing at the sky and cursing.","“Damn you, Zhen Wuyang! I’ve been dead for so many years, and you still don’t want to let me go? Just you wait! I’ll go back and get reinforcements to kill all of you!”","Jian Wushuang’s speed was extremely fast. In almost every breath, he could cross hundreds of millions of miles.","This was due to a small magical power he had comprehended after lying in the Great Yan Domain for 500,000 years. It was called the ‘Mantra of Mountains and Rivers’.","Whatever the heart thinks, the mountains and rivers will obey.","Moreover, the consumption of power from this small divine power was almost negligible. In the current situation, it had become an important skill for Jian Wushuang.","With the support of Mantra of Mountains and Rivers, he was able to close in on the tall and thin old man who was still running away in a sorry state.","As for Chun Qiu, Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared in a breath.","The tall and thin old man subconsciously looked behind him when he heard the sound of something breaking through the air behind him. What he saw frightened him so much that his soul was in a mess.","Jian Wushuang had already followed closely behind, and the sharp and long Invisible Sword in his hand was almost about to cut down."]},{"number":4693,"title":"Chapter 4693 The Three Lively Emperors (1)","paragraphs":["4693 The Three Lively Emperors (1)","Taking a deep breath, the tall and thin old man, who did not dare to stop, did not forget to turn around and shout, “Boy, I advise you to retreat quickly. I will let bygones be bygones for your previous offense!”","“Otherwise, my iron-fisted methods are not something you can withstand!”","“Why is this guy so long-winded?” Jian Wushuang was speechless. He had seen too many fights where people would draw their swords and cut each other at the slightest disagreement. He did not even know how to attack such a kind old man.","Judging from the ‘troubles’ that the Young Emperor had mentioned, the purpose of this visit to Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes was to eliminate the True Souls of these old Emperors.","Jian Wushuang had never been an indecisive person. He had too many things to do in the Great Yan Domain. It was impossible for him to be imprisoned in the black mountain.","Without any hesitation, Jian Wushuang aimed at the tall and thin old man and slashed down. An extremely sharp Sword Intent rose.","The tall and thin old man was shocked. Almost instinctively, he dodged to the side and barely dodged the terrifying attack.","At this point, one was running, while the other was chasing.","Even though the tall and thin old man was only in the form of a divine soul, his Yan power was mighty. Jian Wushuang could not do anything to him for a while.","However, given enough time, a random hit will land eventually. Jian Wushuang waved his sword behind the old man, and one of the swords stabbed the old man’s butt, making him scream like a pig being plucked.","“How dare you sneak attack me?! I’ll whip your soul in the future!” The tall and thin old man did not care about covering his injured area, and turned his head to threaten.","Jian Wushuang felt helpless. At the same time, he began to doubt if this chatterbox was really an Emperor...","After another round of confrontation, the Invisible Sword cut a few more wounds on the tall and thin old man’s body, causing him to curse in pain.","Jian Wushuang ignored him and focused on eliminating the ‘troubles’ in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes.","Perhaps he knew that he had lost the battle and could not escape, the tall and thin old man simply stood in place, waiting to be killed.","Caught off guard, Jian Wushuang almost stabbed him with his sword.","The old man placed his hands behind his back and laughed loudly. “Good boy. Even if I am a God today, I still want you to pass a message to that old man Zhen Wuyang. Tell him that Yang Jun died with regrets. His biggest regret is not being able to see you in mourning and be a filial son for once. Hahaha!”","“...”","Jian Wushuang’s face was full of black lines.","“Come on, kill me and go back to claim your prize!” the tall and thin old man opened his arms and said.","There was a flash of hesitation in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, and he put down the Invisible Sword that he had raised.","Judging from the tall and thin old man’s behavior, he was not an evil person. On the contrary, he had some real temperament.","The world fell silent for a moment. The tall and thin old man had a tragic expression and waited for the blow that did not come.","“Do you have any way to hide your aura, or to leave this place and never set foot here again?” Jian Wushuang withdrew his long sword and said indifferently.","The tall and thin old man was stunned, obviously still unable to react. “You’re not going to kill me? ”","“I’m too lazy to kill you,” Jian Wushuang said concisely.","The tall and thin old man’s expression immediately became interesting. “Good boy, I knew you were full of righteousness. How could you associate with shameless people like Zhen Wuyang? I was right!”","“Don’t interrupt. Let’s get down to business and leave this place,” Jian Wushuang said helplessly.","The tall and thin old man scratched his head, his face troubled.","In the next moment, the sky and earth suddenly changed color. The clouds were like the sky sea, surging and changing.","“Who dares to trespass into the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes?”","A low roar that carried mighty Yan power resounded through the universe and rushed over.","Even Jian Wushuang’s calm heart trembled.","The tall and thin old man saw this ever-changing scene and immediately became impatient. “This old thing, every time he appears, it’s like he’s performing in a big singing show. He’s really degrading himself!”","“...”","Immediately after, an old man with a extraordinary majesty rode the wind over. He was also wearing an Emperor’s robe. Although he was also in tatters, it could not hide his terrifying strength.","Their eyes met and Jian Wushuang activated Yan power almost immediately.","On the other hand, the tall and thin old man was extremely calm. He raised his head and shouted, “Old man Daogong, come down quickly and receive the guests!”","“...” Jian Wushuang’s face was full of black lines.","“You old thing, you were crying for help just now. Now that I’m here to support you, you’re acting tough again?” The old man who was still in the clouds rolled up his sleeves and rushed down.","The tall and thin old man pouted and dodged a flying kick with great familiarity. He said, “Old thing, hurry up and be serious. This concerns the three of us.”","Hearing this, the majestic elder acted as if nothing had happened. He rolled up his sleeves and looked at Jian Wushuang warily. “Zhen Wuyang asked you to persuade us to surrender?”","“You’re wrong. This kid is definitely not on good terms with Zhen Wuyang,” the tall and thin old man said.","“Then what are you here for?” The awe-inspiring elder examined Jian Wushuang again.","“It’s a personal matter, so I have no choice but to come here to cleanse this Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes,” Jian Wushuang said. “I don’t want to kill for no reason, so I would like to ask you two to leave and never set foot here again.”","As Jian Wushuang’s voice fell, an angry roar came from the clouds, “You’re talking nonsense, ignorant child!”","This time, before Jian Wushuang could react, the tall and thin old man and the awe-inspiring elder attacked at the same time. Two rays of Yan power shot directly into the clouds and the voice disappeared.","“What’s your relationship with Zhen Wuyang?” the old man asked.","Jian Wushuang said directly, “I don’t know any Zhen Wuyang. I came here to eliminate you guys because I had no choice.”","“What if we don’t leave?”","“Then I have no choice but to purge this place,” Jian Wushuang said slowly.","The awe-inspiring old man laughed out of anger. His Yan power was so solid that it turned into hundreds of sharp awls and pointed at him.","“Just because you say so? Aren’t you going to pray for your life?”","“We can discuss things. Using brute force is too vulgar!” the tall and thin old man said hurriedly.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang with a flash of embarrassment in his eyes. “It’s not that we don’t want to leave, but outside of the Daogong, all of that Realm belongs to the old man Zhen Wuyang. Once he senses us, even our True Souls will be dissipated.”","“So, we can’t leave this Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes. We can’t go back.”","Jian Wushuang frowned. If they did not leave, Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes would not be cleaned out. If he could not purge this place, the young Emperor would not let him leave.","Just as he was hesitating, the sound of something breaking through the air came from behind him. Chun Qiu, who was slightly out of breath, flew over.","“Brother Jian, so you’re here. I’ve been looking for you.”","The tall and thin old man’s nose twitched. He looked at Chun Qiu and asked, “The aura of a treasure?”","Chun Qiu did not know what was going on, but he was on his guard.","“How could this kid have the smell of the Boyang Bottle on him?” the tall and skinny old man said in a low voice."]},{"number":4694,"title":"Chapter 4694 The Three Lively Emperors (2)","paragraphs":["4694 The Three Lively Emperors (2)","They looked at each other, confused. Then, the tall and thin old man took a step forward and looked at Chun Qiu. “Little Friend, can you take a look at the Supreme Treasure on you?”","Chun Qiu looked at Jian Wushuang. After getting his approval, he took out all the Supreme treasures in his arms.","However, the tall and thin old man’s eyes swept over the Supreme Treasure, but he did not find anything. He could not help but wonder, “Strange, I clearly felt the existence of the Boyang Bottle, how can it not be there?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then took out the Emerald Jade Guord that he had chosen earlier.","Seeing this, the tall and thin old man’s eyes lit up. He immediately flew forward and raised his hand to take the exquisite gourd into his hand.","After that, he was filled with emotions. “This is fate! After so many years, I’ve finally seen my precious treasure again!”","The awe-inspiring old man laughed disdainfully. “It’s just a broken bottle that’s used to store things. Why are you treating it like a baby? I think it’s not even worthy to be my chamber pot.”","“You know nothing!” the tall and thin old man quickly refuted. “Your entire Heavenly Court is not even worth a fart in front of my Boyang Bottle!”","The awe-inspiring old man rolled up his sleeves subconsciously, “Not worth a fart? Then we’ll have to have a good talk. Who the hell made me rush hundreds of millions of miles to help you? Without me, your Heavenly Court would have been reduced to ashes!”","The tall and thin old man’s face turned livid. “What are you doing here? My Heavenly Court has already been scattered. You’re lucky that I didn’t pee on the spot and wash you away!”","Jian Wushuang, “...”","Chun Qiu, “...”","Seeing that the two of them were about to start a fight, Jian Wushuang said helplessly, “I say, we should discuss important things.”","Only then did the two roll down their sleeves, both extremely angry.","“With this Boyang Bottle, we can leave this place in a few days!” The tall and thin old man glared at him, unable to hide the excitement in his eyes.","The awe-inspiring old man also came to his senses. He hurriedly moved closer to the tall and thin old man and said, “I understand. You mean that old man Zhen Wuyang won’t find out that we’re leaving the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes?”","“Not bad, your chamber pot brain has finally been Enlightened,” the tall and thin old man smiled proudly. “Although this Boyang Bottle can’t hold the celestial heavens, it’s more than enough to hold the three of us.”","The awe-inspiring old man could noot be bothered to curse anymore. His face finally revealed a touch of excitement.","Although they were not afraid of the invasion of the Young Emperor and the others in the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, as Emperors themselves who once controlled a Heavenly Court, they were too aggrieved.","Even they themselves did not know how many years had passed. It was probably so long ago that even a dozen galaxy star rivers had been broken.","Now, there was an almost perfect plan and an opportunity to escape. How could they not be excited?","The two of them looked at Jian Wushuang at the same time, and the light in their eyes grew brighter.","Jian Wushuang felt a chill in his heart. It was not a good feeling to be targeted.","“Young Friend, we can leave now!” The tall and thin old man took a step forward, raised the thumb-sized jade gourd in his hand, and said excitedly, “We only need to enter this Boyang Bottle, and our aura will be completely hidden. Even if that old man Zhen Wuyang comes, he won’t be able to find us!”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and said, “But if we are discovered, we will all be in trouble. I don’t want to take risks.”","The tall and thin old man was stunned and hurriedly said, “Don’t you worry. This Boyang Bottle was an item I had when I was an Emperor. It was enough to contain a world in it, so it can easily contain the three of us.”","After he finished speaking, in order to verify the truth of his words, the tall and thin old man directly pulled out the gourd’s stopper and impatiently went in. However, in just a few seconds, he came out at a speed even faster than before.","“Damn it, who’s living in my precious gourd? It’s so stinky!”","Jian Wushuang understood that the Supreme Treasures were in the hands of Yan Immortal in the black mountains before. It was very likely that he used the Boyang Bottle as a residence and lived in it.","After briefly explaining the situation to him, the tall and thin old man, who was eager to escape, did not pursue the matter. He pinched his nose and demonstrated it to Jian Wushuang.","Sure enough, this treasure gourd seemed to be able to isolate all things and form its own system. The tall and thin old man’s aura completely disappeared.","“Little Friend, what do you think?” the tall and thin old man’s figure appeared and said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “It’s definitely possible. But before that, I need you to put on an act with me.”","“That’s fine. We’re good at acting, especially this guy. He’s the best at playing dead.” The tall and thin old man pointed at the awe-inspiring old man.","However, this time, he did not refute, but looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Tell me, is this plan the idea of Zhen Wuyang’s cunning son?”","When the tall and thin old man heard this, his expression suddenly changed. “Is he trying to outwit us?”","The old man sneered, “Otherwise, how could you be so coincidental? When your Emperor Body was destroyed, this Boyang Bowl fell into the hands of that old man Zhen Wuyang’s army. Now, a guy who claims to have nothing to do with Zhen Wuyang’s army is here with this Boyang Bowl, saying that his mission is to cleanse the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes. How could there be so many coincidences?”","The tall and thin old man came to a sudden realization. “I was wondering what was wrong. So you’re trying to play us?!”","Jian Wushuang was already completely numb to the two old men. The drama that they had made up in their head made him even more confused.","The old man smiled triumphantly. “Fortunately, I’ve been immersed in political tactics for a long time. Go back and tell old man Zhen Wuyang to stop wasting his time. We will destroy his lair sooner or later!”","Jian Wushuang had already lost his patience. “I only have one thing to say. I don’t know that Zhen Wuyang or his son. If you don’t want to do this, I will have no choice but to insist on purging the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes!”","The two of them seemed to be facing a great enemy. Right when they were about to fight, a voice faintly echoed. “I say, you two old farts, since you’ve missed this opportunity, prepare to self-destruct your True Souls!”","In the sky, a figure with strange polycoria and dressed in the same Emperor’s robe stepped on the clouds and descended. He looked at the two of them with contempt and said, “You’re making trouble for yourself. I believe that this Young Friend has nothing to do with Zhen Wuyang. I’m willing to follow him out of the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes.”","“Su He, are you still sleeping? The truth has already been revealed!” the awe-inspiring old man said in a deep voice.","The elder with polycoria, Su He, sneered in disdain. “If this Young Friend is with Zhen Wuyang, Yang Jun wouldn’t have been able to escape from him earlier. He wouldn’t even be standing here and talking to us in one piece.”","“Moreover, from this Young Friend’s behavior, it’s clear that he doesn’t know what this Boyang Bottle is.”"]},{"number":4695,"title":"Chapter 4695 The Three Lively Emperors (3)","paragraphs":["4695 The Three Lively Emperors (3)","Su He looked at the tall and thin old man and said, “If Yang Jun didn’t sense the aura of that Supreme Treasure, our Young Friend wouldn’t even know to take out the Boyang Bottle.”","“Then tell me, where did he get this Boyang Bottle?” the awe-inspiring old man questioned.","The three of them looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and then told him about how he killed the Yan Immortal in the black mountains.","“I see. I knew it was impossible for Young Friend to be on that filthy old man’s side. It’s all because of that stupid Daogong who misled me!” the tall and thin old man said anxiously.","“You’re a simple-minded fellow. You’re just waiting to fall into all sorts of traps,” the awe-inspiring elder said anxiously.","“Daogong,” Su He suddenly said in a serious tone, “we’ve already taken that step that’s beyond redemption. What can we lose now? If we give up on this opportunity today, we’ll be truly doomed.”","The three people who were quarreling suddenly fell silent, no one speaking again.","After a long time, the awe-inspiring old man suddenly rolled up his sleeves and said, “Come on, tell us how to act!”","The corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth twitched. Then, he asked Chun Qiu to take out the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror that the Young Emperor had given him before he left.","“All you need to do is cooperate with me and save an image in this mirror.”","“Of course, Daogong should be the first to do this. He’s the best at playing dead.”","...","After another deep discussion, the two of them chose Daogong first, almost causing the three to fight again.","After barely convincing the old man, Chun Qiu raised the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror and began to record the scene, as if he was recording a video.","“Let’s begin.”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and slashed at the majestic elder.","However, the two only exchanged a dozen rounds before the majestic old man let out a miserable howl and his True Shadow dissipated.","“Stop, stop, no, it’s too fake. That Young Emperor will know it’s fake with just one look.” Chun Qiu shook his head. “We have to highlight the most tragic scene, and at the same time, express the most sincere feelings, the kind that can trigger resonance.”","The majestic old man’s true image appeared, and he nodded thoughtfully. Then, he began a new round of performance.","Then, a strange scene appeared under the sky of the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes.","A figure was holding a mirror, looking for an angle to record images. There were two main characters, demonstrating the tragic and shocking scene over and over again. There were also two old men standing outside the field, giving serious pointers from time to time...","“Lord Young Emperor, there’s news from the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror.”","In the giant hall, the luxuriously dressed figure slowly opened his eyes and waved his hand. An image appeared in the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror that was suspended in the air.","In a world of howling sand, a black-robed figure raised an Invisible Sword in his hand and pressed forward. The vast Sword Intent directly shattered the surrounding sand and bombarded a tall and thin old man without losing momentum.","Even the sky was shattered, and the True Shadow was eventually annihilated in the endless Sword Intent.","Seeing this, the Young Emperor had already sat up from the bed, and his flirtatious eyes revealed an inexplicable look.","“How is this possible? Who is this guy? How could he so easily kill that old guy?”","“My companion, have you found the information I asked you to?”","A thin purple robe appeared in the void quietly. “Your Highness, we have found it. This person’s origin is a mystery. Two servants found him by accident in the deep mountains. When they found him, his aura was extremely weak and there was no injury on his body. Other than that, there was no other news.”","The Young Emperor frowned slightly. This was obviously not the answer he wanted.","Then, he shifted his gaze to the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror and remained silent.","“Your origin is a mystery? Very well, I’m going to dig out your identity bit by bit.”","In the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes, the acting award that lasted several months finally came to an end after Jian Wushuang killed Su He, who had strange polycoria.","Jian Wushuang felt that his head was swollen when he faced the three funny old men. It was far more painful than going through a hundred battles.","Chun Qiu wiped the sweat off his forehead and handed the mirror over to him.","“We’re finally done. I can finally leave this place,” the tall and thin old man said excitedly.","The awe-inspiring old man snorted. “You’re swaggering. Aren’t you going to sleep in the chamber pot?”","“You’re making it seem like you’re not going to use it as well.”","“Alright, you finally admit that the bottle is a chamber pot?”","“You...”","Jian Wushuang hurriedly waved his hand to stop him. “Okay, that’s enough. Please leave with me.”","Only then did the three of them stop a new round of scolding.","Then, the tall and skinny old man took the lead and cupped his hands. “Yang Jun would like to thank you, Young Friend.”","The awe-inspiring old man then said, “My respects and thanks to you, Young Friend.”","The dual-pupiled old man smiled. “Su He and the rest would like to thank you, Young Friend.”","After saying this, the three figures turned into three streaks of golden light and fell into the bottle.","Feeling the vibration from the bottle, Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. Finally, it was quiet.","“Let’s go. The Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes has been cleared.” Jian Wushuang looked at Chun Qiudao.","Chun Qiu’s heart was pounding. From the moment he entered the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes with the mentality that he was going to die, to the dramatic ending today, everything had been too mysterious and coincidental.","The purging of the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes meant that he could end his long and dark life as a prisoner and return to freedom.","But then, he felt nervous and uneasy. He looked at Jian Wushuang nervously and asked, “What if, and I mean what if, the Young Emperor goes back on his word? What should we do?”","Jian Wushuang slowly let out a breath of turbid air, and wisps of golden light burst out from the depths of his pupils. “If he goes back on his word, I’ll take him down with me before I die!”","The endless darkness dissipated, and the entire Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes began to clear up. Rivers began to emerge from the ground, and countless trees and vines began to grow wildly.","He turned around and took one last look at the world that had been cleared out. Then, he disappeared.","In front of the bronze hall, two figures quietly landed and walked forward.","The door of the bronze hall was wide open. In the center of the thousand-feet-tall door stood a weak figure.","The Young Emperor seemed to have been waiting for a long time. When he saw the figure appear in the square in front of him, he smiled and said, “My companion, please go and welcome our distinguished guest.”","After saying this, the Young Emperor turned around and entered the palace.","The skinny purple-robed man came to Jian Wushuang and stretched out his hand, as if asking for something.","Jian Wushuang gave him a sidelong glance and then walked straight into the bronze hall.","The strong musky smell with a faint fishy smell was no longer present, and it was replaced by an unknown fragrance.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and walked in. Chun Qiu followed behind him.","To Chun Qiu, the Young Emperor was a nightmare.","He would never forget the day when his Heavenly Court was destroyed, and the purple-robed figure that appeared."]},{"number":4696,"title":"Chapter 4696 The Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["4696 The Undercurrent Surges","After Emperor Fenghua died and the Heavenly Court fell, the Young Emperor in a purple robe who looked like a sick man seemed to have entered a no man’s land, and his terrifying means almost single-handedly controlled the whole event.","In the Heavenly Realm, all the Yan Immortals were exterminated, leaving only Chun Qiu, the son of Emperor Fenghua.","After that, he was brought to the black mountain and underwent an extremely long life as a prisoner.","The more he feared the Young Emperor, the more he hated him.","As he walked into the depths of the hall, Jian Wushuang’s gaze never wavered.","“A man of unknown origin with his cultivation sealed by chains could kill three Emperors by himself. What kind of amazing person is he to be able to accomplish such an impossible task?”","In the silent hall, only the Young Emperor’s eerie voice resounded.","“You are the Emperor of an area?” he turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang with raised eyebrows.","Jian Wushuang did not answer him. Instead, he threw a mirror to him and said, “I’ve fulfilled your conditions. It’s time for you to fulfill your promise.”","“Oh? Is that so?” The Young Emperor took the Reverse Heavenly Mystery Mirror and glanced at it casually. Then, he threw it back to Jian Wushuang. “But why don’t I remember making a promise?”","As soon as he said that, both Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu’s hearts sank.","He did not expect that this Young Emperor, who seemed extremely shameless, would be so brazen.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were as calm as water. A long, narrow, and Invisible Sword appeared in his palm.","The Young Emperor’s eyes narrowed and he subconsciously took half a step back.","The image that Jian Wushuang had left behind was so shocking and terrifying that it affected his judgment.","As if it could feel its master’s heart that was about to explode, the long sword let out a cold sword cry.","Step by step, Chun Qiu followed closely behind. The resentment and anger after being fooled buried his last bit of humiliation, making him even more determined to take revenge.","The chain and metal plate on his neck began to surge with an endless power of imprisonment. His meridians began to be imprisoned. Every time he used a portion of Yan power, his meridians would curl up in pain.","However, Jian Wushuang did not seem to be troubled at all and continued to move forward firmly.","“I said, untie me!”","Jian Wushuang’s suppressed rage resounded. Half of his face was covered in dark blue confinement power, and he looked particularly terrifying and ferocious at the moment.","The Young Emperor, who had been frightened a moment ago, revealed a strange smile the next moment.","As soon as he said that, the skinny purple-robed man swept over and slapped Jian Wushuang with his palm.","The endless Yan power was like a vast ocean.","However, Jian Wushuang only lifted his sword and slashed once. The mighty Yan power was split into two halves from the middle and swept to the sides.","The Young Emperor’s eyes narrowed, and he said slowly, “I seem to have suddenly remembered.”","“I’ll definitely keep my promise to you, but before that, I’d like to ask you a few questions.”","He smiled slowly, not caring about the current situation at all. He said to himself, “Are you an itinerant Immortal, the master of a Heavenly Court, or the son of the Emperor?”","Suppressing the annoyance in his heart, Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, “I’m a wild crane.”","“It’s hard to imagine that a wild crane can reach your level. I’m afraid that there are very few Heaven’s Favorites like you in all the Realms,” the Young Emperor said faintly. “Follow me. I promise that I’ll give you whatever you want the moment it becomes a possibility.”","“I’m not interested,” Jian Wushuang said concisely.","However, the young Empyrean Lord did not seem to hear him. He extended a finger and said, “In a hundred years, if you wish me to ascend to the throne, I will give you an entire small world. On top of that, I can agree to several conditions.”","“I said, I’m not interested!” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“You’ll agree to my offer. I’m not an evil person. It’s just a win-win situation.” The Young Emperor half-leaned on the bed again as if he had him in the palm of his hand. “Although you call yourself an itinerant Immortal, I can feel that you’re in such a hurry to leave, not because you’re afraid, but because you’re looking for something.”","“But in this Great Yan Domain, all the Emperors and Yan Immortals are just a speck of dust.”","“Without a Heavenly Court, without any foundation, I can guarantee that you will soon be destroyed, let alone searching aimlessly.”","The Young Emperor stood up and whispered to Jian Wushuang, “As long as you help me ascend to the throne, I will definitely make you an Emperor in the Great Yan Domain.”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and just looked at him coldly.","The Young Emperor smiled playfully, then reached out his palm from his luxurious clothes and pressed it on his neck.","The iron plate with the power of the great restriction shattered.","Yan power, which was surging to the extreme, instantly filled his limbs and bones. The Yan Immortal realm that had been confined all this time was completely released, and his aura rose to another realm.","Jian Wushuang looked at him deeply, then turned around and prepared to leave.","However, as he stepped out, purple-robed figures slowly walked out from the darkness on both sides of the hall.","Every single one of them was surrounded by a vast amount of Yan power, there were no less than 20 of them!","Jian Wushuang stood still and the Young Emperor walked over. He placed his palm on his shoulder and said, “I’ve told you my ambition and secrets. You know what it means.”","With more than 20 Yan Immortals, even if Jian Wushuang completely released his realm and fought to the last moment, it was impossible for him to break out of the encirclement and he would definitely die.","The threat was obvious.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang turned around and said in a deep voice, “Are you threatening me?”","“It’s not a threat, it’s just a clear attitude.” The Young Emperor shrugged. “It’s a win-win situation, and I really can’t bear to let you leave.”","“It’s only 100 years. I won’t bother you anymore, whether it’s successful or not. As a reward, I’ll give you everything you want, including the entire Six Heavens Realms.”","The hall was deathly silent, leaving only the flickering of the candles.","After a long time, Jian Wushuang said, “Okay.”","A smile finally appeared on the Young Emperor’s pale face. “Very good. Welcome to the new era.”","Jian Wushuang’s face was extremely calm. “100 years is the limit.”","“Understood.” The Young Emperor smiled and nodded.","As he walked out of the hall, a feeling of being in a different world emerged in Chun Qiu’s heart.","The shackles that had been binding him for countless years had been removed, which meant that he was free from now on.","He did not expect the Young Emperor to let him go so easily and not even stop him.","He had probably become the first former Emperor to survive the Young Emperor’s attack."]},{"number":4697,"title":"Chapter 4697 The Great Voyage","paragraphs":["4697 The Great Voyage","After the destruction of the heavenly court, the princes who did not die in the war were all captured by the Young Emperor and thrown into the Lower Three Heavens as prisoners.","Based on what Chun Qiu knew, there were three Princes who had become prisoners like him, but he was the only one who had survived to this day and had even obtained his freedom.","“In the future, cultivate well. Only when you are strong will everything else be possible,” Jian Wushuang turned to him and said.","Chun Qiu came back to his senses and nodded solemnly. Then, as if he had made up his mind, he said nervously, “Brother Jian, if you don’t mind, I’ll stay by your side.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang asked in confusion, “You’ve been imprisoned for so long. Don’t you want to go back and take a look?”","Chun Qiu smiled bitterly. “The former Heavenly Court has long been destroyed, and I’m afraid that the old site has also been destroyed. Going back will only add to my sadness. Instead of being stuck here, I might as well follow you and travel around!”","Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “You will be in danger if you follow me. Are you sure?”","Chun Qiu replied, “Of course I’m sure. I’ve already gotten over it. Rather than living a muddled life, I might as well do something meaningful.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at the clouds in the distance. “Then follow me.”","The clouds rolled and the sky changed.","In the following months, the Young Emperor handed over the Small and Big Lonely Heavens of the Six Heavens Realms to Jian Wushuang. He kept the Lower Three Heavens and the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes for mining.","There were no signs of life in the two worlds. As the Young Emperor’s back garden, it was filled to the extreme.","Not long after he entered Little Lonely Heaven, the Young Emperor, who usually lived in the giant hall, appeared in Little Lonely Heaven.","The Young Emperor, who was still dressed in bright and luxurious clothes, said with a smile, “Brother Jian, is this a suitable place?”","Jian Wushuang looked calm and did not say anything after nodding slightly.","After so many incidents, he had no good feelings for the Young Emperor and the Six Heavens Realms. The 100-year agreement was just a temporary excuse. Once the time was right, he would never want to have anything to do with the Young Emperor.","“You’ve been bored alone in Little Lonely Heaven. Come with me to the Lower Three Heavens.” The Young Emperor turned around and left after he finished speaking.","Jian Wushuang stood up, concealed his aura, and followed.","The structure of the entire Six Heavens was very strange. It was in the shape of a pagoda, overlapping with each other.","Above the Lower Three Heavens were the Little Lonely Heaven, the Big Lonely Heaven, and the Heaven of Ten Thousand Eyes.","As he descended from the sky, he saw a dozen black mountains.","He had learned from Chun Qiu that these mountains produced a kind of crystal that contained the power of concentration. No matter what realm one was in, they would need this kind of crystal.","The main reason why the Young Emperor kept so many prisoners was to extract these crystals from the black mountains.","The Young Emperor threw a black crystal to Jian Wushuang and said, “The crystals produced in this mountain are the foundation of my growth. Apart from keeping some for myself, I’ll send the rest to heaven’s beyond in exchange for various rare treasures.”","“What do you think?” The Young Emperor turned around and asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Not bad.”","“Of course. This small crystal is worth several years of ordinary cultivation. It’s naturally expensive.”","As the two conversed, they arrived at the center of the world, where a towering city was located.","When he arrived above the city, Jian Wushuang noticed that there were more than a dozen ships under construction. People walking among them were as small as ants.","These pitch-black ships were not any weaker than a Cosmic Boat.","The two of them stepped on the clouds and got off the ship. The Young Emperor waved his hand and the deck opened. The crystals that filled the belly of the ship came into sight. Even with Jian Wushuang’s composure, he could not help but raise his eyebrows.","He then closed the deck and pointed at the ships. “These are the crystals that have been mined and are ready to be sent to the other worlds. You’ll be in charge of transporting them this time.”","“Me?”","“You won’t be the only one. When the time comes, I’ll get my partner to bring some people along with you. You can rest assured,” the Young Emperor said. “Prepare well. The journey to cross the sea is dangerous. Even a Yan Immortal could die if he is not careful.”","Although Jian Wushuang did not understand what the Young Emperor meant, he did not reject the Young Emperor. Perhaps this was the best time to leave.","“Remember, we can afford to lose these things, but you must come back safely,” on the deck, the Young Emperor slowly turned around and said. “I don’t want a right-hand man to disappear just like that.”","Although Jian Wushuang felt a little strange, he did not say anything. “When do we leave?”","“There’s no rush. We’ll leave in ten days. I’ll send you off personally then.”","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye.","In Little Lonely Heaven, Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu opened their eyes.","Little Lonely Heaven’s barrier opened, and a thin purple-robed man came to receive him.","In front of the Realm, a total of ten majestic ships stopped in the clouds.","The luxuriously dressed Young Emperor landed in front of Little Lonely Heaven and smiled at Jian Wushuang. “I’ll leave the rest to you, Brother Jian.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. When he was about to board the ship with Chun Qiu, the Young Emperor stopped him. “Whether it’s successful or not, I’ll be back in ten years at most. I have something important to discuss with you then.”","“I understand.”","As the two of them boarded the ship, the Young Emperor said indifferently, “If you sense that he has the intention to leave, kill him immediately. If not, protect him with all your might.”","The skinny purple-robed man nodded and said in a low voice, “I will obey your orders, Your Highness.”","The clouds surged, and ten giant ships loaded with crystals of the black mountains disappeared from the Realm in a moment, flying across the sea.","The Young Emperor stopped for a moment and then disappeared.","Sitting at the bow of the ship, Jian Wushuang seemed to have returned to the Divine Power Universe, traveling freely in the universe.","However, this was the Great Yan Domain, a vast and unknown ultimate Realm that was destined to be larger than the Divine Power Universe.","Chun Qiu was extremely excited. This was the first time he had left the Six Heavens Realms since he his home had been destroyed.","He even raised his hand and pointed at the traces of the galaxy’s decay to Jian Wushuang.","The decline of one galaxy was probably beyond the reincarnation of a universe. The decline of eight galaxies... He could not imagine how long this young man had lived..."]},{"number":4698,"title":"Chapter 4698 The Vast Mirage (1)","paragraphs":["4698 The Vast Mirage (1)","There were only ten people on the first ship. Excluding Jian Wushuang and Chun Qiu, the rest were the Young Emperor’s followers.","Jian Wushuang had no opinion on this. If it were him, he would naturally use the same method.","Apart from the two of them conversing, the other purple-robed figures were like dead people, each standing in a corner of the deck.","After several days of travel, the ten ships left the Six Heavens Realms and entered a vast and barren galaxy.","A boundless ocean stretched across the world like a still ribbon.","The hundreds of millions of stars above his head were giving off a strange light, which was extremely beautiful.","Jian Wushuang, who was sitting at the bow of the ship, waved his hand and picked a star. He used Yan power to squeeze it into a round ball the size of a thumb and embellished it in the galaxy again.","From the Six Heavens to the other worlds, they used the most difficult path — the sea crossing. Jian Wushuang guessed that it was to prevent experts from the other worlds from interfering.","For the sea, variables were very common. Tides and huge waves were common. What was more important was the unknown that had been silent in the sea for countless years.","The giant ship in the lead fell into the huge sea, causing layers of ripples on the surface of the sea. Then, it continued to move forward without stopping.","The speed in the water was much slower than in the air.","However, according to the map given by the Young Emperor, they would reach their final destination in three years at most.","Time had become the most meaningless thing when sailing in this huge sea.","However, Chun Qiu was still extremely excited. This was the first time he had gone on a long journey with complete freedom, and he had imprinted everything he saw in his mind.","Jian Wushuang was already exhausted, so he sat on the bow of the ship and began to meditate.","Although his cultivation realm had been completely stabilized in the Yan Immortal realm, the damage caused by the clay idol was still indelible. For a long time, his meridians showed a unique aging state.","It was only after he entered the Great Yan Domain that the irreversible injuries in his body miraculously recovered. Jian Wushuang was very confused but he had no clue.","After he began to diligently cultivate and meditate, the entire sea became silent.","After more than half a year, Jian Wushuang seemed to have entered a different kind of ethereal state. Memories that were so ancient that he had almost forgotten began to appear in his mind again.","The slightly hunchbacked Elder Shi Ting stepped on countless corpses and blood as he walked over. His white robe was already soaked in the divine blood.","Old Master, who carried the power of the entire Black Sea, also stepped forward. He looked at Jian Wushuang with his dark eyes and said nothing.","Another fog appeared in the depths of his memory, and that strangely familiar yet extremely strange aura rose.","“You shouldn’t have come. The catastrophe here is far from what you can bear...”","“You shouldn’t have come. The catastrophe here is far from what you can bear...”","A mysterious and arrogant voice exploded in Jian Wushuang’s divine sense. At the same time, all the bodies that had died or disappeared began to overlap and finally turned into a cloud of thick black smoke.","“Leave or sleep. You shouldn’t have to bear all this. Leaving is the best choice.”","The extremely familiar voice cleared Jian Wushuang’s mind from the chaos.","However, as soon as he woke up, all the memories that had appeared in his spiritual sense instantly disappeared, not even leaving a trace.","“Is, is that you...” Jian Wushuang’s body shook slightly and his face was extremely pale.","However, at this moment, a silly laugh came from behind him.","“Imperial Father, why are you here? I’ve been unfilial. I’ve come to see you now.”","Jian Wushuang turned around subconsciously and saw that Chun Qiu had suddenly jumped up from the deck and was flying toward the dark sea.","He saw it clearly. Almost at the moment when Chun Qiu jumped, he released Yan power and pulled him back.","Soon after, wisps of black light appeared at the edge of the fence and disappeared in an instant.","He threw Chun Qiu on the deck and quickly looked down at the sea.","However, other than the pitch-black seawater, there was no other trace.","The few purple-robed figures on the deck had also noticed that something was wrong and gathered together as if they were facing a great enemy.","“What’s wrong? why do I feel backache after sleeping?” Chun Qiu sat up on the deck and opened his sleepy eyes.","“Don’t sleep, there’s something strange in the sea,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice. At the same time, he released his Yan power and prepared to explore the sea.","However, what surprised him was that even Yan power could not remain on the surface of the sea. It only took a moment for Yan power to be devoured.","“There’s something strange in the sea?” Chun Qiu jumped up and looked nervously at the sea, trying to find the enemy hiding in the dark.","However, everything returned to normal, as if nothing had happened.","“I hope I’m overthinking it,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","The eight purple-robed figures returned to their previous standing positions and remained silent.","Jian Wushuang was not worried about them at all and was too lazy to deal with them. After all, eight of them had the strength of a Yan Immortal, which was enough to deal with most of the dangers.","As for the other nine ships, Jian Wushuang roughly glanced at them and found that there were no less than five Yan Immortals.","After surviving the fright without any danger, he found it difficult to enter the state of meditation. The reason was that he could not tell if it was a dream or an illusion in his spiritual sense, and the scene that appeared in his mind had thrown his mind into chaos.","After he managed to dispel the messy information in his heart, Jian Wushuang forced himself to continue meditating.","However, not long after, Chun Qiu’s surprised voice rang in his ears. “H-how is this possible? How can these things be here, in a Realm that no one has ever set foot in?”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and what he saw next shocked him.","In the chaotic mist, there were thousands of jade buildings with auspicious light flickering in and out of them. It was a shocking sight.","The pavilion-like scene in the sky appeared in front of his eyes. It was like a dream, but it was extremely real.","“Could it be a mirage?”","Jian Wushuang, who had been cultivating since he was a nobody, had comprehended thousands of Great Daos. Among them, he knew a thing or two about the Dao of Mountain Spirits.","This mirage was nothing more than a wonder, but there were also spiritual monsters who used this illusion to confuse cultivators, dragging them into the deep sea to devour them.","However, what kind of almighty spiritual monster was it that could use illusions to fool Yan Immortals?","Jian Wushuang focused his attention to get rid of the fog in front of him and looked forward again. Soon, he was surprised.","The wonder that was thought to be a mirage and illusion was actually real!","To be able to spend such a terrifying amount of energy to build these magnificent buildings, what kind of supreme power would it be?","Even the rest of the purple-robed men were on their guard."]},{"number":4699,"title":"Chapter 4699 The Vast Mirage (2)","paragraphs":["4699 The Vast Mirage (2)","The scene unfolding before their eyes was simply too inconceivable!","It was not an exaggeration to say that the mountain-like, row upon row of jade buildings were Secret Realms.","“Brother Jian, what do you think?” Chun Qiu asked in a serious tone.","Jian Wushuang did not speak. After staring at it for a while, he said seriously, “Go around this place and leave at full speed. Don’t stay here even for a moment.”","When the other purple-robed men heard this, although they did not make any big movements, they all activated their own powers to change the course of the giant ship and move forward at full speed!","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. He felt that there was a pair of eyes in the dark looking at him from time to time, but he could not tell where.","He prayed in his heart that everything would be fine. After all, if there was really a terrifying existence in the water, it would be a destructive blow.","The giant ship sailed quickly on the sea, and none of the possible situations that they had imagined happened.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Then, he heard Chun Qiu’s trembling voice, “Brother Jian, do you feel that those houses are following us?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart tightened and he quickly turned around to take a look. With one look, his Qi and blood immediately surged.","He saw that the jade palace that should have been left far behind had not disappeared. Instead, it was getting closer and closer.","The surface of the ocean began to ripple, and dark tentacles quietly clung to the fence of the ship.","In the next moment, the sea surface suddenly rolled up, like a mountain rising.","The jade palace also rose.","Everyone looked at the scene in shock.","Under the jade palace, a pitch-black head that was almost the size of a world rose from the bottom of the sea!","Ten thousand pairs of blood-red eyes rose up like tens of thousands of blood-red suns.","It was a giant sea octopus that had grown to the ultimate level!","An indescribable aura spread out and it was beyond Jian Wushuang’s knowledge.","And those exquisite buildings and jade spaces were growing on the head of the giant Sea Sky Octopus.","Tentacles the size of real Dragons began to emerge from under the head that had tens of thousands of blood-red eyes, stirring the huge sea.","Even the ship that was larger than the sky and earth looked like a toy in front of the huge Sea Sky Octopus.","After recovering from the shock, Jian Wushuang immediately released his unparalleled Yan power and an Invisible Longsword appeared in his hand.","The rest of the purple-robed figures also released their powers at the same time.","Ten thousand pairs of blood-red eyes narrowed at the same time, reflecting the ten giant ships in their eyes. Every tentacle the size of a True Dragon emerged from the water at the same time, whipping the giant ships on the surface of the sea!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and vast Yan power turned into a pure barrier to protect the entire ship.","At the same time, the remaining eight purple-robed figures also moved. Every one of them had a Yan power aura that was not weaker than the Yan Immortal realm. It soared into the sky and turned into layers of barriers that covered the ship.","Boom boom boom!","The tentacle smashed into the barrier created by Yan power, directly shattering six layers!","Jian Wushuang and the others all suffered different kinds of injuries. The slight tearing of their meridians made everyone know how terrifying the huge Sea Sky Octopus was.","As for the other ships, they only had one Yan Immortal guarding them at most, so they suffered a great disaster. Almost in an instant, two of the ships were broken by the tentacles.","Countless crystals of the black moountains were sent flying, emitting dark purple light. Just as they were about to fall into the deep sea, they decorated the sky with beautiful light.","The entire surface of the sea was boiling. The giant Sea Sky Octopus rose from the deep sea, lying on the surface of the sea. Every time it waved its tentacles, a giant ship full of crystals would be shattered.","The barrier of the ship that Jian Wushuang was on could not hold on any longer.","The skinny purple-robed man turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang. Then, he tore a crack in the magic barrier and jumped out.","The rest of the purple-robed figures followed closely behind, turning into powerful forces that swept toward the giant Sea Sky Octopus.","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and also rushed forward. Facing such a terrifying existence, he released the Transcendence Heavenly Gate with all his might.","The majestic heavenly gate opened, and the finger that was like the brilliant sun pressed down on the giant Ocean Sky octopus’s head.","Rumble...","Nearly a thousand beautiful pavilions hidden in the mist were destroyed, and even its extremely huge head paused.","Taking advantage of this moment of pause, the eight purple-robed figures simultaneously released their mighty Yan power, which combined into a vast pillar of light and smashed into the eyes of the giant octopus.","A heart-shaking scream that sounded like a sea demon’s chant resounded. Nearly 5,000 pairs of blood-red eyes were destroyed by this joint attack!","The defenseless eyes were clearly the weakest part of the vast Sky Sky Octopus.","Thick ink-like liquid poured out of its broken chakra and fell into the sea, solidifying the surface of the sea.","At the same time, the severe injuries it had suffered had driven it completely mad. Its vine-like tentacles waved wildly in the air, each strike fatal!","A purple-robed Yan Immortal was just a step slower and was directly crushed into dust, his body and soul destroyed!","One had to know that these people were beyond the Ancestor realm, and they were in an even more profound cultivation realm, the Yan Immortal realm! However, it was reduced to dust by a single blow from the giant Sea Sky Octopus.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold. He swept out the invisible long sword in his hand and cut off several tentacles.","At the same time, all kinds of unparalleled divine abilities were thrown out in an instant.","The Transcendence Heavenly Gate and the Extreme Darkness Heavenly Gate were two Ancestral Skills that complemented each other. The power that they could unleash at the same time was unimaginable.","This was especially so when he had the support of his innate ability, ‘Primordial Universe’.","The unparalleled divine might directly caused cracks to appear in this part of the world. The vast sea was like boiling water, boiling for thousands of feet.","Under the appearance of these two Ancestral Skills, even the combined strength of the other seven purple-robed Yan Immortals paled in comparison.","A giant palm formed from countless divine weapons smashed toward the giant Sea Sky Octopus with a destructive force.","As its body was too huge, it could not avoid it at all. Even the tentacles that tried to block it fell apart when they came into contact with this terrifying move.","Two ultimate Ancestral Skills pressed down on the giant Sea Sky Octopus’s head without any suspense.","The magnificent buildings and palaces were all destroyed, and the mighty power even pressed it into the sea.","The seawater splashed up for tens of thousands of feet, and the extremely thick black liquid covered almost half of the sea.","Standing in the void, Jian Wushuang’s chest heaved up and down quickly. At the same time, he stuffed several crystals into his mouth as if he was eating candy to quickly recover his Yan power.","The two Ancestral Skills released by this all-out attack almost made him unable to withstand it even though he had already reached the Yan Immortal realm.","The Ancestral Skills that he had comprehended from the Land of Sorrows were still extremely terrifying."]},{"number":4700,"title":"Chapter 4700 The Vast Mirage (3)","paragraphs":["4700 The Vast Mirage (3)","Moreover, Jian Wushuang could feel that the two Ancestral Skills were still not perfect, which meant that he had not fully comprehended them.","The rest of the purple-robed figures who were standing side by side with Jian Wushuang were completely shocked.","They had witnessed and participated in the entire process, so they could naturally feel how terrifying that destructive attack was.","None of them could guarantee that they could survive that attack.","What kind of existence was this guy, who was at most a Yan Immortal?","Before they could even catch their breath or say a word, hundreds of tentacles suddenly rose from the bottom of the sea and smashed toward the crowd.","Caught off guard, four of the purple-robed Yan Immortals were struck and destroyed in body and soul!","The smallest purple-robed figure trembled and shouted, “You’re looking for death!”","In the next moment, he turned into a bolt of lightning and dashed forward. The Yan power in his hand turned into a ball of light and he threw out tens of thousands of them in an instant.","The magnificent and tragic bones exploded, but they did not leave many scars on the surface of the giant Sea Sky Octopus.","Under Jian Wushuang’s previous attack, its tens of thousands of bloody eyes had been destroyed. At this moment, there were no more than thousands.","Moreover, the black liquid that flowed out of its eye chakra seemed to have covered its body with a layer of shell. Although it was passively beaten, it was no longer damaged.","A thick tentacle with ferocious bone spikes directly hit him in the waist.","The skinny purple-robed man, who was madly attacking, was sent flying back like a cannonball.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and caught it. Yan power turned into a ribbon and caught it.","Upon closer inspection, the skinny purple-robed man’s waist was almost broken into two, and only a bone spine was barely connected. He was already exhaling more than he was inhaling.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang stuffed the remaining dozens of black mountain crystals into his mouth.","Whether he lived or died was up to fate. Then, he threw him onto the deck.","Chun Qiu caught him and laid him down. He was ready to fight in the void, but then he seemed to have thought of something and gritted his teeth and retreated.","Earlier on, Jian Wushuang had warned him to stay on the boat and not fight no matter what.","He naturally understood that he had yet to reach the Yan Immortal stage, so how could he be of any help?","At this moment, there were only three figures standing in the sky that was about to shatter.","The other two purple-robed figures had already collapsed. In the face of such a terrifying existence, continuing the battle was no different from courting death. Thus, the two of them looked at each other and directly swept toward the giant ship that was not damaged, trying to escape.","The twisted tentacles were still waving wildly. The huge Sea Sky Octopus recognized Jian Wushuang, who had injured it by himself, at a glance.","The remaining thousand pairs of compound eyes flashed with a hint of fear, and then it went completely crazy, controlling the tentacles to smash over without regard for anything.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly and did not dare to relax.","The immense force that was difficult to dissipate forced him back a thousand feet, and a dozen tentacles were cut off.","In the next moment, a dazzling river of Sword Dao that looked like thousands of stars gushed in the void. Jian Wushuang sat on the river and poured down.","Millions of extremely sharp Sword Intents fell like a silver river waterfall, illuminating the entire dark world for an instant. Then, they directly covered the huge Sea Sky Octopus.","In the Sword Intents, Jian Wushuang was like a fish swimming. He held an InvisibleLongsword in his hand and rushed straight to the head of the huge Sea Sky Octopus.","Swish!","The entire Invisible Sword pierced through his head, and an ancient aura gushed out from the top of his head.","Jian Wushuang was almost suffocated by the broken acupoint.","The giant Sea Sky Octopus wailed sorrowfully, and a viscous liquid began to gush out of the blood abyss’s huge mouth under its compound eye.","It was rapidly dying!","However, this favorable situation only existed for a moment. Nearly a hundred tentacles hit Jian Wushuang at the same time.","Even though he had already achieved the indestructible divine body, he was almost turned into dust by this blow.","He quickly used Yan power to seal the damaged meridians and the Invisible Sword appeared in his hand again.","This move was not gaudy at all, but it shattered the void. This was an Extinctive Sword, a sword strike with no way to retreat.","The tentacles, which could destroy Yan Immortals with every strike, were easily destroyed like paper under the Extinctive Sword Strike.","This Extinctive Sword Strike was a combination of 100,000 identical Sword Intents. It broke through the giant Sea Sky Octopus’s defense and stabbed into its head without leaving a single mark.","Its dark skin was torn apart, and its bones and flesh were reduced to nothing. A hideous and terrifying wound was torn open on its unimaginably large head.","An ancient aura began to spread wildly from its wounds, accompanied by countless dazzling golden glows that flickered for an instant.","The giant Sea Sky Octopus finally felt an instinctive shiver. It no longer fought, but instead, it controlled its extremely huge body to escape.","However, the moment it moved, Jian Wushuang arrived with his sword.","He had never been soft-hearted when it came to existences that threatened his life.","However, how could Jian Wushuang let the giant Sea Sky Octopus escape?","Take its life when it’s weak!","He thrust the sword down again, and the sword ray, which was nearly ten kilometers tall, directly stabbed into its skull.","The surface of the ocean trembled violently, and the void was finally torn apart. The giant Sea Sky Octopus already descended into a completely berserk state.","It wanted to get rid of the rapid loss of life, so it shook its head crazily in an attempt to throw Jian Wushuang away.","However, Jian Wushuang did not move. He clenched the Invisible Sword in his hand and further destroyed its life source.","However, the heavenly movement of the octopus was simply too massive. Even the sword-light that was a few hundred feet long could not touch its life source!","In this desperate stalemate, Jian Wushuang felt a heat in his arms. Then, a green gourd the size of a thumb flew out and stood in front of him.","“My God, what is this thing? I’ve never seen such a giant thing before!”","“It’s indeed big. If it was in the past, I’m afraid even three Heavenly Courts wouldn’t be able to finish eating this thing.”","“Forget three Heavenly Courts, even if you add another three Heavenly Courts, we won’t be able to finish eating it!”","Jian Wushuang used so much strength that he almost suffocated. His face turned red and he could not say a word.","“Eh, Young Friend, you seem to be struggling. Do you need our help?”","With the last of his strength, Jian Wushuang said with great difficulty, “Sword, Sword...”","The tall and thin old man’s figure appeared and he immediately understood. He looked at the sword hilt at his waist and laughed loudly. “Unfortunately, I have been immersed in sword Dao for countless years and am particularly obsessed with it. Today, I will show you my self-created Sword Dao!”","With that, the tall and thin old man suddenly pulled out the sword from Jian Wushuang’s waist!","However, the incomparably sharp blade was gone, and only the hilt was pulled out?"]}]);
